\par }{\fs20\lang1024\langfe1024\noproof {\shp{\*\shpinst\shpleft1440\shptop2070\shpright10512\shpbottom2070\shpfhdr1\shpbxpage\shpbxignore\shpbypage\shpbyignore\shpwr3\shpwrk0\shpfblwtxt0\shpz2\shplockanchor\shplid2049{\sp{\sn shapeType}{\sv 20}}{\sp{\sn fFlipH}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFlipV}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn shapePath}{\sv 4}}{\sp{\sn fFillOK}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fFilled}{\sv 0}}{\sp{\sn fArrowheadsOK}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn posrelh}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn posrelv}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}{\sp{\sn fLayoutInCell}{\sv 1}}}{\shprslt{\*\do\dobxpage\dobypage\dodhgt8194\dpline\dpptx0\dppty0\dpptx9920\dppty0\dpx1190\dpy2070\dpxsize9920\dpysize0\dplinew15\dplinecor0\dplinecog0\dplinecob0}}}}{\f0\fs16  \par }}{\footerf \pard\plain \s22\ql \b\f354\fs18  Page {\field{\*\fldinst PAGE}{\fldrslt 1}}{     }\'a9 2025 \uc2 Factiva, Inc.  All rights reserved.\par }{\footer \pard\plain \s22\ql \b\f354\fs18  Page {\field{\*\fldinst PAGE}{\fldrslt 1}} of {\field{\*\fldinst NUMPAGES}{\fldrslt 1}}{     }\'a9 2025 \uc2 Factiva, Inc.  All rights reserved.\par }\pard\plain \ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\fs20 {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/22: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, SOL, DOGE, DOT, LEO, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,786 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 June 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC and select altcoins attempted a reversal, but are facing heavy selling at higher levels, which is proof that bears remain in control of the wider market.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) continues to face a tough battle near the psychological level of $20,000 as the bulls and the bears attempt to assert their supremacy. Trading firm QCP Capital said in their latest market circular that funding rates on derivatives markets were stable and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-rises-to-20-7k-as-fed-s-powell-says-more-rate-hikes-appropriate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22bearish\b0 \highlight22  conditions were fading}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Another ray of hope for the Bitcoin bulls is that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-miners-sold-their-entire-may-harvest-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin miners may be capitulating}}}\uc2  as the recent decline in the price has made some mining machines unprofitable. Data from Arcane Research shows that public Bitcoin mining companies that had only sold 30% of their mined production from January to April of this year had dumped 100% of their Bitcoin production in May. Some analysts believe that miners giving up was a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signal.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/352c0199-b295-462e-a525-b0e853d88c92.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 However, one metric suggests that Bitcoin may not have bottomed out. Historically, Bitcoin signals a bottom when less than 50% of the Bitcoin addresses remain profitable. Glassnode data as of June 20 shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/that-s-not-hodling-over-50-of-bitcoin-addresses-still-in-profit"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 56.2% of Bitcoin addresses are in profit}}}\uc2 , increasing concerns of another down leg.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and the altcoins sustain the recovery or will bears pull the price lower? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to start a recovery in Bitcoin but the long wick on the June 21 candlestick suggests that bears are not willing to surrender their advantage.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/f65a36ef-657e-4d25-a1f1-177e4c3ff6ed.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive is that the bulls are buying the dips to $20,000 on June 22. If the price rebounds off the current level, the buyers will try to drive the BTC/USDT pair above $22,000. That could open the doors for a possible rally to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA)($24,076).\par \par \uc2 This level is likely to act as a stiff resistance but if bulls overcome this barrier, the next stop could be the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($28,678).\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view could be negated if the price turns down and breaks below $19,600. That could enhance the prospects of a retest of the June 18 intraday low of $17,622.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) bounce off the June 18 intraday low of $881 turned down from $1,194 on June 21, suggesting that bears have not yet given up and they continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/5892c6d0-518e-4664-9387-8906ac6cc014.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls don't not give up much ground from the current level, the ETH/USDT pair could again attempt a rally to the 20-day EMA ($1,368). This is an important level to keep an eye on because bears tend to defend the 20-day EMA during downtrends.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again try to pull the pair to $1,000 and then $881. A break below this level could signal the resumption of the downtrend. On the other hand, if bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to $1,700.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  has been sustaining above the crucial support of $211 since June 19 but the bulls are struggling to push the price higher. The long wick on the June 21 candlestick suggests that bears continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/73505b68-e8ad-4fcb-aa02-012399fd5bfa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below $211, the BNB/USDT pair could decline to $200 and then to the June 18 intraday low of $183. This is an important level to watch out for because if the price dips below it, the pair could plummet to $150.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off $211 or $200, it will suggest that bulls continue to buy on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, it will suggest that the break below $211 may have been a bear trap.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounce from the $0.44 to $0.40 support zone fizzled out near the 20-day EMA ($0.51) on June 21. This suggests that the bears continue to defend the level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/cdcd1e8b-dce7-4e78-8f41-718ff2cf19d3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers will now attempt to sink the price below the support zone. If they manage to do that, it will suggest the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then slip to $0.33 and later to $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price again rebounds off the support zone, it will suggest that bulls continue to accumulate on dips. The buyers will then make one more attempt to push the pair above the moving averages and start a rally to $0.70.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound between $0.28 and $0.35 for the past few days. This suggests a state of equilibrium between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/50bc951a-5c72-404e-a8cf-8fdfd09d64ff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The longer the time spent inside the range, the stronger will be the breakout from it. If the price continues lower and breaks below the support of the range at $0.28, it could suggest the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 The RSI is showing a positive divergence, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening. If bulls push the price above $0.35, it will suggest the start of a new up-move. The XRP/USDT pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA ($0.41) and later rally to $0.45.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) recovery on June 21 rose above the 20-day EMA ($36) but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that bears are selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/28dc84f4-731e-454a-bb9f-45b6b76a0fbc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price remains below the 20-day EMA on June 22 but the bulls have not given up much ground. This suggests that the buyers expect a break above the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the SOL/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($47) where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price fails to rise above the 20-day EMA, it could attract profit-booking from short-term traders. That may pull the pair to $30 and later to $27.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) started a recovery on June 19 and reached the 20-day EMA ($0.06) on June 21. Although bulls pushed the price above the 20-day EMA, they could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/11fa6510-5a99-4e12-8ea4-3bc52fbc4fb3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 That may have attracted profit-booking from the short-term bulls and selling by the aggressive bears. The sellers will now attempt to sink the DOGE/USDT pair below $0.06 and challenge the vital support at $0.05.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off $0.06, it will suggest that the sentiment has changed from selling on rallies to buying on dips. That could increase the possibility of a break above the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the pair may rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.08).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-wicks-below-20k-as-whales-send-50k-btc-to-exchanges"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin price wicks below $20K as whales send 50K BTC to exchanges}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned down from th 20-day EMA ($8.20) on June 21, suggesting that bears continue to defend the level aggressively. The sellers will now try to pull the price below the immediate support at $7.30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/95970ad9-6fc5-4e5f-8341-5326519de590.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the DOT/USDT pair could drop to the crucial support at $6.36. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break below it could start the next leg of the downtrend to $4.23.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off $7.30, it will suggest that bulls are trying to form a higher low. That could enhance the prospects of a break above the 20-day EMA. The pair could then rally to the 50-day SMA ($9.78). If this level is also crossed, the next stop could be $12.44.\par \par \uc2 LEO/USD\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed UNUS SED LEO ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/leo-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LEO}}}\uc2  ) above the resistance line of the descending channel on June 22 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears are selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/9529c2af-d6ae-4bbe-b31e-38b8dbab1810.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LEO/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($5.29) has started to turn up and the RSI is near the overbought territory, indicating that bulls have the upper hand. If the price sustains above the channel, it could open the doors for a possible up-move to $6.50.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price fails to sustain above the channel, traders may book profits and that could pull the LEO/USD pair to the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest that the pair may remain stuck inside the channel for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure to sink Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) below $0.000007 may have tempted short sellers to book profits and aggressive bulls to start buying. That may have resulted in the sharp rally on June 21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/2cdd2290-f3da-498b-9df3-c052b1a247ad.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Traders pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.000010) but could not clear the hurdle at the 50-day SMA ($0.000012). This suggests that bears are defending the level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 The sellers are attempting to pull the price back below the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, it will suggest that the recent recovery may have been a bear market rally. The SHIB/USDT pair could then drop toward $0.000007.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI is near the midpoint suggesting a range-bound action in the near term. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA to signal a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDYvYTc0MjE4NTMtNjk1NS00NGVmLTg3MGYtOGFiNzE2YzQ5MTIxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220622ei6m000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/20: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, SOL, DOGE, DOT, LEO, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,770 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 June 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins attempted a relief rally, but most breakouts are being capped-off well below the 20-day moving average.\par \par \uc2 The crypto markets have been in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/trading-for-beginners/bull-vs-bear-crypto-market-what-is-the-difference-and-how-to-handle-both"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 strong bear phase}}}\uc2  for the past several months but \uc2 JPMorgan Chase\uc2  analysts expect that to change and they have projected a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/record-stablecoin-market-share-points-to-crypto-upside-jpmorgan"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 significant upside from the current levels}}}\uc2 . The analysts cited the rising share of all stablecoins in the total crypto market for their \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook.\par \par \uc2 Unperturbed by the current fall, retail traders have been adding Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) to their portfolios. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-mints-more-than-13-000-wholecoiners-in-the-past-seven-days"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 number of wallet addresses holding one Bitcoin surged}}}\uc2  by 13,091 to a record high of 865,254. Similarly, the number of addresses holding about 0.1 Bitcoin has also witnessed a sharp rise in the past 10 days, according to data from Glassnode.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/30d694f3-7e2f-4638-b6ee-52ac38575130.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s sharp recovery from the June 18 fall shows {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-recovers-to-3-day-highs-as-new-whale-support-forms-at-19-2k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 strong buying at lower levels}}}\uc2  and according to Whalemap, this has led to the formation of a new \u8220\'20\'1Cwhale level,\u8221\'20\'1D which may act as short-term support.\par \par \uc2 Could the recovery in Bitcoin and major altcoins continue in the near term? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin plunged below $20,000 on June 18 but made an equally sharp recovery on June 19, indicating aggressive buying at lower levels. If bulls sustain the price above $20,000, it could improve sentiment and attract more buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/d4fd620d-a0c2-4607-8b11-a02268bb9445.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair could first rise to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $23,024 and then to the 20-day exponential moving average (EM($24,890). The bears are likely to defend this zone with all their might.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this zone, the sellers will make another attempt to pull the pair below $20,000. A break and close below $17,622 could start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if buyers push the price above the 20-day EMA, it will signal a potential change in trend. The pair could then rally to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($29,386) where the bears may mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) plummeted below the psychological level of $1,000 on June 18, which suggests that the downtrend remains intact. A minor positive is that the bulls purchased the dip as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/1ca7957e-b868-4da0-868b-05933f9112fc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers sustained the momentum on June 19 and pushed the price back above $1,000. The ETH/USDT pair could rise to $1,250 and later to the 20-day EMA ($1,429). This remains the critical resistance to watch out for.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are active at higher levels. The sellers will then try to pull the pair to the June 18 intraday low of $881. A break and close below this level could signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  broke and closed below the strong support at $211 on June 18 but the bears could not build upon this advantage. This suggests that lower levels continue to attract buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/5f2607b8-01fb-4537-9899-bb2cd1ec9dfd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price back above the breakdown level of $211 on June 19. If buyers sustain this level, it will suggest that the breakdown on June 18 may have been a bear trap.\par \par \uc2 If bears rush to cover their positions, it could cause a short squeeze and push the BNB/USDT pair toward the 20-day EMA ($251). If bulls overcome this barrier, the pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($297).\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $211, it will suggest that bears are selling on minor rallies. The bears will then try to sink the pair below $183 and resume the downtrend.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls once again successfully defended the $0.44 to $0.40 zone on June 18. That started a recovery in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), which has reached the 20-day EMA ($0.52).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/8aaf98dc-65d6-4bc9-9c55-c7faf928469f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive the price above the moving averages, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance zone between $0.70 and $0.74. The bears are likely to defend this zone with all their might.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from it, the pair could remain stuck in a wide range between $0.40 and $0.74 for a few days. The next trending move could begin after bulls push the price above $0.74 or bears pull the pair below $0.40.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) slipped below $0.29 on June 18 but the bears could not capitalize on the advantage. This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/32794e5f-94d7-4f76-abb1-b733ffc925f2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls may attempt to push the price to the overhead resistance zone between the 20-day EMA ($0.35) and the breakdown level of $0.38. The bears are likely to defend this zone aggressively but if bulls bulldoze their way through, the XRP/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $0.46.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead zone. The bears will then make another attempt to sink and sustain the price below $0.29.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) remains in a downtrend but the bulls are attempting to start a recovery. The price has reached the 20-day EMA ($36), which is an important level to keep an eye on.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/f78d863f-cb99-4e13-919f-718ac4a5601e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The positive divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) indicates that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening. If buyers propel the price above the 20-day EMA, the SOL/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($49). This level may again act as a resistance but if bulls clear this hurdle, the next stop could be $60.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that bears continue to defend the 20-day EMA with vigor. The bears will have to pull the pair below $25 to signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) below the psychological support at $0.05 on June 18 but they could not sustain the lower levels. This suggests that bulls are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/428c3a5a-032e-43a8-91d5-3aaa3f4a1a1b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Buyers will try to push the price to the 20-day EMA ($0.07) which could act as a stiff barrier. If the price turns down from this level, it will suggest that bears remain in command. The sellers will then make one more attempt to sink and sustain the price below $0.05. If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to $0.04.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break and close above the 20-day EMA will be the first indication that the bulls are on a comeback. The pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA ($0.09), which may again act as a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-analyst-warns-of-clean-fakeout-despite-30-eth-price-rebound"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum analyst warns of 'clean fakeout' despite 30% ETH price rebound}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to sink Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) below the support at $6.36 on June 18 but the bulls held their ground. Strong buying at lower levels pushed the price back above the breakdown level of $7.30 on June 19.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/fadd2125-482c-4bb3-9418-2bf5d8deb008.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will attempt to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($8.33). If they succeed, it will suggest the start of a sustained recovery. The DOT/USDT pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA ($10.06) and later to the overhead resistance at $12.44. The positive divergence on the RSI is also pointing toward a possible relief rally.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again try to sink the pair below $6.36 and resume the downtrend. The next support on the downside is $4.23.\par \par \uc2 LEO/USD\par \par \uc2 UNUS SED LEO ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/leo-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LEO}}}\uc2  ) dipped below the support line of the descending channel on June 18 but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests aggressive buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/c3cb3f96-9c78-4410-b89d-846d07c1d51f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LEO/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls sustained their momentum and pushed the price above the moving averages on June 20. If the LEO/USD pair maintains above the moving averages, the next stop could be the resistance line of the channel. The buyers will have to push the price above this level to indicate the start of a new up-move.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the resistance line, it will suggest that bears are defending the level aggressively. That could keep the pair stuck inside the channel for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the support at $14.50 on June 18 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. The bulls are attempting a rebound on June 20 which could reach the 20-day EMA ($20).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/b2def203-3d10-467b-a537-9b1fd1a05975.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears remain in control and they are selling on rallies. The bears will then make one more attempt to sink the price below $13.71 and resume the downtrend. The next support on the downside is $13.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls thrust the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears may be losing their grip. The AVAX/USDT pair could then attempt a rally to the 50-day SMA ($30) where the bears may again pose a challenge.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDYvZTRkZTQ1OTYtOTE3YS00N2UxLTliNTItNjkwNmI5ZjNjNTA2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220620ei6k000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/17: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, SOL, DOGE, DOT, LEO, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,785 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 June 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price struggles to hold support at $20,000, and the outcome of this battle between bulls and bears will determine the next directional move.\par \par \uc2 The sharp fall in cryptocurrencies has pulled the total crypto market capitalization below $900 billion. According to CoinGoLive, 72 out of the top 100 tokens have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/72-of-the-top-100-coins-have-fallen-90-or-more-here-are-the-holdouts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 declined in excess of 90%}}}\uc2  from their all-time highs. In comparison, the top-10 coins have outperformed during the fall, dropping an average of 79% from their all-time high.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is down more than 70% from its all-time high but the bulls are struggling to arrest the decline. Jurrien Timmer, director of global macro of Fidelity, highlighted that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cheaper-than-it-looks-fidelity-exec-says-btc-undervalued-and-oversold"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could be \u8220\'20\'1Ccheaper than it looks\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2  considering the metric of price-to-network ratio, which is similar to the price-to-earnings ratio used in the equities market to value a stock.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/324a0b3e-bcde-4f7a-825b-cb9f33cf0650.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Billionaire investor Mark Cuban said in an interview with Fortune that projects without valid business prospects will vanish as {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/mark-cuban-says-crypto-crash-highlights-warren-buffett-s-wisdom"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bear markets have a cleansing effect}}}\uc2  on the market. However, he added that innovation in the crypto sector is likely to continue during the market downturn.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and major altcoins hold their respective support levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to keep Bitcoin above the psychological support of $20,000 but they are facing strong resistance at $23,362. This suggests that the bears have not given up and that they continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/6488c9fc-17a7-4c31-ab81-2efbc3af288c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The longer the time spent near $20,000, the greater the possibility of a break below it. If bears sink the price below $20,000, the BTC/USDT pair could witness panic selling. That could pull the price to $17,500 and then to $16,000.\par \par \uc2 The one ray of hope for the buyers is that the relative strength index (RSI) has dipped into deeply oversold levels. This suggests that a relief rally is possible in the short term. If bulls drive the price above $23,362, the pair could rally to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($26,574).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is in a firm bear grip. The bulls bought the dip to $1,014 on June 15, as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. However, the recovery was short-lived as the bears pulled the price back below $1,100 on June 16.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/2c6215f0-ba4e-459d-a3e4-e2e6756eee85.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below $1,000, the selling pressure could accelerate and the ETH/USDT pair could plummet to $900. Although the downsloping moving averages indicate advantage to bears, the deeply oversold level on the RSI suggests that a relief rally may be around the corner.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $1,268 to start a sustained recovery. Above this level, the pair could rise to the 20-day EMA ($1,547) where the bears may again mount a strong resistance.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  is consolidating near the crucial support of $211 since June 13. The bulls started a recovery on June 15 but that fizzled out at $237 on June 16.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/424dbd8d-6210-430e-89ea-0e46d3f6f7d6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price slips below the $211 to $198 support zone, the BNB/USDT pair could start the next leg of the downtrend. The pair could then slide to $186 and later plummet toward the strong support at $150.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rebounds off the $211 support, the buyers will try to propel the pair above $237. If they succeed, the pair could rally to the 20-day EMA ($265). This is an important level to watch out for because a break and close above it will suggest that the pair may have bottomed out.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounced off $0.44 on June 14 and bulls pushed the price to the 20-day EMA ($0.54) on June 15. The bears defended this level aggressively and the price turned down on June 16.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/63b7b622-5dd5-47c6-bb83-534d85923137.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price is stuck between the 20-day EMA and $0.44 but this tight range trading is unlikely to continue for long. If buyers propel the price above the 20-day EMA, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($0.59). A break above this level could open the doors for a potential rally to the overhead zone between $0.69 and $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and plummets below $0.44, it will suggest that bears are back in the game. A break and close below $0.40 could start the next leg of the downward move.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) bounced off $0.29 on June 14 and reached $0.35 on June 15, which turned out to be stiff resistance. The buyers are again attempting to push the price above $0.35.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/c8f1b4dd-93c6-48f5-b565-7cd58b45c6b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the XRP/USDT pair could rally to the breakdown level of $0.38. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it could clear the path for a possible rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.44). The positive divergence on the RSI indicates that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and slips below $0.29, it will suggest the resumption of the downtrend. The next support on the downside is $0.24.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) attempted a recovery on June 15, which hit a barrier at the breakdown level of $35. The price turned down on June 16 but the bulls are attempting to defend the level at $30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/c42edac0-7d5e-4fe0-a13c-c56de6eeb6cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers will make one more attempt to push the price above the overhead zone between $35 and the 20-day EMA ($37). If they succeed, the SOL/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($52).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the overhead zone, it will suggest that bears continue to sell at resistance levels. The bears will then try to sink the pair below $26 and resume the downtrend. The next support on the downside is $22 and then $20.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is consolidating in a downtrend. The buyers defended the psychological level at $0.05 and attempted a relief rally on June 15 but they could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that bears continue to sell on rallies\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/88149222-6474-4a16-b556-af34f9e022ba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers are attempting to arrest the decline near $0.06 on June 17. If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could resume its recovery.\par \par \uc2 A break above the June 15 intraday high could clear the path for a possible rally to the 20-day EMA ($0.07). If bulls overcome this barrier, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.09).\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the critical support at $0.05, it will suggest the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The pair could then decline to $0.04.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whale-support-lines-up-as-trader-says-14k-most-bearish-btc-price-target"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin whale support lines up as trader says $14K 'most \b  \highlight22bearish\b0 \highlight22 ' BTC price target}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) rallied sharply on June 15 and reached the 20-day EMA ($8.62) but the bulls could not overcome this resistance. This indicates that bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/e1f0695c-8cc1-4c0d-9f94-67634e88dfac.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned down sharply on June 16 and has dropped near the critical support zone between $7.30 and $6.36. The buyers are expected to defend this zone aggressively because a failure to do so could resume the downtrend toward $4.23.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the support zone, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The buyers will then make one more attempt to push the price above the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the DOT/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($10.54).\par \par \uc2 LEO/USD\par \par \uc2 UNUS SED LEO ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/leo-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LEO}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the descending channel. The bears pulled the price below the moving averages on June 15 but failed to extend the decline to the support line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/f6f20b4f-8c3d-4427-912f-5e7dddd96039.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LEO/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers are attempting to push the price back toward the moving averages. If the price turns down from this resistance, it could increase the prospects of a retest of the support line of the channel. A break and close below this level could intensify selling.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if buyers push the price above the moving averages, the LEO/USD pair could rise to the resistance line. This is an important level for the bears to defend because a break and close above it could suggest the start of a new up-move to $6.25.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) is consolidating in a downtrend and the bulls are attempting to defend the support at $14.50. The buyers tried to push the price toward the breakdown level of $21.35 on June 16 but the higher levels continue to attract selling.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/13b1997a-4b5c-462e-b3e2-2513a99b9df5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below $14.50, it could signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The AVAX/USDT pair could then decline to $13.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls successfully defend the $14.50 support, the pair could make another attempt to rise to $21.35. This is an important level to watch out for because the bears will try to flip it into resistance and pull the pair down to $14.50.\par \par \uc2 The buyers will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($21.94) to signal a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDYvMTk3OGEyZjQtMWFmMC00ZjJhLTk4MDQtNjc2ZDNmNmRjMDM5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220617ei6h000e5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/17: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, SOL, DOGE, DOT, LEO, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,786 \uc2 words\par \uc2 17 June 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin price struggles to hold support at $20,000, and the outcome of this battle between bulls and bears 