ighlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price is stuck between the 20-day EMA and $0.44 but this tight range trading is unlikely to continue for long. If buyers propel the price above the 20-day EMA, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to the 50-day simple moving average ($0.59). A break above this level could open the doors for a potential rally to the overhead zone between $0.69 and $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and plummets below $0.44, it will suggest that bears are back in the game. A break and close below $0.40 could start the next leg of the downward move.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) bounced off $0.29 on June 14 and reached $0.35 on June 15 which turned out to be a stiff resistance. The buyers are again attempting to push the price above $0.35.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/c8f1b4dd-93c6-48f5-b565-7cd58b45c6b5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the XRP/USDT pair could rally to the breakdown level of $0.38. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it could clear the path for a possible rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.44). The positive divergence on the RSI indicates that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and slips below $0.29, it will suggest the resumption of the downtrend. The next support on the downside is $0.24.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) attempted a recovery on June 15 which hit a barrier at the breakdown level of $35. The price turned down on June 16 but the bulls are attempting to defend the level at $30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/c42edac0-7d5e-4fe0-a13c-c56de6eeb6cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers will make one more attempt to push the price above the overhead zone between $35 and the 20-day EMA ($37). If they succeed, the SOL/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($52).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the overhead zone, it will suggest that bears continue to sell at resistance levels. The bears will then try to sink the pair below $26 and resume the downtrend. The next support on the downside is $22 and then $20.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is consolidating in a downtrend. The buyers defended the psychological level at $0.05 and attempted a relief rally on June 15 but they could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that bears continue to sell on rallies\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/88149222-6474-4a16-b556-af34f9e022ba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers are attempting to arrest the decline near $0.06 on June 17. If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could resume its recovery.\par \par \uc2 A break above the June 15 intraday high could clear the path for a possible rally to the 20-day EMA ($0.07). If bulls overcome this barrier, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.09).\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the critical support at $0.05, it will suggest the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The pair could then decline to $0.04.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whale-support-lines-up-as-trader-says-14k-most-bearish-btc-price-target"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin whale support lines up as trader says $14K 'most \b  \highlight22bearish\b0 \highlight22 ' BTC price target}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) rallied sharply on June 15 and reached the 20-day EMA ($8.62) but the bulls could not overcome this resistance. This indicates that bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/e1f0695c-8cc1-4c0d-9f94-67634e88dfac.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price turned down sharply on June 16 and has dropped near the critical support zone between $7.30 and $6.36. The buyers are expected to defend this zone aggressively because a failure to do so could resume the downtrend toward $4.23.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the support zone, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The buyers will then make one more attempt to push the price above the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the DOT/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($10.54).\par \par \uc2 LEO/USD\par \par \uc2 UNUS SED LEO ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/leo-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LEO}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade inside the descending channel. The bears pulled the price below the moving averages on June 15 but failed to extend the decline to the support line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/f6f20b4f-8c3d-4427-912f-5e7dddd96039.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LEO/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers are attempting to push the price back toward the moving averages. If the price turns down from this resistance, it could increase the prospects of a retest of the support line of the channel. A break and close below this level could intensify selling.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if buyers push the price above the moving averages, the LEO/USD pair could rise to the resistance line. This is an important level for the bears to defend because a break and close above it could suggest the start of a new up-move to $6.25.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) is consolidating in a downtrend and the bulls are attempting to defend the support at $14.50. The buyers tried to push the price toward the breakdown level of $21.35 on June 16 but the higher levels continue to attract selling.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/13b1997a-4b5c-462e-b3e2-2513a99b9df5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below $14.50, it could signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The AVAX/USDT pair could then decline to $13.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls successfully defend the $14.50 support, the pair could make another attempt to rise to $21.35. This is an important level to watch out for because the bears will try to flip it into resistance and pull the pair down to $14.50.\par \par \uc2 The buyers will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($21.94) to signal a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDYvMTk3OGEyZjQtMWFmMC00ZjJhLTk4MDQtNjc2ZDNmNmRjMDM5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220617ei6h000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/15: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, SOL, DOGE, DOT, LEO, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,961 \uc2 words\par \uc2 15 June 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC and select altcoins notched small gains after the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  rolled out a 75 basis point rate hike, but technical analysis suggests that further downside is the most realistic outcome.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-bounces-8-from-lows-amid-warning-btc-price-bottom-shouldn-t-be-like-that"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 plummeted close to the crucial support of $20,000}}}\uc2  as traders panicked and dumped their holdings, fearing an aggressive rate hike by the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  on June 15. Another reason for the sell-off could be fears of possible contagion if lending platform Celsius and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/su-zhu-s-cryptic-statement-as-rumors-swirl-of-3ac-liquidation-and-insolvency"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto venture capital firm Three Arrows Capital}}}\uc2  (3AC) go belly up.\par \par \uc2 Data from on-chain analytics platform CryptoQuant showed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/biggest-bitcoin-exchange-inflows-since-2018-put-potential-20k-bottom-at-risk"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 24-hour exchange inflows of 59,376 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  on June 14, the highest inflows since November 30, 2018. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-for-beginners/how-to-mine-bitcoin-a-beginners-guide-to-mine-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin miners}}}\uc2  also joined other investors in sending Bitcoin to the exchanges. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-miners-exchange-flow-reaches-7-month-high-as-btc-price-tanks-below-21k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin Miners to Exchange flow metric}}}\uc2  reached a seven-month high of 9,476, indicating that the miners may be anticipating a further fall in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/cecc768a-2f62-464b-ba9b-97d77db21033.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Prominent investors are divided on whether a bottom has been made in Bitcoin or not. \uc2 Galaxy Digital Holdings\uc2  chairman and CEO \uc2 Mike Novogratz\uc2  believes that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/is-the-bottom-in-raoul-pal-scaramucci-load-up-novogratz-and-hayes-weigh-in"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could hold $20,000}}}\uc2  and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) may bottom out at $1,000. These levels were also referred to by Arthur Hayes, co-founder and former chief of BitMEX, who cautioned that if the levels crack, it may lead to \u8220\'20\'1Cmassive sell pressure in spot markets.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 What are the important levels to watch out for on Bitcoin and major altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin remains in a firm bear grip. The bulls tried to start a recovery on June 14, as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick, but the bears were in no mood to relent. They sold aggressively and pulled the price to $20,111 on June 15.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/aad34302-2cfb-4d35-9190-b096e9c56b06.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sharp selling in the past few days has pulled the relative strength index (RSI) near 21. This suggests that a rebound is possible in the short term. The BTC/USDT pair could rise to the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level of $24,562 and then to the 50% retracement level at $25,938. The bears are expected to mount a strong defense in this zone.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this overhead zone, the bears will attempt to resume the downtrend by pulling the pair below $20,000. If they succeed, the pair could drop to the next support at $17,500 and later $16,000.\par \par \uc2 The buyers will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA)($27,748) to indicate a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether is in a strong downtrend. The buyers tried to stall the decline on June 14 but they could not sustain the higher levels. The bears renewed their selling on June 15 but the bulls are defending the psychological level of $1,000 with all their might.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/48587a74-426a-4948-926d-e7130887bdc7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The incessant selling of the past few days has pulled the RSI into deeply oversold territory. This suggests that the selling may have been overdone in the short term. This could result in a strong bear market rally that may pick up momentum above $1,268. The ETH/USDT pair could then rally to the 20-day EMA ($1,636).\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price continues lower and breaks below $1,000, it will suggest the resumption of the downtrend. The pair could then drop to $900 where the bulls will again try to arrest the decline.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  is witnessing a tough battle between the bulls and the bears near the crucial level of $211. The bulls tried to start a rebound on June 14 but they could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/fb802aec-55d8-45d1-ac75-42eca42b2f84.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears took advantage of this and pulled the price below $211 on June 15. Although the downsloping moving averages indicate an advantage to bears, the deeply oversold level on the RSI suggests a relief rally in the short term.\par \par \uc2 If bulls sustain the price above $211, the BNB/USDT pair could attempt a rally to the 20-day EMA ($275). A break and close above this resistance could suggest that the pair may remain stuck in a large range between $211 and $350 for some more days.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to resume the downtrend. The next support on the downside is at $186.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to pull Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) below the support at $0.44 on June 13 and 14 but failed to sustain the lower levels. This suggests that the bulls are defending the support zone between $0.44 and $0.40 aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/fd184f08-7349-4a89-830f-8f5ec5a8cf9e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will attempt to push the price above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA)($0.60). If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to $0.69 and then to $0.74. The bears are likely to defend this overhead zone with vigor.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA ($0.54), it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on minor rallies.\par \par \uc2 The bears will then make one more attempt to sink the price below the support zone. If they succeed, the pair could signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The next support on the downside is $0.30.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) dropped to $0.30 on June 13, which is the pattern target of the break below the descending triangle. The bears pulled the price below the support on June 14 but the bulls purchased the dip as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/153a3d7d-dba6-4a80-be20-16b1f79f1106.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers are attempting to start a recovery that could reach the breakdown level of $0.38. If bears flip this level into resistance, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative. The sellers will then try to resume the downtrend and sink the XRP/USDT pair to the next strong support at $0.24.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls drive and sustain the price above $0.38, it will suggest strong buying at lower levels. The buyers will then try to push the pair to the 50-day SMA ($0.45). The bears are likely to pose a strong challenge in the zone between $0.46 and $0.50.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is trying to sustain above the $26 level. The bulls tried to push the price back above the breakdown level of $35 on June 14 but the bears held their ground. This suggests that the bears are trying to flip the $35 level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/66793804-438a-4fbe-83d7-5594fcbb646c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down and breaks below $26, it will suggest the resumption of the downtrend. The SOL/USDT pair could then decline to $22 and later to the psychological level at $20.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view could invalidate in the short term if buyers push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($38). If that happens, the aggressive bears who may have entered short positions below $35 may rush to the exit. That could result in a short squeeze and push the pair toward the overhead resistance at $60.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The buyers are trying to sustain Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above the psychological level of $0.05. The deeply oversold levels on the RSI indicate that a relief rally is possible in the short term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/462fa2f4-4125-4ad3-8671-f9042e1836a0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will try to push the DOGE/USDT pair to the 20-day EMA ($0.07). If the price turns down from this level, the bears will again try to resume the downtrend and sink the pair to $0.04.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks above the 20-day EMA, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up and the pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.09). Such a move will suggest that the pair may have bottomed out in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nexo-price-drops-40-in-three-days-on-rumors-of-ties-to-insolvent-crypto-fund"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 NEXO price drops 40% in three days on contagion fears from 'insolvent' crypto fund}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been trading near the crucial support of $7.30 for the past two days. Although bears pulled the price below $7.30, they could not sustain the lower levels. This indicates strong buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/160611ff-0b5b-4b6f-999b-8fe8663f8b1d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above $7.30, the DOT/USDT pair could rise to the 20-day EMA ($8.80). This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it will suggest that the pair may consolidate between $6.36 and $12.44 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. A break and close below $6.36 could signal the resumption of the downtrend. The pair could then decline to $5 and later to $4.23.\par \par \uc2 LEO/USD\par \par \uc2 UNUS SED LEO ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/leo-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LEO}}}\uc2  ) dipped below the moving averages on June 13 but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows aggressive buying at lower levels. That was followed by an inside-day candlestick pattern on June 14, indicating indecision among the buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/db355177-2120-4f15-a0aa-23a4891a457d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LEO/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push the price toward the resistance line of the descending channel on June 15 but the bears had other plans. They have pulled the price back below the moving averages, increasing the possibility of a drop to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the support line with strength, it will indicate that the LEO/USD pair may extend its stay inside the channel for a few more days. The next trending move could begin if bears sink the pair below the channel or bulls thrust the price above the resistance line.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to defend the $0.000007 level aggressively. Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) formed a Doji candlestick pattern on June 14, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/d9c3bfd9-e6f8-4b2b-8e04-170c126404c8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the uncertainty resolves to the upside and bulls push the price above $0.000009, the SHIB/USDT pair could rise to the breakdown level of $0.000010. If the price turns down from this level, it will suggest that the trend remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then attempt to resume the downtrend and sink the pair to $0.000006.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls drive the price above the downtrend line, it could open the doors for a possible rally to $0.000014. Such a move could suggest that the pair may have bottomed out.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDYvZDMzNjk4MDItOTY3Mi00Nzk4LWJlZGItMjQ3YWU0MzgzNDE3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220615ei6f000e7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/13: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, SOL, DOGE, DOT, LEO, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,814 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 June 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins are seeing heavy selling as today\u8217\'20\'19s massive unwinding could be the final capitulation-level event before the market finally hits a bottom.\par \par \uc2 The United States equities markets extended their decline to start the week on June 13. The S&P 500 hit a new year-to-date low and dipped into {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/trading-for-beginners/bull-vs-bear-crypto-market-what-is-the-difference-and-how-to-handle-both"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/trading-for-beginners/bull-vs-bear-crypto-market-what-is-the-difference-and-how-to-handle-both}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/trading-for-beginners/bull-vs-bear-crypto-market-what-is-the-difference-and-how-to-handle-both"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bear market territory}}}\uc2 , falling more than 20% from its all-time high made on Jan. 4.\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency markets are tracking the equities markets lower and the selling pressure further intensified due to the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tether-celsius-crisis-has-no-impact-on-usdt-reserves"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rumored liquidity crisis}}}\uc2  of major lending platform Celsius and traders possibly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-price-flash-crashes-to-950-on-uniswap-as-whale-dumps-93k-eth"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 selling positions to meet margin calls}}}\uc2 . This pulled the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-nears-23-8k-may-low-as-crypto-market-cap-drops-under-1-trillion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 total crypto market capitalization below $1 trillion}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/ce8aa10e-1bec-4466-ac18-f1b2bbe1145e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 The sharp declines have led some analysts to project {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-analysts-are-watching-these-btc-price-levels-as-key-trendline-looms"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 extremely \b  \highlight22bearish\b0 \highlight22  targets}}}\uc2 . While anything is possible in the markets and it is difficult to call a bottom, capitulations usually tend to start a bottoming formation. Traders may get their buy list ready and consider accumulating in phases after the price stops falling.\par \par \uc2 What are the important levels that may arrest the decline in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and major altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke below the immediate support at $28,630 on June 11. This accelerated selling and the bears pulled the price below the critical support at $26,700 on June 12. This indicated the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/f7397674-1d0d-4567-a0a9-9607c084e372.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears maintained their selling pressure on June 13 and sent the BTC/USDT pair tumbling to an intraday low of $22,600. The sharp fall of the past few days has pulled the relative strength index (RSI) into the oversold zone. This suggests that a relief rally or consolidation is likely in the next few days.\par \par \uc2 Any recovery is likely to face selling in the zone between $26,700 and $28,630. If bears flip this zone into resistance, it will suggest that sentiment remains negative. Traders could then make one more attempt to resume the downtrend. A break below $22,600 could sink the pair to the psychological level at $20,000.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $28,630 to suggest that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) plummeted below the vital support of $1,700 on June 10, indicating that bears are in control. This signaled the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/03e4111e-2317-498b-801a-997b822f4c94.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling picked up momentum on June 11 and bears have pulled the price below the strong support at $1,300. This suggests that traders are gripped with fear and are dumping their positions.\par \par \uc2 The aggressive selling of the past three days has pulled the RSI below 22. Historically, the ETH/USDT pair starts a relief rally when the RSI falls close to 21. This suggests that the pair could attempt a rally to the breakdown level of $1,700.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bears sustain their selling pressure, the pair could drop to psychological support at $1,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  back into the triangle may have attracted strong selling by the bears on June 11. The selling picked up momentum and the price has dropped near the strong support at $211.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/8114b755-ae72-4b06-82e4-0f9ac0d9d89c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $211, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The buyers will then make an attempt to push the price above the 20-day exponential moving average ($289). If they succeed, it will indicate that the BNB/USDT pair may remain range-bound between $211 and $350 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bears sink the price below $211, it will signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The psychological level of $200 may offer a minor support but if the level gives way, the next support could be at $186.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA ($0.56) on June 10 and attempts by the bulls to push the price back above the level on June 11 met with strong selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/a590dbb7-2dc5-4683-8e83-1116d48d6e67.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears have pulled the price to the strong support zone between $0.44 and $0.40. This zone is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls because a break below it could signal the resumption of the downtrend. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then start its southward journey toward the next major support at $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rises from the current level, the bulls will attempt to push the pair above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA($0.61). If that happens, the pair may consolidate between $0.74 and $0.40 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the support at $0.38 on June 11. This completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern, signaling that sellers have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/e99dbd97-80ad-4766-903c-bdc630b31517.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling picked up momentum and bears pulled the price below the crucial support at $0.33 on June 13. This indicates the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The short-term bears may book profits near the pattern target of $0.30.\par \par \uc2 If they do that, the XRP/USDT pair could start a relief rally that may reach the breakdown level of $0.33 and then $0.38. Alternatively, if bears sink the price below $0.30, the pair could drop to the next strong support at $0.24.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) had been stuck between the 20-day EMA ($40) and $35 for a few days. This uncertainty resolved to the downside on June 11 as bears pulled the price below the support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/3ff968eb-0618-4404-addf-b3df086701cf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This accelerated the selling and the bears pulled the price below the immediate support at $30. The next support on the downside is $22 and later $20.\par \par \uc2 The sharp selling of the past few days has sent the RSI into the oversold territory. This suggests a relief rally or consolidation is likely in the near term. The bulls will attempt to push the price above the breakdown level of $35 and the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, it will suggest that the current breakdown may have been a bear trap.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) tight range trading expanded to the downside on June 10. The bears pulled the price below the May 12 intraday low of $0.07 on June 11, indicating the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/97ad7c59-1006-4ed3-b6c8-b5741f195789.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling further picked up momentum and the bears pulled the DOGE/USDT pair to the psychological support of $0.05. This level could act as a short-term support because the deeply oversold levels on the RSI suggest a relief rally is possible.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bears will attempt to stall the recovery at the breakdown level of $0.07. If the price turns down from this resistance, the bears will attempt to resume the downtrend and sink the pair to $0.04. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA ($0.08).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-to-survive-in-a-bear-market-tips-for-beginners"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 How to survive in a bear market? Tips for beginners}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) back into the symmetrical triangle attracted aggressive selling by the bears on June 10. That started a downward move that pulled the price below the critical support of $7.30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/5398729a-7dc5-486b-b1e8-42eb0bb547ea.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push the price back above the breakdown level of $7.30. If they manage to do that, it will suggest that the break below $7.30 may have been a bear trap. The DOT/USDT pair could then rise to the 20-day EMA ($9.17).\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price fails to rise above $7.30, it will suggest that the bears have flipped the level into resistance. That could resume the downtrend with the next stop being the psychological level of $5 and then the pattern target of $4.23.\par \par \uc2 LEO/USD\par \par \uc2 UNUS SED LEO ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/leo-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LEO}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a descending channel for the past several weeks. The bears are posing a challenge near $5.60 but are finding it difficult to pull the price below the 20-day EMA ($5.24).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/7ec5de00-c1e4-4916-adf1-5005cd2230a6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LEO/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off the current level and rises above $5.60, the LEO/USD pair could gradually move up to the resistance line of the channel. The bears are likely to defend this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the resistance line, the bears will attempt to sink the pair below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the pair may gradually dip toward the support line. Such a move will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the channel for some more time.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move could begin after the bulls push the price above the resistance line or bears sink the pair below the support line.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) tight range trading between the 20-day EMA ($24) and the critical support of $21 resolved to the downside on June 11. This indicated the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/e787776f-3567-4bf2-a7f4-b877643a9d1e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling picked up momentum and sliced through the support at $18 on June 12. There is a minor support at $15 but if this level breaks down, the AVAX/USDT pair could plummet to the next strong support of $13.\par \par \uc2 Although the downsloping moving averages indicate advantage to sellers, the oversold levels on the RSI suggest that the selling may have been overdone in the near term. That could result in a relief rally to the breakdown level of $21. The bulls will have to push the price above the 20-day EMA to indicate that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDYvZjAwZTQ1ZWEtMzcxZC00ZjFhLWJkNWQtMmZmNDRhNTI4N2ViLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220613ei6d000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/13: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, SOL, DOGE, DOT, LEO, AVAX\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,795 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 June 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins are seeing heavy selling as today\u8217\'20\'19s massive unwinding could be the final capitulation-level event before the market finally hits a bottom.\par \par \uc2 The United States equities markets extended their decline to start the week on June 13. The S&P 500 hit a new year-to-date low and dipped into {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/trading-for-beginners/bull-vs-bear-crypto-market-what-is-the-difference-and-how-to-handle-both"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bear market}}}\uc2  territory, falling more than 20% from its all-time high made on Jan. 4.\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency markets are tracking the equities markets lower and the selling pressure further intensified due to the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tether-celsius-crisis-has-no-impact-on-usdt-reserves"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rumored liquidity crisis}}}\uc2  of major lending platform Celsius and traders possibly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-price-flash-crashes-to-950-on-uniswap-as-whale-dumps-93k-eth"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 selling positions to meet margin calls}}}\uc2 . This pulled the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-nears-23-8k-may-low-as-crypto-market-cap-drops-under-1-trillion"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 total crypto market capitalization below $1 trillion}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/ce8aa10e-1bec-4466-ac18-f1b2bbe1145e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 The sharp declines have led some analysts to project {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-analysts-are-watching-these-btc-price-levels-as-key-trendline-looms"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 extremely \b  \highlight22bearish\b0 \highlight22  targets}}}\uc2 . While anything is possible in the markets and it is difficult to call a bottom, capitulations usually tend to start a bottoming formation. Traders may get their buy list ready and consider accumulating in phases after the price stops falling.\par \par \uc2 What are the important levels that may arrest the decline in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and major altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke below the immediate support at $28,630 on June 11. This accelerated selling and the bears pulled the price below the critical support at $26,700 on June 12. This indicated the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/f7397674-1d0d-4567-a0a9-9607c084e372.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears maintained their selling pressure on June 13 and sent the BTC/USDT pair tumbling to an intraday low of $22,600. The sharp fall of the past few days has pulled the relative strength index (RSI) into the oversold zone. This suggests that a relief rally or consolidation is likely in the next few days.\par \par \uc2 Any recovery is likely to face selling in the zone between $26,700 and $28,630. If bears flip this zone into resistance, it will suggest that sentiment remains negative. Traders could then make one more attempt to resume the downtrend. A break below $22,600 could sink the pair to the psychological level at $20,000.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $28,630 to suggest that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) plummeted below the vital support of $1,700 on June 10, indicating that bears are in control. This signaled the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/03e4111e-2317-498b-801a-997b822f4c94.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling picked up momentum on June 11 and bears have pulled the price below the strong support at $1,300. This suggests that traders are gripped with fear and are dumping their positions.\par \par \uc2 The aggressive selling of the past three days has pulled the RSI below 22. Historically, the ETH/USDT pair starts a relief rally when the RSI falls close to 21. This suggests that the pair could attempt a rally to the breakdown level of $1,700.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bears sustain their selling pressure, the pair could drop to psychological support at $1,000.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) back into the triangle may have attracted strong selling by the bears on June 11. The selling picked up momentum and the price has dropped near the strong support at $211.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/8114b755-ae72-4b06-82e4-0f9ac0d9d89c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $211, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The buyers will then make an attempt to push the price above the 20-day exponential moving average ($289). If they succeed, it will indicate that the BNB/USDT pair may remain range-bound between $211 and $350 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bears sink the price below $211, it will signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The psychological level of $200 may offer a minor support but if the level gives way, the next support could be at $186.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA ($0.56) on June 10 and attempts by the bulls to push the price back above the level on June 11 met with strong selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/a590dbb7-2dc5-4683-8e83-1116d48d6e67.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears have pulled the price to the strong support zone between $0.44 and $0.40. This zone is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls because a break below it could signal the resumption of the downtrend. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then start its southward journey toward the next major support at $0.30.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rises from the current level, the bulls will attempt to push the pair above the 50-day simple moving average ($0.61). If that happens, the pair may consolidate between $0.74 and $0.40 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the support at $0.38 on June 11. This completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern, signaling that sellers have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/e99dbd97-80ad-4766-903c-bdc630b31517.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling picked up momentum and bears pulled the price below the crucial support at $0.33 on June 13. This indicates the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The short-term bears may book profits near the pattern target of $0.30.\par \par \uc2 If they do that, the XRP/USDT pair could start a relief rally that may reach the breakdown level of $0.33 and then $0.38. Alternatively, if bears sink the price below $0.30, the pair could drop to the next strong support at $0.24.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) had been stuck between the 20-day EMA ($40) and $35 for a few days. This uncertainty resolved to the downside on June 11 as bears pulled the price below the support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/3ff968eb-0618-4404-addf-b3df086701cf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This accelerated the selling and the bears pulled the price below the immediate support at $30. The next support on the downside is $22 and later $20.\par \par \uc2 The sharp selling of the past few days has sent the RSI into the oversold territory. This suggests a relief rally or consolidation is likely in the near term. The bulls will attempt to push the price above the breakdown level of $35 and the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, it will suggest that the current breakdown may have been a bear trap.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) tight range trading expanded to the downside on June 10. The bears pulled the price below the May 12 intraday low of $0.07 on June 11, indicating the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/97ad7c59-1006-4ed3-b6c8-b5741f195789.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling further picked up momentum and the bears pulled the DOGE/USDT pair to the psychological support of $0.05. This level could act as a short-term support because the deeply oversold levels on the RSI suggest a relief rally is possible.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bears will attempt to stall the recovery at the breakdown level of $0.07. If the price turns down from this resistance, the bears will attempt to resume the downtrend and sink the pair to $0.04. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA ($0.08).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/how-to-survive-in-a-bear-market-tips-for-beginners"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 How to survive in a bear market? Tips for beginners}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) back into the symmetrical triangle attracted aggressive selling by the bears on June 10. That started a downward move which pulled the price below the critical support of $7.30.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/5398729a-7dc5-486b-b1e8-42eb0bb547ea.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push the price back above the breakdown level of $7.30. If they manage to do that, it will suggest that the break below $7.30 may have been a bear trap. The DOT/USDT pair could then rise to the 20-day EMA ($9.17).\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price fails to rise above $7.30, it will suggest that the bears have flipped the level into resistance. That could resume the downtrend with the next stop being the psychological level of $5 and then the pattern target of $4.23.\par \par \uc2 LEO/USD\par \par \uc2 UNUS SED LEO ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/leo-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LEO}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a descending channel for the past several weeks. The bears are posing a challenge near $5.60 but are finding it difficult to pull the price below the 20-day EMA ($5.24).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/7ec5de00-c1e4-4916-adf1-5005cd2230a6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LEO/USD daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price bounces off the current level and rises above $5.60, the LEO/USD pair could gradually move up to the resistance line of the channel. The bears are likely to defend this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the resistance line, the bears will attempt to sink the pair below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the pair may gradually dip toward the support line. Such a move will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the channel for some more time.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move could begin after the bulls push the price above the resistance line or bears sink the pair below the support line.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) tight range trading between the 20-day EMA ($24) and the critical support of $21 resolved to the downside on June 11. This indicated the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/e787776f-3567-4bf2-a7f4-b877643a9d1e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling picked up momentum and sliced through the support at $18 on June 12. There is a minor support at $15 but if this level breaks down, the AVAX/USDT pair could plummet to the next strong support of $13.\par \par \uc2 Although the downsloping moving averages indicate advantage to sellers, the oversold levels on the RSI suggest that the selling may have been overdone in the near term. That could result in a relief rally to the breakdown level of $21. The bulls will have to push the price above the 20-day EMA to indicate that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDYvZjAwZTQ1ZWEtMzcxZC00ZjFhLWJkNWQtMmZmNDRhNTI4N2ViLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220613ei6d000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/10: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, SOL, DOGE, DOT, AVAX, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,768 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 June 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC and altcoins are on the verge of falling below critical support levels, and today\u8217\'20\'19s higher than expected CPI report isn\u8217\'20\'19t helping.\par \par \uc2 The United States equities markets tumbled on June 10 after the Consumer Price Index (CPI) report showed inflation soaring 8.6% from a year ago, the highest increase since 1981. The latest figures show that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-for-beginners/bitcoin-and-inflation-everything-you-need-to-know"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 talks of inflation having peaked were premature}}}\uc2  and according to \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2 , investors are pricing in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-falls-under-29-5k-after-unexpected-40-year-high-us-inflation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 key interest rate of 3%}}}\uc2  by the end of the year.\par \par \uc2 Continuing its tight correlation with the S&P 500, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) dipped below $30,000 on June 10. Analysts are still divided about the near-term price action but Fundstrat co-founder \uc2 Tom Lee\uc2  said in an interview with CNBC that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-will-finish-2022-flat-possibly-up-says-analyst-as-saylor-bets-on-1m-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin may have already bottomed}}}\uc2 . However, Lee seems to have toned down his expectations as he said that Bitcoin could \u8220\'20\'1Cremain flat for the year, possibly up.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/5445d36d-aff8-4510-a565-d431faf603a4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Among the constant flow of negative news, there was a ray of hope from news that \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  expanded coverage of cryptocurrency data on its Bloomberg Terminal to 50 crypto assets. \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  cryptocurrency product manager Alex Wenham, gave positive vibes as he said that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bloomberg-terminal-supersizes-its-crypto-coverage-40-more-coins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 institutional interest in digital assets continues to grow}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Now that Bitcoin is trading near swing lows again, is a capitulation-level crisis a threat? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push the price above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($30,365) on June 9 but the bears did not relent. The selling continued on June 10 and the bears have pulled the price below the trendline of the ascending triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/d36ac8a6-b2c3-427f-8829-8b773422b5df.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn down gradually and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the negative territory, indicating advantage to sellers.\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below the trendline, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. That could pull the BTC/USDT pair down to $28,630, which may act as strong support but if this level cracks, the decline could extend to $26,700.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off $28,630 and rises above the 20-day EMA, the up-move could reach $32,659.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Strong selling on June 10 has pulled Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) below the critical support at $1,700. If the price sustains below this support, the pair could resume its downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/3c623cc4-967c-4a09-9ec2-08fe912e6820.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair could first decline to $1,500 and if this level also gives way, the next stop could be the vital support at $1,300. The bulls are expected to defend this level with all their might.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bears fail to sustain the price below $1,700, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. That could open the doors for a possible rally to $2,159.\par \par \uc2 The indicators are giving a mixed signal because the downsloping moving averages favor the sellers but the positive divergence on the RSI suggests that a relief rally may be around the corner.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  has been trading below the support line of the symmetrical triangle for the past three days but the bears have not been able to build upon the breakdown. This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/148c98d9-a029-45bb-adbd-70305188961c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers will try to push the price back into the triangle. If that happens, the aggressive bears who may have gone short on the break below the support line may get trapped. That could result in a short-covering, which could push the price above the resistance line of the triangle. Such a move will suggest that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price continues lower from the current level and plummets below $273, it will increase the possibility of a break below the critical support of $260. The pair could then start a decline toward the vital support of $211.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($0.64) on June 8 and 9 but could not sustain the higher levels. That may have tempted short-term traders to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/67c29a1a-d76b-4b30-88e9-7a026d184770.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are attempting to sustain the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.58). If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could plummet to the next support at $0.53. If this level also gives way, the decline could extend to $0.44.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the current level, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned positive and the bulls are buying on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at the 50-day SMA. If they succeed, the pair could rally to the breakdown level of $0.74, which may again act as a resistance.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) had been trading close to the downtrend line for the past two days. The failure to push the price above the overhead resistance may have attracted profit-booking from the short-term traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/3ccb0939-69e7-4057-8315-857f49b2e9f5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair has dipped to the strong support of $0.38 where the buyers may attempt to stall the decline. If the price rebounds off the support and rises above the downtrend line, the pair could rally to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bears sink and sustain the price below $0.38, it will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. That could intensify the selling and pull the price down to $0.33. A break below this support could signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is trading between the 20-day EMA ($44) and $37 for the past few days. The buyers tried to push the price above the 20-day EMA on June 9 but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/6c29dd20-42a5-4f8a-8c61-19d4471b878e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The positive divergence on the RSI indicates a minor advantage to buyers while the downsloping moving averages suggest that bears have the upper hand. This uncertainty is unlikely to continue for long. If bears sink the price below $35, the SOL/USDT pair may resume the downtrend The next stop on the downside could be $30.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bulls propel the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to $50 and then to the overhead resistance at $60.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls struggled to sustain Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above $0.08 on June 8 and 9. This may have attracted further selling and the support collapsed on June 10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/62bb626f-7506-431d-be88-3294ffa225bd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to build upon their advantage and attempt to sink the price to the vital support of $0.07. A break and close below this level could signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 This negative view could invalidate in the short term if the price turns up and breaks above the 20-day EMA ($0.08). That could attract buying from the aggressive bulls, which could push the DOGE/USDT pair to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-eyes-fresh-yearly-lows-vs-bitcoin-as-bulls-snub-successful-merge-rehearsal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum eyes fresh yearly lows vs. Bitcoin as bulls snub successful 'Merge' rehearsal}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) back into the symmetrical triangle on June 9 but the bears defended the level aggressively. This suggests that the bears have flipped the support line into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/ee36cf49-769e-458f-ba8d-a7a5069b3442.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will attempt to sink the price below the immediate support of $8.56. If they succeed, the DOT/USDT pair could drop to the critical level at $7.30. The bears will have to pull the price below this support to indicate the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view could invalidate if the price rebounds off $8.56 and rises above the resistance line. If that happens, the pair could attract buyers who may then attempt to push the price to $11 and later to $12.50.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) formed a Doji candlestick pattern for the past two days indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. This uncertainty resolved to the downside on June 10 and bears are trying to pull the price to the strong support at $21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/d8906739-f55b-424a-a037-99cb4a765006.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price is stuck between the 20-day EMA ($27) and $21. This tight-range trading is likely to resolve with a range expansion in the next few days. Although the positive divergence on the RSI indicates a minor advantage to buyers, the downsloping moving averages suggest that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the range expands to the downside and the price drops below $21, it will suggest the resumption of the downtrend. The AVAX/USDT pair could then decline to $18. Alternatively, if the price explodes above the 20-day EMA, it may clear the path for a possible rally to $33 and then $37.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading close to the strong support at $0.000010 since June 7. Although bulls have defended the support, they have failed to achieve a strong rebound.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/509b3456-9da6-4df3-9ee9-be5b8b128624.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This increases the possibility of a break below the strong support at $0.000010. If that happens, the SHIB/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. The pair could then decline to the May 12 intraday low of $0.000009. If this support also cracks, the next stop could be $0.000006.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, the buyers will have to push the price above the downtrend line. That could clear the path for a possible rally to $0.000014.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDYvYzBjNTkxOWEtMWJkMS00N2RkLWFiOTctOTgxNzA5MDE0NDc2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220610ei6a000e6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Crypto Biz: Stablecoins are paving the way for mass adoption of crypto, June 2\u8211\'20\'138\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Sam Bourgi \par \uc2 788 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 June 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The business of blockchain and cryptocurrency continues to evolve despite turbulent market conditions.\par \par \uc2 Stablecoins are a controversial subject in crypto. Questioning the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/relax-tether-won-t-be-targeted-by-sec-says-bitfinex-cto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 legitimacy and backing of Tether}}}\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) is a right of passage for many entering the crypto market for the first time. The meltdown of the Terra (LUNC; or the old LUNA) ecosystem left little doubt that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-biz-luna-s-meltdown-will-live-on-in-infamy-may-5-11-2022"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 algorithmic stablecoins don\u8217\'20\'19t have a future}}}\uc2  beyond Do Kwon\u8217\'20\'19s fantasies. Pesky regulators are constantly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-united-states-turns-its-attention-to-stablecoin-regulation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 poking and prodding}}}\uc2  at dollar-pegged assets to carve out firmer rules on their usage.\par \par \uc2 But, if you look beyond all the fear, uncertainty and doubt, stablecoins are providing liquidity to millions of people who don\u8217\'20\'19t have access to dollars because of capital controls or sanctions, or because hyperinflation is destroying their local currency. This week\u8217\'20\'19s Crypto Biz newsletter looks at the role of stablecoins in fueling e-commerce. We also do some prodding of our own to see if a major payment platform is prepping its own stable asset.\par \par \uc2 Checkout\u8203\'20\'0B.com launches 24/7 stablecoin settlement in partnership with Fireblocks\par \par \uc2 If crypto is ever going to achieve mainstream success as a payment system, stablecoins will likely play a major role. This week, global payment processor Checkout.com announced that it was launching a new {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/checkout-com-launches-24-7-stablecoin-settlement-in-partnership-with-fireblocks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stablecoin settlement system}}}\uc2  centered around Circle\u8217\'20\'19s USD Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/usdc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDC}}}\uc2  ). Now, merchants who use Checkout.com will be able to receive USDC payments and convert them into fiat instantly. As it turns out, Checkout.com already settled more than $300 million in USDC transactions during its beta testing phase. Regardless of what you think of them, stablecoins continue to deliver real-world utility.\par \par \uc2 Crypto.com\u8217\'20\'19s Cronos launches $100M accelerator for DeFi and Web3\par \par \uc2 On Tuesday, \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchange Crypto.com announced that its Cronos blockchain ecosystem had launched a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-com-s-cronos-launches-100m-accelerator-for-defi-and-web3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $100 million accelerator program}}}\uc2  to fast-track decentralized finance, Web3 and metaverse projects. The new fund aims to help up-and-coming crypto projects earn seed and pre-seed investments as they get their concepts and business models off the ground. You may have heard that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/after-record-growth-vc-crypto-investments-decline-38-in-may"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 venture capital funding into crypto has slowed}}}\uc2  somewhat from its torrid pace. That may be true, but 2022 is already shaping up to be a record-breaking year for VC funding \u8212\'20\'14 and we\u8217\'20\'19re not even halfway through.\par \par \uc2 FTX will not freeze hiring amid layoffs at other crypto firms, CEO states\par \par \uc2 The bear market has been brutal on crypto exchanges and other blockchain-focused companies. Amid heartbreaking stories of people accepting jobs at \uc2 Coinbase\uc2  only to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-jobs-market-holding-up-despite-tech-industry-cutbacks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 have their offers rescinded}}}\uc2  due to a hiring freeze, derivatives exchange FTX clarified this week that its HR department will {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ftx-will-not-freeze-hiring-amid-layoffs-at-other-crypto-firms-ceo-states"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 continue to add personnel}}}\uc2 . CEO \uc2 Sam Bankman\uc2 -Fried explained that his exchange will \u8220\'20\'1Ckeep growing\u8221\'20\'1D despite the so-called crypto winter. In fact, the CEO said he has no plans to scale back. \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19re going to keep pushing forward,\u8221\'20\'1D he tweeted. Maybe it\u8217\'20\'19s time to consider a career in crypto derivatives?\par \par \uc2 12) And because we hired carefully, we can keep growing regardless of market conditions.\par \par \uc2 Because we exponentially scaled our revenue and productivity, not our expenses.\par \par \uc2 But more importantly, because each person we add takes on a huge opportunity, and a huge responsibility.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 SBF (@SBF_FTX) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/SBF_FTX/status/1533946727270596608?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 June 6, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 PayPal\uc2  enables transfer of digital currencies to external wallets\par \par \uc2 When \uc2 PayPal\uc2  launched its crypto services in October 2020, the company provided a huge market catalyst by sucking up the available supply of newly minted Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ). Now, finally, the global payment provider is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/paypal-enables-transfer-of-digital-currencies-to-external-wallets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 allowing users to natively transfer}}}\uc2 , send and receive crypto between \uc2 PayPal\uc2  and external wallets and exchanges. Of course, the service is currently available only to United States residents. You may also be intrigued to know that \uc2 PayPal\uc2  is still actively exploring the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/paypal-stablecoin-what-it-could-mean-for-payments"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 creation of its own stablecoin}}}\uc2  \u8212\'20\'14 at least, according to the source code on the company\u8217\'20\'19s iPhone app.\par \par \uc2 Before you go! Can the Merge save Ethereum from the ETH Killers?\par \par \uc2 There\u8217\'20\'19s a lot riding on the successful rollout of Ethereum 2.0. On this week\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://youtu.be/HpK3CXaWI3s"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Market Report}}}\uc2 , I sat down with fellow analysts Jordan Finneseth, Marcel Pechman and Benton Yuan to explain what exactly Eth2 entails and whether competitors such as Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2 , Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) can actually de-throne Ethereum as the largest smart contract platform. What do you think \u8212\'20\'14 do they stand a chance? Catch a recording of the discussion below and tell us what you think.\par \par \uc2 Crypto Biz is your weekly pulse of the business behind blockchain and crypto delivered directly to your inbox every Thursday.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDYvODBiOTIyNDUtYmY3NC00OGUxLTk1YTItNjI1YmE3ZjliYjY3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220610ei6a000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/10: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, SOL, DOGE, DOT, AVAX, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,772 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 June 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC and altcoins are on the verge of falling below critical support levels, and today\u8217\'20\'19s higher than expected CPI report isn\u8217\'20\'19t helping.\par \par \uc2 The United States equities markets tumbled on June 10 after the consumer price index report showed inflation soaring 8.6% from a year ago, the highest increase since 1981. The latest figures show that talks of i {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-for-beginners/bitcoin-and-inflation-everything-you-need-to-know"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 nflation}}}\uc2  having peaked were premature and according to \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2 , investors are pricing in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-falls-under-29-5k-after-unexpected-40-year-high-us-inflation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 key interest rates of 3%}}}\uc2  by the end of the year.\par \par \uc2 Continuing its tight correlation with the S&P 500, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) dipped below $30,000 on June 10. Analysts are still divided about the near-term price action but Fundstrat co-founder \uc2 Tom Lee\uc2  said in an interview with CNBC that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-will-finish-2022-flat-possibly-up-says-analyst-as-saylor-bets-on-1m-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin may have already bottomed}}}\uc2 . However, Lee seems to have toned down his expectations as he said that Bitcoin could \u8220\'20\'1Cremain flat for the year, possibly up.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/5445d36d-aff8-4510-a565-d431faf603a4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Among the constant flow of negative news, there was a ray of hope from news that \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  expanded coverage of cryptocurrency data on its Bloomberg Terminal to 50 crypto assets. \uc2 Bloomberg\uc2  cryptocurrency product manager Alex Wenham, gave positive vibes as he said that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bloomberg-terminal-supersizes-its-crypto-coverage-40-more-coins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 institutional interest in digital assets continues to grow}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Now that Bitcoin is trading near swing lows again, is a capitulation-level crisis a threat? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push the price above the 20-day exponential moving average ($30,365) on June 9 but the bears did not relent. The selling continued on June 10 and the bears have pulled the price below the trendline of the ascending triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/d36ac8a6-b2c3-427f-8829-8b773422b5df.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn down gradually and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the negative territory, indicating advantage to sellers.\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below the trendline, it will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup. That could pull the BTC/USDT pair down to $28,630 which may act as a strong support but if this level cracks, the decline could extend to $26,700.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off $28,630 and rises above the 20-day EMA, the up-move could reach $32,659.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Strong selling on June 10 has pulled Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) below the critical support at $1,700. If the price sustains below this support, the pair could resume its downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/3c623cc4-967c-4a09-9ec2-08fe912e6820.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The ETH/USDT pair could first decline to $1,500 and if this level also gives way, the next stop could be the vital support at $1,300. The bulls are expected to defend this level with all their might.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bears fail to sustain the price below $1,700, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. That could open the doors for a possible rally to $2,159.\par \par \uc2 The indicators are giving a mixed signal because the downsloping moving averages favor the sellers but the positive divergence on the RSI suggests that a relief rally may be around the corner.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the support line of the symmetrical triangle for the past three days but the bears have not been able to build upon the breakdown. This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/148c98d9-a029-45bb-adbd-70305188961c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers will try to push the price back into the triangle. If that happens, the aggressive bears who may have gone short on the break below the support line may get trapped. That could result in a short-covering, which could push the price above the resistance line of the triangle. Such a move will suggest that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price continues lower from the current level and plummets below $273, it will increase the possibility of a break below the critical support of $260. The pair could then start a decline toward the vital support of $211.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day simple moving average ($0.64) on June 8 and June 9 but could not sustain the higher levels. That may have tempted short-term traders to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/67c29a1a-d76b-4b30-88e9-7a026d184770.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are attempting to sustain the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.58). If they manage to do that, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could plummet to the next support at $0.53. If this level also gives way, the decline could extend to $0.44.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the current level, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned positive and the bulls are buying on dips. The bulls will then make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at the 50-day SMA. If they succeed, the pair could rally to the breakdown level of $0.74 which may again act as a resistance.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) had been trading close to the downtrend line for the past two days. The failure to push the price above the overhead resistance may have attracted profit-booking from the short-term traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/3ccb0939-69e7-4057-8315-857f49b2e9f5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair has dipped to the strong support of $0.38 where the buyers may attempt to stall the decline. If the price rebounds off the support and rises above the downtrend line, the pair could rally to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bears sink and sustain the price below $0.38, it will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. That could intensify the selling and pull the price down to $0.33. A break below this support could signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is trading between the 20-day EMA ($44) and $37 for the past few days. The buyers tried to push the price above the 20-day EMA on June 9 but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/6c29dd20-42a5-4f8a-8c61-19d4471b878e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The positive divergence on the RSI indicates a minor advantage to buyers while the downsloping moving averages suggest that bears have the upper hand. This uncertainty is unlikely to continue for long. If bears sink the price below $35, the SOL/USDT pair may resume the downtrend, The next stop on the downside could be $30.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bulls propel the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to $50 and then to the overhead resistance at $60.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls struggled to sustain Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) above $0.08 on June 8 and June 9. This may have attracted further selling and the support collapsed on June 10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/62bb626f-7506-431d-be88-3294ffa225bd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to build upon their advantage and attempt to sink the price to the vital support of $0.07. A break and close below this level could signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 This negative view could invalidate in the short term if the price turns up and breaks above the 20-day EMA ($0.08). That could attract buying from the aggressive bulls which could push the DOGE/USDT pair to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-eyes-fresh-yearly-lows-vs-bitcoin-as-bulls-snub-successful-merge-rehearsal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum eyes fresh yearly lows vs. Bitcoin as bulls snub successful 'Merge' rehearsal}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls tried to push Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) back into the symmetrical triangle on June 9 but the bears defended the level aggressively. This suggests that the bears have flipped the support line into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/ee36cf49-769e-458f-ba8d-a7a5069b3442.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will attempt to sink the price below the immediate support of $8.56. If they succeed, the DOT/USDT pair could drop to the critical level at $7.30. The bears will have to pull the price below this support to indicate the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view could invalidate if the price rebounds off $8.56 and rises above the resistance line. If that happens, the pair could attract buyers who may then attempt to push the price to $11 and later to $12.50.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) formed a Doji candlestick pattern for the past two days indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. This uncertainty resolved to the downside on June 10 and bears are trying to pull the price to the strong support at $21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/d8906739-f55b-424a-a037-99cb4a765006.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price is stuck between the 20-day EMA ($27) and $21. This tight-range trading is likely to resolve with a range expansion in the next few days. Although the positive divergence on the RSI indicates a minor advantage to buyers, the downsloping moving averages suggest that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the range expands to the downside and the price drops below $21, it will suggest the resumption of the downtrend, The AVAX/USDT pair could then decline to $18. Alternatively, if the price explodes above the 20-day EMA, it may clear the path for a possible rally to $33 and then $37.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) has been trading close to the strong support at $0.000010 since June 7. Although bulls have defended the support, they have failed to achieve a strong rebound off it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/509b3456-9da6-4df3-9ee9-be5b8b128624.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This increases the possibility of a break below the strong support at $0.000010. If that happens, the SHIB/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. The pair could then decline to the May 12 intraday low of $0.000009. If this support also cracks, the next stop could be $0.000006.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, the buyers will have to push the price above the downtrend line. That could clear the path for a possible rally to $0.000014.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDYvYzBjNTkxOWEtMWJkMS00N2RkLWFiOTctOTgxNzA5MDE0NDc2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220610ei6a000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/8: BTC, ETH, BNB,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XRP, SOL, DOGE, DOT, AVAX, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,832 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 June 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins are losing \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum and persistent selling at overhead resistance suggests that the current consolidation is far from over.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade in a range with the local tops and bottoms coinciding with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/can-it-get-any-easier-bitcoin-whales-dictate-when-to-buy-and-sell-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increased whale activity in the region}}}\uc2 , according to on-chain analytics resource Whalemap.\par \par \uc2 The range-bound action in Bitcoin has kept the analysts guessing and a few expect the consolidation to continue for some more time, while others {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-recovers-31-5k-but-traders-say-scam-price-action-will-bring-more-downside"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 anticipate another leg lower}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 A June 6 Glassnode report said that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/longer-term-bitcoin-holder-losses-hit-two-year-lows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 aggregated realized losses from long-term holders}}}\uc2  reflected more than 0.006% of the market capitalization on May 29. This is in comparison to the peak of 0.015% of the market capitalization reached during the 2018 to 2019 bear market.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/8c3e6e7d-3c59-4ab7-86aa-0e9aac0c0157.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Along with the quantum of losses, investors may also have to be prepared for a longer duration of subdued prices. The duration of the current loss for long-term investors is only one month old, while the previous losses remained roughly for a year.\par \par \uc2 Could the lackluster trading action in Bitcoin and other major altcoins continue? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin plunged below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($30,565) on June 7 but a positive sign is that the bulls aggressively purchased the dip to the trendline of the ascending triangle pattern. This resulted in a strong recovery as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. The ascending triangle pattern remains intact favoring the buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/977c7185-eb08-44f2-bd94-b88569989e97.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, a minor negative is that the bulls could not build upon the momentum on June 8. This gave an opportunity to the bears who have again pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA. This suggests that bears continue to sell in the zone between the 20-day EMA and $32,659.\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below the trendline, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to $28,630 where buying may emerge. If that happens, it will suggest that the pair may remain range-bound between $32,659 and $28,630 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The next directional move is likely to begin on a break above $32,659 or below $28,630. Until then, volatile range-bound action is likely to continue.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($1,908) on June 6, indicating that bears are not willing to cede ground to the bulls. The sellers then tried to sink the price below the critical support of $1,700 on June 7 but the long tail on the candlestick shows aggressive buying by the bulls near the support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/3321cd86-020d-42a2-9c11-2374ea41f0db.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price is currently coiling between the downsloping 20-day EMA and $1,700. This is likely to result in a range expansion that could set the stage for the next directional move.\par \par \uc2 If buyers drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to $2,159. The bears may again mount a strong defense at this level. If the price turns down from it, the pair may spend some time inside the $2,159 to $1,700 range.\par \par \uc2 A break above $2,159 will be the first sign that the pair may have bottomed out while a break below $1,700 could signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  turned down from the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle pattern on June 6 and plunged below the support line. This suggests that the bears continue to sell aggressively at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/92e08008-06a9-479e-b01b-0dd3186488bc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price below the immediate support at $286 on June 7 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows strong buying at lower levels. The bulls are attempting to push the price back above the support line on June 8.\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the BNB/USDT pair could try to rise above the resistance line and trap the aggressive bears. Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that the bears have flipped the support line into resistance. That could increase the possibility of a drop to $265.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) June 6 and 7 candlestick shows that bears are selling the rallies to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($0.65). Although bears tried to pull the price below the 20-day EMA ($0.58) on June 7, the bulls held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/2b45a1b7-122d-40c3-9216-454e2cb51c14.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers are again attempting to push the price above the 50-day SMA. If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to the breakdown level of $0.74. This is an important level for the bears to defend because a break and close above it could suggest a potential change in trend. The pair could then rally toward the psychological level of $1.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 50-day SMA or $0.74, the bears will attempt to pull the pair below the 20-day EMA and gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) formed an outside-day candlestick pattern on June 7, with the price rebounding off the strong support at $0.38 and closing near the overhead resistance at the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/c8c827ff-9341-4389-b9fe-2ddab869335e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, buyers could not build upon this move and push the price above the downtrend line on June 8. This suggests that bears continue to sell near resistance levels. The bears will again attempt to sink the price below $0.38.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair will complete a descending triangle pattern. That could result in a decline to the May 12 intraday low of $0.33. If this support cracks, the next stop could be the pattern target of $0.30.\par \par \uc2 This negative view could be invalidated in the short term if bulls propel the price above the 20-day EMA. The pair could then rally to $0.46.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) attempt to start a recovery met with stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($45), which suggests that the trend remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/ad700c89-10ec-4cf6-9f3b-29d26108c897.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price below the crucial support zone between $37 and $35. If they manage to do that, the SOL/USDT pair could resume its downtrend. The pair could then decline to $30.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off the support zone, it will suggest that bulls are accumulating at lower levels. A break above the 20-day EMA will be the first sign that the selling pressure may be reducing. The pair could then rise to $50 and later to $60.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) once again turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.08) on June 6, indicating that bears are selling on rallies. A minor positive is that the bulls purchased the dip on June 7, indicating buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/8d1bc339-bfd7-4d79-87f2-0a4b8ae4c369.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair has been stuck in a tight range between the 20-day EMA and $0.07, indicating uncertainty among the bulls and the bears. Usually, tight ranges resolve with an expansion but it is difficult to predict the direction of the breakout.\par \par \uc2 If the price rises above the 20-day EMA, buyers who may be waiting on the sidelines could enter and push the pair toward the psychological level of $0.10. On the contrary, if the price slips below $0.07, the pair may resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-double-doji-pattern-hints-at-a-50-eth-price-rally-by-september"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum 'double Doji' pattern hints at a 50% ETH price rally by September}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) attempted to rise above the 20-day EMA ($10) on June 6 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows strong selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/e34b80fd-b899-46e8-bb2d-f7a67a0ba5ad.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USDT pair dipped below the support line on June 7, indicating that the symmetrical triangle resolved in favor of the sellers. The pair could next drop to the strong support at $8.50 where the buyers will try to stall the decline.\par \par \uc2 This negative view could invalidate in the short term if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the resistance line of the triangle. Such a move will suggest that the break below the support line may have been a bear trap. The pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA ($12.35).\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 The buyers tried to push Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($28) on June 6 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that the bears are defending the level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/f70a1a53-46a3-431e-9388-5a3a23438bdc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price is getting squeezed between the 20-day EMA and the strong support at $21 but this tight range trading is unlikely to continue for long.\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive the AVAX/USDT pair above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest the start of a recovery that may reach $37. The positive divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) also supports a relief rally in the near term.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the range expands to the downside and the price plummets below $21, the pair could resume its downtrend and drop to $18.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears tried to sink Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) below the strong support of $0.000010 on June 7 but the bulls successfully defended the level as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/3af36caf-3e6c-4563-ac51-33650bf8ac83.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The longer the price trades below the 20-day EMA ($0.000012), the greater the possibility of a break below $0.000010. If that happens, the SHIB/USDT pair could drop to $0.000009 where the bulls may attempt to stall the decline.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view, the bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, the pair could rally to $0.000014 where the bears are likely to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDYvZjAyZjQwMTEtYmNjZi00OWE4LThmZjYtZGNjYjA1MGUzZDI2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220608ei68000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/6: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, AVAX, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,797 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 June 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC and altcoins flashed green at the weekly open, but overhead resistance levels will continue to pose a challenge in the short-term.\par \par \uc2 After nine successive weeks of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/trading-for-beginners/crypto-charts-101-how-to-read-cryptocurrency-charts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 red weekly candles}}}\uc2 , Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) printed a green weekly candle on June 5. Leading into this week, buyers kept up their momentum with a strong weekly open that boosted BTC price to $31,800.\par \par \uc2 Going forward, traders might keep a close eye on the Consumer Price Index (CPI) data for May which is due on June 10. Depending on the figures, this could keep the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-snaps-its-longest-losing-streak-in-history-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22volatility\b0 \highlight22  elevated as investors digest the report}}}\uc2  and speculate on the next possible move of the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/88e0935a-f569-4130-8843-1ff2ff33226b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Analysts are divided about the next directional move for Bitcoin. While some believe a bottom has been made, others anticipate another leg down. For analyst Bob Loukas, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-approaches-32k-as-analyst-warns-of-boring-summer-for-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 price action in the summer could remain uninteresting}}}\uc2  and he expects the new cycle to begin late in the year.\par \par \uc2 Could bulls sustain higher levels or will bears sell aggressively and pull the price down? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 After two small range days on June 4 and June 5, the range expanded on June 6 and Bitcoin soared above the 20-day exponential moving average ($30,510). The bulls are attempting to push the price to the overhead resistance at $32,659.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/ce04ad0a-3a9f-4cdc-85cf-e8cb45767d23.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price action of the past few days has formed an ascending triangle pattern which will complete on a break and close above $32,659. If that happens, the BTC/USDT pair could start a new up-move. The pattern target of the breakout from the triangle is $38,618.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the relative strength index (RSI) is near the midpoint, suggesting that the selling pressure is reducing.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate if the price turns down sharply and plunges below the trendline of the triangle. The pair could then drop to the strong support at $28,630 where the bulls may try to arrest the decline. A break and close below this support could tilt the advantage in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) bounced off $1,737 on June 3, indicating that bulls are attempting to defend the crucial support of $1,700. The buyers are attempting to push the price above the overhead resistance at the 20-day EMA ($1,930) on June 6.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/1d7dc1a1-8eca-4561-9cb1-b6e92dfafb9e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to $2,016. Above this level, the pair could reach the stiff overhead resistance at $2,159. The bears are likely to defend this level aggressively. If the price turns down from this resistance, the pair could consolidate between $2,159 and $1,700 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the June 6 candlestick suggests that bears continue to defend the 20-day EMA. This indicates that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will now try to pull the pair below $1,700 and resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has formed a symmetrical triangle pattern, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. The bulls are attempting to push the price above the resistance line but the bears are not willing to cede ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/2f0459f2-b046-4758-b88c-00f6f0691807.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the bears will again try to pull the BNB/USDT pair below the support line. If they manage to do that, the pair could decline to $265 where buying may emerge.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls push and sustain the price above the resistance line, it will suggest that the sellers are losing their grip. The pair could then rally to the breakdown level of $350. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it could signal that the downtrend may be over.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. The bulls are attempting to push the price above the downtrend line but the bears are posing a strong challenge as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/81cabc78-bf2c-49ee-970f-19d0bde3b135.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls propel the price above the downtrend line, it will negate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern. That could cause a short squeeze, pushing the XRP/USDT pair to $0.46 and later to the psychological level at $0.50.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the downtrend line, the pair could drop to the $0.38 support. If bears pull the price below $0.38, the descending triangle pattern will complete. The pair could then decline to the important support at $0.33. A break and close below this support could resume the downtrend.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) had been sustaining above the 20-day EMA ($0.56) for the past few days suggesting accumulation by the bulls. Buying picked up on June 6 and the bulls are trying to push the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.66).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/ad980ca6-1c31-43f8-99d9-b1e213b10dbb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to the breakdown level of $0.74. This level may again act as a major hurdle but if the bulls overcome it, the recovery could pick up momentum. The pair could then rally to $0.90.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI is just above the midpoint, suggesting a slight edge to buyers.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view could invalidate in the short term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the pair could gradually slide toward the strong support at $0.44.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the critical support of $37 on June 4 but a minor positive is that the bulls purchased at lower levels. This may have caught the aggressive bears off-guard, which resulted in a strong recovery as seen from the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/5bc02467-c5a1-49bf-857a-5a778f383c40.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The RSI has formed a positive divergence, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be reducing. The bulls are attempting to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($46). If they succeed, the SOL/USDT pair could rally to $55 and thereafter to $60.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the trend remains negative and bears are selling on rallies. The bears will then make one more attempt to resume the downtrend by pulling the pair below $35.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is stuck between the 20-day EMA ($0.08) and $0.08 for the past few days but this tight range trading is unlikely to continue for long.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/c79b57c0-6dbb-46e8-b355-aa1a561cc898.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers push the price above the 20-day EMA, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally toward the psychological resistance at $0.10. This level may again act as a hurdle but if bulls overcome it, the pair could rally to $0.12.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on minor rallies. If bears sink the price below $0.08, the pair could drop to $0.07. A break and close below this support will suggest the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/is-cardano-ready-for-a-go-at-1-june-s-hard-fork-fomo-lifts-ada-price-to-weekly-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Is Cardano ready for a go at $1? June's hard fork FOMO lifts \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22  price to weekly highs}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has formed a symmetrical triangle, which usually acts as a continuation pattern. The buyers are attempting to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($10) and challenge the resistance line of the triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/94fa0833-c714-4497-bd28-2cb82dd5be20.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the triangle will be the first indication of a potential trend change. The DOT/USDT pair could rise to $12 and then attempt a rally to the breakdown level of $14. The bears are likely to defend this level aggressively.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and breaks below the triangle, it will suggest that bears are in control. The pair could then decline to $8 and later retest the May 12 intraday low of $7.30.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) bounced off $22.14 on June 4, indicating that bulls are defending the $21.35 support with vigor. The buyers have pushed the price above the downtrend line and are attempting to clear the overhead hurdle at the 20-day EMA ($28).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/12d21526-3b08-43d3-8866-a6dcdc544ada.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the AVAX/USDT pair could pick up momentum and start its northward journey toward $33 and then $37. Such a move will suggest that the bulls are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears remain active at higher levels. The pair could then slide toward $21.35. A break and close below this support could start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The buyers have successfully defended the $0.000010 support for the past several days but they have not been able to push Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.000012). This suggests that buying dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/cc5cf622-8e74-4947-9e6c-7df956b0b635.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The tight range trading between $0.000010 and the 20-day EMA is unlikely to continue for long. If bears sink the price below $0.000010, the SHIB/USDT pair could retest the May 12 intraday low at $0.000009. A break and close below this level could signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if buyers propel the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $0.000014. The bears are expected to mount a strong defense at this level.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDYvNzFhZWQzOGMtNzAxYS00YjU2LTgwOWQtY2MzNzUwMTJjNTQ1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220606ei66000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 BTC price approaches $32K as analyst warns of 'boring' summer for Bitcoin\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 699 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 June 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  BTC price predictions emerge as Bitcoin remains tied to stocks.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) retained new higher levels at the June 6 Wall Street open after BTC/USD snapped a nine-week losing streak.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/ee352db0-379b-4e26-a9d0-5896fbd564da.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Stocks could take BTC as high as $37,000\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.142027444.742658523.1640948929-762064149.1640948929"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  followed the largest cryptocurrency as it circled $31,500 on the back of 6% daily gains.\par \par \uc2 The start of Wall Street trading provided further support to bulls as United States equities headed higher. The S&P 500 traded up 1.4% at the time of writing, while the Nasdaq Composite gained close to 2%.\par \par \uc2 For popular social media analyst Wolf, Bitcoin's correlation to stocks could see further upside should the S&P 500 flip its 21-month exponential moving average (EMA) to support.\par \par \uc2 "$SPX sitting on the monthly 21EMA, should it hold, we will see $BTC recover to the same band now at $36\u8211\'20\'13$37K," he summarized to \uc2 Twitter\uc2  followers on the day.\par \par \uc2 A further post {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/IamCryptoWolf/status/1533764665276342273"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 described}}}\uc2  BTC as "lagging" behind the S&P but apt to "recover pretty soon" in the event of the former holding monthly support.\par \par \uc2 Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe was also more optimistic after $30,000 held overnight on BTC/USD.\par \par \uc2 "A nice move of Bitcoin overnight, as we held the area around $29.7K and continued to run," he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1533751622911803393"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 explained}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "Resistance zone now, wouldn't be longing around here (might even sweep above $31.8K to take the liquidity). Looking at around $30.5K for a potential new long and then targeting $32.8K."\par \par \uc2 Fellow trader Pentoshi, nonetheless retained a conservative outlook, forecasting a reversal for the S&P, which could well deflate the latest momentum in crypto markets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/SPX?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #SPX}}}\uc2  nailed from top down and back up from 3840\par \par \uc2 Think they want to take out 4300's before a reversal back down. Bear market rallies are brutal frens. They go higher then people think {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/RJVUjugtGo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/RJVUjugtGo}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Pentoshi (@Pentosh1) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1533802228829528072?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 June 6, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 On longer timeframes, the mood was thus subdued in the face of ongoing monetary tightening by central banks and rampant inflation.\par \par \uc2 For commentator Bob Loukas, the summer looked to be uninspiring for hodlers.\par \par \uc2 "Probably going to be a boring summer in Crypto. The heavy selling is done, now it's the doldrums period where only smart money accumulates," he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/BobLoukas/status/1533594692104896514"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 acknowledged}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "Once all the weak hands have turned over, higher prices will be needed, and the new cycle can begin. Still targeting late in year."\par \par \uc2 Analyst on altcoins: "Worse can get much worse"\par \par \uc2 Some major altcoins, meanwhile, took the opportunity to capitalize on Bitcoin's gains.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-snaps-its-longest-losing-streak-in-history-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price snaps its longest losing streak in history \u8212\'20\'14 5 things to know in Bitcoin this week}}}\par \par \uc2 Among them was Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), the largest altcoin by market cap, which saw daily gains in excess of 7% to pass $1,900.\par \par \uc2 "Good momentum on $ETH here," Van de Poppe {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1533734500928303106"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 commented}}}\uc2  in a separate update.\par \par \uc2 "Approaching [the] first point of resistance, but given the HL and the current recovery on $BTC, I think we're up for a few weeks of green in which we'll be looking for tests around $2,300\u8211\'20\'13$2,500 on $ETH too."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/0db2eeed-6700-430a-bac9-f56dfade999e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 1-hour candle chart (Binance). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Elsewhere in the top ten cryptocurrencies by market cap, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) both {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/is-cardano-ready-for-a-go-at-1-june-s-hard-fork-fomo-lifts-ada-price-to-weekly-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 jumped an excess of 10% on the day}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Out of the top fifty tokens, only one, Elrond ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/elrond-egld-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 EGLD}}}\uc2  ), traded in the red.\par \par \uc2 Loukas, nonetheless, noted that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-reasons-why-bitcoin-is-regaining-its-crypto-market-dominance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin's market cap was apt to cost altcoins}}}\uc2  big in the coming months.\par \par \uc2 "With BTC maybe 3\u8211\'20\'136 months from $USD bear lows, watch out on ALT positions. Worse can get much worse," part of a tweet {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/BobLoukas/status/1533803007607029760"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warned}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDYvZDIwYmM1ZGQtNTY4Zi00NTFlLWFkNzUtNTA2YzBmOTM2MWFlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220606ei660008e\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 BTC price snaps its longest losing streak in history \u8212\'20\'14 5 things to know in Bitcoin this week\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 1,716 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 June 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin breaks its weekly losing streak as BTC price action returns above the $30,000 mark.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) starts a new week with some fresh hope for hodlers after halting what has been the longest weekly downtrend in its history.\par \par \uc2 After battling for support throughout the weekend, BTC/USD ultimately found its footing to close out the week at $29,900 \u8212\'20\'14 $450 higher than last Sunday.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum did not stop there, with the pair climbing through the night into June 6 to reach multi-day highs.\par \par \uc2 The price action provides some long-awaited relief to bulls, but Bitcoin is far from out of the woods at the start of what promises to be an interesting trading week.\par \par \uc2 The culmination will likely be United States inflation data, this itself a yardstick for the macroeconomic forces at world globally. As time goes on, the impact of anti-COVID policies, geopolitical tensions and supply shortages is becoming all the more apparent.\par \par \uc2 Risk assets remain an unlikely bet for many, as central bank monetary tightening is seen to be apt to pressure stocks and crypto alike going forward.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s network fundamentals, meanwhile, continue to adapt to the surrounding reality and its impact on network participants.\par \par \uc2 Cointelegraph takes a look at five factors to bear in mind when charting where BTC price action may be headed in the coming days.\par \par \uc2 Tenth time's the charm for BTC weekly\par \par \uc2 It was a long time coming, but Bitcoin has finally closed out a \u8220\'20\'1Cgreen\u8221\'20\'1D week on the weekly chart.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD had spent a record nine weeks making progressively lower weekly closes \u8212\'20\'14 a trend which began in late March and ended up being the longest ever in its history.\par \par \uc2 On June 5, however, bears had no chance, pushing the pair to $29,900 before the new week began, this still being approximately $450 higher than the previous week\u8217\'20\'19s closing price.\par \par \uc2 That event sparked several hours of upside, with local highs totaling $31,327 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  at the time of writing \u8212\'20\'14 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s best performance since June 1.\par \par \uc2 On the Weekly candle close, Trend Precognition printed a Long signal on the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Bitcoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Bitcoin}}}\uc2  Weekly chart. Looking for a HH on the Weekly to confirm a breakout. If {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/BTC?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #BTC}}}\uc2  rallies, key MA's should act as technical resistance. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/NPVL3D27C5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/NPVL3D27C5}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/GxwT5zI3gC"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/GxwT5zI3gC}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Material Indicators (@MI_Algos) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MI_Algos/status/1533624570237837314?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 June 6, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 While some {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/WClementeIII/status/1533600603171078144"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 celebrated}}}\uc2  Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s newfound strength, others remained firmly cool on the prospects of a more substantial rally.\par \par \uc2 Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe eyed the open \uc2 CME\uc2  futures gap from the weekend, this providing a lure for a return to $29,000.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CStill expecting this to be happening on Bitcoin,\u8221\'20\'1D he told \uc2 Twitter\uc2  followers.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CA drop towards the CME Gap at $29K would make a lot of sense before a short reversal towards $31.5K.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 A look at order book data reinforces the friction bulls are likely to face in the event of a continued breakout. At the time of writing, the area around $32,000 had more than $60 million in sell-side liquidity lined up on Binance alone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/f026aadc-ca52-4ffd-a80a-ad1e92edf013.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD order book data chart (Binance). Source: Material Indicators\par \par \uc2 For Il Capo of Crypto, a \uc2 Twitter\uc2  analytics account well known for its sobering takes on upcoming BTC price action, there was likewise little to feel confident about.\par \par \uc2 In addition to this:\par \par \uc2 -Price is basically ranging between 29k-31k. That's below the main pivot (S/R flip)\par \par \uc2 -Every move up is corrective and data shows that bulls are being trapped.\par \par \uc2 We might see a scam pump to $30.7k-31.5k, but the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  main targets are still very likely. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/UnmENNNK6z"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/UnmENNNK6z}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 il Capo Of Crypto (@CryptoCapo_) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoCapo_/status/1533562099544342530?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 June 5, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, the market was not without its optimism.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHaving a plan is more important than guessing the correct direction,\u8221\'20\'1D popular \uc2 Twitter\uc2  account IncomeSharks {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/IncomeSharks/status/1533558868998881280"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 argued}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI think we drop then go up, so I'll be longing if this happens. If stocks open up green we could rally and I'll pivot to alts to ride them up. TP level is at $34,000 for now.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Countdown to U.S. CPI reado\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://fred.stlouisfed.org/graph/?g=rocU"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 U.S. inflation}}}\uc2  is at its highest since the early 1980s, but will it continue?\par \par \uc2 The market will find out this week as June 10 sees the release of Consumer Price Index (CPI) data for May.\par \par \uc2 One of the benchmarks for gauging how inflation is progressing, CPI prints have traditionally been accompanied by market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  both within crypto and beyond.\par \par \uc2 The question for many is how much higher it can go as the aftermath of the Russia-Ukraine conflict and its impact on global trade and supply chains continues to play out.\par \par \uc2 In the U.S., the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s interest rate hikes are also under scrutiny as a result of prices surging.\par \par \uc2 The end of the \u8220\'20\'1Ceasy money\u8221\'20\'1D era is a difficult one for stocks and correlated crypto assets more generally, and that pain trend is expected not to end any time soon, regardless of inflation performance.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CLiquidity is going out of the market and what that means is it will have an impact on the equity markets,\u8221\'20\'1D Charu Chanana, market strategist at Saxo Capital Markets, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2022-06-05/stocks-to-open-cautiously-monday-after-us-jobs-markets-wrap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2 Bloomberg\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe do expect that the drawdown in the equity markets still has some room to go.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Chanana was speaking as Asian markets rallied in early week's trading, led by China loosening its latest round of COVID-19 lockdown measures.\par \par \uc2 The Shanghai Composite Index was up 1.1% at the time of writing, while Hong Kong\u8217\'20\'19s Hang Seng traded up more than 1.5%.\par \par \uc2 Beyond the intraday data, however, the mood when it comes to macro versus crypto is very much one of cold feet.\par \par \uc2 For trading firm QCP Capital, the latest contraction in U.S. M2 money supply \u8212\'20\'14 only its third in around twenty years \u8212\'20\'14 is another reason to not take any chances.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis contraction in M2 has been a result of Fed hikes and forward guidance which drove a surge in reverse repos (RRP) to all-time record levels. Banks and money market funds withdrew money from the financial system in order to park it with the Fed to take advantage of high overnight interest rates,\u8221\'20\'1D it wrote in the latest edition of its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://qcp.capital/insights/4-easy-come-easy-go/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto Circular}}}\uc2  research series.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis draining of liquidity will only be exacerbated by the upcoming QT balance sheet unwind as well, beginning 1 June. We expect these factors to weigh on crypto prices.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/c942f9f0-29b0-4344-8482-e130479e4264.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 U.S. inflation data chart. Source: \uc2 St. Louis Fed\par \par \uc2 Miner capitulation "very close"\par \par \uc2 Despite weeks of lower prices {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-drops-1-5-on-us-market-open-amid-warning-miners-may-capitulate-in-months"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 endangering}}}\uc2  their cost basis, Bitcoin miners have so far held off from significant distribution of coins.\par \par \uc2 This may soon change, new analysis argues, sparking what has historically accompanied generational BTC price bottoms.\par \par \uc2 In a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/caprioleio/status/1533586499681210368/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tweet}}}\uc2  on June 6, Charles Edwards, founder of crypto asset manager Capriole, highlighted a classic bottom signal in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s hash ribbons metric.\par \par \uc2 Hash ribbons measures miner profitability and has been historically accurate in correlating with price phases. Currently, the \u8220\'20\'1Ccapitulation\u8221\'20\'1D phase similar to March 2020 is underway, he explained, but hodlers should do anything but sell as a result.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CHash Ribbon miner capitulation is very close. Bitcoin mining profit margins are getting squeezed,\u8221\'20\'1D Edwards commented.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CReminder: this is not a sell signal. The end of a capitulation period has historically set up some of the best long-term buys for Bitcoin.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/3e6f227c-9a7d-46bb-81fe-dc684eb212d6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin hash ribbons chart. Source: Charles Edwards/ Twitter\par \par \uc2 Previously, Cointelegraph {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-daily-mining-revenue-slumped-in-may-to-eleven-month-low"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2  on miners\u8217\'20\'19 ongoing challenges, which now includes a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-york-state-senate-passes-bitcoin-mining-moratorium"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ban the practice}}}\uc2  by the State of New York this month.\par \par \uc2 Fundamentals echo miner calm\par \par \uc2 Fluctuations in miner participation will have a palpable effect on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s hash rate and network difficulty.\par \par \uc2 So far, hash rate has remained stable above 200 exahashes per second (EH/s), according to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://btc.com/stats/diff"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 estimates}}}\uc2 , indicating that miners for the most part remain active and have not decreased activity over cost concerns.\par \par \uc2 Data covering Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s network difficulty likewise presents a calm short-term picture.\par \par \uc2 At its upcoming automated readjustment this week, difficulty will decrease by less than 1%, again reflecting a relative lack of upheaval in the mining sphere.\par \par \uc2 By contrast, the previous readjustment two weeks ago saw a 4.3% reduction, marking the biggest reversal since July 2021.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/43a18b8f-1bbb-45c8-9500-d9c2b0a4d878.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin hash rate, difficulty estimates chart. Source: BTC.com\par \par \uc2 Beyond the short term, a sense of optimism prevails among some of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s best-known commentators.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CAs we see in the growth of its hash rate, today bitcoin is roughly 50% cheaper yet 20% stronger than a year ago,\u8221\'20\'1D podcast host Robert Breedlove {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Breedlove22/status/1533241167734784005"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2  in part of a \uc2 Twitter\uc2  debate on June 5, arguing that this showed \u8220\'20\'1Cmobilization\u8221\'20\'1D of entrepreneurs interested in fueling Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s growth.\par \par \uc2 Megawhales show "promising sign"\par \par \uc2 In terms of putting their money where their mouth is, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s biggest investors could be showing the way this month.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/top-5-cryptocurrencies-to-watch-this-week-btc-ada-xlm-xmr-mana"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Top 5 cryptocurrencies to watch this week: BTC, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , XLM, XMR, MANA}}}\par \par \uc2 As noted by sentiment monitoring firm Santiment, entities controlling 1,000 BTC or more now own more of the BTC supply than at any point in the past year.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe mega whale addresses of Bitcoin, comprised partially of exchange addresses, own their highest supply of $BTC in a year,\u8221\'20\'1D Santiment {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/santimentfeed/status/1533681192611893248"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  on June 6.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe often analyze the 100 to 10k $BTC addresses for alpha, but accumulation from this high tier can still be a promising sign.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/a529991c-4736-46d5-9551-f6087090338f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin megawhale accumulation trends chart. Source: Santiment/ \uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 Data from on-chain analytics firm {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cryptoquant.com/asset/btc/chart/exchange-flows/exchange-reserve?exchange=all_exchange&window=DAY&sma=0&ema=0&priceScale=log&metricScale=linear&chartStyle=line"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CryptoQuant}}}\uc2  meanwhile allays fears that users are sending BTC en masse to exchanges for sale. The overall trend in decreasing exchange reserves continues, and is at levels last seen in October 2018.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/2d521649-0ffe-4b23-9c62-e7321f11e845.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin exchange reserves vs. BTC/USD chart. Source: CryptoQuant\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDYvMTg2YmVjNWItYWU2ZS00MjIwLTk2MTQtZjNhYzZmNDEwZDQ2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220606ei660002u\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Top 5 cryptocurrencies to watch this week: BTC,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , XLM, XMR, MANA\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,656 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 June 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC appears to be in the early stage of a recovery this week, and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , XLM, XMR and MANA could follow.\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to extend Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) record of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-needs-to-close-above-29-450-for-its-first-green-weekly-candle-since-march"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 nine consecutive red weekly candles}}}\uc2  to ten weeks, but the bulls are trying to avert this negative occurrence. Although sentiment remains negative, Arthur Hayes, former CEO of derivatives giant BitMEX, anticipates {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-touches-30k-as-ex-bitmex-ceo-hopes-25k-marks-btc-price-local-bottom"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin to bottom out}}}\uc2  in the range of $25,000 to $27,000.\par \par \uc2 On-chain data from Glassnode shows that smart money may have started {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/trading-for-beginners/a-beginners-guide-to-taking-crypto-profits-and-reinvesting"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 accumulating}}}\uc2  Bitcoin. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-long-term-hodlers-begin-distribution-which-preceded-btc-price-bottoms"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 net outflows from major cryptocurrency exchanges}}}\uc2  reached 23,286 Bitcoin on June 3, the highest since May 14.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/aff1ff6d-8f4f-48a7-8f23-029aed7917ce.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Another positive sign of accumulation is that investment into Bitcoin exchange-traded products (ETPs) was strong in May and has only risen further in the first two days of June, according to an Arcane Research report. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/over-200k-btc-now-stored-in-bitcoin-etfs-and-other-institutional-products"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETPs hold 205,000 Bitcoin under management}}}\uc2 , which is a new record.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin turn up and start a recovery? If that happens, could select altcoins follow the leader? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-5 cryptocurrencies that may lead the relief rally.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin plunged below the 20-day exponential moving average ($30,459) on June 1. The bulls attempted to push the price back above the 20-day EMA on June 2 and June 3 but the bears did not relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/e8408a89-8e76-434c-840d-f707f14dde72.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price below the strong support at $28,630. If they manage to do that, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the vital support at $26,700. The buyers are expected to defend this support zone with all their might because if they fail to do that, the downtrend may resume.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $32,659 to suggest that a new uptrend could be starting. The \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up on a break and close above the 50-day simple moving average ($33,778). The pair could then rally to the pattern target of $36,688 and thereafter to $40,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/78ceb83a-3cd8-4665-8ff1-514adb0fbf9e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the price action is getting squeezed. Although bulls pushed the price above the 20-EMA, they are facing stiff resistance at the 50-SMA. This suggests that bears are active at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 A minor positive in favor of the bulls is that they have not allowed the price to break below the support at $29,282.\par \par \uc2 If the price rises from the current level and breaks above the downtrend line, the bulls will attempt to push the pair to the 200-SMA. Conversely, if the price breaks below $29,282, the next stop could be $28,630.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke above the downtrend line on May 31 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/ea11b76e-dac6-46ab-ae79-8eeafdb668af.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the bears have successfully defended the downtrend line, a minor positive is that the bulls have held the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair above the 20-day EMA ($0.56). This increases the possibility of a break above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.67) where the bears may again pose a strong challenge. A break and close above this level will suggest a potential change in trend. The pair could then rally to the breakdown level of $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and plummets below $0.53, the bears will try to pull the pair to $0.50 and later to $0.44.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/9cb9b849-88ca-4fbc-aaf0-d04e9759783b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the price has been squeezed between the 200-SMA and the 50-SMA but this tight range trading is unlikely to continue for long. If bulls propel the price above the 200-SMA, the pair could attempt a rally to $0.64. A break and close above this level could open the doors for a possible rally to $0.69.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below $0.53, the selling could pick up momentum. The pair may then decline to $0.50 and later to $0.47.\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT\par \par \uc2 Stellar ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) rallied above the 20-day EMA ($0.14) on May 30, which was the first indication that the selling pressure may be reducing. The bears stalled the up-move near the 50-day SMA ($0.15) but they haven\u8217\'20\'19t been able to sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/971ec9c7-3db5-4b95-af32-a2bfa1970766.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the bulls are buying the dips to the 20-day EMA. If bulls drive the price above the 50-day SMA, it will suggest the start of a sustained recovery. The XLM/USDT pair could then attempt a rally to $0.18 and later to the 200-day SMA ($0.21).\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the short term if the price turns down and breaks below $0.13. Such a move will suggest that demand dries up at higher levels. That could pull the pair down to $0.12. If this support also gives way, the bears will try to resume the downtrend by sinking the pair below the psychological level of $0.10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/db6ee92b-456c-4a95-b09b-f8e7e5b3a520.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows the price is trading inside a symmetrical triangle. If bulls push the price above the resistance line of the triangle, the pair could rally to $0.15 and thereafter attempt a rally to the pattern target of $0.17.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level, the bears will try to sink the pair below the support line of the triangle. If they do that, the selling could intensify and the pair may slide to the strong support at $0.13.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-reasons-ethereum-price-risks-25-downside-in-june"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3 reasons Ethereum price risks 25% downside in June}}}\par \par \uc2 XMR/USDT\par \par \uc2 Monero\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xmr-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XMR}}}\uc2  ) failure to rise above the 50-day SMA ($202) may have tempted short-term traders to book profits. That has pulled the price down to the 20-day EMA ($189).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/ab65bba8-c5cf-4b70-905f-c1faf5520dcf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XMR/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to defend the 20-day EMA but the lack of a strong bounce off it suggests weak demand. If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the next stop could be the uptrend line. A break and close below this support could pull the price down to $167.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off the current level, the buyers will attempt to overcome the resistance zone between the 50-day SMA and $210. If they manage to do that, the XMR/USDT pair could extend its rally to $230.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/2d098202-78c6-41f3-882b-232f0399c00e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XMR/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The pair has been declining inside a descending channel, suggesting a minor advantage to sellers. If bears sink the price below the channel, the negative momentum may pick up and the pair could slide to $167.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the support line, the buyers will try to propel the pair above the channel. If they manage to do that, the pair could again attempt a break above the overhead resistance at $210.\par \par \uc2 MANA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Decentraland ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/decentraland-mana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MANA}}}\uc2  ) has failed to break above the 20-day EMA ($1.06) for the past several days but a minor positive is that the bulls have not given up much ground. This suggests that the bulls are buying on dips as they anticipate a move higher.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/7bfb1c44-c382-4764-9d42-be39fbe68552.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MANA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls propel the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears are losing their grip. The MANA/USDT pair could then rise to the overhead resistance at $1.36. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it could signal that a bottom may be in place. The pair could then rally to $1.68.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below $0.90, it will suggest that the bears are in no mood to surrender their advantage. The pair could then retest the crucial support at $0.60. The bears will have to pull the price below this support to indicate the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/be88c246-e840-42bf-82b1-4c5d004c93ec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MANA/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the pair has been trading inside a tight range between $0.94 and $1.04. The gradually downsloping 20-EMA and the RSI in the negative territory suggest a slight advantage to sellers. If bears pull the price below $0.94, the pair could drop to $0.90.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if bulls push the price above $1.04, it will suggest that demand exceeds supply. That could open the doors for a possible rally to the stiff overhead resistance at $1.15.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this level, the pair may oscillate between $0.90 and $1.15 for some more time. A break and close above $1.15 could suggest that buyers have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDYvMDdmOWFkZGEtMTg5MC00NjVjLWE3MDMtMzE5ZmEzNjZkYjAxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220605ei65000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Solana\par \b \uc2 Is Solana a \u8216\'20\'18buy\u8217\'20\'19 with SOL price at 10-month lows and down 85% from its peak?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 688 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 June 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 SOL price shed another 60% as it continues to follow Bitcoin as well as Solana\u8217\'20\'19s repeated network downtimes.\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) price dropped on June 3, bringing its net paper losses down to 85% seven months after topping out above $260.\par \par \uc2 SOL price fell by more than 6.5% intraday to $35.68, after failing to rebound with conviction from 10-month lows.\par \par \uc2 Now sitting on a historically significant support level, the SOL/USD pair could see an upside retracement in June, eyeing the $40-$45 area next, up around 25% from its June 4 price.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/8bd30f3c-5c8c-4b5a-887b-b488510581ba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USD daily price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 60% SOL price decline ahead?\par \par \uc2 However, a rebound scenario is far from guaranteed and Solana faces headwinds from trading in lockstep with Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), the top cryptocurrency (by market cap) that typically influences trends across the top altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Notably, the weekly correlation coefficient between BTC and SOL was 0.92 as of June 4.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/a1602ac6-d3e7-4eb7-b5e1-6673154a3979.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USD versus BTC/USD correlation coefficient. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 What\u8217\'20\'19s more, Solana is likely to see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-reasons-why-bitcoin-is-regaining-its-crypto-market-dominance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 even bigger losses}}}\uc2  than BTC if Bitcoin falls deeper below its current {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-touches-30k-as-ex-bitmex-ceo-hopes-25k-marks-btc-price-local-bottom"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 psychological support level of $30,000}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the Federal Reserve looks determined to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/07/us-fed-hikes-rates-bitcoin-plunges-below-36k-argentina-central-bank-says-no-financial-institutions-offering-crypto-may-1-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 raise benchmark interest rates}}}\uc2  and reduce its balance sheet. As a result of this hawkish policy, riskier assets like Bitcoin have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-may-bottom-at-15-5k-if-it-retests-this-lifetime-historical-support-level"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 room to go lower}}}\uc2 , hurting Solana\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  prospects.\par \par \uc2 Breaking below SOL\u8217\'20\'19s current support level \u8212\'20\'14 around $35 \u8212\'20\'14 raises the chances for a decline toward the $18-25 range, which acted as a strong support area in March-July 2021, and preceded a 1,200% price rally, as shown below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/6fca669a-1420-4d9a-9e1a-a26fda478545.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USD weekly price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario would put SOL almost 60% below the price on June 4.\par \par \uc2 Solana network outages\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for SOL also comes as the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-is-solana-and-how-does-it-work"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana blockchain}}}\uc2  faces repeated outages, thus leaving its network practically unusable for its key "dapps," including lending protocol Solend and decentralized exchange Serum, for hours.\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s latest software glitch {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/reliably-unreliable-solana-price-dives-after-latest-network-outage"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 appeared on June 1}}}\uc2  that shut down the network for 4.5 hours. The blockchain's biggest outage {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tvl-network-outages-or-derivatives-what-s-behind-solana-s-sol-60-drop"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 happened in January}}}\uc2  and was down for almost 18 hours.\par \par \uc2 Validator operators successfully completed a cluster restart of Mainnet Beta at 9:00 PM UTC, following a roughly 4 and a half hour outage after the network failed to reach consensus. Network operators an dapps will continue to restore client services over the next several hours.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Solana Status (@SolanaStatus) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/SolanaStatus/status/1532106367279955969?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 June 1, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 The outages risk spooking investors to the benefit of Solana\u8217\'20\'19s competition and have already coincided with several traders rotating their capital elsewhere.\par \par \uc2 Just sold all of my {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SOL&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SOL}}}\uc2  for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ADA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 . Solana is a great project but personally I cant in good faith continue to invest in a layer 1 that shuts down on a frequent basis (partial and major outages about 11 times).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/ADA?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Cardano?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Cardano}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 $Smac07_NFT$ (@Shawn_Deezy07) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Shawn_Deezy07/status/1531430455278542848?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 May 31, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Miles Deutscher, an independent market analyst, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/milesdeutscher/status/1532346449840996353"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 believes}}}\uc2  crypto investors have become cautious after witnessing the recent Terra fiasco. Nonetheless, the analyst asserts that Solana's outages would decrease over time as the network matures.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/alchemy-announces-support-for-solana-web3-applications-the-day-after-blockchain-halted"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Alchemy announces support for Solana Web3 applications the day after blockchain halted}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBut if they fail to stifle such events, then other L1s [layer-1 blockchains] will continue to eat away at its market share,\u8221\'20\'1D he noted.\par \par \uc2 8/ However, the reasons I like Solana still stand:\par \par \uc2 \u8226\'20\'22 Scales using a single global state (liquidity isn\u8217\'20\'19t fragmented).\par \par \uc2 \u8226\'20\'22 Low cost and fast (despite handling the most transactions of any chain).\par \par \uc2 \u8226\'20\'22 3rd most developed on chain (Electric Capital)\par \par \uc2 \u8226\'20\'22 Large list of VC backers\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Miles Deutscher (@milesdeutscher) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/milesdeutscher/status/1532346469948456960?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 June 2, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDYvZDM4NjhiNGUtMGIxNS00MzM5LTk5NmEtZjA3YzU2MTQ2NmRkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220605ei640008e\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Hodler's\par \b \uc2 US Fed begins quantitative tightening, Japan restricts stablecoin issuance and LUNA 2.0 rides a price roller coaster: Hodler\u8217\'20\'19s Digest, May 29-June 4\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Editorial Staff \par \uc2 1,590 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 June 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Coming every Saturday, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/hodlers-digest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Hodlers Digest}}}\uc2  will help you track every single important news story that happened this week. The best (and worst) quotes, adoption and \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  highlights, leading coins, predictions and much more a week on Cointelegraph in one link.\par \par \uc2 Top Stories This Week\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fed-money-printer-goes-into-reverse-what-does-it-mean-for-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fed money printer goes into reverse: What does it mean for crypto?}}}\par \par \uc2 Over the last two years or so, the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  has flooded the financial system with excess liquidity benefiting stocks, crypto and other markets as well. Now, the Fed is going in the opposite direction in order to combat inflation. In addition to raising interest rates, the central bank has begun the process of quantitative tightening (QT). Its not entirely clear how the crypto markets will respond to the Feds QT efforts, but the short-term outlook probably isnt good for risk assets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cftc-sues-gemini-claiming-the-crypto-exchange-lied-in-futures-contract-evaluation"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 CFTC sues Gemini claiming crypto exchange lied in futures contract evaluation}}}\par \par \uc2 United States crypto exchange \uc2 Gemini\uc2  faces action from the U.S. Commodity Futures Trading Commission (CFTC) for certain alleged activity dating back to 2017. The CFTC essentially asserts that \uc2 Gemini\uc2  acted dishonestly in 2017 during its push to add Bitcoin futures trading contracts to its offerings. The commission claims \uc2 Gemini\uc2  was not honest during its evaluation process.\par \par \uc2 Gemini\uc2  has been a pioneer and proponent of thoughtful \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  since day one, \uc2 Gemini\uc2  told Cointelegraph in response to the lawsuit. We have an eight year track record of asking for permission, not forgiveness, and always doing the right thing. We look forward to definitively proving this in court.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/25/crypto-blockchain-changing-humanitarian-agencies-deliver-aid"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/25/crypto-blockchain-changing-humanitarian-agencies-deliver-aid"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto is changing how humanitarian agencies deliver aid and services}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/25/crypto-blockchain-changing-humanitarian-agencies-deliver-aid"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 May 25, 2022}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/11/bitcoin-2022-will-real-btc-maximalists-please-stand-up"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/11/bitcoin-2022-will-real-btc-maximalists-please-stand-up"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin 2022 Will the real maximalists please stand up?}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/11/bitcoin-2022-will-real-btc-maximalists-please-stand-up"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 May 11, 2022}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/03/can-p2e-gaming-grind-away-market-share-from-mainstream-games"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/03/can-p2e-gaming-grind-away-market-share-from-mainstream-games"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Blockchain games take on the mainstream: Heres how they can win}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/03/can-p2e-gaming-grind-away-market-share-from-mainstream-games"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 May 3, 2022}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/04/22/degens-can-stake-crypto-to-help-the-ukrainian-people"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/04/22/degens-can-stake-crypto-to-help-the-ukrainian-people"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Helping Ukraine without donating: Lauras DeFi staking plan}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/04/22/degens-can-stake-crypto-to-help-the-ukrainian-people"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 April 22, 2022}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/04/19/what-metaverse-really-like-right-now-pictures"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/04/19/what-metaverse-really-like-right-now-pictures"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Basic and weird: What the Metaverse is like right now}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/04/19/what-metaverse-really-like-right-now-pictures"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 April 19, 2022}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/city-of-shenzhen-airdrops-30m-in-free-digital-yuan-to-stimulate-consumer-spending"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 City of Shenzhen airdrops 30M in free digital yuan to stimulate consumer spending}}}\par \par \uc2 Residents of the city of Shenzhen could receive some of \uc2 Chinas central bank\uc2  digital currency, the e-CNY, as part of an airdrop. Shenzhen is working with one of Chinas top food delivery apps to airdrop a total of 30 million e-CNY in a lottery-style giveaway for certain app users. At least 15,000 in-app merchant portals allow the e-CNY as a form of payment. China has stuck to a strict COVID restriction playbook, leading to economic difficulties. The airdrop is intended to spur consumer spending and reinvigorate the economy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/south-korean-government-becomes-an-early-investor-in-metaverse"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 South Korean government becomes an early investor in the Metaverse}}}\par \par \uc2 South Korea has made several crypto-centric headlines in recent weeks, ranging from its interest in crypto \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  to it now investing in the Metaverse. The country plans on putting roughly $177 million toward the Metaverse as part of its Digital New Deal program. The money will go into developing a Metaverse platform touting government services for citizens, as well as toward different Metaverse projects. This investment tags South Korea as a global pioneer in terms of government Metaverse interest.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/japan-passes-bill-to-limit-stablecoin-issuance-to-banks-and-trust-companies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Japan passes bill to limit stablecoin issuance to banks and trust companies}}}\par \par \uc2 A new bill from Japan, reportedly going into play in 2023, will only allow licensed banks and registered money transfer agents to issue stablecoins. The \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  aims to provide more protection around stablecoins, given their growing popularity. Japans intent to regulate stablecoins comes amid a crypto bear market that has seen declining asset prices and the downfall of a major stablecoin, TerraUSD Classic (USTC).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/Digest_03-06_1-1024x682.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Winners and Losers\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/WL-june-4-01-1024x826.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 At the end of the week, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is at $29,540, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) at $1,750 and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  at $0.38. The total market cap is at $1.21 trillion, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinmarketcap.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according}}}\uc2  to CoinMarketCap.\par \par \uc2 Among the biggest 100 cryptocurrencies, the top three altcoin gainers of the week are Waves (WAVES) at 114.63%, Cardano (\b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) at 24.19% and Helium (HNT) at 22.49%.\par \par \uc2 The top three altcoin losers of the week are Convex Finance (CVX) at -7.51%, Solana (SOL) at -6.93% and 1inch Network (1INCH) at -3.40%.\par \par \uc2 For more info on crypto prices, make sure to read {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraphs market analysis}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/25/crypto-blockchain-changing-humanitarian-agencies-deliver-aid"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/25/crypto-blockchain-changing-humanitarian-agencies-deliver-aid"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto is changing how humanitarian agencies deliver aid and services}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/25/crypto-blockchain-changing-humanitarian-agencies-deliver-aid"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 May 25, 2022}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/11/bitcoin-2022-will-real-btc-maximalists-please-stand-up"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/11/bitcoin-2022-will-real-btc-maximalists-please-stand-up"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin 2022 Will the real maximalists please stand up?}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/11/bitcoin-2022-will-real-btc-maximalists-please-stand-up"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 May 11, 2022}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/03/can-p2e-gaming-grind-away-market-share-from-mainstream-games"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/03/can-p2e-gaming-grind-away-market-share-from-mainstream-games"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Blockchain games take on the mainstream: Heres how they can win}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/03/can-p2e-gaming-grind-away-market-share-from-mainstream-games"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 May 3, 2022}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/04/22/degens-can-stake-crypto-to-help-the-ukrainian-people"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/04/22/degens-can-stake-crypto-to-help-the-ukrainian-people"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Helping Ukraine without donating: Lauras DeFi staking plan}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/04/22/degens-can-stake-crypto-to-help-the-ukrainian-people"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 April 22, 2022}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/04/19/what-metaverse-really-like-right-now-pictures"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/04/19/what-metaverse-really-like-right-now-pictures"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Basic and weird: What the Metaverse is like right now}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/04/19/what-metaverse-really-like-right-now-pictures"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 April 19, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Most Memorable Quotations\par \par \uc2 We could actually imagine the entire global economy running on the blockchain like 30 or 50 years from now.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/netscape-creator-says-web3-really-is-like-the-rise-of-the-early-internet"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Marc Andreessen}}}\uc2 , co-founder of \uc2 Andreessen Horowitz\uc2  (a16z)\par \par \uc2 If properly managed, if well managed, I think algorithmic stablecoins in theory should work.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-s-cz-says-he-is-skeptical-about-the-terra-relaunch"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Changpeng CZ Zhao}}}\uc2 , CEO of \uc2 Binance\par \par \uc2 How will we ever reduce wealth inequality when our regulatory system has financial discrimination at its core? Its time to remove the Sophisticated Investor discrimination rules that advisors use to hide behind and allow everyone access to financial advice and services.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/aussie-banks-anz-and-nab-won-t-endorse-retail-speculation-on-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ian Love}}}\uc2 , CEO and founder of Blockchain Assets\par \par \uc2 We have changed our position on mining, and also permit the use of cryptocurrency in foreign trade and outside the country.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/russian-central-bank-signals-agreement-with-crypto-law-revisions-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ksenia Yudaeva}}}\uc2 , first deputy governor for the \uc2 Central Bank of Russia\par \par \uc2 I dont think were living in a single-chain world.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/brad-garlinghouse-says-nfts-underhyped-sees-new-use-cases-cointelegraph-interview"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Brad Garlinghouse}}}\uc2 , CEO of \uc2 Ripple Labs\par \par \uc2 There are too many general-purpose blockchains that are effectively competing with Ethereum (and one another) in a race to the bottom on fees. Only so many of them can survive.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/29/6-questions-andrew-levine-of-koinos-group"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Andrew Levine}}}\uc2 , CEO of Koinos Group\par \par \uc2 Prediction of the Week\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-may-hit-14k-in-2022-but-buying-btc-now-as-good-as-it-gets-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin may hit $14K in 2022 but buying BTC now \u8216\'20\'18as good as it gets:\u8217\'20\'19 Analyst}}}\par \par \uc2 Although Bitcoin charts saw some positive moves during the first part of this week to close out May, June brought back sub-$30,000 price action, based on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraphs BTC price index}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Using former BTC price data as a backdrop in line with Bitcoins halving cycle (roughly four years), pseudonymous \uc2 Twitter\uc2  user and CryptoQuant contributor Venturefounder suggested the asset could see a macro price bottom in the next half-year. As part of a tweet thread, the analyst said Bitcoin could reach a depth between $14,000 and $21,000. The analysis included parallels to 2018, the focal year of the last crypto bear market. Price action currently lines up with historical Bitcoin cycles.\par \par \uc2 FUD of the Week\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/investors-dumping-on-terra-as-luna-2-tanks-70-in-two-days"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/investors-dumping-on-terra-as-luna-2-tanks-70-in-two-days"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Investors dumping on Terra as LUNA 2 tanks 70% in two days}}}\par \par \uc2 In the aftermath of the Terra ecosystem collapse, Terra 2.0 and its related LUNA 2.0 asset launched on May 28, with the price of token falling sharply after the unveiling. Terraform Labs CEO Do Kwons revival plan included distributing LUNA 2.0 to certain participants of the old Terra ecosystem. Roughly a day later, \uc2 Binance\uc2  announced that it had {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/binance-staking-completes-initial-phase-of-terra-2-0-airdrop-as-ecosystem-issues-persist"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 completed its first airdrop}}}\uc2  of the new LUNA tokens to certain users. Between the time of Cointelegraphs Monday article (linked above), and the writing of the Binance airdrop article on Tuesday, LUNA 2.0 rose in price from $5.71 to $9.25.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-york-state-senate-passes-bitcoin-mining-moratorium"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 New York State Senate passes Bitcoin mining moratorium}}}\par \par \uc2 Additional proof-of-work (PoW) mining operations in New York could be put on hold for a two-year period, pending approval from the states governor. A bill temporarily banning new PoW mining outfits, as well as license renewal of current players, was passed by the New York State Senate. One exception to the bill, however, is the allowance of fresh PoW mining players that only use renewable energy for their work.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/former-product-manager-at-opensea-charged-with-insider-trading"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Former product manager at OpenSea charged with insider trading}}}\par \par \uc2 Former OpenSea employee Nathaniel Chastain has been charged with insider trading, wire fraud and money laundering. During his time as product manager for the NFT exchange, Chastain allegedly traded numerous NFTs based on non-public knowledge. Claims include that his job allowed him to influence which NFTs the platforms main page featured, which he then used to his personal advantage. Chastain quit his post at OpenSea after the entity requested his exit as a result of discovering the foul play, according to OpenSea. The development raises questions as to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/opensea-insider-trading-case-see-nfts-labeled-securities-former-sec-lawyer"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 NFTs possibly being tagged as securities}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Best Cointelegraph Features\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/31/you-can-now-clone-nfts-as-mimics-heres-what-that-means"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/31/you-can-now-clone-nfts-as-mimics-heres-what-that-means"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 You can now clone NFTs as \u8216\'20\'18Mimics\u8217\'20\'19: Here\u8217\'20\'19s what that means}}}\par \par \uc2 I think I just broke the NFT market.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/06/02/fail-better-scott-melker-defying-odds-with-crypto-trading"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Fail better: Scott Melker on defying the odds with crypto trading}}}\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s a math game of taking small losses and big wins.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/anonymous-culture-in-crypto-may-be-losing-its-relevance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Anonymous culture in crypto may be losing its relevance}}}\par \par \uc2 Although anonymous teams have built some of the leading infrastructure in crypto, many new participants in the ecosystem are using their real identities.\par \par \uc2 The best of blockchain, every Tuesday\par \par \uc2 Subscribe for thoughtful explorations and leisurely reads from Magazine.\par \par \uc2 By subscribing you agree to our {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terms-and-privacy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Terms of Service and Privacy Policy}}}\uc2  Leave this field empty if you're human:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/wp-content/uploads/2022/06/june-4.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220604ei64000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Solana\par \b \uc2 Is Solana a 'buy' with SOL price at 10-month lows and down 85% from its peak?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 685 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 June 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 SOL price shed another 60% as it continues to follow Bitcoin as well as Solana's repeated network downtimes.\par \par \uc2 Solana's ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) price dropped on June 3, bringing its net paper losses down to 85% seven months after topping out above $260.\par \par \uc2 SOL price fell by more than 6.5% intraday to $35.68, after failing to rebound with conviction from 10-month lows.\par \par \uc2 Now sitting on a historically significant support level, the SOL/USD pair could see an upside retracement in June, eyeing the $40-$45 area next, up around 25% from today's price.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/8bd30f3c-5c8c-4b5a-887b-b488510581ba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USD daily price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 60% SOL price decline ahead?\par \par \uc2 However, a rebound scenario is far from guaranteed and Solana faces headwinds from trading in lockstep with Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), the top cryptocurrency (by market cap) that typically influences trends across the top altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Notably, the weekly correlation coefficient between BTC and SOL was 0.92 as of June 4.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/a1602ac6-d3e7-4eb7-b5e1-6673154a3979.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USD versus BTC/USD correlation coefficient. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 What's more, Solana is likely to see {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-reasons-why-bitcoin-is-regaining-its-crypto-market-dominance"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 even bigger losses}}}\uc2  than BTC if Bitcoin falls deeper below its current {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-touches-30k-as-ex-bitmex-ceo-hopes-25k-marks-btc-price-local-bottom"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 psychological support level of $30,000}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, the Federal Reserve looks determined to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/05/07/us-fed-hikes-rates-bitcoin-plunges-below-36k-argentina-central-bank-says-no-financial-institutions-offering-crypto-may-1-7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 raise benchmark interest rates}}}\uc2  and reduce its balance sheet. As a result of this hawkish policy, riskier assets like Bitcoin have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-may-bottom-at-15-5k-if-it-retests-this-lifetime-historical-support-level"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 room to go lower}}}\uc2 , hurting Solana's \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  prospects.\par \par \uc2 Breaking below SOL's current support level\u8212\'20\'14around $35\u8212\'20\'14raises the chances for a decline toward the $18-25 range, which acted as a strong support area in March-July 2021, and preceded a 1,200% price rally, as shown below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/6fca669a-1420-4d9a-9e1a-a26fda478545.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USD weekly price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  scenario would put SOL almost 60% below today's price.\par \par \uc2 Solana network outages\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for SOL also comes as the Solana blockchain faces repeated outages, thus leaving its network practically unusable for its key "dapps," including lending protocol {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-tvl-and-price-drop-50-from-ath-but-gaming-dapps-could-turn-the-tables"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solend}}}\uc2  and decentralized exchange {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/liquidity-has-driven-defi-s-growth-to-date-so-what-s-the-future-outlook"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Serum}}}\uc2 , for hours.\par \par \uc2 Solana's latest software glitch {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/reliably-unreliable-solana-price-dives-after-latest-network-outage"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 appeared on June 1}}}\uc2  that shut down the network for 4.5 hours. The blockchain's biggest outage {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tvl-network-outages-or-derivatives-what-s-behind-solana-s-sol-60-drop"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 happened in January}}}\uc2  and was down for almost 18 hours.\par \par \uc2 Validator operators successfully completed a cluster restart of Mainnet Beta at 9:00 PM UTC, following a roughly 4 and a half hour outage after the network failed to reach consensus. Network operators an dapps will continue to restore client services over the next several hours.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Solana Status (@SolanaStatus) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/SolanaStatus/status/1532106367279955969?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 June 1, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 The outages risk spooking investors to the benefit of Solana's competition and have already coincided with several traders rotating their capital elsewhere.\par \par \uc2 Just sold all of my {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SOL&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SOL}}}\uc2  for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ADA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2 . Solana is a great project but personally I cant in good faith continue to invest in a layer 1 that shuts down on a frequent basis (partial and major outages about 11 times).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/ADA?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Cardano?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Cardano}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 $Smac07_NFT$ (@Shawn_Deezy07) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Shawn_Deezy07/status/1531430455278542848?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 May 31, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Miles Deutscher, an independent market analyst, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/milesdeutscher/status/1532346449840996353"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 believes}}}\uc2  crypto investors have become cautious after witnessing the recent Terra fiasco. Nonetheless, the analyst asserts that Solana's outages would decrease over time as the network matures.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/alchemy-announces-support-for-solana-web3-applications-the-day-after-blockchain-halted"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Alchemy announces support for Solana Web3 applications the day after blockchain halted}}}\par \par \uc2 "But if they fail to stifle such events, then other L1s [layer-1 blockchains] will continue to eat away at its market share," he noted.\par \par \uc2 8/ However, the reasons I like Solana still stand:\par \par \uc2 \u8226\'20\'22 Scales using a single global state (liquidity isn\u8217\'20\'19t fragmented).\par \par \uc2 \u8226\'20\'22 Low cost and fast (despite handling the most transactions of any chain).\par \par \uc2 \u8226\'20\'22 3rd most developed on chain (Electric Capital)\par \par \uc2 \u8226\'20\'22 Large list of VC backers\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Miles Deutscher (@milesdeutscher) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/milesdeutscher/status/1532346469948456960?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 June 2, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDYvZDM4NjhiNGUtMGIxNS00MzM5LTk5NmEtZjA3YzU2MTQ2NmRkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220604ei640008d\par }\page {\par\fs20\b \uc2 Stocks surge, altcoins give back their gains and dollar strength may push Bitcoin lower\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Jon Morgan \par \uc2 721 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 June 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 This week major cryptocurrencies reversed course after rallying, stocks struggled to maintain gains and a strengthening dollar could continue to weigh on BTC price.\par \par \uc2 Between May 23 and 27, the equities markets had an impressive run, with the tech-heavy NASDAQ (NASDAQ: QQQ) ETF up over 7% and the S&P 500 (NYSE: SPY) up over 6.50%. However, this week' whipsaws in price action occurred throughout the week and while the J trade session is not yet over, the weekly candlesticks suggest a close near last week\u8217\'20\'19s open.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/bbe3b46a-6492-43ff-9b4f-8ec86bd9e1b9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 QQQ weekly chart (NYSE). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Currently, all major indexes face significant technical resistance levels above their present traded levels. Throw in thegrowing economic uncertainty and fears of a recession; the bounce may be limited.\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrencies down again\par \par \uc2 The crypto market may close relatively flat but down for the week, extending its losing streak to an all-time high of nine consecutive weekly losses. Some altcoins this week were in the green, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Stellar ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ), for example, but both saw 50% to 70% of those gains wiped out.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/6aa15916-21d1-49f3-814f-d161855b0249.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto total market capitalization weekly chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-for-beginners/what-is-bitcoin-a-beginners-guide-to-the-worlds-first-cryptocurrency"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 total market capitalization for the cryptocurrency market}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-for-beginners/what-is-bitcoin-a-beginners-guide-to-the-worlds-first-cryptocurrency"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-for-beginners/what-is-bitcoin-a-beginners-guide-to-the-worlds-first-cryptocurrency}}}\uc2  stands just above the $1.20 trillion level, which is getting uncomfortably close to the critical $1 trillion zone.\par \par \uc2 Oil continues to rise\par \par \uc2 Light crude futures (NYMEX: CL) continue to rise and could complete an implied close near 14-year highs, levels not seen since late July 2008. From April 11 to June 3, oil has already gained more than 20% and rests just below the $120 level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/30da6ba2-8a5f-40dd-9f49-e2f1caa9fe42.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Oil futures weekly chart (NYMEX). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The weekly crude oil inventory data on June 1 showed a massively larger drop of -5 million barrels versus the estimated -1.35 million. Even the recent agreement from OPEC+ to nearly double production has failed to stymy oil\u8217\'20\'19s rise.\par \par \uc2 Food commodities tank\par \par \uc2 Wheat futures (CBOT: ZW) and corn futures (CBOT: ZC) are down this week, -10% and -6%, respectively. However, the drop in these markets is most likely due to severely extended overbought conditions, resulting in a technical pullback. Global fears and uncertainty about food security and scarcity continue to plague this market.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/d4c573bb-1f8c-474d-a37a-5907c2c3cda9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Wheat futures weekly chart (CBOT). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Dollar recovery may be underway\par \par \uc2 Like wheat and corn, the greenback is coming off of a technical pullback from extended overbought conditions. As a result, within the Ichimoku Kinko Hyo system, the US Dollar Index (TVC: DXY) has an implied close for the week that is higher with a marginal gain of 0.3%.\par \par \uc2 A strong technical bounce of the weekly Tenkan-Sen saw the DXY bounce more than +1%, but most of those gains have been lost. The DXY could drop lower to the critical 100 level near the weekly Kijun-Sen, but the hidden \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence between the chart and the composite index may prevent further downside pressure.\par \par \uc2 For traders and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/over-200k-btc-now-stored-in-bitcoin-etfs-and-other-institutional-products"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 investors of cryptocurrencies}}}\uc2 , the DXY is sometimes viewed as a non-correlated market. In other words, when the DXY moves up, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and altcoins move down.\par \par \uc2 That is not always the case, but the DXY should be viewed as a flight to safety. When money moves into the dollar, it is assumed that market participants are afraid and uncertain.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/06ffde3d-f70c-4382-9afd-eef183d5284f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Coupled with continued economic uncertainty and some shakiness in the labor market, the DXY may continue its steady rise higher.\par \par \uc2 Major economic data next week to watch\par \par \uc2 * June 7: Canadian balance of trade and Ivey PMI data. US API Crude oil stock change.\par \par \uc2 * June 9: European Union Central Bank interest rate decision. US initial jobless claims.\par \par \uc2 * June 10: Canadian unemployment rate. US core inflation (MoM), real inflation rate, core inflation (YoY) and Michigan consumer sentiment.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDYvNmExYWRmMzMtYTQxNy00NmE1LTgwZTctODYxMTRhYmIxMjhjLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220603ei63000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin touches $30K as ex-BitMEX CEO hopes $25K marks BTC price 'local bottom'\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 606 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 June 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin faces off with $30,000 while analyst demands BTC price retain $29,000 to avoid "massive breakdowns."\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) recovered to $30,000 prior to the June 2 Wall Street open as feet remained cold across crypto markets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/8853c536-6df1-4649-9b99-f6b23a3d70fe.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 "Crucial breaker rejecting" on Bitcoin\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.142027444.742658523.1640948929-762064149.1640948929"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD climbing to local highs of $30,182 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  after wicking down to near $29,300 overnight.\par \par \uc2 Amid testing times for equities, Bitcoin followed in {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-risks-29k-nosedive-as-wall-street-opens-with-fresh-losses"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 giving up recent gains}}}\uc2 , with Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe insisting that $29,000 needed to hold to avoid more serious retracement.\par \par \uc2 "Cascade further south for Bitcoin towards the level that caused the breakout," he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1532278256472309763"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2  on the day.\par \par \uc2 "Resistances above us are $30.5K and $31.5K. Let's see how it goes, has to hold $29.2\u8211\'20\'13$29.3K to avoid any massive breakdowns."\par \par \uc2 A subsequent tweet highlighted what Van de Poppe described as an intraday "crucial breaker" level acting as resistance.\par \par \uc2 Crucial breaker for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Bitcoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Bitcoin}}}\uc2  rejecting. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/vYdLUlNxyw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/vYdLUlNxyw}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe (@CryptoMichNL) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1532313040288350208?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 June 2, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Analyzing what led Bitcoin to reverse downward, meanwhile, on-chain analytics resource Material Indicators pointed the finger at large-volume investors engineering \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "Large orders chased price to the top, then switched sides, alongside whales starting to market-sell. Now, some buying by $1M+ on support," part of an explanatory \uc2 Twitter\uc2  post {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Mtrl_Scientist/status/1532309400651812864"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 read}}}\uc2 . {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Mtrl_Scientist/status/1532309400651812864/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://twitter.com/Mtrl_Scientist/status/1532309400651812864/photo/1}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD thus remained firmly in a narrow trading range in place since the second week of May.\par \par \uc2 Positivity creeps in over BTC price floor\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, one of the industry's best-known figures gave cause to consider that much deeper corrections may not be in store for Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-6-1-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-ada-sol-doge-dot-avax-shib"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 6/1: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, AVAX, SHIB}}}\par \par \uc2 In his latest blog post {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://entrepreneurshandbook.co/shut-it-down-15d230b28089"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 released}}}\uc2  on June 2, Arthur Hayes, former CEO of derivatives giant BitMEX, argued that last month's bottom could well have been the bottom that everyone was looking for.\par \par \uc2 He flagged data from on-chain analytics firm Glassnode, which presented BTC/USD drawdowns from all-time highs over the years.\par \par \uc2 Looking back at past {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-for-beginners/bitcoin-halving-how-does-the-halving-cycle-work-and-why-does-it-matter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 halving cycles}}}\uc2 , there should be strong support at around $25,000, given that $69,000 marked the latest all-time high.\par \par \uc2 "Don\u8217\'20\'19t take these levels as an exact science. There could be an exchange that traded at a higher or lower intraday level than what\u8217\'20\'19s observed on glassnode," Hayes reasoned.\par \par \uc2 "The point is to be generally correct, and with a bit of fudging around the edges we can approximate a range that corresponds to what we believe is the local bottom. For Bitcoin, that\u8217\'20\'19s $25,000 to $27,000. For Ether, that\u8217\'20\'19s $1,700 to $1,800."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/58f3ad47-2506-4b2a-8865-4307a17c6b33.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD drawdown from all-time highs annotated chart. Source: Arthur Hayes/ Entrepreneur's Handbook\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph reported, however, the same data had been used earlier in the week to deliver {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-may-hit-14k-in-2022-but-buying-btc-now-as-good-as-it-gets-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a more \b  \highlight22bearish\b0 \highlight22  BTC price target}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Hayes, himself, has said that he would be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-macro-bottom-not-in-yet-warns-analyst-as-btc-price-holds-30k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 a "buyer" of Bitcoin at $20,000}}}\uc2  and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) at $1,300.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDYvMTNlMWJkNjMtYmQ5Yi00MWZjLWE1NmQtZDkwYTgzZTc4ODlmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220602ei620008i\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Here are 3 altcoins that could surge once Bitcoin flips $35K to support\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Jon Morgan \par \uc2 975 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 June 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , MATIC and XLM appear well positioned for a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  breakout once BTC flips the $32,000 to $35,000 zone to support.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and the wider cryptocurrency market are taking a breather after the rally on May 31. Meanwhile, most altcoins remain severely oversold, with most between 70% and 90% below their all-time highs.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/4047474a-fe67-4f1e-b851-0908b33876df.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total altcoin index capitalization\par \par \uc2 What is clear is that fear is everywhere and blood is in the water. Risk-on markets are suffering worldwide, but it is exactly these kinds of conditions that create opportunities where professional money accumulates and adds to positions.\par \par \uc2 Let\u8217\'20\'19s take a look at three altcoins that could be positioned for a rebound if the broader market enters a new uptrend.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could be setting up for an 80% surge\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has a significantly \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  update coming very soon. The much anticipated Vasil hard fork, which increases performance and adds more Plutus enhancements, is planned for June.\par \par \uc2 From a price action perspective, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  is positioned in a strong price range that will likely support any further upside that the broader market experienced. Within the Ichimoku Kinko Hyo system, \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has maintained a significant gap between the bodies of the past three weekly candlesticks and the Tenkan-Sen.\par \par \uc2 When the bodies of the candlesticks and the Tenkan-Sen have noticeable gaps, a correction often occurs within three to four days. This is because the equilibrium is out of sync, the Tenkan-Sen and price action like to stick together as much as possible. A mean reversion back to the Tenkan-sen is extremely likely when one strays too far from the other.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/59a5c62e-a274-4bba-980f-a6d5770a4656.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD weekly Ichimoku Kinko Hyo chart Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, if the broader cryptocurrency market experiences a big bounce, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-price-fake-out-ada-s-45-rebound-in-two-days-could-trap-bulls"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  price may shoot past the Tenkan-Sen to test the Kijun-Sen. \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not tested the weekly Kijun-Sen since the week of November 8, 2021.\par \par \uc2 The weekly Kijun-Sen is at $1.02 and contains the 2021 volume point of control and the 50% Fibonacci retracement of the all-time high to the low of January 25, 2021.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/56809a21-4d3a-45dc-b94c-dbea8d04c2f7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD weekly chart (Binance) Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-may-hit-14k-in-2022-but-buying-btc-now-as-good-as-it-gets-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin may hit $14K in 2022, but buying BTC now \u8216\'20\'18as good as it gets:\u8217\'20\'19 Analyst}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC aims for $1\par \par \uc2 Looking at the weekly chart of Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ), one can\u8217\'20\'19t help but notice that it looks strikingly similar to \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 . MATIC and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  both have sold off from $3 and both are stuck in the mid $0.50 to mid $0.60 price range, but that is where the similarities mostly end.\par \par \uc2 Fundamentally, MATIC remains strong. Governments worldwide have attempted to restrict or ban mining due to excessive energy costs for proof-of-work blockchains and MATIC is likely to avoid government scrutiny and attract supporters as a positive example of environmental stewardship.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/b8973981-0c50-475a-a418-6b093f18d30c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Polygon (MATIC) Source: \uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 Like \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , MATIC has significant gaps between the bodies of its weekly candlesticks and the Tenkan-Sen. Although, MATIC\u8217\'20\'19s gaps are more significant. Likewise, the gap between price and the Kijun-Sen is much more meaningful.\par \par \uc2 Within the Ichimoku Kinko Hyo system, there is a max-mean that price will travel away from the Kijun-Sen before experiencing a violent mean reversion. For MATIC, that threshold is 63%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/fb901eba-610d-42a0-bf96-4358492710bd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MATIC/USD weekly chart (Binance) Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Any renewed \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum ifor {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-rallies-to-32-3k-but-three-factors-could-limit-its-recovery"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin}}}\uc2  will likely see MATIC lead the altcoins higher until it reaches the $1.00 to $1.15 value area near the weekly Tenkan-Sen.\par \par \uc2 XLM lags the altcoin market, but it\u8217\'20\'19s known for surprises\par \par \uc2 Sometimes it is hard to forget that during the last major bull run from the COVID crash to November 2021, there were a few major {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/altcoins-for-beginners"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 altcoins}}}\uc2  that did not hit new all-time highs. Stellar ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) is one. In fact, the last time XLM made a new all-time high was the week of January 8, 2018, almost four and a half years ago!\par \par \uc2 One thing that XLM has going for it that not many other weekly charts have is a very clear falling wedge pattern. Out of the standard rectangle and triangle patterns in technical analysis, wedge patterns are the most powerful. What makes its wedge so powerful is the probable fakeout breakout lower.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/7cf72f65-1807-4993-8f4c-51a886acd5ca.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XLM/USD weekly chart (Binance) Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The most probable direction for a falling wedge is higher \u8212\'20\'14 but breakouts below a falling wedge can yield powerful short opportunities. The typical behavior that analysts and traders expect to see with a failed falling wedge is an immediate and swift sell-off, but so far, bears have been unable or unwilling to do so.\par \par \uc2 Instead, the weekly chart for XLM shows a very strong probability of a fakeout. If \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum returns to the cryptocurrency market, XLM is likely to hit the second peak of the falling wedge near the $0.38 value area.\par \par \uc2 Classic technical analysts believe that technicals lead fundamentals. If that is true, then altcoins like XLM, MATIC, and \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  could be positioned in very desirable conditions in the event of any new bull run.\par \par \uc2 However, downside risks remain a concern, but they are likely extremely limited. If a new uptrend fails to materialize before the end of June, the cryptocurrency market will probably move sideways until a major breakout higher or lower occurs in the Fall.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDYvNDcwZmQ0OWUtMzYyOS00NzVjLTliNzMtOGYxOTQ4NTU0NzQ0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220601ei61000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 6/1: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, AVAX, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,781 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 June 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC and altcoins met resistance at a key moving average, leading traders to wonder whether the current pullback is a lower support test, or proof that bears are still in control.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has made a tentative start to the month of June, suggesting that bears have not gone into hibernation just yet. Although Bitcoin is trading nearly 55% off its all-time high of $69,000, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-faces-uphill-battle-despite-btc-price-gaining-35-from-23-8k-bottom"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 whales and institutions remain cautious}}}\uc2  and have not jumped into the market with gusto according to BlockTrends analyst Caue Oliveira.\par \par \uc2 According to CryptoQuant contributor Venturefounder, if Bitcoin repeats the historical patterns seen after the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-for-beginners/bitcoin-halving-how-does-the-halving-cycle-work-and-why-does-it-matter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous halving cycles}}}\uc2 , then a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-may-hit-14k-in-2022-but-buying-btc-now-as-good-as-it-gets-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bottom may be formed between $14,000 and $21,000}}}\uc2  in the next six months. Thereafter, Bitcoin may chop around the $28,000 to $40,000 range for a large part of the next year and be around $40,000 during the halving.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/47481399-3db3-4074-be42-cd9e412dc5cc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto's bear market has not stopped \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  from exploring the possibility of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/goldman-sachs-reportedly-eyes-crypto-derivatives-markets-with-ftx-integration"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 integrating its derivatives products}}}\uc2  into FTX.US derivatives offerings. This suggests that the investment bank expects derivatives demand to pick up in the future.\par \par \uc2 Has Bitcoin started a bottoming formation? Is the short-term downtrend in altcoins over? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin reached the overhead resistance at $32,659 on May 31 but the bulls could not clear this hurdle. The Doji candlestick pattern on May 31 indicates uncertainty among the buyers and sellers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/89cecdbb-2aff-49d0-83fd-e02c64dded66.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This uncertainty resolved in favor of the bears on June 1 and they pulled the price below the 20-day exponential moving average ($30,741). If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the next stop could be $28,630. The buyers are expected to defend this level with all their might.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $28,600, the BTC/USDT pair could again attempt a rally to $32,659. If that happens, the pair may consolidate between these two levels for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The next trending move could begin if the price breaks above or below the range. If the price soars above $32,659, the rally could reach the 50-day simple moving average ($34,629). The downtrend could resume on a break below the $28,630 to $26,700 support zone.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears stalled Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) relief rally at the 20-day EMA ($2,009) on May 31, indicating that they are not allowing the bulls to get a foothold.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/013910b6-5a4e-413e-b8a8-4804047754f3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price to the vital support at $1,700. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if it cracks, the ETH/USDT pair could witness panic selling. The pair could then resume its downtrend and plummet to $1,300.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off $1,700, it will suggest that the bulls are proactively buying at these levels. The bulls will then again try to push the price above the 20-day EMA and challenge the stiff resistance at $2,159.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rose above the immediate resistance of $320 on May 30 but the bulls have not been able to build upon this move. This indicates that bears are posing a strong challenge at $325.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/d62beaf8-2dd1-42a1-8d9e-6da640dc61b3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers have pulled the price to the uptrend line. This is an important level to keep an eye on in the near term. If the price rebounds off this level, it will suggest that bulls are accumulating on dips. That could enhance the prospects of a break above $325.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bears sink the price below the uptrend line, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to the strong support zone between $286 and $265. A break below $265 could send the pair tumbling to the vital support at $211.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rose above the downtrend line on May 30 but the bulls could not clear the overhead hurdle at the 20-day EMA ($0.43). This suggests that bears are not willing to surrender their advantage.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/e0c09002-d5e6-4103-904f-57f445de200c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to sink the price below the downtrend line. If that happens, the XRP/USDT pair could decline to $0.38. The buyers are likely to defend this level and a bounce off it will point to a possible consolidation in the near term.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off the downtrend line, it will suggest that bulls are attempting to flip this level to support. If that happens, the possibility of a break above the 20-day EMA increases. The pair could then rally to the psychological resistance at $0.50.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke above the 20-day EMA ($0.56) on May 30 and followed it up with another sharp up-move on May 31. This pushed the price to the 50-day SMA ($0.70) but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears are selling near this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/be4ba912-b485-4392-8286-30421578f8b8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price back below the 20-day EMA and trap the aggressive bulls. If that happens, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to $0.44 where buying may emerge.\par \par \uc2 That could suggest a consolidation inside the large range between $0.44 and $0.74. The flattening 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) just below the midpoint also indicate a range-bound action in the near term.\par \par \uc2 The bulls may gain the upper hand if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA and breaks above $0.74. Such a move will suggest that the downtrend may be over.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) relief rally is facing stiff resistance from the bears near the psychological level at $50. This suggests that bears have not yet given up and they continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/9ae2a608-0011-42c7-843d-9233df12ceeb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price to the strong support at $40. The bulls are expected to buy the dips to this level. If the price rebounds off this support, the buyers will again try to push the SOL/USDT pair above the 20-day EMA ($51). If they succeed, the pair could rally to $60 and thereafter attempt an up-move to the breakdown level of $75.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if bears sink the price below $40, the pair could drop to the May 12 intraday low of $37. The pair could resume its downtrend if bears pull the price below this crucial support.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) price has been trading near the 20-day EMA ($0.09) for the past two days but the bulls have failed to achieve a breakout. This suggests that bears are defending the 20-day EMA with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/1d7f9050-0825-415f-8ffa-9a19ff976fa9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to sink the price to the strong support at $0.07. This level has held on two previous occasions, hence the bulls will again try to defend it. If the price rebounds off this support, the DOGE/USDT pair may remain stuck inside a range between $0.10 and $0.07 for some time.\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive the price above $0.10, it will suggest that the downtrend could be weakening. The pair could then rally to $0.12. Conversely, the downtrend could resume on a break below $0.07.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/axie-infinity-v-shape-recovery-fizzles-as-axs-price-drops-20-from-three-week-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Axie Infinity V-shape recovery fizzles as AXS price drops 20% from three-week high}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is facing resistance at the 20-day EMA ($10.55) but the bulls have not allowed the price to sustain below $10. This suggests strong demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/8f0bb2f3-28ec-4e16-9149-72b734a6bf66.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the DOT/USDT pair could rally to $12. This level may act as a minor hurdle but if crossed, the recovery could reach the strong overhead resistance at $14.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and sustains below $10, the decline could extend to the strong support at $8. A strong bounce off this support will suggest that the pair may remain range-bound between $8 and $12 for some time.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the downtrend line on May 31 suggesting that bears continue to defend the level with vigor. The bears will now try to pull the price below the strong support zone of $23.51 to $21.35.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/99459e4a-726d-48cb-9f26-4613d188af41.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the AVAX/USDT pair will complete a descending triangle pattern, indicating the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The pair could then decline to $20.\par \par \uc2 Although the downsloping 20-day EMA ($31.33) favors the bears, the positive divergence on the RSI suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening. If the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA, buying could resume. The bulls will then try to propel the pair to $38.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) recovery is facing stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($0.000012) suggesting that the sentiment remains negative and bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-06/4f5db9e2-ea7a-4188-938b-6761090cf52b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price to the strong support at $0.000010. This level is likely to attract aggressive buying by the bulls. If the price rebounds off $0.000010, the SHIB/USDT pair could rally toward the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If buyers push the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to $0.000014 and later to the breakdown level of $0.000017. On the downside, the bears will have to sink the price below $0.000009 to signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDYvMjgyNmU5NTktNTEyMy00YjFjLThhNDktYTUzYzI2N2RmZGU0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220601ei61000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, AVAX, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,823 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 May 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The elusive relief rally that BTC and ETH traders expected has arrived, but will the market sustain enough \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum to catalyze a trend change?\par \par \uc2 After creating the dubious record of nine successive red weekly closes, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to make amends by starting a price recovery to end the losing streak. Analysts have repeatedly said that investors should not fear a bear market because it is one of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/market-cleansing-bear-cycles-are-healthy-say-industry-experts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 best times to invest in fundamentally strong projects}}}\uc2  in preparation for the next bull phase.\par \par \uc2 CryptoQuant CEO Ki Young Ju highlighted that unspent transaction outputs (UTXOs) that are older than six months reflect 62% of the realized cap, which is similar to the level seen during the March 2020 crash. Hence, Ki said that Bitcoin may be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/mega-bullish-signal-or-real-breakdown-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 close to forming a cyclic bottom}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/a0027dbc-8ccd-432a-a229-bd0cf43e0f5b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 In the current \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  environment, it is difficult to fathom a Bitcoin rally to $250,000 but billionaire investor Tim Draper is still \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . While speaking on a \uc2 YouTube\uc2  show on May 24, Draper said that if more retailers start accepting Bitcoin, participation from women will increase as they will buy things with Bitcoin. According to Draper, this could boost {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/tim-draper-women-will-drive-the-next-bitcoin-bull-market"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price above his target objective of $250,000}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 With several analysts calling for a bottom in Bitcoin, is it a good time to buy? Could the crypto markets start a recovery in the short term? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke above the downtrend line on May 30 and the bulls are attempting to sustain the price above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($30,562). If they succeed, it will be the first indication that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/dd0579ac-c881-49b5-aa07-762cfd9155f3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above the 20-day EMA, the BTC/USDT pair could rise to $32,659 and later to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($34,954). The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the relative strength index (RSI) has risen above 46, suggesting that bulls are attempting a comeback.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then make another attempt to pull the pair below $28,630 and challenge the May 12 intraday low at $26,700. A break below this support could signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the vital support at $1,700 on May 28 and is marching toward the 20-day EMA ($2,026). This suggests that bulls are attempting to start a sustained recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/b70198ad-d1f9-4b78-9847-979eacae2cad.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The RSI is showing a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence suggesting that the selling pressure may be reducing. The buyers will try to push the price above the 20-day EMA and challenge the breakdown level at $2,159. If bulls fail to clear this hurdle, the BNB/USDT pair may turn down and consolidate between $1,700 and $2,159.\par \par \uc2 If bulls thrust the price above $2,159, it will suggest that $1,700 may be the bottom in the short term. The pair could then rally to the 50-day SMA ($2,504). This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view could be invalidated if the price turns down and plummets below $1,700.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  took support near the immediate support at $286 on May 27, suggesting that traders are buying the dips. The bulls will now again attempt to push the price above the overhead resistance at $320.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/68127bec-9a2e-4f1f-b146-17ede62c0ca3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to $350. The longer the price sustains above $320, the greater the possibility that the bottom has been made on May 12. If bulls overcome the barrier at $350, the rally could reach $400.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the current level or $350, it will suggest that bears are selling on rallies. That could again pull the price to the immediate support at $286. If this support cracks, the pair could decline to $260.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Although Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) dipped below $0.38 on May 26, the bears could not maintain the selling pressure. This started a recovery on May 28, which has reached the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/e4f57638-b951-4b8c-bbf7-885dc4e75c88.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears have repeatedly mounted a strong defense at the downtrend line; hence, this is an important resistance to keep an eye on. If the price reverses direction from the downtrend line, the bears will try to pull the XRP/USDT pair below $0.37 and challenge the crucial support at $0.33.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if buyers drive and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.43), it will suggest that the sellers may be losing their grip. The pair could then rally to the psychological level at $0.50.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke below the minor support at $0.46 on May 27 but the bears could not build upon the advantage. The bulls purchased this dip and started a recovery on May 28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/aeb61fd1-66cb-44cf-8901-7dc20c3b133e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally picked up momentum on May 30 and the bulls are attempting to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.54). If they succeed, it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair is attempting to form a bottom. The pair could then rise to $0.61 and later attempt a rally to the breakdown level of $0.74.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could be negated if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the bears will again try to sink the pair below $0.40 and start the next leg of the downward move.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) recovered from $40 on May 28, indicating that lower levels continue to attract buying by the bulls. The buyers will now try to push the price to the 20-day EMA ($53).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/efc1b063-eeec-4552-88fe-44ed01d8867d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls propel the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the downtrend could be weakening. The SOL/USDT pair may then rise to $60 and thereafter rally to the 50% Fibonacci retracement level of $66.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on rallies. That could increase the possibility of a retest of $37.37. A break below this support may start the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) plunged below $0.08 on May 26 but made a strong comeback on May 27. This suggests aggressive buying at lower levels but the bears are not ready to give up their advantage as they continue to defend the 20-day EMA ($0.09) with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/1ff0a7c5-bea2-4ae7-8ddb-f35f41b0c59a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will again try to push the price above the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the DOGE/USDT pair could rise to the psychological level at $0.10. This level may again act as a resistance but if bulls overcome this hurdle, the pair could rally to $0.12.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA or $0.10, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. That could pull the pair down to $0.08 and later to the May 12 intraday low of $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-ready-for-32-8k-after-consolidation-as-btc-price-gains-6-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin \u8216\'20\'18ready\u8217\'20\'19 for $32.8K after consolidation as BTC price gains 6.3%}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) formed a Doji candlestick pattern on May 27, suggesting indecision among the bulls and the bears. This uncertainty resolved to the upside and bulls pushed the price to the overhead resistance at $10.37.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/8d69ebf3-138f-43cd-9ec7-10f6e8ac5a3c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the price above the overhead resistance, it could open the doors for a possible rally to $12. If bulls clear this hurdle, the next stop could be $14. A break and close above this resistance could indicate that the DOT/USDT pair may have bottomed out.\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate if the price turns down sharply from the current level and breaks below $8.56. That could result in a decline to the May 12 intraday low of $7.30. The bears will have to sink the price below this level to indicate the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) dipped below the strong support at $23.51 on May 26 but the bears could not capitalize on this advantage. The bulls bought the dip on May 27 and started a recovery on May 28.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/7e0815a2-358d-441d-ad11-2aced7a54173.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will attempt to push the price to the 20-day EMA ($32.42), which is an important level to keep an eye on. If the price turns down from this resistance, the bears will try to retest the May 27 intraday low at $21.35. If this support cracks, the AVAX/USDT pair could slide to the psychological level at $20.\par \par \uc2 The RSI is showing a positive divergence, indicating that the selling pressure could be reducing. If bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to $38 and later attempt an up-move to $46.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the support at $0.000010 on May 27, which resulted in a rebound on May 28. Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) continued its recovery and has reached the 20-day EMA ($0.000012), which is likely to act as a strong resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/a6e99850-e931-455a-ab7a-35d91de1e27e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will again attempt to sink the SHIB/USDT pair below $0.000010. If that happens, the pair could retest the critical support at $0.000009.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the downtrend may be weakening. The pair could then attempt a rally to $0.000014 and later to the breakdown level at $0.000017. The bulls will have to clear this overhead hurdle to signal a potential change in trend.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDUvOTBjZTAyMTMtMDRkNy00MjlmLWJhMzMtNzI1ZmIyMDQwNWYwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220530ei5u000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recent gains have traders calling a bottom, but various metrics remain  \highlight22\uc2 bearish \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Marcel Pechman \par \uc2 867 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 May 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The total crypto market capitalization recovered roughly 5%, but a variety of trading metrics show investors are skeptical about the rally being a trend change.\par \par \uc2 On May 30, the total crypto market capitalization gained 4% and currently is within reach of a $1.3 trillion market capitalization. The move was enough to erase the losses from the previous seven days and was driven mainly by Bitcoin's ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) 4.9% gain during that time frame.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/6c601148-2016-4c96-8e38-1c7920487cc7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total crypto market cap, USD billion. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Apart from Bitcoin, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) was the only large-cap cryptocurrency that managed to close the week with a positive 4.5% performance. Meanwhile, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2 , \uc2 Ripple\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) and Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) failed to present weekly gains.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s turn-around happened after the United States stock market presented gains for the first time after seven consecutive negative weeks. The longest losing streak in over a decade for the S&P 500 was followed by a 6.6% positive performance at the closing bell on May 22.\par \par \uc2 According to Yahoo! Finance, \u8220\'20\'1Ca favorable batch of quarterly results from major retailers helped at least temporarily {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://finance.yahoo.com/news/what-to-watch-in-markets-this-week-may-31-2022-153030161.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 mitigate}}}\uc2  concerns over the toll [that ...] inflationary headwinds could take on profit margins.\u8221\'20\'1D For instance, \uc2 Macy\u8217\'20\'19s\uc2  (M) gained 29.1% in the week, followed by \uc2 Nordstrom\uc2  (JWN) 25.4% positive performance and \uc2 Ross Stores\uc2  (ROST) rallied by 21.5%.\par \par \uc2 Curiously, \uc2 JP Morgan\uc2  sent out a research note to clients on May 25, claiming that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/jpmorgan-places-btc-fair-price-at-38k-declares-crypto-a-preferred-alternative-asset"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $38,000 was the fair value for Bitcoin}}}\uc2 . The global investment bank also said that Terra's ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  ) collapse did not harm the crypto venture capital demand.\par \par \uc2 On May 23, during the \uc2 World Economic Forum\uc2  (\uc2 WEF\uc2 ) in Davos, Switzerland, \uc2 PayPal\uc2  vice president Richard Nash stated the company\u8217\'20\'19s intention to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/wef-2022-paypal-looks-to-embrace-all-possible-crypto-and-blockchain-services"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 embrace all possible crypto and blockchain services}}}\uc2 . After rolling out its Bitcoin trading across the United States in 2020, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-for-beginners/how-to-buy-ethereum-with-paypal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-for-beginners/how-to-buy-ethereum-with-paypal}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-for-beginners/how-to-buy-ethereum-with-paypal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 PayPal continues to expand}}}\uc2  its digital currency-related offering.\par \par \uc2 Below are the winners and losers from the past seven days. While the leading cryptocurrencies presented modest movements, some mid-capitalization altcoins presented high \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/a99f47c0-d8c5-4f88-9376-fa53da0d46e9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Weekly winners and losers among the top 80 coins. Source: Nomics\par \par \uc2 Synthetix (SNX) rallied 15.8% after Kwenta, a zero-slippage derivatives trading application {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://grafana.synthetix.io/d/pjPJZ6x7z/synthetix-system-stats?orgId=1&kiosk=full"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 powered}}}\uc2  by Synthetix, reached $325 million in volume.\par \par \uc2 Helium (HNT) gained 15.2% after details regarding improvement proposal #51 were released on May 27. The change {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://blog.helium.com/helium-chapter-2-a-network-of-networks-7372262210bd"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 introduces}}}\uc2  a framework to enable subnets with their own token and governance.\par \par \uc2 STEPN Governance ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stepn-gmt-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 GMT}}}\uc2  ) lost 14.6% after {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/stepn-to-block-mainland-china-users-to-comply-with-regulatory-policies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 blocking users based in mainland China}}}\uc2  from its mobile app.\par \par \uc2 Terra Luna Classic (LUNC), previously known as LUNA, moved down 12.2% after the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/south-korean-authorities-reportedly-probe-staff-behind-terra"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 South Korean authorities summoned all employees}}}\uc2  at Terraform Labs as part of a full-scale investigation.\par \par \uc2 Due to the mixed performance of altcoin markets, it is worth investigating how traders are positioned according to trading and derivatives indicators.\par \par \uc2 The Tether premium shows a lack of retail demand\par \par \uc2 The OKX Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) premium is a good gauge of China-based retail trader crypto demand. It measures the difference between China-based peer-to-peer (P2P) trades and the United States dollar.\par \par \uc2 Excessive buying demand tends to pressure the indicator above fair value. On the other hand, during \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, Tether's market offer is flooded, causing a 4% or higher discount.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/b4fa147e-074d-48d2-acee-44f290231897.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Tether (USDT) peer-to-peer vs. USD/CNY. Source: OKX\par \par \uc2 Between May 23 and 30, the Tether premium in CNY terms has averaged a 2% discount, signaling a lack of retail demand. More importantly, the 4% crypto market capitalization rally on May 30 did not change investors' sentiment.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-s-youngest-investors-hold-firm-against-headwinds-and-headlines"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto\u8217\'20\'19s youngest investors hold firm against headwinds \u8212\'20\'14 and headlines}}}\par \par \uc2 Derivatives indicators are slightly \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for altcoins\par \par \uc2 Perpetual\uc2  contracts, also known as inverse swaps, have an embedded rate that is usually charged every eight hours. Exchanges use this fee to avoid exchange risk imbalances.\par \par \uc2 A positive funding rate indicates that longs (buyers) demand more leverage. However, the opposite situation occurs when shorts (sellers) require additional leverage, causing the funding rate to turn negative.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/7ebe6811-2125-46c7-9c42-b9dd66ffa8f8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Accumulated perpetual futures funding rate on May 30. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 Perpetual\uc2  contracts reflect mixed sentiment as Bitcoin and Ether held a slightly positive (\b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 ) funding rate, but altcoins signaled the opposite. For example, Solana's negative 0.20% weekly rate equals 0.8% per month, which is irrelevant for most derivatives traders.\par \par \uc2 The data suggests that investors are not rushing in to confirm that the recent price recovery represents a trend change. While the total crypto market capitalization broke above the $1.3 trillion support, traders are pricing higher odds of a downturn. So far, there is no clear indication of a market bottom according to trading metrics.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/noshitcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDUvNmNjNDBkM2ItMDExNi00YjhhLThjYTMtOWI0OGU5Yjk5YTM5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220530ei5u000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/25: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, AVAX, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,724 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 May 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The tight-range trading in Bitcoin and several altcoins could result in a trending move in the short term.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been struggling to sustain above $30,800 since May 16, suggesting that demand dries up at higher levels. Similarly, U.S. equity markets have not ceased to decline due to uncertainty regarding the number of rate hikes that will be needed to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/low-inflation-or-bust-analysts-say-the-fed-has-no-choice-but-to-continue-raising-rates"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bring inflation under control}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 As the crypto bear market deepens, analysts are becoming extra \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on their projections for the extent of the fall. Trader and analyst Rekt Capital said that Bitcoin could be at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-may-bottom-at-15-5k-if-it-retests-this-lifetime-historical-support-level"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 risk of falling to $19,000 to $15,500}}}\uc2  before a bottom is formed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/7f8c27f4-41dc-48db-8e0b-db458f71057e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 However, Arcane Research recently pointed out that buying when Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s Fear and Greed Index reaches a score of 8 had resulted in an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-bottom-signals-flash-as-fear-and-greed-index-matches-march-2020-lows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 average median 30-day return of 28.72%}}}\uc2 . Interestingly, the index hit 8 on May 17.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin slide further and pull altcoins lower or is it time for a recovery? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rose above the downtrend line on May 23 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. The price turned down and dipped to the strong support at $28,630 on May 24 but a minor positive is that the bulls successfully defended this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/2d0c0fe5-3cb0-40fb-a36f-8c1fbfd28fef.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are again attempting to push and sustain the price above the downtrend line. If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($31,286).\par \par \uc2 In downtrends, the bears tend to sell the rallies to the 20-day EMA. Hence, this level may act as a stiff resistance. The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to suggest that a bottom may be in place.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, $28,630 is the important support to keep an eye on because a break below it could result in a drop to the May 12 intraday low at $26,700.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) dipped below the uptrend line on May 24 but the bulls bought at lower levels and pushed the price back above the uptrend line. This suggests that bulls are trying to defend the uptrend line with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/bb8ed653-9775-485c-b122-0daf10cf14f3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the bears have not given up and they are again attempting to pull the price below the uptrend line on May 25. If bulls thwart this attempt, the ETH/USDT could rise to the overhead resistance at $2,159.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks and sustains below the uptrend line, it will suggest advantage to bears. The pair could then decline to $1,903. A break and close below this support could pull the pair to the May 12 intraday low at $1,800.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  climbed above the 20-day EMA ($323) on May 24 but the long wick on the May 25 candlestick suggests that the bears are attempting to defend the overhead resistance at $350.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/79734dbc-5d3a-4dbf-8d09-8684d78d4829.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 If bulls push the price above $350, the advantage could tilt in favor of the buyers. Such a move could clear the path for a potential rally to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($368) and later to $413.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below $320, it will suggest that bears are aggressively selling at higher levels. The BNB/USDT pair could then slide to $286.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are defending the immediate support at $0.38. Although Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) bounced off $0.39 on May 24, the bulls could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/edb7a45e-c239-4774-8b3e-5a6874137b1e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are again attempting to sink the price below the support at $0.38 but the long tail on the candlestick suggests strong buying at lower levels. If the demand sustains at higher levels, the bulls will attempt to push the price above the downtrend line and challenge the 20-day EMA ($0.46).\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level or the downtrend line, the bears may again try to sink the XRP/USDT pair below $0.38. If they can pull it off, the pair could drop to the vital support at $0.33.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been trading in a tight range between $0.49 and $0.56 since May 19. This suggests that bulls are attempting to form a higher low but are facing stiff resistance from the bears at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/0e9f0d20-2c1d-4981-b2a0-84b13b0641cd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the support at $0.49, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may remain stuck in the range for a few more days. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.58) to indicate the start of a strong relief rally that may reach the breakdown level of $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Instead, if bears sink the price below the strong support at $0.49, the selling may intensify and the pair could slide toward the May 12 intraday low at $0.40.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) attempt to rally on May 23 fizzled out at $54. The failure of the bulls to push the price to the 20-day EMA ($58) indicates that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/2dd96306-6bd9-4602-aa03-9c0f0ee7b9d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to sink the price below the immediate support at $47. If they manage to do that, the SOL/USDT pair could drop to $43 and thereafter to the critical support at $37. The downsloping moving averages and the RSI near the oversold territory indicate advantage to sellers.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off $47, the bulls will try to propel the pair above the 20-day EMA and challenge the breakdown level at $75.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck inside a tight range between $0.08 and $0.09 for the past few days. The bulls tried to push the price above $0.09 on May 23 but failed. This may have attracted selling by the bears who are trying to sink the price below the immediate support at $0.08.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/c46f441c-4bed-4e43-841f-c221428fe32a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could slide to the crucial support at $0.06. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break and close below it could resume the downtrend. The pair could then drop to $0.04.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off $0.08, the pair may continue to trade inside the range for a few more days. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the psychological level of $0.10 to indicate that the downtrend may be weakening.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/singapore-venture-firm-launches-100m-web3-and-metaverse-fund"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Singapore venture firm launches $100M Web3 and metaverse fund}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been clinging to the $10.37 level for the past few days. The bulls pushed the price above $10.37 on May 23 but could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that bears are selling on rallies to the 20-day EMA ($11.23).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/08e4939f-13f5-4c6f-a057-43e6794a614c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears may try to pull the price to the immediate support at $9.22. If this support cracks, the DOT/USDT pair could drop to $8 and thereafter to $7.30. The bulls are expected to defend the zone between $8 and $7.30 aggressively.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the buyers will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA to indicate that the sellers may be losing their grip. The pair could then rally to the breakdown level at $14 where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) broke below the pennant formation on May 24 but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that bulls bought the dip. They tried to push the price back into the pennant but failed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/c4adc5cc-1210-485f-b1b4-7e5c701e5541.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to build upon their advantage and pull the price below the immediate support at $26.87. If they do that, the AVAX/USDT pair could slide to the crucial support at $23.51. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if they fail to do that, the downtrend could resume. The next support on the downside is $20.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view in the short term, the bulls will have to push the price above the pennant and the 20-day EMA ($37.23).\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) attempted to break above the immediate resistance at $0.000013 on May 23 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that bears continue to sell at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/a5e0d69b-b6ec-4db8-8c4f-935d25608640.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push the price higher could attract selling by aggressive bears who will try to pull the SHIB/USDT pair below the immediate support at $0.000010. If they manage to do that, the pair could slide to the May 12 intraday low at $0.000009.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the support at $0.000010, it will suggest that bulls are buying on dips. That could keep the pair stuck inside the $0.000010 to $0.000014 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDUvZDQwZTBmYWYtODdmYi00NjI5LTgwMDEtOTkxZWEzMThhN2NkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220525ei5p000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Crypto funds under management drop to a low not seen since July 2021\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Jordan Finneseth \par \uc2 552 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 May 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Outflows from \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  funds reached $141 million last week, a figure not seen since July 2021.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-for-beginners/bitcoin-etfs-a-beginners-guide-to-exchange-traded-funds"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22Digital asset\b0 \highlight22  investment products}}}\uc2  saw $141 million in outflows during the week ending on May 20, a move that reduced the total assets under management (AUM) by institutional funds down to $38 billion, the lowest level since July 2021.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://blog.coinshares.com/volume-81-digital-asset-fund-flows-weekly-report-9bee09901859"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 According}}}\uc2  to the latest edition of CoinShare\u8217\'20\'19s weekly \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital Asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  Fund Flows report, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) was the primary focus of outflows after experiencing a decline of $154 million for the week. The removal of funds coincided with a choppy week of trading that saw the price of BTC oscillate between $28,600 and $31,430.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/fb3b97b5-cf9c-49b0-b906-e733963a0f2a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 1-day chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Despite the sizable outflow, the month-to-date BTC flow for May remain positive at $187.1 million, while the year-to-date figure stands at $307 million.\par \par \uc2 On a more positive note, the multi-asset category of investment products managed to record a total of $9.7 million worth of inflows last week. This brings the yearly total inflow into these products to $185 million, representing 5.3% of the total AUM.\par \par \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  pointed to the uptick in \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  as a possible source for the increased inflows into multi-asset investment products, which can be seen as \u8220\'20\'1Csafer relative to single line investment products during volatile periods.\u8221\'20\'1D So far in 2020, these investment products have only experienced two weeks of outflows.\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) led the altcoin inflows with increases of $1 million each, followed by $700,000 worth of inflows into \uc2 Ripple\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) and $500,000 into Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/c5f11975-0feb-4f6c-820c-f5d968bd5518.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Flows by asset during the week ending May 20, 2022. Source: \uc2 CoinShares\par \par \uc2 Out of all the assets covered, Ethereum ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has seen the worst performance so far this year with $44 million worth of outflows in the month of May bringing its year-to-date figure to $239 million.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-s-current-setup-creates-an-interesting-risk-reward-situation-for-bulls"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s current setup creates an interesting risk-reward situation for bulls}}}\par \par \uc2 Strengthening dollar continues to impact crypto market sentiment\par \par \uc2 The declining interest in \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment products comes amid the backdrop of a strengthening dollar, which has been \u8220\'20\'1Cone of the most important macro factors driving asset prices over the last six months,\u8221\'20\'1D according to cryptocurrency market intelligence firm Delphi Digital.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/19735ce0-c672-449b-846e-5f2834f24469.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 U.S. dollar currency index. 1-week chart. Source: Delphi Digital\par \par \uc2 As shown on the chart above, the Dollar Index (DXY) has risen from 95 at the start of 2022 to 102 on May 23, a year-to-date gain of 6.8%. This marks the fastest year-over-year change for the DXY in recent history and led to a breakout from the range it had been stuck in for the past seven-years.\par \par \uc2 Delphi Digital said,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis DXY strength has been a consistent drag to risk asset performances over this same time period.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDUvOTA3ZDU0OWEtMDYyNS00ZGQ5LTg4NDAtYTRjYzNhZTQ5ZTdhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220524ei5o000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, AVAX, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,799 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 May 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and the major altcoins have bounced off their immediate support levels, paving the way for a possible relief rally in the short term.\par \par \uc2 The United States equity markets are attempting a recovery after weeks of relentless selling. Along similar lines, on-chain monitoring resource Material Indicators expects the crypto market to recover, but they anticipate Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-coma-greets-wall-street-open-amid-signs-market-calling-for-rally"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 spend some time in a range}}}\uc2  before \u8220\'20\'1Ca real breakout.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The seven-day moving average of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/trading-for-beginners/on-chain-volume-vs-trading-volume-differences-explained"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 on-chain transaction volume}}}\uc2  tracked by Glassnode hit a nine-month low on May 23. This suggests that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s lackluster price action in 2022 has led to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/largest-difficulty-drop-since-july-2021-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reduced participation from traders}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/8d1655a2-e78a-427f-b70e-fa1ccaa0c23b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 While signs of a short-term recovery are visible, a sustained recovery could be difficult because the macro conditions remain challenging. \uc2 International Monetary Fund\uc2  managing director Kristalina Georgieva wrote in a blog post that the global economy is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2022/05/23/imf-economy-faces-confluence-of-calamities-in-biggest-test-since-world-war-ii.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 witnessing}}}\uc2  its \u8220\'20\'1Cbiggest test since the Second World War.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins overcome their immediate resistance levels and start a relief rally? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin held the $28,630 support on May 20, indicating that bulls are buying at lower levels. The buyers have pushed the price above the downtrend line, which is the first sign of a recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/41e3125c-586b-40bd-a6ba-dc4b1d010fab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above the downtrend line, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($31,758). The bears are likely to defend the 20-day EMA aggressively because a break and close above it could clear the path for a possible rally to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $34,823.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will have to sink the price below $28,630 to clear the path for a possible retest of the crucial support at $26,700.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the uptrend line on May 21, indicating that bulls are buying the dips to this level. The buyers will now try to push the price to the overhead resistance at $2,159 where the bears may pose a strong challenge.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/8c45c4e1-1e60-4106-a870-c84c45338324.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead resistance, it could drop to the uptrend line. This is an important level to keep an eye on in the short term. If the price rebounds off the uptrend line, it could enhance the prospects of a break above $2,159. If that happens, the ETH/USDT pair could attempt a rally to $2,500.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the uptrend line, it will suggest that the pair may remain stuck between $2,159 and $1,700 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pushed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  above the 20-day EMA ($324), which is the first sign that the downtrend may have ended.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/6a34b8c8-e0f7-4367-a788-ec4666ab6222.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to $350 and later to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($374). The bears may again attempt to stall the up-move in this zone. If the price turns down from this zone but rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will increase the possibility of a break above the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be invalidated in the short term if the price turns down and breaks below $320. That would indicate selling by the bears at higher levels. The pair could then gradually drop to $286.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is attempting a recovery after the bulls successfully defended the immediate support at $0.38 on May 19. The buyers will now try to push the price to the 20-day EMA ($0.47).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/c553df5f-5f10-4c89-adf7-8f0b05893044.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears have the upper hand. The sellers will attempt to defend the 20-day EMA with vigor. If that happens, the XRP/USDT pair could turn down from the overhead resistance and drop to the strong support at $0.38.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, it could suggest a possible change in the short-term trend. The pair could then rise to the overhead zone between $0.50 and $0.55, which may act as a major obstacle.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the bears will have to sink and sustain the price below $0.38 to open the doors for a possible retest of the May 12 intraday low at $0.33.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls successfully defended the psychological level at $0.50 in the past few days, indicating demand at lower levels. The buyers will now try to push Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA ($0.60).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/0b04771d-5b6a-4580-a8fa-3f52a6c60c8b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could attempt a rally to the breakdown level of $0.74. The bears are likely to pose a stiff challenge at this level. If bulls arrest the subsequent decline at the 20-day EMA, it will suggest a change in sentiment from selling on rallies to buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that bears continue to sell on rallies. The bears will then try to pull the price below $0.50 and retest the crucial support at $0.40.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip to $47 on May 20 and are attempting to push Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) toward the 20-day EMA ($61). The bears are expected to defend this level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/ecbfcdb9-0a08-48bd-b6c2-c3079325814f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the SOL/USDT pair could drop to $47 where the bulls will attempt to stall the decline. If that happens, the pair may trade between $47 and $60 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the 20-day EMA will be the first indication that the bulls are back in the game. The pair could then rally to the breakdown level at $75. Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below $47, the pair could slide to the strong support at $37.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) is consolidating in a downtrend. The bulls defended the $0.08 support in the past few days and are attempting to push the price to the overhead resistance at $0.10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/d6a52551-96b7-499c-852c-5db26f408225.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $0.10, it will suggest that bears are trying to flip this level into resistance. If they succeed, the DOGE/USDT pair could continue its range-bound action for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The buyers will have to propel the price above $0.10 to suggest that the downtrend may be weakening. The pair could then rally to $0.12.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $0.08, the pair could retest the critical support at $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/monero-enters-overbought-danger-zone-after-xmr-price-gains-75-in-two-weeks"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Monero enters 'overbought' danger zone after XMR price gains 75% in two weeks}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push and sustain Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $10.37. If they succeed, the price could rally to the 20-day EMA ($11.57).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/0c0d38dc-96d8-43aa-8761-6a0b09b5ae75.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers will have to push the price above the 20-day EMA to indicate a potential change in the short-term trend. The DOT/USDT pair could then rally to the overhead resistance zone between $14 and $16 where the bears may mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the trend remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then try to pull the pair below $9.22 and retest the crucial support at $7.30.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the support line of the pennant, indicating that bulls are defending this level aggressively. The buyers will now try to push the price above the pennant.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/bc06ae1a-8149-4fe9-be6d-63982bc56294.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the AVAX/USDT pair could rally to the 20-day EMA ($39). This is an important level to watch out for because the bears are expected to defend it with vigor.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA but does not re-enter the pennant, it will suggest a possible change in trend. The buyers will then again attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at the 20-day EMA and push the pair toward $51.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA and breaks below the support line, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. The pair could then slide to $23.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to rise above the immediate resistance at $0.000013 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears are attempting to stall the rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/80d4be75-aadb-4718-9b1b-36d9c99e4cd0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the SHIB/USDT pair could spend some more time inside the range between $0.000010 and $0.000014. The next trending move could start after the price breaks above or below the range.\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.000014), the pair could attempt a rally to $0.000017. This level could again act as a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below $0.000010, the pair could slide to $0.000009. This is an important level to keep an eye on because if it cracks, the next stop could be $0.000005.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDUvY2VhYTAzYjctZGEwYi00YzQ3LTkyODQtNzgwZmFlOThkMzM4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220523ei5n000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, AVAX, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,913 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 May 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC and altcoins produced the occasional relief rally, but technical analysis suggests that the prevailing trend will remain \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for some time to come.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) tight correlation with the legacy markets continues to be a drag, especially as the United States equity markets remain in a firm bear trend. The Dow Jones Industrial Average is on track for its eighth consecutive negative week and the S&P 500 is close to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2022/05/19/stock-market-futures-open-to-close-news.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 plunging}}}\uc2  into the bear market territory.\par \par \uc2 Celsius (CEL) CEO \uc2 Alex Mashinsky\uc2  believes that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/mashinsky-says-sharks-of-wall-street-circling-around-celsius-and-other-projects"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 short sellers on Wall Street}}}\uc2  are looking for any weakness in crypto companies to \u8220\'20\'1Cshort and destroy.\u8221\'20\'1D Mashinsky blamed \u8220\'20\'1Cthe Sharks of Wall Street\u8221\'20\'1D for bringing down Terra ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  ) and trying to destabilize Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) and Maker ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/maker-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MKR}}}\uc2  ) and \u8220\'20\'1Cmany other companies,\u8221\'20\'1D including Celsius.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/65dc4aec-e9ac-4b80-ad1e-1744d5803e3c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Bear markets, though painful in the short term, tend to be good buying opportunities for long-term investors. However, it's important to remember thatwhen the next bull phase starts, not all coins will return to their former glory.\par \par \uc2 Every bull market generally has a new set of leaders; hence, traders should try to identify the cryptocurrencies that are leading the market rather than buying the laggards. Nic Carter put it nicely when he said that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-veterans-extend-a-helping-hand-to-bear-market-newbies"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 everything will not make a comeback}}}\uc2  and \u8220\'20\'1Csome things die permanently.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins break below their recent lows or will bulls defend the supports successfully? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rebounded off the strong support at $28,630 on May 19 but the bulls could not push the price above the downtrend line. This suggests that bears have not yet given up and they continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/9aa263aa-a519-4298-aeed-6fb69d248d31.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to pull the price below $28,630. If they manage to do that, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the May 20 intraday low at $26,700. This is an important support for the bulls to defend because if they fail to do that, the pair could resume its downtrend. The next support on the downside is $25,000 and then $21,800.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off $28,630 and rises above the downtrend line, it will suggest strong accumulation at lower levels. The buyers will then try to push the price to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($32,332). If bulls clear this hurdle, the pair could rise toward the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $34,823.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) below the immediate support at $1,940 on May 18 and 19 but they could not capitalize on this move. The bulls bought the dip but could not push the price to the overhead resistance at $2,159.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/a29e22d1-d6d4-427b-ab4f-fb26f1a33011.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Strong selling at higher levels has pulled the price to the uptrend line on May 20. If the ETH/USDT pair breaks below the uptrend line, the decline could extend to the crucial support at $1,700. The bears will have to sink the pair below this level to suggest the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level or $1,700, it will suggest buying on dips. The pair will then make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $2,159. If they manage to do that, it will suggest that the pair may have bottomed out.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  has been consolidating near the overhead resistance at $320 for the past few days. A tight consolidation near a stiff resistance indicates that bulls are not dumping their positions as they expect the recovery to continue.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/82be7489-32ea-4ab9-aae7-7ad1dc0eff8a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls thrust the price above the overhead resistance zone between $320 and the 20-day EMA ($326), it will suggest that the BNB/USDT pair may have bottomed out. The pair could then start its northward journey toward the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($381).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and breaks below $285, it will suggest that the bulls have given up and may be closing their positions. That could pull the pair to $265 and thereafter to the critical support at $211.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $0.40 to $0.38 support zone on May 19 but the bulls could not clear the overhead resistance at $0.45. This suggests that while bulls are buying on dips, the bears have maintained their selling pressure near overhead resistance levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/eef92ee1-73cc-43bd-807e-8270ae59793e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower and breaks below $0.38, the XRP/USDT pair could drop to $0.33. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break below it could resume the downtrend. The pair could then drop to $0.24.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the support zone once again, the buyers will try to push the pair to $0.50. A break and close above this level will be the first indication that the pair may be bottoming out. The next stop on the upside could be the 50-day SMA ($0.64).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to defend the $0.50 support in Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) but the bears are in no mood to let go of their advantage and they continue to sell on every minor rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/f4f2e64d-c74c-4cad-b773-5f4d79ac8851.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price slips and sustains below $0.50, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could retest the critical support at $0.40. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break below it could signal the resumption of the downtrend. The pair could then drop to $0.33 and thereafter to $0.28.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level, the buyers will attempt to push the pair above the 20-day EMA ($0.63). If they manage to do that, it will suggest that the selling pressure could be reducing. The pair could then rise to the breakdown level at $0.74.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is in a strong downtrend. Attempts by the bulls to start a recovery on May 19 failed as bears continue to sell at higher levels. The bears pulled the price back below the psychological level at $50 on May 20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/6d141683-6812-4026-bee0-bff515465beb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower, the SOL/USDT pair could drop to $43. This level may act as a strong support but if bears pull the price below it, the next stop could be $37. If this level also cracks, the decline could extend to $32.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up sharply from the current level or the support, it will suggest accumulation by the bulls. The buyers will then attempt to push the pair to the 20-day EMA ($64). A break and close above this level could open the doors for a possible rally to $75.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the immediate support at $0.08 on May 18 but the recovery continues to face selling at higher levels. This suggests that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on every minor rise.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/3a5fe186-f039-4034-939a-471095563645.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower and breaks below $0.08, the bears will fancy their chances and try to pull the DOGE/USDT pair below the May 12 intraday low at $0.06. If they manage to do that, the next leg of the downtrend could begin and the pair may drop to $0.04.\par \par \uc2 This negative view could invalidate in the short term if the price turns up from the current level or the support beneath and rises above the psychological resistance at $10. Such a move could open the doors for a recovery to the 50-day SMA ($0.12).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-preparing-a-bear-trap-ahead-of-the-merge-eth-price-to-4k-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum preparing a 'bear trap' ahead of the Merge \u8212\'20\'14 ETH price to $4K next?}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) slipped below $10.37 on May 18 but the bulls purchased this dip and tried to push the price back above the level on May 19. However, the bears stood their ground and are attempting to flip $10.37 into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/6ab809dc-f788-4829-a795-aed4ef914358.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price slips below $9.22, the DOT/USDT pair could retest the support zone between $8 and $7.30. The bears will have to sink and sustain the price below this zone to indicate the resumption of the downtrend. The next support on the downside is $5.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the support levels, the bulls will attempt to push the price to the 20-day EMA ($12). This level may act as a strong resistance but if bulls overcome this barrier, it will suggest that the sellers may be losing their grip. The pair could then attempt a rally to the 50-day SMA ($16).\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) is in a downtrend. The price action of the past few days has formed a pennant, which usually acts as a continuation pattern.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/9c1484bb-04f1-4f4c-8689-13795b11cb37.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below the support line of the pennant, the AVAX/USDT pair could retest the critical support at $23.51. A break and close below this level could signal the resumption of the downtrend. The pair could drop to $20 and thereafter to $18.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rises from the current level, the buyers will try to push the pair above the pennant. If they manage to do that, the pair could pick up momentum and rise to the 20-day EMA ($42.35). The bulls will have to clear this barrier to challenge the breakdown level at $51.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck between $0.000010 and $0.000014 for the past few days, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. This indicates that bulls are attempting to form a bottom but the bears are not allowing the rebound to sustain.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/236f6af8-c6ae-4b4e-b40c-62e53115a0a5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rises above $0.000014, it will suggest that bulls have absorbed the supply. That could clear the path for a possible rally to $0.000017 where the bears may again pose a strong challenge. The bulls will have to clear this resistance to indicate a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price slips below $0.000010, the pair could drop to the May 12 intraday low at $0.000009. If this support cracks, the decline could extend to $0.000007 and then to $0.000005.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDUvOTcwNTRjNWUtOTRlZC00MWRlLTg4MGQtYWU3MjBhZDU1ZjA0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220520ei5k000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/18: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, AVAX, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,800 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 May 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Ailing stock markets continue to impact crypto prices and technical analysis suggests BTC is at risk of falling below its recent $25,500 low.\par \par \uc2 On May 17, \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  Chairman \uc2 Jerome Powell\uc2  told the Wall Street Journal that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-shakes-of-fed-volatility-as-analysts-remain-split-on-return-under-24k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 50-basis-point rate hikes would continue}}}\uc2  until inflation is under control. Powell\u8217\'20\'19s emphasis on a hawkish policy suggests that monetary conditions are likely to remain tight in 2022, which could limit the upside in risky assets.\par \par \uc2 On-chain market intelligence firm Glassnode said that historically, Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has bottomed out when the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-is-discounted-near-its-realized-price-but-analysts-say-there-s-room-for-deep-downside"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 price breaks below the realized price}}}\uc2 . However, barring the 2019 to 2020 bear market, during previous bear cycles, Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price stayed below the realized price for anywhere between 114 to 299 days. This suggests that if macro situations are not favorable, a quick recovery is unlikely.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/44220b85-6e95-4142-8c08-67d734422847.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 While the current decline in U.S. equity markets and Bitcoin has similarities with the crash in March 2020, the recovery may not follow the same trajectory because {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/analysts-note-parallels-with-march-2020-will-this-time-be-different"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 market conditions are different}}}\uc2 . In 2020, the Fed supported the markets with an unprecedented stimulus, but in 2022 the focus will remain on reducing inflation and monetary tightening.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins resume their downtrend or will lower levels attract buying? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recovery failed to rise above the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $31,721 suggesting that the trend remains negative and traders are selling on minor rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/4d1ebfb1-aa8f-476c-bc4e-eb2b41feb351.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair could drop to the immediate support at $28,630. If the price rebounds off this level, the pair could consolidate between $28,630 and $31,721 for some time.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($32,979) will be the first sign of a potential change in trend. The pair could then rally to the 61.8% retracement level at $34,823.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price slips below $28,630, the bears will try to cement their position by pulling the pair below $26,700. If that happens, the negative momentum could pick up and the pair may slide to $25,000 and thereafter to $21,800.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) failure to rise above the overhead resistance at $2,159 may have tempted short-term traders to book profits. That pulled the price below $1,940 but the bulls are attempting to defend the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/a3cd8eea-b8f4-485d-96df-c57bffb3a0fa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $1,940 with strength, the ETH/USDT pair could again rise to $2,159. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $2,159 to clear the path for a rally to the 20-day EMA ($2,353). A break and close above this resistance will suggest that the markets have rejected the lower levels.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bears sustain the price below $1,940, the pair could decline to the crucial support at $1,700. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break below it could result in panic selling. The pair could then slump to $1,500 and later to $1,300.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls have not been able to push {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  above the overhead resistance at $320. This suggests that bears have not given up and they continue to sell at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/c73e1dc9-a79e-451c-a84c-01f1f8f4335f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price slips below $290, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to $265. This level is likely to act as a strong support but if bears pull the price below it, the next stop could be the critical level at $211. The bears will have to break this level to signal the start of the next leg of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off $265, it will suggest that bulls are attempting to form a bottom. That could keep the pair stuck between $320 and $265 for a few days. A break and close above $320 could suggest that the pair may have bottomed out.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) recovery failed to sustain above $0.45, indicating a lack of demand at higher levels. The bears will now attempt to pull the price below the immediate support zone at $0.40 to $0.38.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/f7b40bf3-6052-4456-bc9d-969efb924d93.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they do that, the XRP/USDT pair could drop to $0.33. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close below it could signal the resumption of the downtrend. The XRP/UDST pair could then plunge to the next support at $0.24.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rises from $0.38 or $0.33, the bulls will again try to push the pair above $0.45. If they succeed, the pair could rise to the stiff overhead resistance zone at $0.50 to $0.55. The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to suggest that the downtrend may be over.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been stuck in a tight range between $0.61 and $0.51 for the past few days. This suggests a tough battle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/ff4e0b09-e78c-4def-8c02-35ba0aa1d3ee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price slips below $0.51, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could slide to the support zone between $0.46 and $0.40. The bulls may mount a strong defense in this zone. If the price rebounds off this zone, the buyers will again try to push the pair above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair could rise to $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below $0.40, the selling could pick up momentum and the pair may extend its decline to $0.33 and then to $0.28.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is facing strong resistance near the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $59, suggesting that the sentiment remains negative and bears are selling on minor rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/d19a2447-757b-434d-a1be-a68330697133.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below the psychological level at $50, the pair could slip to $43 and thereafter to $37. The bulls are likely to defend this level with all their might because if the support gives way, the downtrend could resume. The next stop on the downside may be $32.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above $59, the SOL/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance zone between the 20-day EMA ($67) and $75. A break and close above this zone could suggest that the downtrend may be over.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade below the breakdown level of $0.10. This suggests a lack of urgency to buy at higher levels. Generally, sharp declines are followed by consolidations as bulls and bears battle it out for supremacy.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/a59c62e3-8bd5-47bd-8942-d1189fe266fc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push the price above $0.10 may attract another round of selling by the bears who will attempt to resume the downtrend. If the price dips below $0.08, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to $0.06. If this support cracks, the decline could extend to the next support at $0.04.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off $0.08, the pair may rise to $0.10 and remain stuck inside this range for a few days. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.10) to suggest that the downward momentum may be weakening.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/aave-price-risks-a-25-plunge-as-a-classic-bearish-reversal-pattern-emerges"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Aave price risks a 25% plunge as a classic \b  \highlight22bearish\b0 \highlight22  reversal pattern emerges}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls defended the $10.37 support on May 17 but the shallow rebound suggested a lack of demand at higher levels. The bears resumed their selling on May 18 and pulled the price below $10.37. Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) could now drop to $8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/7459ef3a-d127-4f25-9e0f-70ad6d19b707.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers are expected to aggressively defend the zone between $8 and $7.30. If the price rebounds off this zone, the DOT/USDT pair could again attempt a relief rally. The recovery could pick up momentum on a break above the 20-day EMA ($12.53).\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bears sink the price below $7.30, the selling could accelerate and the pair may signal the resumption of the downtrend. The pair could then plummet toward psychological support at $5.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 The buyers could not push Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) above the immediate resistance at $38. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/5abba259-5df6-4965-bc8a-e692306c6731.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now fancy their chances and attempt to pull the price below the critical support at $29. If they succeed, the AVAX/USDT pair could retest the May 12 intraday low at $23.51. A break and close below this level could open the doors for a further decline to $20 and later to $18.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off $29, the bulls will again try to push the pair above $38. If that happens, the relief rally could reach the 20-day EMA ($45). The bears may again pose a strong challenge at this level.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating inside the tight range between $0.000011 and $0.000014 for the past four days. Usually, such tight ranges resolve in a strong trending move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/f2676557-3e13-48aa-bd5c-8eb797387413.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below $0.000011, the bears will try to pull the SHIB/USDT pair to $0.000009. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break below it could signal the resumption of the downtrend. The pair could then decline to $0.000007 and later to $0.000005.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up and breaks above the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.000014, the bulls will attempt to push the pair to the breakdown level at $0.000017.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDUvYTg2ZTEzNzgtNmFhMC00NDlhLTk5NDEtNjY4YzQ4MjQ4NjRlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220518ei5i000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin price drops under $29K as \uc2 Walmart\uc2 , Target stock lose most since 1987\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 623 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 May 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin stays at the mercy of stocks as BTC price threatens a trip below $29,000.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) headed toward an "interesting" liquidity area on May 18 as United States stock markets opened with a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  bang.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/0ee393e9-9287-4caf-85ca-eb707a1c7b08.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 BTC price nears "interesting" rematch with lows\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.142027444.742658523.1640948929-762064149.1640948929"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  followed BTC/USD as it broke through the $29,000 support after the Wall Street open.\par \par \uc2 U.S. markets saw a swift reversal of prior gains on the day, with the S&P 500 down 2% and the Nasdaq 100 down 2.3% within the first hour of trading.\par \par \uc2 The big surprise, however, came from grocery giants \uc2 Walmart\uc2  and Target, both of which saw the biggest intraday declines since the weeks prior to the 1987 "Black Monday" market crash.\par \par \uc2 At the time of writing, WMT was down over 15% in five trading days, while TGT was nearing 25%. Both came after reports of deteriorating earnings amid a squeeze on consumer spending from inflation.\par \par \uc2 "Bear market rallies can last weeks or just a few days. The combo \uc2 Walmart\uc2 /Target bombs indicate the U.S. consumer might not be as healthy as thought. The 3-day rally could be over," Fred Hickey, editor of The High-Tech Strategist, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/htsfhickey/status/1526934332090245121"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2 Twitter\uc2  followers on the day.\par \par \uc2 As standard, BTC declined with the indices to threaten a break below $29,000 toward an area of liquidity that represented the daily closes from last week's drop, which had seen spikes below $24,000.\par \par \uc2 "Looks like a clean breakdown to me. Price action has been choppy but we should at least sweep the lows," popular trader and analyst Nebraskan Gooner tweeted in his latest update.\par \par \uc2 "Lows break and we probably see $22K. Lows hold and we can break back above $30K."\par \par \uc2 Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe agreed, descrbing the area at around $28,400 as "interesting."\par \par \uc2 Fellow longstanding social media trading presence Josh Rager hoped for a bounce at the key level to take Bitcoin higher once more.\par \par \uc2 "Many times these {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-shakes-of-fed-volatility-as-analysts-remain-split-on-return-under-24k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 compressions break one way for a fakeout}}}\uc2  and then reverse," he tweeted regarding declining \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  now potentially resulting in a price move.\par \par \uc2 "Would love to see $BTC break down, get shorts off sides, and move up. Not certain this happens at all but would be a great set up."{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Rager/status/1526744056176513024/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://twitter.com/Rager/status/1526744056176513024/photo/1}}}\par \par \uc2 A subsequent post {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Rager/status/1526908708323721217"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 confirmed}}}\uc2  that BTC/USD was moving according to plan.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/aave-price-risks-a-25-plunge-as-a-classic-bearish-reversal-pattern-emerges"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Aave price risks a 25% plunge as a classic \b  \highlight22bearish\b0 \highlight22  reversal pattern emerges}}}\par \par \uc2 Altcoins risk 90% "standard bear market correction"\par \par \uc2 On altcoins, losses began to mount faster as Bitcoin abandoned any short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  signals.\par \par \uc2 Out of the top ten cryptocurrencies by market cap, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index%60"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) were the worst performers, with daily losses near 8%.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) lost $2,000 support and headed toward its lowest levels since the May 12 cross-crypto capitulation.\par \par \uc2 "Altcoins have retraced a lot. But previous bear markets suggest they could go lower," trader and analyst Rekt Capital {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1526919295464312832/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warned}}}\uc2  on the day.\par \par \uc2 "If BTC loses its Macro Range Low, that would confirm more downside in the Crypto market. Which could enable Altcoins to follow their standard Bear Market correction of over -90%."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/a1b52b29-550e-443c-ba3d-efeef6bc7e4c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 1-hour candle chart (Binance). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDUvZTY3MGE5OWQtYjQ0Ny00ZDAxLWFmMjEtZGExNGZhMDcwODNlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220518ei5i000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/16: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, DOGE, DOT, AVAX, SHIB\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,824 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 May 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC and most altcoins are facing strong selling at the top of each rally, but the short-term downside could be limited since Bitcoin bulls keep buying each dip.\par \par \uc2 The selling in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is showing no sign of abating and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/first-7-week-losing-streak-in-history-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin has fallen for seven straight weeks}}}\uc2  for the first time ever. This indicates that the momentum remains strongly in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 While the short-term sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , institutional traders seem to be taking a longer-term approach on cryptocurrencies. \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  and \uc2 Barclays\uc2  joined {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/goldman-sachs-and-barclays-invest-in-uk-crypto-trading-platform-elwood"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 several other institutional investors}}}\uc2  in a $70 million Series A funding round by institutional trading platform Elwood Technologies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/4b545b29-62aa-4b08-943b-d6fbf984ae1c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 After the mayhem and \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the last week, crypto prices may attempt a relief rally in the next few days. It is unlikely to be a V-shaped recovery because the macro conditions are not supportive. During periods of high \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and uncertainty, it might be a wise decision to cut down on the trading position size to keep risk under check.\par \par \uc2 What are the critical support and resistance levels that may indicate a potential change in trend when breached? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from $3,460, suggesting that bears are selling on minor rallies. The bears will now attempt to sink the price below the crucial support at $28,805 but the bulls are likely to have other plans.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/73320e7d-e8af-4c0e-b245-b789a7106a8f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If price rebounds off $28,805, the bulls will again try to push the BTC/USDT pair to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($33,646). This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it could indicate that bulls are attempting a comeback. The pair could then rise to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($39,300).\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price slips below $28,805, the pair could drop to $26,700. If this support cracks, the pair could resume its downtrend and the price may plummet to $25,000 and later to $21,800.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) is facing stiff resistance at the breakdown level at $2,159, which suggests that bears continue to sell on rallies. The bears will now try to pull the price below the immediate support at $1,940.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/2c1e64c4-f0b3-4b2f-83b7-f859aa13d33c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could drop to the critical support at $1,700. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if they fail to do that, the downtrend could resume and the pair may drop to $1,500.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from $1,700, the pair could rise to $2,159 and remain range-bound between these two levels.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above $2,159. That could clear the path for a rally to the 20-day EMA ($2,421). The bulls will have to overcome this barrier to indicate that the downtrend may be over.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  's strong recovery reached near the breakdown level at $320 on May 13 and 15 but the bulls could not clear this overhead barrier. This suggests that bears are attempting to flip the level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/b92225c8-43e0-46bd-b57d-a5b4469a665a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair could now drop to $265, which is likely to act as support. If the price rebounds off this level, the buyers will again try to drive the pair above $320. If they succeed, the pair could rally to $350 and thereafter to the 50-day SMA ($391).\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price slips below $265, the pair could drop toward the strong support at $211. The bulls are expected to defend this level with vigor. A strong bounce off this support could keep the pair range-bound between $211 and $320 for the next few days.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Ripple\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) May 13 candlestick suggests that bears are trying to pose a strong challenge near the breakdown level at $0.50. The failure to rise above this overhead resistance could have tempted short-term traders to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/163994b8-2703-4f28-8349-6db7f79c36d3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower and breaks below $0.38, the XRP/USDT pair could drop to $0.33. The bulls are expected to defend this level aggressively but if the support cracks, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up and the pair may plummet to $0.24.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level or the support at $0.38, the bulls will try to push the pair above the $0.50 to $0.55 overhead zone. If they succeed, it will suggest that the markets have rejected the lower levels. That could clear the path for a potential rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.67).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) relief rally is facing selling near $0.61, suggesting that bears are not willing to let go of their advantage. The bears will try to pull the price below $0.46 and retest the May 12 intraday low at $0.40.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/acb9712b-e737-4cad-8f4f-5a4fd45c0912.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below $0.40, the selling could intensify further and the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may plunge to $0.33 and later to $0.28.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level or the support at $0.46, it will suggest that bulls are attempting to put in a bottom. The buyers will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.68) to signal that the correction may be over. The pair could then rise to $0.74 and later to the 50-day SMA ($0.89).\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) bounce from $37 is facing stiff resistance at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $59. This suggests that bears continue to sell on minor rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/456ae11e-6056-4af7-afa3-058ee81f6412.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to pull the price below the immediate support at $44. If they succeed, the SOL/USDT pair could retest the crucial level at $37. A break and close below this support could sink the pair to $32.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level or the support at $44, it will suggest that bulls are buying on dips. The bulls will then try to clear the overhead hurdle at $59 and push the pair to the 20-day EMA ($70). This level is likely to act as a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) recovery could not rise above the breakdown level at $0.10, suggesting that the bears are trying to flip the level into resistance. If sellers succeed in their endeavor, the likelihood of a retest of $0.06 increases.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/808903b8-b3a4-4033-99b1-175a1632d369.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break and close below it could signal the resumption of the downtrend. The DOGE/USDT pair could then drop to $0.04 where the bulls may again try to arrest the decline.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns up from the current level, the bulls will attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $0.10 and the 20-day EMA ($0.11). If they do that, the pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.13).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/deus-finance-s-dollar-pegged-stablecoin-dei-falls-below-60-cents"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Deus Finance\u8217\'20\'19s dollar-pegged stablecoin DEI falls below 60 cents}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) climbed back above the breakdown level of $10.37 on May 13 but the recovery stalled near $12. This suggests that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/41198aa2-c5f4-437a-9378-d68a6085948e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below $10.37, the DOT/USDT pair could drift lower toward the minor support at $8. If this level cracks, the possibility of a break below $7.30 increases. The pair could then resume its downtrend and plummet toward the next strong support at $5.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off $10.37 or $8, the bulls will attempt to push the pair above the 20-day EMA ($13). If they manage to do that, it will suggest that the short-term trend may have turned in favor of the buyers. The pair could then attempt a rally to $16.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) recovery is facing stiff resistance at $38. The shallow rebound following a sharp decline suggests a lack of aggressive buying by the bulls. This could embolden the bears who may try to build upon their advantage.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/9a8b5c13-2a9e-4922-80de-957cb153e893.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears pull the price below $29, the selling could pick up momentum and the AVAX/USDT pair could drop to the critical level at $23. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break and close below it could result in a decline to $20 and thereafter to $18.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level or $29, it will suggest that bulls are buying at lower levels. That could increase the possibility of a relief rally to the 20-day EMA ($48) where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Shiba Inu\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/shiba-inu-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB}}}\uc2  ) rebound hit a wall at the 38.2% Fibonacci retracement level at $0.000014 on May 13 and 14, indicating that bears do not want to let go of their advantage.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/d7a3320d-c94f-4969-8769-cbd308fa5989.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SHIB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will once again try to sink the price below the psychological level at $0.000010 and challenge the intraday low of $0.000009 made on May 12. A break and close below this level could signal the resumption of the downtrend. The SHIB/USDT pair could then decline to $0.000007, which is likely to act as a strong support.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off $0.000010, the bulls will attempt to push the pair to the breakdown level at $0.000017. The buyers will have to clear this hurdle to suggest that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDUvMTdmZGIwYjEtNGQxYi00NmYyLWI4MzgtNTc5YzdmYTQ4NmJkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220516ei5g000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LUNA, DOGE, AVAX, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,903 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 May 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC and many altcoins are fast approaching the \u8220\'20\'1Ccapitulation phase\u8221\'20\'1D, which is typically followed by the market finding a bottom.\par \par \uc2 Global equity markets extended their decline on May 9 and the S&P 500 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbc.com/2022/05/08/stock-futures-fall-as-wall-street-looks-to-stabilize-after-rollercoaster-week.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 fell}}}\uc2  to a new 52-week low. Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) dropped to a new year-to-date low and most major altcoins extended their decline as they tracked the weakness in the stock markets.\par \par \uc2 Data from blockchain analytics firm Glassnode shows that Bitcoin {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-whales-jumping-ship-as-exchange-inflows-reach-3-month-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 inflows to centralized exchanges have risen}}}\uc2  to more than 1.7 million coins, the highest since February. This suggests that whales may be dumping their holdings as they anticipate an extended downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/0016f137-d879-4e2e-925a-d540d63dff2c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Several analysts expect the crypto markets to enter a capitulation phase which generally marks a bottom. Analyst Dylan LeClair highlighted that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sets-news-2022-lows-as-analyst-says-trip-to-24k-realized-price-entirely-possible"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 previous market bottoms during bear markets}}}\uc2  happened when Bitcoin dropped to its realized price (average on-chain cost basis). The metric is currently at $24,300.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins enter a capitulation phase or is it time for the crypto markets to surprise many by staging a strong recovery? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin plummeted below the ascending channel on May 5 and has continued lower, indicating that bears are in no mood to let go of their advantage. The price has dipped below the critical support at $32,917 but the bears may face a strong challenge from the bulls at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/e607c77b-9184-4826-b79c-e32b2809c49e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level, the relief rally could reach the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($37,670). This is an important level to watch out for because if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par \uc2 The bears will then make another attempt to pull the BTC/USDT pair to the critical support at $28,805. This level is again likely to attract buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break and close above the 20-day EMA will be the first indication that the selling pressure may be reducing. That could clear the path for a possible rally to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($41,279).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke below the uptrend line on May 7. This move invalidated the developing ascending triangle pattern. The breakdown of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern is usually a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign as stops of several bulls who may have purchased in anticipation of a breakout from the pattern being triggered.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/91f7648b-31cc-44b3-ad01-24d749d7f20e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Strong selling has pulled the price below the immediate support at $2,445. This opens the door for a possible drop to the critical support zone between $2,300 and $2,159. The bulls are likely to defend this zone with all their might because a break below it could sink the ETH/USDT pair to $1,700.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the support zone, the bulls will make an attempt to push the pair above the 20-day EMA ($2,790). If they succeed, it will suggest that the bears may be losing their grip. The pair could then rally to the 50-day SMA ($3,043).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  has witnessed sustained selling for the past few days. The bears pulled the price below the strong support at $350 and are now challenging the critical level at $320.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/f7e7686e-16e2-4e93-8fc7-2b523320d370.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close below $320 would be a huge negative as this level has not been breached since August 2021. There is a minor support at $300 but if this level fails to arrest the decline, the BNB/USDT pair could plummet to $250.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off $320, the bulls will try to push the pair above $350 and challenge the 20-day EMA ($383). The buyers will have to clear this hurdle to signal that the decline could be over. The pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA ($409).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.63) on May 5 and dipped below $0.62. The buyers attempted to push the price back above $0.62 on May 6 but the bears held their ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/03055f2f-1ea7-4f26-bbe1-852b532a8c41.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The XRP/USDT pair continued its decline and has broken below the support at $0.55. This clears the path for a retest of the psychological support at $0.50. The buyers are expected to defend this level with vigor because a break and close below it could start a downtrend that could sink the pair to $0.42.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the $0.50 support, the bulls will again attempt to drive and sustain the pair above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, it will suggest that the selling pressure could be reducing.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) above the 20-day EMA on May 5 may have attracted strong selling by the bears. The price continued its downward move and has slipped below the strong support at $75.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/bed00075-902d-4e66-915f-903892fcda47.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below $75, it will suggest the start of the next leg of the downtrend. The SOL/USDT pair could first decline to $66 and next to $58. If the price rebounds off this zone, the buyers will try to push and sustain the pair back above $75. If they manage to do that, it will suggest that the downtrend could be ending.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the recovery stalls at $75, it will suggest that bears have flipped the level into resistance. If that happens, the bears will attempt to resume the decline.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($0.81) on May 4 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. The price turned down on May 5 and broke below the strong support at $0.74 on May 8.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/452f62b0-a37d-4e0d-9e0f-dcb9c1da8427.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This suggests the resumption of the downtrend. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could now decline to $0.64, which could act as a support. If the price rebounds off this level, the bulls will again try to push the pair above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, it will suggest that the break below $0.74 may have been a bear trap.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the relief rally stalls at $0.74 or the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. The sellers will then attempt to sink the pair to the psychological support at $0.50.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token turned down from the downtrend line on May 5 and plunged below the strong support at $75 on May 7. This completed the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern, suggesting the start of a new downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/98e28a33-d68d-4297-a6bb-0a210bb02c33.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long tail on the May 7 and 8 candlestick suggests that bulls purchased at lower levels but the failure to start a recovery shows that bears are in no mood to let go of their advantage. The pattern target of this topping formation is $50. This level is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $50, the bulls will attempt to push the LUNA/USDT pair toward the breakdown level at $75. If the price turns down from this level, the pair may form a range between $50 and $75.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/shib-price-eyes-30-drop-with-shiba-inu-s-massive-triangle-breakdown-underway"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SHIB price eyes 30% drop with Shiba Inu's massive triangle breakdown underway}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.13) on May 7, indicating that bears continue to sell on rallies. The selling picked up momentum on May 9 and the bears have pulled the price below the strong support at $0.12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/dc20e052-d895-41dd-b4d3-3897da1b16aa.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative territory indicate advantage to sellers. If bears sustain the price below $0.12, the DOGE/USDT pair could slide to the psychological support at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $0.10, the buyers will try to push the pair above $0.12 and challenge the 20-day EMA. A break and close above the 20-day EMA could be the first indication that the pair may remain stuck between $0.10 and $0.17 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bears sink the pair below $0.10, the selling could intensify and the decline could extend to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($63) on May 5 and has plunged below the critical support at $51. If bears sustain the price below $51, it will indicate the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/ae8d782c-e84c-4bc2-a2c8-63a4e859f08f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 There is a minor support at $47 and then at $43. If the price turns up from either support, the buyers will try to push the AVAX/USDT pair back above $51. If they succeed, the pair could recover to the 20-day EMA, which is an important level to keep an eye on.\par \par \uc2 If bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bears could be losing their grip. The pair could then attempt a rally to the 50-day SMA ($77).\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the recovery falters at the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then again try to resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) tight range trading between $14 and $16 resolved to the downside on May 7, indicating that the bears have overpowered the buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/1ae95e69-d89b-4b64-8043-e292b34aff39.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USDT pair could now drop to the crucial support at $10 where the bulls are expected to mount a strong defense. Although the downsloping 20-day EMA ($15.54) signals advantage to bears, the RSI in the oversold territory suggests a recovery may be around the corner.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $10, the bulls will attempt to push the pair above the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, it will be the first sign that the selling pressure may be reducing.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on rallies. The bears will then again attempt to sink the pair below the strong support at $10. If they do that, the pair could slide to $7.16.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDUvNmU0ODhmYzAtZDY3Ni00ZTQ5LWI4ZjQtZTgxODEzZTZjNjIyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220509ei59000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Aussie exchange Swyftx to offer \u8216\'20\'18no lock-in\u8217\'20\'19 yield on crypto\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Tom Mitchelhill \par \uc2 628 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 May 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Swyftx\u8217\'20\'19s new product, called Earn, will offer Australian and New Zealand residents the ability to earn interest on 21 different digital assets.\par \par \uc2 Swyftx exchange will begin offering interest-bearing yields on a wide range of cryptocurrency assets \u8212\'20\'14 the first Australian-operated crypto exchange to do so.\par \par \uc2 Swyftx\u8217\'20\'19s new product, called Earn, will offer Australian and New Zealand residents the ability to earn interest on 21 different digital assets, including large-cap cryptocurrencies such as Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ethereum ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and stablecoins like Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) and USD Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/usdc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDC}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 Swyftx Chief Executive Officer, Ryan Parsons, said the exchange\u8217\'20\'19s Earn feature was one of the most competitive in the crypto industry, as the Brisbane-based company will allow customers to withdraw their assets from Earn at any time, with no exit fees, lock-ups or minimum notice period.\par \par \uc2 Parsons added that this fee-free flexibility is the main differentiator between its Earn product and similar ones offered by larger, multinational exchanges such as Binance and Crypto.com.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CVery few global exchanges are offering crypto users the level of interest rates that we are without also having lock-in periods.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Swyftx stated that the amount of yield that can be offered to lenders ultimately depends on the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the underlying asset. Large-cap stablecoins such as USDC and USDT are set to bear interest rates of up to 6.7%, while mainstay crypto assets like BTC and ETH will offer up to 5.1%. Slightly more risk-on assets such as Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) will offer returns of up to 12.7%, while DeFi token KAVA is set to offer up to 25.8%.\par \par \uc2 Earn will also offer yields on TrueAUD (TAUD), an Australian-dollar pegged stablecoin. Users can expect to earn up to 5.3% APY on TAUD deposits.\par \par \uc2 Swyftx clarified that the rates offered by Earn will be variable, with Swyftx providing a seven-day notice period for any changes.\par \par \uc2 Parsons said that he expects Earn to appeal to a large array of Australian investors. Currently, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/massive-jump-in-number-of-australians-who-own-crypto-survey"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 around 28.8% of all adults in Australians own}}}\uc2 , or have owned cryptocurrency according to a 2021 survey from the Independent Reserve\u8217\'20\'19s Cryptocurrency Index.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COur expectation is that you\u8217\'20\'19ll start to see many more Aussies using crypto wealth services as they become more familiar with digital assets,\u8221\'20\'1D added Parsons.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe\u8217\'20\'19re looking at significant pockets of traditional finance and thinking \u8216\'20\'18you know what, we can out-compete you.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 While Swyftx may be the first Australian crypto exchange to offer yields on cryptocurrency deposits, other Fintech startups have begun offering similar yield-bearing products to Australian consumers as well. On March 17, Australian fintech startup Block Earner {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/aussie-fintech-to-offer-mainstream-direct-access-to-defi-with-a-fixed-rate"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 began offering mainstream direct access}}}\uc2  to the world of decentralized finance (DeFi).\par \par \uc2 In an interview with Cointelegraph, Block Earner co-founder Jordan Momtazi, said that Australia\u8217\'20\'19s current economic climate makes products that offer yields on savings quite attractive, especially as it is practically impossible to achieve similar returns using methods offered by traditional financial institutions.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/swyftx-signs-major-sponsorship-deal-with-aussie-national-rugby-league"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Swyftx signs major sponsorship deal with Aussie National Rugby League}}}\par \par \uc2 The regulatory situation in Australia, concerning yield-bearing crypto deposits, is far more relaxed than in the United States. The SEC is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-firms-may-still-face-sec-penalties-for-self-reporting-securities-laws-violations-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 continuing its hard-line stance against crypto lending}}}\uc2  and related interest-bearing digital assets.\par \par \uc2 In late-Jan. of this year the SEC {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-reportedly-probing-crypto-lending-products-by-gemini-and-celsius"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launched a probe into high-yield \b  \highlight22digital asset\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  lending products offered by \uc2 Gemini\uc2 , \uc2 Celsius\uc2  and \uc2 Voyager Digital\uc2 . Then, on Feb. 14, the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/sec-hits-blockfi-with-a-100-million-penalty-gives-60-days-to-comply-with-a-1940-law"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SEC slapped crypto-lending company BlockFi}}}\uc2  with a $100 million fine for failing to register high-yield interest accounts that the agency deemed to be securities.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDUvMTEzMDdiY2YtYmIzZi00YzQxLWE0ZmYtZmMzNTBlN2VlOTUzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220505ei550002w\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/4: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, LUNA,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, AVAX, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,853 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 May 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and the altcoins are likely to swing wildly following the Fed rate decision and it may take time before the market calms down.\par \par \uc2 Investors across the world are waiting for the outcome of the Federal Open Market Committee meeting on May 4. Although {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-gains-4-pre-fed-as-microstrategy-vows-to-protect-bitcoin-from-21k-crash"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 markets expect a 50 basis point rate hike}}}\uc2  and an announcement by the Fed to start shrinking its balance sheet from June, it is difficult to predict how the markets will react to this trigger.\par \par \uc2 Billionaire investor \uc2 Paul Tudor Jones\uc2 , in an interview with CNBC, said that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-nervously-awaits-fed-as-paul-tudor-jones-says-clearly-don-t-own-stocks-bonds"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 United States was entering \u8220\'20\'1Cuncharted territory\u8221\'20\'1D}}}\uc2  as rates were being raised when the Financial Conditions Index was tightening. Tudor Jones warned investors that it was \u8220\'20\'1Cgoing to be a very, very negative situation\u8221\'20\'1D for both stocks and bonds. He added that the current environment for financial assets was the worst.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/b824b566-55fb-408b-b5ba-cbdb09df6f94.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Due to the uncertainty, some investors seem to be reducing their crypto exposure. That led to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-funds-saw-largest-single-week-of-outflows-since-june-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 weekly outflows of $132.7 million}}}\uc2  from Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) funds last week, the largest since June of last year, according to a report from \uc2 CoinShares\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins enter a period of capitulation or will investors buy after the Fed event is over? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to identify the critical levels to watch out for both on the upside and the downside.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls have successfully defended the support line of the ascending channel for the past four days, which is a positive sign. If buyers propel the price above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($39,553), it will suggest that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/189e6eca-f0d1-4710-9183-bec0250d3390.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BTC/USDT pair could then rally to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($41,922). This level may again act as resistance but if bulls overcome this barrier, the pair could rally toward the 200-day SMA ($46,924).\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA or the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on rallies. The pair could then again retest the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below the channel could open the doors for a further decline to $34,300 and later to $32,917.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) tried to rise above the 20-day EMA ($2,920) on May 2 but failed. A minor positive is that the bulls did not give up much ground and are again attempting to clear the overhead hurdle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/7644a5f8-9aa3-42b5-a920-3a05f7ac004d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers thrust the price above the 20-day EMA, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($3,069). The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above this level to signal a change in the short-term trend. The pair could then rise to the 200-day SMA ($3,441). A break and close above this level could indicate the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears are not willing to let go of their advantage. That could enhance the prospects of a break below the uptrend line. If that happens, the pair could plummet to $2,450.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  has been trading below the $391 support for the past four days but the bears could not build upon this advantage and sink the price to $350. This indicates a lack of sellers at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/529e24dd-09db-4cb2-a5f7-0e17355db6f7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push the price above the $391 resistance. If they do that, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($412). A break and close above this resistance could signal advantage to buyers. The pair could then rally to the 200-day SMA ($468).\par \par \uc2 This positive view could invalidate in the short term if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and plummets below $375. That will indicate renewed selling and may pull the pair down to $350.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) is finding buying support near $82 but the bulls have not succeeded in pushing the price above the 20-day EMA ($96). This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/77df79ef-dc86-42a0-9016-11ae09c3cece.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price fails to rise above the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to sink the SOL/USDT pair below the strong support at $75. This is an important level to keep an eye on because if the support cracks, the pair could resume the downtrend. The next support on the downside is $66.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bulls push the price above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the selling pressure may be reducing. The pair could then rise to $111 and later extend its stay inside the large range between $75 and $143.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck inside a large range between $0.55 and $0.91 for the past several days. The price rebounded off $0.56 on April 30 and the bulls are attempting to overcome the hurdle at $0.62.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/33201bc3-2208-40e0-9768-b0946f8530bf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above $0.62, the recovery could reach the 20-day EMA ($0.67). This level may again act as a stiff resistance. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to sink the XRP/USDT pair to the critical support at $0.55. A break and close below this support could pull the pair to the psychological level at $0.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.75). Such a move will suggest that the pair may spend some more time inside the large range.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token rallied to the 20-day EMA ($87) Wednesday but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/f7f1a761-c6f8-4cf2-b0ac-5fa4dc837386.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers will now try to pull the price to the strong support zone between $75 and the 200-day SMA ($71). If this zone gives way, the LUNA/USDT pair will complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern, signaling a potential trend change. The pair could then start its downward journey toward $50.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls push and sustain the price above the downtrend line, it will suggest that the short-term corrective phase may be over. The pair could rise to the psychological resistance at $100. A break and close above this level could clear the path for a possible retest of the all-time high at $119.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Although Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) was trading close to the critical level at $0.74 for the past few days, the bears could not break the support. This suggests that bulls defended the support aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/d7b614f5-f1e3-4320-a4e1-c253b57b70d7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could now recover to the 20-day EMA ($0.86) where the bears may again mount a strong resistance. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the sellers will again try to pull the pair below $0.74. If they manage to do that, the pair could start the next leg of the downward move to $0.68.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls propel the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could attempt a rally to the overhead resistance at $1. A break and close above this level could suggest that bulls are back in the game.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-eyes-mini-breakout-above-3k-as-coinbase-eth-outflows-hit-new-record"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum eyes mini breakout above $3K as Coinbase ETH outflows hit new record}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been trading below the moving averages for the past few days but the bears have not been able to challenge the support at $0.12. This suggests a lack of sellers at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/f3767943-e529-496e-a88c-a246b7e911a5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.13). If they manage to do that, the DOGE/USDT pair could rise to $0.15 and thereafter attempt a rally to the stiff overhead resistance at $0.17. This is an important level for the bears to defend because a break and close above it could signal the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, the bears will fancy their chances and try to sink the pair below $0.12. If that happens, the pair could slide to the psychological support at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) is trading inside a large range between $51 and $99. The bulls purchased the dip to $55 on April 30 but they have not been able to push the price above the breakdown level at $65.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/ba3c1854-7f1a-40f8-bbf0-52f87a8b913c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $65, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and bears are selling on rallies. The bears will then make one more attempt to pull the AVAX/USDT pair below the strong support at $51. If they succeed, the pair could start the next leg of the downtrend which could result in a decline to $32.\par \par \uc2 This negative view could invalidate in the short term if bulls drive and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($68). The pair could then rise to the 50-day SMA ($80).\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is range-bound in a downtrend. The bulls are defending the support at $14 while the bears are selling on rallies to $16. This tight-range trading is unlikely to continue for long.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/10a40764-bb33-4b1f-bcf5-c9e2bf8a301c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers push the price above $16, the DOT/USDT pair will attempt to rise above the 20-day EMA ($16.86). If that happens, it will suggest that the bears may be losing their grip. The pair could then rise to the overhead resistance at $19 where the bears may again try to stall the recovery.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the pair may spend some more time inside the range. The bears will have to sink and sustain the price below the support at $14 to indicate the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDUvNTY4NWEzMTMtNmUwNi00Mjg4LTg1ZGYtNDk3NTgzNTAwMzdiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220504ei54000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 5/2: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, LUNA,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, AVAX, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,895 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 May 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC and altcoins are holding at their current support levels, but this week\u8217\'20\'19s comments from the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  could be a determining factor in short-term price action.\par \par \uc2 The U.S. equity markets opened on a tentative note on May 2 but a minor positive is that the crypto markets led by Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) are holding above their immediate support levels. The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/fed-will-determine-the-fate-of-the-market-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 price action over the next few days}}}\uc2  will be dictated by the outcome of the Federal Open Markets Committee (FOMC) on May 4.\par \par \uc2 If the Fed springs a negative surprise, the markets could react with a knee-jerk reaction to the downside. On the other hand, if the policy meets market expectations, the equity and crypto markets could attempt a recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/afaf810c-aab8-44b7-b3f4-9848622a9f93.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 If history were to repeat itself, Bitcoin could witness a large move in the month of May. According to data from on-chain analytics platform Coinglass, Bitcoin rose more than 50% in May on two occasions in the past nine years, once in 2019 and another in 2017.\par \par \uc2 In comparison, the worst fall was in 2021 when Bitcoin plunged by more than 35%. Considering the increased \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  since 2017, traders should be ready for a possible roller-coaster ride.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins sustain the recovery? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin bounced off the support line of the ascending channel on May 1, indicating that the bulls are buying the dips to this level. The buyers will now attempt to push the price above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA)($39,824).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/58d9f231-2803-422c-87f8-6c2a3ea0a48f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, it will suggest that the bears may be losing their grip. The positive divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) also suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be reducing.\par \par \uc2 Above the 20-day EMA, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($41,970). A break and close above this level could clear the path for a rally to the 200-day SMA ($47,154).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price once again turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears continue to sell on every minor rally. That could enhance the prospects of a break below the channel.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the selling momentum could increase and the pair could plummet to $34,300 and later to $32,917.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) started a recovery on May 1 but the bears are in no mood to let go of their advantage. The long wick on May 2\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears continue to sell near the 20-day EMA ($2,939).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/d954e783-07c4-4ca5-9c23-d0feed0ea6f7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to sink the price to the uptrend line. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close below it could clear the path for a possible decline to the next support at $2,450.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off the uptrend line, it will suggest that the bulls are trying to keep the ascending triangle pattern intact. A break and close above the 50-day SMA ($3,059) could open the doors for a possible up-move to the 200-day SMA ($3,451).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  turned down from the 50-day SMA ($411) on April 29 and broke below the support at $391 on April 30. The buyers attempted to push the price back above $391 on May 1 but are facing selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/f7cbf083-8e1a-43d8-9b5f-796149dd5fa5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA ($401), it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling near overhead resistance levels. That could clear the path for a possible drop to the strong support at $350.\par \par \uc2 This negative view could invalidate in the short term if the bulls push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA. If they do that, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to $431 and later attempt an up-move to the 200-day SMA ($469).\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke below the support line of the ascending channel on April 29, invalidating the pattern. The selling continued on April 30 and the price dipped to $82.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/f4b417a4-950a-4005-a17d-900351574d9d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers attempted to push the price back into the channel on May 1 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears sold at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 If the price fails to climb back into the channel, the SOL/USDT pair could decline to the strong support at $75. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because the failure to do so may resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, a break and close above the 50-day SMA ($103) will suggest that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) plummeted below the $0.62 support on April 29 and the bears extended the decline to $0.56 on April 30. The price rebounded on May 1 indicating buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/93be0613-0ae9-4491-a646-d43ab5e98bcb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are currently trying to push the price above the breakdown level at $0.62. If they succeed, the recovery could reach the 20-day EMA ($0.68).\par \par \uc2 This is an important level to keep an eye on because if the price turns down from this level, it will suggest that the bears are active at higher levels. The pair may then drop to the strong support at $0.55. A break below this support could open the doors for a drop to $0.50.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rise to the 50-day SMA ($0.76). Such a move will suggest that the XRP/USDT pair could consolidate in a large range between $0.55 and $0.91 in the near future.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token bounced off the strong support at $75 on May 1, indicating that the bulls are trying to defend this level. However, the bears are unlikely to surrender easily as they will try to stall the recovery at the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/398cba73-c841-4553-8bab-8b43a6fa4976.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the downtrend line, the bears will make another attempt to pull the LUNA/USDT pair below $75. If they succeed, the pair could complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  head and shoulders pattern.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will attempt to arrest the decline at the 200-day SMA ($70) but if this support cracks, the selling could pick up momentum and the pair may plummet to $50.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a break and close above the downtrend line could suggest that the bears may be losing their grip. That could clear the path for a possible rally to the psychological resistance at $100.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) dropped to the strong support at $0.74 on April 30, signaling that bears remain under control. The price rebounded off the support on May 1 but the bulls are struggling to sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/83a98bed-8589-4766-9218-07686e8d37a4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This suggests that bears are selling on every minor rally. The bears will now try to sink and sustain the price below the strong support at $0.74. If they manage to do that, the selling could accelerate and the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair may resume its downtrend. The next support on the downside where buying may emerge is $0.68.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off $0.74, the bulls will try to push the pair above the 20-day EMA ($0.87). If that happens, the pair could attempt a rally to $1.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/xrp-price-rebounds-after-worst-month-since-june-2021-major-recovery-ahead"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP price rebounds after worst month since June 2021 \u8212\'20\'14 major recovery ahead?}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) slipped below the 50-day SMA ($0.13) on April 29 but the bears could not challenge the strong support at $0.12. This suggests that bulls continue to buy at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/c5e7a6b0-e72e-4001-840d-3e06f5a5799e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers attempted to push the price above the 50-day SMA on May 1 but the bears were not willing to relent. This suggests that the DOGE/USDT pair could oscillate between the 20-day EMA ($0.13) and $0.12 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below $0.12, the pair could drop to the psychological support at $0.10. The bulls are expected to defend this level with vigor. Alternatively, if bulls drive the price above the 20-day EMA, the possibility of a rally to $0.17 increases.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) broke below the strong support at $65 on April 29 and followed that up with another down move on April 30. The buyers started a recovery on May 1 and are currently attempting to push the price back above the breakdown level at $65.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/527dce9c-2f21-44e7-a5c9-378566f26e0a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers will attempt to flip the $65 level into resistance. If they do that, the AVAX/USDT pair could extend the decline to the strong support at $51.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break and close below it may intensify selling. The pair may then resume its downtrend and plummet to the next major support at $32.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls push the price above $65, the pair may rise to the 20-day EMA ($70). A break and close above this level will suggest that the selling pressure may be reducing. That could keep the pair range-bound between $51 and $99 for some time.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the $16 support on April 30 and reached the critical support at $14. A minor positive is that the price bounced off $14 on May 1, indicating buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-05/b4bcce75-8d9f-43d6-9fba-128eb4d3783f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rebound is facing selling at the breakdown level of $16 as the bears are trying to flip the previous support into resistance. If the price fails to rise above $16, the possibility of a break below $14 increases. If that happens, the DOT/USDT pair could resume its decline and plunge to the psychological level at $10.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this view, the bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($17). If they manage to do that, the pair may rise to $19 where the bears may again pose a strong challenge.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDUvZDY4NDc5NTItZjdjZC00ODIxLThmZTAtYmIzYTdhNjA5MjgxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220502ei52000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 2 key metrics point toward further downside for the entire crypto market\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Marcel Pechman \par \uc2 692 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 April 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Futures data and decreased demand for Tether signal that the crypto market is set for another round of pain.\par \par \uc2 The total crypto market capitalization has been holding a slightly ascending trend for the past three months, and the $1.75 trillion support was most recently tested on April 27 as Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) bounced at $38,000 and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) at $2,800 on April 27.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/8959f246-9ee8-4eaa-adb7-ed2a6013a61f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total crypto market cap, USD billion. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The crypto market\u8217\'20\'19s aggregate capitalization showed a 3.5% decrease in the last seven days. Meanwhile, notable losers were an 18.8% loss from \uc2 Ripple\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ), a 10.2% loss from Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and a 9.7% drop in Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) price.\par \par \uc2 Analyzing a broader range of altcoins provides a more balanced picture that includes 25% gains from some gaming and metaverse projects in the same time period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/63d3e91a-a5e6-482d-8397-40437bed7f80.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Weekly winners and losers among the top 80 coins. Source: Nomics\par \par \uc2 Apecoin (APE) rallied 44% due to the upcoming {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/apecoin-ape-hits-a-new-all-time-high-ahead-of-this-week-s-otherside-land-auction"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Otherside metaverse land auction}}}\uc2  scheduled for April 30. The Otherside is being developed by Yuga Labs, \uc2 Animoca Brands\uc2  and the Bored Ape Yacht Club nonfungible token (NFT) team, and NFT investors have high expectations for the project.\par \par \uc2 The native tokens of move-to-earn lifestyle app STEPN (GMT) rallied 28% after the United States-based crypto exchange {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/stepn-move-to-earn-tokens-gmt-gst-hit-new-highs-after-coinbase-listing-announcement"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinbase announced plans to list the token}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Nexo gained 15% after crypto and derivatives exchange \uc2 Binance{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.binance.com/en/support/announcement/1b82de6f419743e2ac940566e6639b8b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 announced}}}\uc2  its listing on April 29. Nexo also revealed plans to issue a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-crypto-card-by-nexo-allows-users-to-pay-without-selling-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 credit card that accepts crypto as collateral}}}\uc2  rather than selling the holders\u8217\'20\'19 assets.\par \par \uc2 Zilliqa (ZIL) price has been adjusting after the token pumped 380% in late March, and this follows the project\u8217\'20\'19s March 25 announcement of a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/zilliqa-s-metaverse-debut-pumps-zil-price-350-in-just-five-days-selloff-ahead"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 metaverse service that will utilize Nvidia technology}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, data from DappRadar shows that the play-to-earn unicorn, Axie Infinity ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/axie-infinity-axs-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AXS}}}\uc2  ), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://dappradar.com/multichain/games/axie-infinity"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 plunged}}}\uc2  to its lowest level in nince months after the number of users and transactions declined by 15% over the last 30 days.\par \par \uc2 The Tether premium shows lack of demand from buyers\par \par \uc2 The OKX Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) premium gauges China-based retail demand and it measures the difference between the China-based peer-to-peer trades and the United States dollar.\par \par \uc2 Excessive buying demand puts the indicator above fair value at 100%. On the other hand, Tether\u8217\'20\'19s market offer is flooded during \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, causing a 4% or higher discount.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/6536fbb4-6dc6-4238-be03-f71ecaaed0cf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Tether (USDT) peer-to-peer vs. USD/CNY. Source: OKX\par \par \uc2 The OKX Tether premium peaked at 2% on April 28, its highest level in 2022. The movement coincided with Bitcoin breaking above $40,000, but its price reverted later that day. Currently, the Tether premium stands at 0%, signaling a neutral sentiment from retail traders.\par \par \uc2 Futures markets show mixed sentiment\par \par \uc2 Perpetual contracts, also known as inverse swaps, have an embedded rate that is usually charged every eight hours. Exchanges use this fee to avoid exchange risk imbalances.\par \par \uc2 A positive funding rate indicates that longs (buyers) demand more leverage. However, the opposite situation occurs when shorts (sellers) require additional leverage, causing the funding rate to turn negative.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/baae0068-7204-4515-ac17-65e67afa02d8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Accumulated 7-day perpetual futures funding rate on April 29. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 As shown above, the accumulated seven-day funding rate is slightly positive for Bitcoin and Ether. Data indicates slightly higher demand from longs (buyers), but nothing that would force traders to close their positions. For instance, Terra\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  ) positive 0.15% weekly rate equals 0.6% per month, which should not concern most futures traders.\par \par \uc2 The absence of the Tether premium in Asia and the flattish perpetual contract premiums signal a lack of demand from retail traders right as the total crypto market capitalization struggles to sustain the $1.75 trillion support.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/noshitcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDQvNDk2NTY3OTEtYjhjMy00YTU3LTkzNDItMGEyNzdmMDE0N2ViLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220430ei4t000bb\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 2 key metrics point toward further downside for the entire crypto market\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Marcel Pechman \par \uc2 686 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 April 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Futures data and decreased demand for Tether signal that the crypto market is set for another round of pain.\par \par \uc2 The total crypto market capitalization has been holding a slightly ascending trend for the past 3 months and the $1.75 trillion support was most recently tested on April 27 as Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) bounced at $38,000 and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) at $2,800 on April 27.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/8959f246-9ee8-4eaa-adb7-ed2a6013a61f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total crypto market cap, USD billion. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The crypto market\u8217\'20\'19s aggregate capitalization showed a 3.5% decrease in the last 7 days and notable losers were a 18.8% loss from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2 , a 10.2% loss from Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), and 9.7% drop in Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) price.\par \par \uc2 Analyzing a broader range of altcoins provides a more balanced picture, that includes 25% gains from some gaming and Metaverse projects in the same time period.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/63d3e91a-a5e6-482d-8397-40437bed7f80.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Weekly winners and losers among the top 80 coins. Source: Nomics\par \par \uc2 Apecoin (APE) rallied 44% due to the upcoming {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/apecoin-ape-hits-a-new-all-time-high-ahead-of-this-week-s-otherside-land-auction"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Otherside metaverse land auction}}}\uc2  scheduled for April 30. The Otherside is being developed by Yuga Labs, \uc2 Animoca Brands\uc2  and the Bored Ape Yacht Club NFT team and NFT investors have high expectations for the project.\par \par \uc2 The native tokens of move-to-earn lifestyle app STEPN (GMT) rallied 28% after the U.S.-based crypto exchange {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/stepn-move-to-earn-tokens-gmt-gst-hit-new-highs-after-coinbase-listing-announcement"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinbase announced plans to list the token}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Nexo gained 15% after crypto and derivatives exchange {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.binance.com/en/support/announcement/1b82de6f419743e2ac940566e6639b8b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Binance announced its listing}}}\uc2  on April 29 and Nexo also revealed plans to issue a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-crypto-card-by-nexo-allows-users-to-pay-without-selling-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 credit card that accepts crypto as collateral}}}\uc2  rather than selling the holders\u8217\'20\'19 assets.\par \par \uc2 Zilliqa (ZIL) price has been adjusting after the token pumped 380% in late March and this follows the project\u8217\'20\'19s March 25 announcement of a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/zilliqa-s-metaverse-debut-pumps-zil-price-350-in-just-five-days-selloff-ahead"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 metaverse service}}}\uc2  that will utilize \uc2 Nvidia\uc2  technology.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://dappradar.com/multichain/games/axie-infinity"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DappRadar}}}\uc2  shows that play-to-earn unicorn, Axie Infinity ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/axie-infinity-axs-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AXS}}}\uc2  ) plunged to its lowest level in 9 months after the number of users and transactions declined by 15% over the last 30.\par \par \uc2 The Tether premium shows lack of demand from buyers\par \par \uc2 The OKX Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) premium gauges China-based retail demand and it measures the difference between the China-based peer-to-peer trades and the United States dollar.\par \par \uc2 Excessive buying demand puts the indicator above fair value at 100%. On the other hand, Tether\u8217\'20\'19s market offer is flooded during \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, causing a 4% or higher discount.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/6536fbb4-6dc6-4238-be03-f71ecaaed0cf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Tether (USDT) peer-to-peer vs. USD/CNY. Source: OKX\par \par \uc2 The OKX Tether premium peaked at 2% on April 28, its highest level in 2022. The movement coincided with Bitcoin breaking above $40,000, but its price reverted later that day. Currently, the Tether premium stands at 0%, signaling a neutral sentiment from retail traders.\par \par \uc2 Futures markets show mixed sentiment\par \par \uc2 Perpetual contracts, also known as inverse swaps, have an embedded rate that is usually charged every eight hours. Exchanges use this fee to avoid exchange risk imbalances.\par \par \uc2 A positive funding rate indicates that longs (buyers) demand more leverage. However, the opposite situation occurs when shorts (sellers) require additional leverage, causing the funding rate to turn negative.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/baae0068-7204-4515-ac17-65e67afa02d8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Accumulated 7-day perpetual futures funding rate on April 29. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 As shown above, the accumulated seven-day funding rate is slightly positive for Bitcoin and Ether. Data indicates slightly higher demand from longs (buyers), but nothing that would force traders to close their positions. For instance, Luna\u8217\'20\'19s positive 0.15% weekly rate equals 0.6% per month, which should not concern most futures traders.\par \par \uc2 The absence of the Tether premium in Asia and the flattish perpetual contract premiums signal a lack of demand from retail traders right as the total crypto market capitalization struggles to sustain the $1.75 trillion support.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/noshitcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDQvNDk2NTY3OTEtYjhjMy00YTU3LTkzNDItMGEyNzdmMDE0N2ViLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220430ei4t00005\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/29: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, LUNA, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , DOGE, AVAX, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,810 \uc2 words\par \uc2 29 April 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s inability to hold above $40,000 has traders now targeting extreme lows in the $25,000 zone, a move that would be absolutely deadly for most altcoins.\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar index (DXY) turned down from its 20-year high on April 29 but that has not changed the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  price action seen in Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and the U.S. equity markets. Equities {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-disappoints-on-bull-run-as-amzn-sees-biggest-1-day-drop-since-2014"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 remain under pressure}}}\uc2  and this week, \uc2 Amazon\uc2  stock saw its biggest intraday drop since 2014 after uncertainty over the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s tightening measures placed \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2  back into choppy waters.\par \par \uc2 If Bitcoin extends its correction, on-chain analysis platform Whalemap believes that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/27k-max-pain-bitcoin-price-is-ultimate-buy-the-dip-opportunity-says-research"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $25,000 to $27,000 zone}}}\uc2  may be the best place \u8220\'20\'1Cto go all-in\u8221\'20\'1D on Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Long-term investors do not appear to be panicking over the current weakness in Bitcoin and on-chain data from CryptoQuant shows that the combined BTC reserves of 21 crypto exchanges has plummeted to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/27k-max-pain-bitcoin-price-is-ultimate-buy-the-dip-opportunity-says-research"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 levels not seen since September 2018}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/86da47f8-1069-4f84-b906-09054c80dfa3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 The HODL mentality is not limited to Bitcoin investors alone. A nonfungible token (NFT) survey report by CoinGecko showed that more than 50% of respondents said they have a HODL mentality because they believe NFTs could be important items in games. The report added that the Metaverse could become an $800 billion market in the next two years.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins decline further or is a reversal on the cards? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin pulled back to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($40,363) on April 28 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears are selling on rallies to this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/9c17c53c-c73d-4b98-9d44-11bb21fde40e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) below 41 indicate that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If bears sink and sustain the price below the support line of the channel, the BTC/USDT pair could extend its decline to $34,300 and later to $32,917.\par \par \uc2 To invalidate this negative view, the buyers will have to push and sustain the price above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($41,981). If they succeed, the pair could start its northward journey to the 200-day SMA ($47,433) where the bears may again pose a stiff challenge.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) pulled back to the 20-day EMA ($2,991) in the past two days but the bulls could not push the price above it. This suggests that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/64f0b7db-6c88-4c2f-af42-90389b623b2c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now attempt to sink the price to the uptrend line. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break and close below it could invalidate the developing ascending triangle pattern. The ETH/USDT pair could then decline to $2,450.\par \par \uc2 This negative view could invalidate in the short term if the price turns up and breaks above the 50-day SMA ($3,045). That could attract buyers who may then push the pair to the 200-day SMA ($3,464). A break and close above this level could signal the start of a new up-move.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  dropped below $391 on April 26 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. The price rose back above the breakdown level on April 27. This suggests demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/3a4a0f03-4bdd-43e1-a43f-6695e75973a4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed the price to the 50-day SMA ($410) on April 28 but could not clear this hurdle. This suggests that bears are selling on rallies. The bears will now attempt to pull the price below the $391 to $380 support zone.\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to the strong support at $350. The buyers are expected to mount a strong defense at this level. The short-term trend could turn positive if bulls push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the support line of the ascending channel on April 27 but the bulls could not sustain the positive momentum and clear the overhead hurdle at the 20-day EMA ($101).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/ee3c8850-8887-4073-ba9a-5c79c1a3fc35.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears now sense an opportunity and will try to sink the price below the support line of the channel. If they manage to do that, the selling could accelerate and the SOL/USDT pair could slide to the strong support at $75. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a break and close below it could signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 This negative view could invalidate in the short term if the price turns up and breaks above the 20-day EMA. The pair could then rise to $110 and later attempt a rally to $122.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to push Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token above the psychological resistance at $100 could have tempted short-term traders to book profits. That pulled the price below the minor support at $86 on April 29.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/9d160966-2675-449a-9347-8af159706474.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The RSI has dipped into the negative zone, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. If bears sustain the price below $86, the LUNA/USDT pair could drop to the strong support at $75. The bulls are expected to defend the zone between $75 and the 200-day EMA ($69) aggressively.\par \par \uc2 On the upside, the buyers will have to overcome the stiff barrier at $100 to set up a potential retest of the all-time high at $119. A break and close above this level could signal the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the support at $0.62 on April 26 but the weak rebound suggested a lack of aggressive buying. The selling resumed on April 29 and the bears have pulled the price below the critical support.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/abe2b5d3-69f7-41e2-8bfb-bdf8535095c4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.71) is sloping down and the RSI is in the oversold zone, suggesting that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If the price sustains below $0.62, the XRP/USDT pair could plummet to $0.55 and later challenge the psychological support at $0.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the current level, the buyers will make one more attempt to push the pair above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, it will suggest that the pair may consolidate between $0.62 and $0.91 for some time.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) tried to start a relief rally from $0.81 on April 27 but failed to reach the 20-day EMA ($0.91). The selling resumed on April 29 and the bears will now attempt to pull the price to the strong support at $0.74.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/81b0b4d6-ee39-4e20-bb25-1142d660074b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is sloping down and the RSI is near the oversold territory, suggesting that bears have the edge. If bears sink the price below $0.74, the selling could intensify and the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could plummet to $0.68.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off $0.74, the bulls will try to push the pair above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair could rally to the psychological level at $1, which is likely to act as a stiff resistance.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-reasons-why-dogecoin-price-can-now-gain-50-by-september"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 3 reasons why Dogecoin price can now gain 50% by September}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has managed to stay above the 50-day SMA ($0.13) for the past three days but the bulls have not been able to sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.14). This suggests that the bears are selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/b27ea952-8a11-437e-a743-b9d044051336.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure to bounce may attract further selling, which could pull the price below the 50-day SMA. If that happens, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to $0.12 and later to the psychological support at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rises and sustains above the 20-day EMA, the buyers will try to push the pair to the overhead resistance at $0.17. The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has declined to the strong support at $65. The bulls had defended this support on two previous occasions; hence, they will again try to arrest the decline at this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/254a5184-032b-4832-b701-a56f6b544ebc.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the bears are likely to have other plans. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($74) and the RSI near the oversold territory favor the bears. If the price breaks below $65, the AVAX/USDT pair could drop to the critical support at $51.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off $65, the pair is likely to hit a wall at the 20-day EMA. If the price turns down from this resistance, the prospects of a break below $65 increase.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA to indicate that the bears may be losing control. The pair could then rise to the 200-day SMA ($85).\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are defending the support of the large range between $16 and $23 but haven\u8217\'20\'19t been able to achieve a strong rebound off it. This suggests that demand dries up for Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/f73421b1-3f1a-4920-bae9-11e1af5179f7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($18) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate advantage to sellers. The bears will now attempt to pull the price below the $16 support and if they manage to do that, the DOT/USDT pair may drop to $14.\par \par \uc2 The buyers will have to push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($19) to signal that the corrective phase may be over. The pair could then start its journey toward the overhead resistance at $23.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDQvNDIyZDUxZDEtNDFlYi00NjYyLWFlM2MtODgxYTAwOTcxNzM3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220429ei4t000e0\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/25: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, SOL, LUNA,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , AVAX, DOGE, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,832 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 April 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins are attempting a recovery, but the most likely outcome of any breakout is strong selling at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) continues to trade below $40,000 as bears try to flip the level into resistance. The soaring U.S. dollar index (DXY), which is usually inversely related to Bitcoin, favors the sellers. However, it is not all gloom and doom because the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-spoofs-39-5k-breakout-at-wall-st-open-as-elon-musk-twitter-takeover-nears"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin bulls seem to be taking clues}}}\uc2  from the Nasdaq (NDX), which has been hovering close to positive territory.\par \par \uc2 Although risky assets have been on the receiving end for the past few days, Bitcoin hodlers are focusing on the long-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  projections and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/something-sure-feels-like-it-s-about-to-break-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ignoring the short-term weakness}}}\uc2 . Glassnode data shows that Bitcoin's supply that has not moved for at least a year has hit above \u8220\'20\'1C64% for the first time ever.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/2184720c-532e-4067-b45e-60975b733cf6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 While speaking to Bloomberg, \uc2 SkyBridge Capital\uc2  founder \uc2 Anthony Scaramucci\uc2  said that the firm is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/skybridge-goes-all-in-on-crypto-betting-on-tremendous-growth-ahead"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  on cryptocurrency markets}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cover the three to five years.\u8221\'20\'1D The hedge fund now plans to reposition itself by allocating a majority of its assets under management to digital assets and become the \u8220\'20\'1Cleading cryptocurrency asset manager and adviser:\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Could a further decline in Bitcoin and altcoins attract buying from long-term investors? What are the key levels to keep an eye on? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin dipped below the immediate support at $38,536 on April 2 but the bears could not build upon their advantage. The long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests strong buying near the support line of the ascending channel.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/c3eb9c85-a4ef-43ab-b246-456611fa99fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now attempt to push the price above the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($40,974). If they manage to do that, the BTC/USDT pair could rise to $43,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and bears are selling on rallies to strong overhead resistance levels. The pair could then decline to the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below the channel could accelerate selling and the pair may slide to the strong support zone between $34,300 and $32,917. The bulls are expected to defend this level with all their might.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($3,022) on April 21 indicating weakness. The buyers tried to push the price back above the 50-day SMA on April 22 but failed, suggesting that the bears have flipped the level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/e8aab80a-5b92-4101-bbac-648d3945cde7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price below the immediate support at $2,883 on April 25 but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bulls are aggressively buying at lower levels. If buyers propel the price above the 20-day EMA ($3,045), the ETH/USDT pair could rise to $3,200 and thereafter rally to the 200-day SMA ($3,477).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the psychological level at $3,000, it will suggest that bears continue to sell at higher levels. If the pair slips below $2,797, the pair could drop to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  broke below the immediate support at $391 on April 25 but the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows that bulls are buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/59a2db77-2d7b-4b29-8d7f-38deab826e18.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains and closes above $391, the bulls will strive to push the BNB/USDT pair above the 20-day EMA ($411). If they succeed, the pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $445.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA and breaks below $382, it will suggest that bears are selling on rallies. That could pull the pair to the strong support at $350. The downsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative zone suggest that bears have an edge.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke below the strong support at $0.69 on April 25, indicating that the range-bound action has resolved in favor of the sellers. The 20-day EMA ($0.74) has turned down and the RSI is near the oversold territory, indicating that bears are in command.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/4043ac16-93f6-47f9-bba9-385978c13efd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below $0.69, the XRP/USDT pair could drop to the immediate support at $0.62. If the price rebounds off this level but does not rise back above $0.69, it will suggest that bears have flipped the level into resistance. That will increase the possibility of a drop to the strong support at $0.54.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up and rises back above $0.69, it will suggest that the markets have rejected the lower levels. The pair could then again attempt to break above the 50-day SMA ($0.78).\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) tight range trading resolved to the downside and the price has slipped to the support line of the ascending channel. This is an important level to keep an eye on.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/786fb2f1-c268-457a-8b15-4b04ee6845e5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears sink and sustain the price below the channel, the selling could intensify and the SOL/USDT pair could slide to the strong support at $75. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($104) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears are in control.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the current level with strength, it will suggest that bulls continue to defend this support with vigor. The buyers will then again try to push the pair above the 20-day EMA. If they do that, the pair could rise toward $122.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token slipped below the 20-day EMA ($91) on April 23 but the bears could not make use of this advantage. This suggests that selling dries up at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/0218dea3-fc25-4f3d-8958-e2928416a925.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($91) is flat and the RSI is just above the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks above the 50-day SMA ($94), the bulls will make another attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $100. If they succeed, the LUNA/USDT pair could start its march toward the all-time high at $119.\par \par \uc2 The balance could tilt in favor of the sellers if the price turns down from the 50-day SMA and plummets below $87. That could pull the pair to the strong support at $75.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been stuck inside a large range between $0.74 and $1.26 for the past several days. This suggests that traders buy near the support and sell close to the resistance of the range.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/abc7c505-167d-4996-86d5-bf50c49037a0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 After failing to cross above the resistance at $1.26 on April 4, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair has been declining toward the support of the range. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.95) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears are in control.\par \par \uc2 The pair broke below the support at $0.87 on April 25 clearing the path for a possible drop to $0.74. This level is likely to attract strong buying by the bulls. If that happens, the bulls will try to push the pair above the 20-day EMA. If they manage to do that, it will suggest that the range-bound action may continue for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/could-xrp-price-lose-another-70-by-q3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Could XRP price lose another 70% by Q3?}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the uptrend line on April 21, which invalidated the possible ascending triangle pattern. The bears pressed upon their advantage and pulled the price near the strong support at $65.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/50e7cb50-0705-47e4-b367-f9210c35ae59.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The long tail on April 25\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bulls are buying the dips near $65. They will now attempt a relief rally, which could hit a wall at the 20-day EMA ($77).\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from this resistance, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on rallies. The bears will then make one more attempt to sink the price below $65.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, a break above the 20-day EMA will suggest that the AVAX/USDT pair could remain range-bound between $65 and $99 for some more time.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 50-day SMA ($0.13) on April 24 and the bears pulled the price to the strong support at $0.12 on April 25. The bulls bought this dip aggressively and have pushed the price back above the 50-day SMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/d26d85d1-365b-42d1-9a26-97cb5751ddd8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.14), the DOGE/USDT pair could attempt to rally to $0.15 and later to the strong overhead resistance at $0.17. The 200-day SMA ($0.17) is placed just above this level, hence the bears are expected to mount a strong defense at $0.17.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that bears are unwilling to surrender and they continue to sell on rallies. The longer the price sustains below the 50-day SMA, the greater the possibility of a drop to the psychological level at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $19 on April 24 and the bears are attempting to build upon this advantage and sink the price below the immediate support at $17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/78187936-780e-4fc4-b3c1-c79fcd574f62.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the DOT/USDT pair could decline to the strong support at $16. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($19) and the RSI in negative territory indicate that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level, the bulls will make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle. A break and close above the 50-day SMA ($19) could clear the path for a possible rally to $23.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDQvNWUyMjgxZjEtYjg1NC00ZmEzLTg0OTQtMDBmM2E5YWY5YTA4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220425ei4p000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Altcoin Roundup: Crypto indexes offer broad access, but are they profitable in the long run?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Jordan Finneseth \par \uc2 1,005 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 April 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Trading crypto can be tricky, but a portion of the risk can be mitigated by investing in crypto indexes. Here\u8217\'20\'19s some of what the market has to offer.\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market is known for its high \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the wild-west nature of the space is, in part, due to many of the assets having small market caps and the 24/7 operational hours of centralized and decentralized exchanges (DEXs).\par \par \uc2 In addition to being high risk, crypto trading can also be a very time-intensive process. It can be an overwhelming task and a barrier to entry for most investors in determining which tokens to invest in.\par \par \uc2 For these investors, index investing could be a profitable alternative for gaining exposure to some of the hottest sectors of the cryptocurrency market.\par \par \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s a look at how crypto index products compare to individual tokens and which strategies have produced the biggest return.\par \par \uc2 Index Cooperative\par \par \uc2 Index Cooperative (INDEX) is a decentralized autonomous asset manager that allows investors to create a custom index of tokens using smart contracts.\par \par \uc2 Several of the most actively traded indexes originated from Index Coop, including the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/index-coop-to-include-badgerdao-in-dpi-defi-index-token-from-august"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DeFi Pulse Index (DPI)}}}\uc2 , Metaverse Index (MVI), Data Economy Index (DATA) and Bankless DeFi Innovation Index (GMI).\par \par \uc2 Plotting the price of these indexes against the total market capitalization of the cryptocurrency market can help provide insight into how each one performed compared to the market as a whole.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/68b7d2ea-b6dc-4105-b997-7bab6140d169.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DPI/USDT vs. MVI/ETH vs. Total crypto market capitalization. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Since May 29, 2021, which is when data first became available for DPI and MVI on TradingView, the weakness of the decentralized finance (DeFi) sector can be seen in the poor performance of DPI, which is currently down more than 50% while the total market cap has risen 19.82%.\par \par \uc2 During that same period of time, the Metaverse index has increased 103% when compared to the price of Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), and the gains are even greater when looking at its value in terms of USD.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/edaaffb2-14d4-4fe3-8d72-ce1714615039.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 MVI/USD 1-day chart. Source: CoinGecko\par \par \uc2 As seen on the chart above, the price of MVI has increased from $42.02 on May 29 to its current value of $118.06, reflecting a gain of 180% compared to the 20% rise in the total market cap.\par \par \uc2 Metaverse and nonfungible token (NFT)-related projects have been a bright spot in an otherwise weak market over the past six months and in this instance, it was beneficial to be invested in a basket of metaverse tokens.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/fb824cb8-08ef-4c93-8f58-35614d968643.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Tokens in the Metaverse Index. Source: Index Cooperative\par \par \uc2 The Data Economy Index and Bankless DeFi Innovation Index have both posted losses since launching. This mirrors the performance of the wider crypto market, which has been in a downtrend since peaking in early November 2022.\par \par \uc2 NFT Index\par \par \uc2 NFTs have been one of the hottest sectors of the past year, but finding {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bored-ape-yacht-club-is-a-huge-mainstream-hit-but-is-wall-street-ready-for-nfts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the next big crowd-pleaser}}}\uc2  is a monumental challenge because dozens of new NFT projects launch on a daily basis.\par \par \uc2 An alternative for gaining exposure is the NFT Index (NFTI), a basket that contains 11 different tokens including Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ), ApeCoin (APE), The Sandbox ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/the-sandbox-sand-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SAND}}}\uc2  ) and Decentraland ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/decentraland-mana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MANA}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/dc436f50-478c-4ec1-b2a5-5a3b6a81a710.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 NFTI/USD 1-day chart. Source: CoinGecko\par \par \uc2 The price of NFTI has increased from $386 on March 5, 2021, to its current price of $1,724, a gain of nearly 350%. During that same period of time, the total crypto market capitalization rose by 30%, providing evidence of the strength the NFT market has seen over the past 13 months.\par \par \uc2 eToro\uc2  baskets\par \par \uc2 For those looking for exposure to crypto baskets in a more regulated environment, \uc2 eToro\uc2 , a multi-asset brokerage firm, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/etoro-rolls-out-smart-portfolios-for-new-metaverse-investors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 provides access to several \u8220\'20\'1Csmart portfolio\u8221\'20\'1D options}}}\uc2  that have performed well over the past year.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/d8dd22a0-2d71-4ee1-9d7c-9fe5e859e196.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top 2 smart portfolios. Source: \uc2 eToro\par \par \uc2 The Napoleon-X smart portfolio is a basket comprising some of the more established projects in the crypto market, including Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2 , \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ) and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ). The DeFiPortfolio contains a large allocation of Ether along with smaller allocations to other projects that are involved in the DeFi sector including Polygon and Algorand.\par \par \uc2 As shown in the graphic above, these portfolios have provided returns of 48.6% and 45.3% over the past year while the total crypto market cap has actually declined 5.71% during the same time period.\par \par \uc2 On a two-year time scale, several of the \uc2 eToro\uc2  portfolios have offered returns in excess of 430% including Napoleon-X, which has experienced an increase of 709.3%. During that same time period, the total crypto market cap has increased 808%, while the price of BTC has increased by 472%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/a190f954-1069-46e8-8093-ce9cafffa1b9.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Top portfolios over the past 2years. Source: \uc2 eToro\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 This suggests that indexes offer the opportunity to capture a large percentage of the overall gains in the market while offering a better return. In many instances, this is a better tactic than trying to pick individual tokens that will see the biggest gains.\par \par \uc2 The results for DeFiPortfolio also highlight the importance of taking profits when big gains are made because they have a tendency to slip away as traders rotate or whipsaw price movements occur.\par \par \uc2 Want more information about trading and investing in crypto markets?\par \par \uc2 * Hashdex to launch {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/hashdex-to-launch-web3-and-smart-contracts-etf-on-brazil-s-stock-exchange-b3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Web3 and smart contracts ETF}}}\uc2  on Brazil\u8217\'20\'19s stock exchange B3\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitwise-launches-nft-index-fund-for-accredited-investors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitwise launches NFT index fund}}}\uc2  for accredited investors\par \par \uc2 * Enso mounting "vampire attack" on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/enso-mounting-vampire-attack-on-six-crypto-index-projects"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 six crypto index projects}}}\par \par \uc2 * WisdomTree {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/wisdomtree-launches-four-cryptocurrency-indices-in-us-and-europe"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launches four cryptocurrency indices}}}\uc2  in the United States and Europe\par \par \uc2 * {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/first-steps-basic-tips-for-getting-started-investing-in-defi"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 First steps: Basic tips}}}\uc2  for getting started investing in DeFi\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDQvM2IzNWQ2ODctMzJmYS00YzZhLWI3NTUtZGVjZGI3NGE2OTk1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220422ei4m000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/22: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LUNA, AVAX, DOGE, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,930 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 April 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins continue to bounce off underlying support areas, raising the chance that a sharp down-side move could occur.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) turned down sharply on April 21, maintaining its tight correlation with the U.S. equity markets, which reversed direction after \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2  Chair Jerome Powell hinted that a 50 basis point rate hike was \u8220\'20\'1Con the table\u8221\'20\'1D in May. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-retests-40k-after-stocks-sell-off-meets-fed-balance-sheet-bust"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The selling has continued o}}}\uc2  n April 22 as investors trim risky assets in expectation of an aggressive stance from central banks to curb surging inflation.\par \par \uc2 Veteran trader Peter Brandt said in a tweet recently that the Nasdaq 100 (NDX) was showing a formation similar to the one it had made before {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/nasdaq-has-dotcom-crash-deja-vu-says-trader-as-bitcoin-correlation-rises"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 plunging in the year 2000}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 If history repeats itself then the NDX could witness a sharp correction. That may be negative for the crypto markets in the short term because of the close correlation between Bitcoin and the NDX.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/85546673-7f7d-4ae0-a5e6-a51b9b06bd1b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 The subdued price action in cryptocurrencies and the weak-macro environment have resulted in reduced \uc2 Google\uc2  searches for the terms Bitcoin and Ethereum. Even crypto trading volumes have been in a declining trend for some time. According to Blockchain.com, the total exchange {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/retail-interest-in-crypto-declines-as-investors-search-for-the-next-big-price-mover"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 volumes on major crypto exchanges plunged}}}\uc2  to $165.8 billion on April 19, the lowest level since October 2020.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins continue their downward move or is it time for a relief rally? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($41,977) on April 21 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels as seen from the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick. The price reversed direction from $42,976 and settled below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($41,478).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/671d92dd-b557-42dd-9180-01de2156f9e0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling continued on April 22 and the bears are attempting to pull the price down to the support line of the ascending channel pattern. The downsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) in the negative zone suggest that bears have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below the support line of the channel, the selling could intensify and the BTC/USDT pair could drop to $33,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level or the support line, it will suggest that bulls are actively buying at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $43,000 to signal strength. The pair could then rise to the 200-day SMA ($47,965) and later challenge the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck between the 20-day EMA ($3,087) and the 50-day SMA ($3,003) for the past few days. Several efforts to break out of this tight range have been unsuccessful, which suggests that bulls are buying on dips while bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/5b114d32-dae1-4c83-92ae-6e0cef7a7d7c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory give a slight edge to the sellers. If the price slips below $2,883, the possibility of a drop to the uptrend line of the developing ascending triangle pattern increases.\par \par \uc2 The bulls are likely to mount a strong defense at this level. If the price rebounds off the uptrend line, the buyers will make another effort to propel the ETH/USDT pair above the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the pair could rally to the 200-day SMA ($3,486). A break and close above this level will complete the ascending triangle pattern, resulting in a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the April 20 candlestick shows that bears are selling on rallies near the overhead resistance at $445. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  continued to move down and broke below the 50-day SMA ($408) on April 21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/da418e6e-28b0-4ff2-900f-7da8f637e88a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below $391, the selling could accelerate and the BNB/USDT pair may drop to the strong support at $350. If the price rebounds off this level with strength, it will suggest that the pair could remain range-bound between $350 and the 200-day SMA ($471) for some more time.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the strong support zone between the 50-day SMA ($408) and $391, the bulls will endeavor to drive the pair to $445 and then to the 200-day SMA. A break and close above this level could signal a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck in a range between $0.69 and $0.91 for the past few days. Although the price rebounded off the support of the range on April 12, the bulls could not clear the overhead hurdle at the 50-day SMA ($0.78), indicating a lack of demand at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/f79dc009-9ebc-4307-a51b-315a8156d784.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now strive to pull the XRP/USDT pair below the $0.69 support. If they manage to do that, the pair could drop to $0.62 and later to $0.54. The 20-day EMA ($0.76) has started to turn down and the RSI is in the negative zone, suggesting that the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off $0.69 with force, it will indicate strong accumulation by the bulls. The buyers will then again try to overcome the overhead barrier at $0.80 and push the pair to $0.91.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 20-day EMA ($105) on April 19 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. The bears pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA on April 20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/7b19027f-4b0c-4edd-91a0-395ec612cb5d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The selling has continued and the bears are trying to sustain the price below the 50-day SMA ($101). If that happens, the SOL/USDT pair could drop to the support line of the ascending channel. This is an important level to keep an eye on because if it gives way, the pair could drop to the strong support at $75.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price bounces off the current level or the support line of the channel, the buyers will again try to push the pair above $111. If they can pull it off, the pair could rally to $122.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been consolidating in a downtrend. The price turned down from the 50-day SMA ($0.97) on April 21, indicating that the bears are aggressively defending the overhead resistance at $1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/4d4db8af-01b8-4c5b-9f6b-abf2196e2f27.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA ($0.97) and the RSI below 40 indicate that bears have the upper hand. If sellers sink the price below $0.87, the selling could pick up momentum and the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the critical support at $0.74. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if it cracks, the downtrend may resume.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $1 to indicate that the bears may be losing their grip. The pair could then rise to $1.10 and later attempt a rally to the stiff overhead resistance at $1.26.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token turned down from the psychological resistance at $100 on April 21 but a minor positive is that the bulls have not allowed the price to sustain below the 20-day EMA ($91).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/1c9b7cd3-9c7e-4f72-a54b-217d93b89b4b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now again attempt to push the LUNA/USDT pair above $100. If that happens, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up and the pair may rally toward the all-time high at $119. The bears are likely to mount a strong defense at this level.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance at $100, the prospects of a break below the support at $88 increase. If the price sustains below this level, the pair could drop to the strong support at $75. A break and close below the 200-day SMA ($68) could signal a potential trend change.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-follows-fresh-us-stocks-dive-as-analysis-expects-btc-price-to-take-37-5k-liquidity"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin follows fresh US stocks dive as analysis 'expects' BTC price to take $37.5K liquidity}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) had been trading between the 20-day EMA ($80) and the uptrend line for the past few days. Usually, such tight-range trading results in a sharp trending move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/e1d01bce-4d59-4091-b38a-47ead577f76e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that bears have an edge. If the price sustains below the uptrend line, the developing ascending triangle pattern will invalidate. That could sink the AVAX/USDT pair to the strong support at $65.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the pair rises from the current level, the buyers will make one more attempt to push the price above the moving averages. If they succeed, the pair could rally to the overhead resistance zone at $99 to $104.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound in a downtrend. The price turned down from $0.15 on April 20 and plunged to the 50-day SMA ($0.13) on April 21. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/e6684103-72e1-421d-ba88-8c3e9dc39e7f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The repeated retest of a support level tends to weaken it. If the price breaks below the 50-day SMA, the bears will attempt to pull the DOGE/USDT pair to the strong support at $0.12. The bulls are expected to defend this level with vigor but if the support gives way, the decline could extend to the critical level at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price rebounds off the 50-day SMA, the bulls will try to push the pair above the overhead resistance at $0.15. If they manage to do that, the pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $0.17.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been range-bound inside a large range between $16 and $23 for the past several days. The bulls pushed the price above the 50-day SMA ($19) on April 20 and 21 but could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/2f905f7f-e924-406c-a2b5-435115e76a28.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This suggests that bears are selling on rallies. If the price slips below the immediate support at $18, the DOT/USDT pair could decline to $17. The gradually downsloping 20-day EMA ($19) and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest a slight advantage to sellers.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if bulls push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA, the pair could attempt a rally to the overhead resistance at $23. The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to suggest the start of a new up-move.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDQvNGY4YWFkNzAtYjM3Ny00ZDJhLWJhY2QtNzdiMGIxMzI1ODMzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220422ei4m000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/20: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LUNA, AVAX, DOGE, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,864 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 April 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC and altcoins remain stuck within a tight range, suggesting that the sideways trading could continue in the short-term.\par \par \uc2 The U.S. dollar currency index (DXY) turned down sharply after rising above 101 on April 20 but this {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-buy-signal-excites-as-dollar-gold-extend-losses-btc-price-heads-past-41-5k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 weakness in the dollar has not helped}}}\uc2  Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), possibly because the S&P 500 is struggling to build upon its strong rally on April 19. This indicates that Bitcoin remains tightly correlated with the U.S. equity markets.\par \par \uc2 Irrespective of the lackluster price action, research projects several positives for Bitcoin this year. A report by Insider Intelligence shows that the number of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-6m-americans-to-use-crypto-to-make-a-purchase-in-2022-research-firm-predicts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 adult crypto users in the U.S. could surge}}}\uc2  from 28.3 million in 2021 to 33.7 million in 2022. Along with the growth in the number of crypto users, the firm also expects the use of cryptocurrencies to make purchases by U.S. adults to increase to 3.6 million, a growth of 70% this year\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/a3eba3e1-941d-49fe-857e-b2a49ae5483f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 In another positive sign that could lead to increased adoption, Australian financial regulators have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/australia-s-first-bitcoin-etf-could-attract-1-billion-after-launch-next-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 approved the first Bitcoin exchange-traded fund}}}\uc2 , which will begin trading on April 27. The Australian Financial Review expects the fund to attract about $1 billion in inflows.\par \par \uc2 Could the higher levels in Bitcoin and select altcoins continue to attract selling by the bears? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned around sharply from $38,536 on April 18, indicating strong buying at lower levels. The buyers continued their purchase and pushed the price to the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($42,104).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/c688c8e4-8874-47d1-ba14-2935922adf9e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($41,811) has flattened out and the relative strength index (RSI) is just below the midpoint, suggesting a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 This equilibrium could tilt in favor of the buyers if the price rises and sustains above the 50-day SMA. That will increase the possibility of an up-move to $43,900. If bulls manage to overcome this barrier, the momentum may pick up and the BTC/USDT pair could rally to the 200-day SMA ($48,052).\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down sharply from the current level, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. The sellers will then attempt to pull the pair to the support line of the ascending channel.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 50-day SMA (3,000) on April 18 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. The bulls purchased the dip and pushed the price back above the 50-day SMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/0858db9d-bf2b-4948-9537-2c9449101fcf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers drove the price above the 20-day EMA ($3,113) on April 20 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears continue to sell at higher levels. The bears are currently attempting to sustain the price below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could consolidate in a tight range between $2,883 and $3,166. This tight range trading is unlikely to continue for long and may result in a sharp range expansion within the next few days.\par \par \uc2 A break below $2,883 could sink the pair to the uptrend line while a break above $3,166 could clear the path for a possible retest of the 200-day SMA ($3,491).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the drop below the 50-day SMA ($408) on April 18, indicating strong demand at lower levels. Sustained buying pushed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  above the 20-day EMA ($419) on April 19 but the bulls are struggling to sustain the momentum.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/6e6a5021-16a8-4ea5-b5d6-c72124ac7870.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest a range-bound action in the near term. If the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance, the bears will again attempt to sink the BNB/USDT pair below the 50-day SMA. A break and close below $391 could result in a decline to the strong support at $350.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA ($419), the bulls will attempt to push the pair above the strong resistance at $445 and challenge the 200-day SMA ($471).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long tail on Ripple\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) April 18 candlestick suggests strong buying at lower levels. The price reached the 50-day SMA ($0.78) on April 19 but the bears are defending this level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/013f6dce-e646-4db3-a366-85e69e55c843.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, it will suggest that the XRP/USDT pair could remain range-bound between the 50-day SMA and $0.69 for some time. A break and close below $0.69 could open the doors for a possible drop to $0.60.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up, the bulls will try to push and sustain the pair above $0.80. If they manage to do that, the pair could rise toward the overhead zone between the 200-day SMA ($0.87) and $0.91. The flat moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the support line of the ascending channel on April 18, indicating that the bulls are buying the dips to this level. The bulls pushed the price above the 20-day EMA ($107) on April 19 but are struggling to sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/62061867-6cba-4e0e-a95d-d7bb0ef63bc7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the bears continue to sell on every minor rally. If the price breaks below the 50-day SMA ($101), the bears will make another attempt to sink the SOL/USDT pair below the ascending channel and retest the critical support at $75.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rises from the current level, the bulls will attempt to challenge the overhead resistance at $122. A break and close above this level could open the doors for a potential rally to the 200-day SMA ($147).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke below the immediate support at $0.91 on April 18 but the bears could not keep the price down. This suggests that the bulls are attempting to form a higher low.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/f8495ce0-7bf5-4edf-bd7c-3a11aeb60215.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the price above the psychological level at $1, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then rally to $1.10 and later retest the critical resistance at $1.26. A break and close above this level will suggest the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the bears will again attempt to pull the pair down. The pair could first drop to $0.87 and if this level cracks, the decline may extend to the strong support at $0.74.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token bounced off the strong support at $75 and reached the 20-day EMA ($91) on April 18. This suggests that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/159382dc-e9fe-42cc-a220-598f4ad1e2d3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally continued on April 19 and the buyers pushed the price above the 50-day SMA ($93). The bulls will attempt to sustain the momentum and drive the LUNA/USDT pair to the psychological level at $100. If bulls clear this hurdle, the possibility of a retest of the all-time high increases.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level or $100, the bears will try to pull the pair below the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, it will suggest that traders may be booking profits on rallies. That could result in a range formation for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-and-eth-will-break-all-time-highs-in-2022-celsius-ceo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC and ETH will break all-time highs in 2022 \u8212\'20\'14 Celsius CEO}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) dipped below the uptrend line on April 18 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. Strong buying by the bulls ensured a recovery and the price reached the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/4b369b67-929c-4251-bd83-dbad4c028f8d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are mounting a stiff resistance at the moving averages. If the price continues lower, the bears will again try to sink and sustain the AVAX/USDT pair below the uptrend line. If they succeed, the decline could extend to $65.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up and breaks above the moving averages, it will suggest strong demand by the bulls. That could open the doors for a possible rally to $99. The bulls will have to overcome this barrier to signal the formation of an ascending triangle pattern.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) once again rebounded off the 50-day SMA ($0.13) on April 18, suggesting that the bulls are defending the level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/23f4ff35-5c56-426e-be07-d15ef9d722ff.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rebound rose above the 20-day EMA ($0.14) on April 19 but the bulls are struggling to sustain the higher levels. This suggests that the bears are selling on rallies to the immediate resistance at $0.15.\par \par \uc2 If the price slips back below the 20-day EMA, the bears will again try to sink the DOGE/USDT pair below the 50-day SMA. If they succeed, the pair could slide to $0.12.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $0.15, the bulls will attempt to push the pair above the neckline. If they succeed, the pair will complete an inverse head and shoulders pattern, which has a pattern target at $0.25.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) turned up on April 18 indicating that bulls are defending the immediate support at $17. The price has reached the moving averages which may act as a stiff hurdle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/170250d6-d602-4686-8230-dce2937cc011.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($19.15) and the 50-day SMA ($19.31) are flat and close to one another while the RSI is just below the midpoint, suggesting a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 This balance could tilt in favor of the buyers if the DOT/USDT pair breaks and sustains above the 50-day SMA. The pair will then attempt to rally to the strong overhead resistance at $23.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level, the bears will again attempt to pull the pair to the immediate support at $17 and then to $16.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDQvNDgxNDIzMDAtZWEzMS00MjEzLWIzYjAtZjFhMTU2OTlmMGMyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220420ei4k000e2\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/18: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LUNA, AVAX, DOGE, DOT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,842 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 April 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The failure of Bitcoin and altcoins to stay above their strong support levels indicates that supply exceeds demand.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and most major altcoins have started the new week on a soft note and the Crypto Fear and Greed Index has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-dollar-strength-mimics-2020-coronavirus-crash-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dropped into the \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme fear\u8221\'20\'1D zone}}}\uc2 , suggesting that investors are still nervous.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has declined about 17% year-to-date while the Nasdaq 100 has dropped about 16% during the same period, indicating a tight correlation between the two. In comparison, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-could-drop-to-30k-in-2-weeks-trader-warns-as-gold-goes-for-2k-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 gold has risen more than 10% in 2022}}}\uc2  and its 50-day correlation coefficient with Bitcoin \u8220\'20\'1Cis around minus 0.4, the lowest since 2018," according to journalist Colin Wu.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/9575f963-6efb-4dd8-a958-7c2a82ca6339.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Although the crypto price action has remained \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the declining balance of Bitcoin on the crypto exchanges indicates that long-term investors are unperturbed and continue to accumulate at every available opportunity. Data from on-chain analytics firm CryptoQuant suggests that the Bitcoin balance of 21 major exchanges dropped to its lowest level since July 2018 at 2.274 million Bitcoin as of April 17.\par \par \uc2 Could buying emerge at lower levels or will bears build upon their advantage and sink prices lower? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has been trading inside an ascending channel pattern for the past several days. The bulls defended the psychological level at $40,000 for the past few days but could not achieve a strong rebound off it. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/c4c3f417-a378-4a4c-8631-754a18367cb4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears pulled the price below the immediate support at $39,200 on April 18 but the long tail on the candlestick indicates bulls are buying at lower levels.\par \par \uc2 If the price rises back above $40,000, the bulls will make one more attempt to clear the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($42,167). If they succeed, the pair could rise to $43,900 and later attempt a rally to the 200-day SMA ($48,109).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the recovery falters at $40,000, it will suggest that bears have flipped this level into resistance. That will enhance the prospects of a drop to the support line of the channel. The bulls are expected to defend this level with all their might because a break below it could open the doors for a possible drop to $32,917.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price}}}\uc2  Ether's ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) tight range trading between the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($3,103) and the 50-day SMA ($2,991) resolved to the downside on April 18. The bulls have pulled the price below the immediate support at $2,950.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/c6bfd04c-04e0-4a65-a6bf-d4dd1468c945.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) below 40 indicate that bears are in control. If the price sustains below the 50-day SMA, the ETH/USDT pair could slide to $2,817 and then to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up and rises above the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that the bulls are attempting to trap the aggressive bears. A break and close above $3,150 could suggest that the correction may be over.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  turned down from the 20-day EMA ($417) and broke below the 50-day SMA ($407) on April 18 but the long tail on the daily candlestick suggests buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/645ad0ae-c960-4ca9-bc33-b581c3ab3973.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will attempt to trap the aggressive bears and push the BNB/USDT pair above the zone between the 20-day EMA and $427. If they manage to do that, the pair could start its northward march toward $445.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bears are active at higher levels. The sellers will then try to sink the price below $391 and challenge the strong support at $350.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to sustain Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the 50-day SMA ($0.78) on April 16 could have attracted selling by traders who may have purchased at lower levels. The price turned down and broke below the 20-day EMA ($0.76) on April 17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/26d06570-603a-4519-bbbc-b3e09e34058a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the bears will attempt to sink the XRP/USDT pair to the strong support at $0.69. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if it cracks, the selling could intensify and the pair may drop to $0.60.\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn down and the RSI is in the negative territory, suggesting that bears have a slight advantage. This negative view will invalidate if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $0.80. That could clear the path for a move to $0.85.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) attempted to rise above the 20-day EMA ($106) on April 17 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears are selling on rallies to this level. The selling picked up momentum on April 18 and the bears have pulled the price below the 50-day SMA ($100).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/21559ae1-5abe-49d9-af3d-2c6196ecba1d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative territory suggest that bears have the upper hand. If the price breaks below the support line of the ascending channel, the SOL/USDT pair could drop to $86 and thereafter to $75.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the support line of the channel, the buyers will again attempt to push the pair above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, it will suggest that the bears may be losing their grip. The pair could then rise to $122.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) repeatedly tried to rise above the psychological level at $1 in the past few days 