n had more than a passing resemblance to traditional market behavior, even after dropping over 50% from November's all-time highs.\par \par \uc2 In focus this month was a similar chart pattern between Bitcoin now and the Dow Jones from the start of the 1990s.\par \par \uc2 "Times change. Assets change. Macro aggregate human behavior usually doesn't," TechDev {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TechDev_52/status/1514356397051367424/photo/1"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 summarized}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin's stocks correlation is nonetheless a cause for concern for some, with a drawdown tipped to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://editorial.space/articles/14507"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 impact price significantly}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Exchange withdrawals heat up\par \par \uc2 For Blockware lead insights analyst William Clemente, meanwhile, there were other reasons to keep the faith.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-4-13-btc-eth-bnb-sol-xrp-ada-luna-avax-dot-doge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 4/13: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , LUNA, AVAX, DOT, DOGE}}}\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrency exchanges were losing BTC reserves at a rate rarely seen before, he noted Wednesday, implying that any rise in demand would compete with a rapidly-dwindling supply, boosting price performance further.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COn only 3 other occasions have we ever seen Bitcoin withdrawn from exchanges at this rate,\u8221\'20\'1D he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/WClementeIII/status/1514253794791641098"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  alongside data from on-chain analytics firm Glassnode.\par \par \uc2 Glassnode's net position change indicator tracks both upwards and downwards changes in balances on 18 exchanges.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/537bddd7-ca8a-4283-9bc5-9bc2fa216a03.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Exchange net position change annotated chart. Source: William Clemente/ Twitter\par \par \uc2 Exchange withdrawal spikes are a much debated phenomenon, and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TheRealPlanC/status/1511154010518171652"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 excitement}}}\uc2  among pundits has increased this year in line with accelerating demand.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDQvNDE1MjJkYjEtNGM5NS00MDYyLTk4ZDUtYTdkNmRhNmI5ZDc2LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220414ei4e0002v\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/13: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LUNA, AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,803 \uc2 words\par \uc2 13 April 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and altcoins could face selling near respective overhead resistance levels, suggesting that the bears have not surrendered yet.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and major altcoins are attempting a recovery after the sharp fall on April 11. According to Glassnode\u8217\'20\'19s recent weekly report, Bitcoin has witnessed a \u8220\'20\'1C {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-slides-below-40k-following-a-lackluster-breakout"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 modest volume of profit-taking by investors}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D since mid-February, which could \u8220\'20\'1Cbe providing sufficient headwinds to prices.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 While some investors are booking profits, the Luna Foundation Guard, the nonprofit organization attached to Blockchain protocol Terra, has continued to grow its stockpile of Bitcoin. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-price-levels-to-watch-as-terra-buys-2-5k-btc-to-nearly-match-tesla"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Terra added 2,508 Bitcoin on April 13}}}\uc2  to take its total holding to 42,406 Bitcoin, just shy of \uc2 Tesla\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s corporate treasury at 43,200 Bitcoin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/993d0cf2-0305-4eef-8de7-f011842868c5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Larger investors do not seem to be perturbed by the \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and sharp declines in cryptocurrencies and are taking a long-term view. Pantera Blockchain Fund, which had plans to raise $600 million, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/pantera-to-wrap-up-blockchain-fund-soon-after-raising-1-3b-double-the-target"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 has amassed about $1.3 billion}}}\uc2 , indicating huge demand.\par \par \uc2 Will bulls be able to sustain the bounce in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Although Bitcoin broke below the psychological level at $40,000 on April 11, the bears could not build upon this momentum. This indicates that the bulls are buying at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/3a4e4973-baca-42a2-b6d6-78163dc9ca08.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally could hit a wall at the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($42,967). If the price turns down from this resistance, it will suggest that bears are selling on rallies. The downsloping 20-day EMA and the relative strength index (RSI) below 44 suggest a minor advantage to sellers.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to sink the price below $39,200 to resume the decline. The BTC/USDT pair could then drop to the support line of the ascending channel. On the contrary, if the price continues higher and breaks above the 20-day EMA, the pair could challenge the overhead resistance at $45,400.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to arrest the decline at the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($2,958). Although Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) attempted a rebound on April 12, the buyers could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/c4067a22-436f-4f6b-b6dd-5c0e52531549.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are again attempting to extend the relief rally on April 13. The bounce is likely to face selling at the 20-day EMA ($3,172). If the price turns down from this level, the likelihood of a break below the 50-day SMA increases. If that happens, the ETH/USDT pair could decline to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest aggressive buying by the bulls. The pair could then attempt a rally to the 200-day SMA ($3,490). The pair may then consolidate between the 50-day SMA and the 200-day SMA for a few days.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  plunged below the 50-day SMA ($402) on April 11 but the bears could not capitalize on this breakdown. The bulls purchased the dip aggressively and pushed the price back above the 50-day SMA on April 12.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/d9c26a30-33d6-418a-a8d1-25e5a3c6b774.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers are attempting to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($420). If they succeed, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to the 200-day SMA ($470) where the bears may mount a strong resistance. That could keep the price inside the range between the 200-day SMA and the 50-day SMA for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price fails to sustain above the 20-day EMA, it will indicate selling at higher levels. The bears will then make one more attempt to sink the price below the immediate support at $391. If they manage to do that, the pair could slide to $350.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($99) on April 12 but the bulls could not push the price above the 20-day EMA ($110). This suggests that bears are selling on rallies to the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/bc8d92cf-06dc-4ee8-ade5-0aa819c6e46f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now attempt to sink and sustain the price below the 50-day SMA. If they manage to do that, the SOL/USDT pair could drop to the strong support at $81. The bulls are expected to defend this level with all their might because a break and close below it could resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rises from the current level and breaks above the 20-day EMA, the bulls will make another attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $122.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the strong support at $0.69 on April 12 but the bulls could not sustain the recovery. This indicates that the bears are active at higher levels. The inside-day candlestick pattern on April 13 suggests indecision among the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/95ad2f0e-a82d-45ab-b7a4-1ffd85958605.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.77) is sloping down and the RSI is near 39, suggesting that the path of least resistance is to the downside. If the price breaks below the strong support at $0.69, the selling could pick up momentum. The XRP/USDT pair could then decline to $0.62.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price continues to move up, the pair will attempt to rise above the 50-day SMA ($0.78). If that happens, it will suggest that the pair could trade inside a large range between $0.69 and $0.91 for some more time.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) attempted a relief rally on April 12 but the bulls could not clear the overhead hurdle at the psychological level at $1. This indicates that bears are attempting to flip the $1 level into resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/d7142c08-7f43-433c-a011-ee8fed47303f.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price once again turns down from the overhead resistance and breaks below $0.91, the correction could resume. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then drop to $0.86 and later to the critical support at $0.74. The 20-day EMA ($1.04) is sloping down and the RSI is in the negative zone, suggesting advantage to bears.\par \par \uc2 This negative view will be invalidated in the short term if the price turns up and breaks above the 20-day EMA. Such a move could open the doors for a possible rally to the overhead resistance at $1.26.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token formed an inside-day candlestick pattern on April 12 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears sold at higher levels. A minor positive is that the buyers are again trying to extend the recovery on April 13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/770912cb-9271-450c-a1c8-393b1627bd90.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls push the price above $89, the LUNA/USDT pair could rise to the 20-day EMA ($96) where the bears are likely to mount a strong resistance. The downsloping 20-day EMA and the RSI in the negative zone indicate advantage to sellers.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead resistance and breaks below $80, the correction could resume and the pair may slide to the strong support at $75.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price continues to move up and breaks above the 20-day EMA, the pair could rally to the 61.8% Fibonacci retracement level at $104.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/apecoin-eyes-250-rally-amid-bull-pennant-breakout-robinhood-ape-listing-rumors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ApeCoin eyes 250% rally amid 'bull pennant' breakout, Robinhood APE listing rumors}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to arrest the decline in Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) at the uptrend line but the bounce is likely to encounter strong resistance from the bears near the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/0a6d375e-3a77-4661-a5a3-264e3e81155b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price fails to break above the moving averages within the next few days, the possibility of a break below the uptrend line increases. If that happens, the AVAX/USDT pair could decline to the next support at $65.\par \par \uc2 This level is likely to act as a strong support as the bulls have defended it successfully on two previous occasions. A strong rebound off it will indicate that the pair may trade inside the range between $65 and $99 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, a break and close below $65 could intensify selling and the pair may drop to the critical support at $51.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is attempting a recovery after the sharp fall on April 11, which suggests buying at lower levels. However, the bulls are likely to face stiff resistance from the bears at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/7002c296-6ea8-40e4-a66c-ff1728d524eb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price fails to rise above the immediate overhead resistance at $19, the bears will try to sink the DOT/USDT pair below the strong support at $16. If they succeed, the decline could extend to $14. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($19) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price moves up sharply and breaks above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest accumulation at lower levels. The pair could then consolidate inside the range between $16 and $23 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The buyers are attempting to defend the 50-day SMA ($0.13) but the weak rebound off the strong support suggests a lack of buyers in Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) at higher levels. This increases the possibility of a break below the 50-day SMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/861376a6-b408-4116-b7c7-126076f7bb56.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price fails to sustain above the 20-day EMA ($0.14), the sellers will attempt to extend the decline by pulling the DOGE/USDT pair below the 50-day SMA. If they succeed, the pair could drop to $0.12 and then slide to the critical support at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up sharply and rises above $0.15, it will suggest strong buying at the 50-day SMA. The pair could then remain stuck between the 200-day SMA ($0.18) and the 50-day SMA for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDQvZmUzOTQxNmEtNmM0OS00MTUyLWEyODMtNzBjMDIwYzhhZjRkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220413ei4d000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/8: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LUNA, AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,869 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 April 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The strength in the U.S. dollar may keep Bitcoin and select altcoins under pressure in the short term.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and most major altcoins are attempting to defend the immediate support levels, indicating that bears sense an opportunity and are looking to take control of the price action.\par \par \uc2 The short-term price action does not seem to worry the long-term Bitcoin bulls who expect a massive return in the next few years. While speaking at the Bitcoin 2022 conference in Miami, ARK Invest Chief Executive Officer Cathie Wood {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-trader-eyes-38k-dip-as-cathie-wood-confirms-1m-btc-price-target-by-2030"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reiterated her Bitcoin price target of $1 million}}}\uc2  by 2030.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, telecom billionaire Ricardo Salinas said during the conference that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-2022-thiel-calls-buffett-sociopathic-mexican-billionaire-has-60-in-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC and Bitcoin equities form 60%}}}\uc2  of his liquid investment portfolio. That is a massive increase from his Bitcoin exposure in 2020, which formed just 10% of his liquid assets.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/dae83ea1-c250-4a3e-83f8-d54006acd8d1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While the long-term may be positive, Bitcoin could remain under pressure in the short term due to the strength in the U.S. dollar. The rising rates and the tapering of the balance sheet have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-plumbs-april-lows-as-us-dollar-strength-hits-highest-since-may-2020"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 boosted the U.S. dollar currency index}}}\uc2  (DXY) to above 100 for the first time since May 2020.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin break below the critical support levels or will buyers stage a strong recovery? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin plunged to the critical support at $42,594 on April 7 but a positive sign is that bulls held this level. The long tail on today\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bulls continue to defend the level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/030abc7c-98d5-49aa-ade4-93fca8280ec2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have flattened out and the relative strength index (RSI) is near the midpoint, suggesting a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to push the price above the 20-day exponential moving average ($44,314) and the critical overhead resistance at $45,400. If they manage to do that, the BTC/USDT pair could challenge the 200-day simple moving average ($48,220).\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA or $45,400, it will suggest that bears are selling on every rise. The bears will then try to pull the pair below the 50-day SMA ($41,789). If they succeed, the decline could extend to the support line of the ascending channel.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke below the 20-day EMA ($3,224) on April 6 but the bears could not sustain the lower levels. The bulls bought the dip and have pushed the price back above the 20-day EMA, indicating strong demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/9ab8f5c3-fcfe-4f2b-add6-b79266df8d82.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the ETH/USDT pair could again rise to the 200-day SMA ($3,487). A break and close above this resistance will suggest the start of a new uptrend. The pair could then rise to $4,150.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the bulls fail to drive the price above the 200-day SMA, it will suggest that bears are holding their ground at higher levels. The pair could then oscillate between the 200-day SMA and the 20-day EMA for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below $3,100 could open the doors for a possible drop to the 50-day SMA ($2,915).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the 20-day EMA ($425) on April 4 but the lower levels attracted strong buying from the bulls. The price rebounded sharply and broke above the overhead resistance at $445 on April 7 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/b2355d3d-0006-4a5d-a236-b24a31dc48d3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, the possibility of a drop to the 50-day SMA ($399) increases. The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. A break below the 50-day SMA will bring the large range between $350 and $445 into play.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rebounds off the 50-day SMA, the bulls will again attempt to push the BNB/USDT pair toward the 200-day SMA ($468). The pair could then trade between these two moving averages for a few days.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls stalled the decline at the 20-day EMA ($114) on April 6 but could not push Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) back above the overhead resistance at $122. This suggests that bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/6f9c8a60-eecb-4617-a6b1-9fa13b280fe4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the next stop could be $106. If this level also fails to hold, the SOL/USDT pair may drop to the 50-day SMA ($97). Such a move will suggest that the pair may remain stuck in a range between $81 and $122 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $122, the bulls will make one more attempt to overcome the barrier at the 200-day SMA ($149).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the 50-day SMA ($0.78) on April 6, indicating that bears are making a comeback. The bulls tried to push the price back above the 50-day SMA but the bears are not willing to relent.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/932b2f56-94ad-45c7-be06-45c04945580a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.81) has started to turn down and the RSI is in the negative territory, indicating advantage to the sellers. If the price remains below the 50-day SMA, the bears will attempt to extend the decline by pulling the XRP/USDT pair below $0.75. If they do that, the next stop could be $0.70.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns up from the current level, the bulls will try to push the pair to the 200-day SMA ($0.88).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the 20-day EMA ($1.08) on April 6. The bulls bought the dip but are struggling to push the price back above the 20-day EMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/2009fbff-3c71-44cd-81be-64da46acbaf5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price fails to break and sustain above the 20-day EMA, the bears will attempt to sink the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair below the 50-day SMA ($0.96). If they manage to do that, the pair could decline to the strong support at $0.74.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rises and sustains above the 20-day EMA, the bulls will attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $1.26. Such a move will complete a cup and handle pattern, signaling the start of a possible new uptrend. The pair could first rise to the 200-day SMA ($1.45) and then rally to $1.60.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token is correcting in an uptrend. The price attempted a rebound off the 20-day EMA ($102) but the bears continue to sell at higher levels. That has pulled the price below the 20-day EMA today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/a6dbbcbc-7554-4b38-acdc-753df71282f8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest that the bulls are losing their grip. If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the selling could accelerate and the LUNA/USDT pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($88). The bulls are expected to defend this level but if they fail in their endeavor, the next stop could be $82.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bulls continue to buy on dips. The pair will then again attempt to break above the all-time high of $119 and resume the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/near-protocol-eyes-a-terra-like-price-rally-after-new-350m-funding-raise"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Near Protocol eyes a Terra-like price rally after new $350M funding raise}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) plunged below the 20-day EMA ($89) and the 200-day SMA ($84) on April 6 but the bulls successfully defended the 50-day SMA ($82). This indicates that traders continue to accumulate on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/81af50ac-e9b1-4a22-91e9-08005f7e36fb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers will now try to push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the AVAX/USDT pair could rise to the overhead resistance at $99. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it could open the doors for a possible rally to $117 and next to $127.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the 50-day SMA, the pair could plunge to the strong support at $65. The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint do not give a clear advantage either to the bulls or the bears.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 After the sharp reversal from $23, Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) is currently attempting to stay above the 50-day SMA ($19). If buyers push the price above the 20-day EMA ($21), a retest of the overhead resistance is likely.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/dd79ce50-01bb-4b71-b1f8-ba5cadea942e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint signal a possible range-bound action in the short term. If the price turns down from the 20-day EMA and plummets below the 50-day SMA, the selling could intensify and the DOT/USDT pair could drop to the strong support at $16.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to clear the hurdle at $23 to indicate the start of a potential new uptrend. A close above $23 could clear the path for a possible up-move to the 200-day SMA ($29).\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) plunged sharply from the overhead resistance at $0.17 on April 6 but a positive sign is that the bulls held the support at the 20-day EMA ($0.14).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/c6d5e8c0-0d3e-45ba-bb38-1a0758c89366.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA continues to slope up gradually and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating a minor advantage to buyers. The bulls will once again attempt to push the DOGE/USDT pair above the 200-day SMA ($0.18). If they succeed, the pair could start an up-move to $0.22.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, a shallow bounce will suggest weak demand. The bears will then try to sink the price below the moving averages and challenge the strong support at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDQvZTViNzg1ZDAtNDVmZi00MDlhLWE3MWMtMWFlYjNkYjE1ZDZiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220408ei48000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Synthetix\par \b \uc2 Sushi and Synthetix get the boot in Grayscale DeFi Fund rebalancing\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Tom Mitchelhill \par \uc2 448 \uc2 words\par \uc2 7 April 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Grayscale has removed SushiSwap and Synthetix from its DeFi Fund while adding three new tokens to other funds during its first quarterly rebalancing of this year.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  management firm Grayscale has added three new cryptocurrency assets across three main investment funds while removing two other assets from its Decentralized Finance Fund as part of this year\u8217\'20\'19s first quarterly rebalance.\par \par \uc2 Grayscale removed tokens from crypto-derivatives decentralized exchange Synthetix and decentralized exchange SushiSwap, as well as from its decentralized finance (DeFi) fund after the two crypto assets failed to meet the required minimum market capitalization. No other cryptocurrencies were removed during the rebalancing.\par \par \uc2 Grayscale\u8217\'20\'19s DeFi fund, which was launched in July last year, currently holds approximately $8 million in assets. The digital assets remaining in the DeFi fund after the quarterly rebalance include Uniswap, Aave, Curve, MakerDAO, Amp, Yearn.finance and Compound.\par \par \uc2 The crypto asset manager added Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) and Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) to its Digital Large Cap Fund, alongside adding Cosmos ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/cosmos-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ATOM}}}\uc2  ) to its Smart Contract Platform Ex-Ethereum Fund (GSCPxE Fund).\par \par \uc2 The GSCPxE Fund, which was launched on March 22, offers investors the ability to bet on an index of Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s largest competitors. The GSCPxE Fund\u8217\'20\'19s current holdings listed by the total amount held are Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), AVAX, DOT, Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ), Algorand (ALGO), Stellar ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ) and ATOM.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-is-like-the-best-and-worst-parts-of-new-york-grayscale"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Ethereum is like the best and worst parts of New York: Grayscale}}}\par \par \uc2 Grayscale remains the world\u8217\'20\'19s leading crypto asset manager, reporting that it held $43.5 billion in assets under management as of January 3, 2022. The \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2  (GBTC) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://grayscale.com/products/grayscale-bitcoin-trust/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 remains}}}\uc2  the largest fund with just over $30 billion in AUM, but has traded at an increasing discount to its net asset value for the past year. GBTC is followed in size by the \uc2 Grayscale Ethereum Trust\uc2  (ETCG) which currently holds approximately $11.8 billion in AUM.\par \par \uc2 01/03/22 UPDATE: Net Assets Under Management, Holdings per Share, and Market Price per Share for our Investment Products.\par \par \uc2 Total AUM: $43.5 billion {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BAT&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BAT}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BCH&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BCH}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LINK&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LINK}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24MANA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $MANA}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ETH&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ETH}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ETC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ETC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24FIL&src=ctag&ref_src=tw