\uc2 In 2021, cryptocurrency {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-funds-attracted-9-3b-in-inflows-in-2021-as-institutional-adoption-grew"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 investment funds generated over $9.3 billion}}}\uc2  in inflows as institutional adoption rose to new highs. Grayscale is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-confirms-bitcoin-etf-plans-and-adds-exposure-to-zcash-stellar-lumens-and-horizen-to-its-trusts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 gearing up to offer a Bitcoin Spot}}}\uc2  exchange-traded fund (ETF) and said it was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-gears-up-for-legal-battle-with-sec-over-bitcoin-etf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 willing to pursue legal action}}}\uc2  if the investment product remains barred by the SEC.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDQvMjg3ZmYwMDktNzQ1MC00NWMyLTgxMmMtOWQwZDEwODI4ODY1LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220407ei4700004\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/6: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LUNA, AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,768 \uc2 words\par \uc2 6 April 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC and select altcoins dropped far below their strong support levels, a clear sign that the recent \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), the entire crypto sector and the S&P 500 index are correcting on April 6, which highlights the tight correlation between the two sectors.\par \par \uc2 Despite the weakness, institutional investors do not seem to be halting their purchases, suggesting that they remain \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the long term. Terra used the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/terra-lfg-outdoes-microstrategy-with-5k-btc-buy-after-bitcoin-price-dips-under-45k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dip to buy an additional 5,040 Bitcoin}}}\uc2 , which takes its total holdings to 35,768 Bitcoin.\par \par \uc2 Terra was not alone in this venture. \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2 , the treasury with the largest Bitcoin reserves, also increased its holdings by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-subsidiary-adds-another-4-197-btc-to-balance-sheet"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 4,197 Bitcoin through its subsidiary MacroStrategy}}}\uc2 . After the latest purchase, the business intelligence firm holds 129,218 Bitcoin.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/777e4dd3-156d-4d05-bc6e-e996541637b4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Another sign of a strong appetite for Bitcoin is seen in the inflows to the two Canadian Bitcoin exchange-traded funds. According to Glassnode data, the funds boosted their holdings to an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/inflows-to-canadian-bitcoin-etfs-hit-all-time-high-glassnode"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 all-time high of 69,052 Bitcoin}}}\uc2 , an increase of 6,594 since January.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins enter a deeper correction or will lower levels attract buying? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 After staying in a tight range between the 200-day simple moving average (SMA) ($48,240) and $45,000 for the past few days, the bears made their move and pulled the price below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($44,567).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/01ac7572-2104-4c4f-93b8-1509b576eb0c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (RSI) has dipped to the midpoint and the 20-day EMA is flattening out. This suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could be weakening. If the price rebounds off the 50-day SMA ($41,752), the bulls will again attempt to push the BTC/USDT pair above the 200-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the bears sink the price below the 50-day SMA, it will signal that the pair could extend its stay inside the ascending channel. The pair could then gradually drop toward the strong support at $37,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bulls to sustain the price of Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the 200-day SMA ($3,487) may have resulted in profit-booking by short-term traders. That has pulled the price to the critical support at the 20-day EMA ($3,223).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/3e8ed6af-103a-4d20-8212-866cb56385f1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bulls are buying on dips. The bulls will then make another attempt to push and sustain the price above the 200-day SMA. If they succeed, the ETH/USDT pair could start its northward march toward $4,150 where the bears are expected to mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the bears sink the price below the 20-day EMA, the selling could pick up momentum and the pair may drop to the 50-day SMA ($2,907).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  once again failed to break above the 200-day SMA ($468) on April 5. The long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick showed that the bears are defending the 200-day SMA with all their might.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/023cf7b0-5c90-4a40-8f7c-2edde37d3468.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair has dipped to the 20-day EMA ($424). The bears will now attempt to sink and sustain the price below the 20-day EMA. If they succeed, the pair could extend its decline to the 50-day SMA ($398). A strong rebound off this level will suggest that the pair may remain range-bound between the 200-day and 50-day SMAs.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the bulls will attempt to drive the pair above the 200-day SMA and challenge the resistance at $500.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) recovery stalled on April 2 and the price has dipped below the breakout level at $122. The bulls are expected to defend the 20-day EMA ($113) with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/17bc5c8e-b0a5-40ae-b664-6ecfa736dd80.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A strong bounce off the 20-day EMA will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then attempt to push the price above the overhead hurdle at the 200-day SMA ($149).\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, a break and close below the 20-day EMA will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. The pair could then drop to the 50-day SMA ($96). A strong rebound off this level could keep the pair stuck between the 50-day and the 200-day SMAs.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down and slipped below the 20-day EMA ($0.81) on April 5. The selling continued today and the price broke below the 50-day SMA ($0.78).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/1874a8fc-650e-41a8-a1ed-b43e6d1dcb89.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The RSI has dropped into the negative territory and the 20-day EMA has started to slope down, suggesting that bears have a slight edge. If the price sustains below the 50-day SMA, the XRP/USDT pair could drop to $0.70. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if it gives way, the decline could extend to $0.60.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns up from the current level and rises above the 20-day EMA, the bulls will attempt to propel the pair above the 200-day SMA ($0.89).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to propel Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $1.26 may have tempted short-term traders to book profits. That has pulled the price below the 20-day EMA ($1.09).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/f2114006-7607-47cc-a4c2-71392c49af8c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, the pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.96). The bulls are likely to defend this level aggressively but if the bears overpower them, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the strong support at $0.74. A strong rebound off this level will suggest that the pair may consolidate between $0.74 and $1.26 for some time.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rises from the current level, the bulls will again attempt to drive the pair above the overhead resistance. If they succeed, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to the 200-day SMA ($1.47).\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token had been in a strong uptrend but the Doji candlestick pattern on April 5 cautioned that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could be weakening. The negative divergence on the RSI also suggested that the bulls may be losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/3bf892cf-eff1-4ff7-ba23-5f14d1072ed0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The uncertainty of the Doji candlestick pattern resolved to the downside on April 6. The bears will now try and pull the price to the 20-day EMA ($102). This is an important level for the bulls to defend because a strong rebound off it will suggest that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, the selling could intensify as traders rush to the exit. That may sink the LUNA/USDT pair to the 50-day SMA ($86).\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-slides-below-44k-in-april-first-as-trader-warns-something-is-off-with-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin slides below $44K in April first as trader warns \u8216\'20\'18something is off\u8217\'20\'19 with BTC}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls purchased the dip to the 20-day EMA ($89) on April 4 but they could not push Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $98. This suggests that bears continue to defend the overhead resistance aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/086c4697-4938-46c0-8290-e29fa279c898.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI has dropped into the negative zone, indicating that bears have a slight edge. If the price breaks below the 50-day SMA ($82), the AVAX/USDT pair could drop to the next major support at $65. A bounce off this level will suggest that the pair may remain range-bound between $65 and $98 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level, the bulls will make another attempt to climb above the overhead zone between $98 and $100.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($21) on April 4 but the bulls could not overcome the barrier at $23. This may have tempted short-term traders to book profits.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/a94dc64a-749f-487d-8afd-cef31dbc6751.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USDT pair plunged below the 20-day EMA on April 6 and the RSI entered negative territory. This suggests that the bulls are losing their grip. The next stop could be the 50-day SMA ($19). The bulls are likely to defend this level with vigor but if the support cracks, the decline could extend to $16.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, a strong rebound off the 50-day SMA could suggest that the pair may consolidate between $19 and $23 for a few days. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above $23 to signal the start of a potential new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) soared above the overhead resistance at $0.17 on April 5 but the bulls could not clear the hurdle at the 200-day SMA ($0.18). This may have attracted profit-booking by the short-term bulls and selling by the aggressive bears, resulting in the sharp reversal on April 6.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/5ac4231b-e1e2-4da6-92c3-df6ca7138542.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair is likely to retest the 20-day EMA ($0.14). If the price rebounds off this level, it will suggest that bulls continue to buy on dips. The buyers will then again try to clear the overhead hurdle at the 200-day SMA.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price continues lower and breaks below the 20-day EMA. Such a move could open the doors for a possible drop to $0.12. The pair could then remain stuck between $0.10 and $0.18 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDQvZTRkNmJmOTctNGJmMi00NjIyLTgzMzctNGE3ZGE2MWM2YjE5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220406ei46000e1\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/4: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LUNA, AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,866 \uc2 words\par \uc2 4 April 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC and altcoins are dropping to retest lower support levels and bulls have yet to buy into the current dip.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been stuck between $45,400 and $47,500 for the past two days, indicating a tough tussle between the buyers and sellers as both attempt to establish control over the trend.\par \par \uc2 Data from on-chain analytics firm Glassnode showed that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-starts-2022-all-over-again-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 100,000 Bitcoin left exchanges}}}\uc2  in March. These large quantities of withdrawals have only happened twice in the history of Bitcoin with the largest being in March 2020. However, this does not mean the price will rally immediately. In 2020, the momentum picked up only by the fourth quarter of the year.\par \par \uc2 For the near term, analysts remain divided with some expecting Bitcoin to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dices-with-46k-as-elon-musk-twitter-buy-sends-dogecoin-near-2-month-highs"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 drop to $44,800 or even to $43,000}}}\uc2  while others anticipate a rally to the psychological level at $50,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/694f7502-38ef-4de0-9fa8-9ad65ea7c232.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 As the crypto markets mature, they continue to attract new investors. A report by Gemini crypto exchange highlighted that the number of users who purchased their first cryptocurrency in 2021 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/new-crypto-owners-nearly-doubled-in-3-key-regions-in-2021-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 soared by more than 50%}}}\uc2  in India, Brazil and Hong Kong. Even Latin America, Asia Pacific, the United States and Europe witnessed over 40% more new users who started investing in 2021.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins bounce off their support and extend the recovery? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the candlestick of the past two days suggests that bears are selling near the 200-day simple moving average (SMA) ($48,266). A minor positive has been that the bulls have not allowed Bitcoin to break below the important support at $45,400.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/8e05ef3b-b69d-4210-a622-54395655e0de.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, this tight-range trading is unlikely to continue for long. If the price breaks below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($44,467), the BTC/USDT pair could drop to the 50-day SMA ($41,689). Such a move could invalidate the short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rises from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that traders continue to buy on dips. That could enhance the prospects of a break above the 200-day SMA. If that happens, the pair could rally to $52,000.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the 200-day SMA ($3,487) on April 3 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that the bears are trying to pull the price lower and trap the aggressive bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/a24c2c73-a129-4d09-b19d-f77fdceb50ed.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below $3,411, the bears will try to pull the ETH/USDT pair to the 20-day EMA ($3,197). This is an important level for the bulls to defend if they want the positive momentum to remain intact.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the buyers will again try to thrust and sustain the price above the 200-day SMA. If they manage to do that, the pair could rally to $4,000.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the 20-day EMA support gives way, the selling could intensify and the pair may drop to the 50-day SMA ($2,895).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  has been trading close to the $445 level for the past few days. Although the bulls pushed the price above this level repeatedly, they could not sustain the higher levels and challenge the 200-day SMA ($467). This indicates that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/f43a36f6-e7b2-4364-98fb-5948da733a1b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to pull the price to the 20-day EMA ($421), which is an important support to watch out for. If the price rebounds off this level, the buyers will make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle and push the BNB/USDT pair to $500.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the short-term traders may be booking profits. That could pull the price to the 50-day SMA. A break below this support will suggest that the break above $445 may have been a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) recovery stalled just below the 200-day SMA ($150). This suggests that higher levels are attracting selling by the bears. The bears will now try to pull the price to the breakout level at $122.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/eb381fbf-7c1e-48b8-9f48-db5e573e714b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $122, the bulls will make another attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at the 200-day SMA. If they succeed, the SOL/USDT pair could rally toward the psychological level at $200. The rising 20-day EMA ($111) and the relative strength index (RSI) near the overbought zone indicate advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bears sink the price below $122, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA. This is an important support to keep an eye on because a break below it could result in a decline to the 50-day SMA ($96).\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls attempted to push Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the overhead resistance at $0.86 but the bears did not budge. The failure to rise above $0.86 may attract profit-booking from short-term traders, which could sink the price to the 50-day SMA ($0.78).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/42e666d4-834b-4094-a2c2-db5bed6b2828.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price once again bounces off the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that bulls are accumulating on dips. That could keep the XRP/USDT pair stuck between the 50-day SMA and the 200-day SMA ($0.89) for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA ($0.82) and the RSI near the midpoint also suggest a consolidation in the near term.\par \par \uc2 If bears pull the price below the 50-day SMA, the pair could plummet to $0.70. Alternatively, if buyers drive the price above the 200-day SMA, the pair could rally to the psychological level at $1.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) turned up on April 1 and has reached the overhead resistance at $1.26 where the bulls are likely to encounter strong resistance from the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/35ce61c5-dfaf-45f6-869f-878b28f1f9c1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($1.08) and the RSI near the overbought zone indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If bulls push the price above $1.26, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to the 200-day SMA ($1.48) and then to $1.63.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price once again turns down from the overhead resistance, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA. A break and close below this support could pull the price down to the psychological level at $1.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token broke out of the overhead resistance at $111 on April 2 and made a new all-time high at $118 on April 3. This suggests that the bulls are in the driver\u8217\'20\'19s seat.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/a3b5c43e-9088-4a61-a063-568b6f2a89a7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, the negative divergence on the RSI warns that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening and the LUNA/USDT pair could witness a minor correction or consolidation.\par \par \uc2 If the price slips below the 20-day EMA ($100), traders who may have bought at lower levels could book profits. That could pull the price down to the 50-day SMA ($84).\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the bulls continue to defend the level aggressively. The buyers will then try to push the pair above $118. If they succeed, the pair could rise to $125 and later march toward $150.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/neutrino-dollar-breaks-peg-falls-to-0-82-amid-waves-price-manipulation-accusations"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Neutrino Dollar breaks peg, falls to $0.82 amid WAVES price 'manipulation' accusations}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) repeatedly broke above the overhead resistance at $98 in the past few days but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This indicates that bears are defending the level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/e95a5754-f7cc-4e9f-8e8f-3269786f38ce.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to pull the price to the 20-day EMA ($89). This is an important level to watch out for because a strong rebound off it will suggest that the sentiment remains \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and traders are buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 That could increase the possibility of a break and close above the $98 to $100 resistance zone. If that happens, the AVAX/USDT pair could rally to $120.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price continues lower and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the next stop could be the 50-day SMA ($82). The pair could then extend its range-bound action for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the overhead resistance at $23 on April 3 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that the bears have not yet given up and are selling on every rise.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/e50896b7-a3ac-4111-99a9-66dd23bbf892.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are trying to sustain the price below $23 and trap the aggressive bulls who may have gone long on a breakout above the resistance. The critical level to watch on the downside is the 20-day EMA ($21).\par \par \uc2 If this support cracks, the DOT/USDT pair could drop to $19. If the price rebounds off this level, the DOT/USDT pair could remain range-bound between $19 and $23 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $24, the pair could rally to the 200-day SMA ($29).\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($0.13) on April 3, indicating that the bulls continue to defend this level aggressively. The rising 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive zone indicate an advantage to buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/809b9079-b571-48a0-9032-525b443a0d1c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buying continued on April 4 and the bulls attempted to resume the up-move toward the overhead resistance zone between $0.17 and the 200-day SMA ($0.18) but the long wick on the candlestick suggests that bears are selling at higher levels.\par \par \uc2 If the price continues lower and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the DOGE/USDT pair could remain range-bound between $0.10 and $0.17 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to propel and sustain the price above the 200-day SMA to signal a potential change in trend.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDQvMmFjMzQyMDEtZGJhMS00YTY3LWJjOTEtNmQ0ZGQyYjM0MmYyLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220404ei44000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Investments\par \b \uc2 Indonesia\u8217\'20\'19s cryptocurrency community in 2022: An overview\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Guest Author \par \uc2 1,155 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 April 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 With Indonesia\u8217\'20\'19s burgeoning crypto community and already vibrant artistic scene, NFTs might be the latest chapter in Indonesia\u8217\'20\'19s crypto journey.\par \par \uc2 Crypto is the next big thing in Indonesia. According to the Ministry of Trade, transactions for currencies like Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/world/asia-pacific/indonesia-regulator-says-financial-firms-banned-facilitating-crypto-sales-2022-01-25/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 grew}}}\uc2  over 14 times from a total of 60 trillion rupiahs ($4.1 billion) in 2020 to a total of 859 trillion rupiahs ($59.83 billion) in 2021.\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s getting to the point where crypto is becoming more popular than traditional stock. Vice Minister of Trade Jerry Sambuaga {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://market.bisnis.com/read/20220128/94/1494491/bursa-crypto-indonesia-meluncur-pada-2022-jadi-yang-pertama-di-dunia"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stated}}}\uc2  that more than 11 million Indonesians bought or sold crypto in 2021. In comparison, according to the Indonesian Central Securities Depository, the total number of portfolio investors \u8212\'20\'14 indicated by the number of single investor identities \u8212\'20\'14 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.thejakartapost.com/business/2021/12/24/indonesian-portfolio-investors-grow-at-five-year-high-in-2021.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reached}}}\uc2  7.35 million in 2021.\par \par \uc2 Even so, 11 million crypto investors is still only about 4% of Indonesia\u8217\'20\'19s total population, meaning there\u8217\'20\'19s still plenty of room to grow. The crypto community\u8217\'20\'19s growth in Indonesia goes hand-in-hand with several supporting local phenomena, including but not limited to:\par \par \uc2 * Regulatory support from government bodies\par \par \uc2 * Increased ease of access to cryptocurrency trading\par \par \uc2 * Adoption from major local tech players\par \par \uc2 Regulators aim to make things more secure\par \par \uc2 Although crypto assets are still not permitted as payment instruments, companies are welcome to buy and sell crypto as trading commodities in Indonesia. Since 2019, cryptocurrency trading in Indonesia has been officially overseen and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://bappebti.go.id"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 regulated}}}\uc2  by the Commodity Futures Trading Regulatory Agency (BAPPEBTI), a body under the Ministry of Trade.\par \par \uc2 This governing body is, among other things, in charge of vetting, documenting and approving companies and commodity items allowed to be traded in Indonesia. As of 2021, its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://bappebti.go.id/resources/docs/peraturan/sk_kep_kepala_bappebti/sk_kep_kepala_bappebti_2020_12_01_i6tg8tfb_id.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 whitelist}}}\uc2  of permitted crypto tokens reached 229 items, including popular assets such as Bitcoin, Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 These items are permitted based on BAPPEBTI\u8217\'20\'19s own vetting methods, considering market capitalization rankings as well as security, background checks on the development teams, blockchain system management, and development roadmaps with verifiable success metrics.\par \par \uc2 In an official statement, the governing body {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.cnbcindonesia.com/tech/20220123073739-37-309649/resmi-ini-cryptocurrency-yang-diakui-di-ri-ada-bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 iterated}}}\uc2  its main objective of providing legal security and protecting the interests of Indonesian crypto consumers. BAPPEBTI stated:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWith the new rules that we had published, it is hoped that we and crypto exchanges in Indonesia could work together to help ensure that every crypto transaction is legally regulated and safe for investors in Indonesia.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Another governing body, the Financial Service Authority, has specifically {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.instagram.com/p/CZIgoP2PjI2/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 prohibited}}}\uc2  financial service companies, such as lending or credit services, from marketing or facilitating crypto trading, reiterating BAPPEBTI\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 regulation\b0 \highlight\uc2  that all crypto exchanges must be specifically registered with them.\par \par \uc2 The aforementioned boom in the number of both crypto and stock investors in Indonesia goes hand-in-hand with the rising popularity of fintech apps, such as Bareksa and Ajaib, meaning that a large portion of these new investors might be novices. Tokocrypto, a prominent local crypto exchange, has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.liputan6.com/crypto/read/4872519/simak-tips-supaya-tak-terjebak-penipuan-investasi-kripto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stated}}}\uc2  its intent to work together with the government to make trading more secure by helping educate investors about the risks of crypto trading and how to avoid legally dubious exchanges and assets.\par \par \uc2 Companies that plan to boost \b \highlight22\uc2 crypto adoption\b0 \highlight\uc2  in Indonesia would need to build an active and positive working relationship with the government and ensure compliance with all of its regulations to gain local consumers\u8217\'20\'19 trust.\par \par \uc2 17 registered crypto exchanges in Indonesia\par \par \uc2 Until March 2022, there have been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://bappebti.go.id/calon_pedagang_aset_kripto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 17 companies}}}\uc2  registered and permitted by BAPPEBTI to exchange cryptocurrencies in Indonesia, with their userbases rapidly increasing. A market leader, Indodax reported reaching {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://tekdeeps.com/indodax-users-reach-five-million-people-in-2022-crypto-prospects-are-getting-more-glance/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 5 million members}}}\uc2  in 2022, a 104% increase compared to 2021. Another prominent exchange, Tokocrypto, had reported reaching {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://market.bisnis.com/read/20220105/94/1485581/nilai-perdagangan-harian-tokocrypto-melesat-754-persen-pada-2021"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 2 million members}}}\uc2  by the end of 2021, an eightfold increase compared to 2020.\par \par \uc2 As mentioned above, a large contributing factor to these platforms\u8217\'20\'19 success is their mobile-first strategy, with easily accessible apps. With Indonesia\u8217\'20\'19s internet penetration standing at {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://datareportal.com/reports/digital-2021-indonesia"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 73.7%}}}\uc2  in 2021, it\u8217\'20\'19s no wonder that there\u8217\'20\'19s more traction from the country\u8217\'20\'19s mobile-heavy user base.\par \par \uc2 Indonesia\u8217\'20\'19s crypto community is also growing beyond just exchanges. The Indonesia Blockchain Association, a local consortium and advocacy group for blockchain and cryptocurrencies, has 28 member companies and organizations as of 2022. The association comprises not only exchanges but also startups and tech companies using blockchain in their ecosystem and media platforms specializing in crypto.\par \par \uc2 Steven Suhadi, co-founder of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://indonesiacrypto.network/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Indonesia Crypto Network}}}\uc2  and founding member of the Indonesia Blockchain Association, told Cointelegraph, \u8220\'20\'1CRegulators in Indonesia over the past 10 years have become adaptable to technological changes, from e-commerce to ride-hailing and, most recently, P2P [peer-to-peer] lending. Indonesia has clearly-defined rules for exchanges and crypto trading already. Over the last 24 months, regulators have taken more proactive steps for digital assets, which will help to proliferate Bitcoin and cryptocurrencies in Indonesia.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 More supply means more demand, and with more players entering the country, the stage is set for another boost in crypto\u8217\'20\'19s popularity.\par \par \uc2 Local tech leaders welcome crypto with open arms\par \par \uc2 In December 2021, crypto exchange \uc2 Binance\uc2  announced a joint venture with a consortium led by MDI Ventures to develop a new \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchange in Indonesia.\par \par \uc2 MDI is the $830-million venture capital arm of Indonesia\u8217\'20\'19s largest telecommunications company, Telkom Indonesia. MDI\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://mdi.vc/portfolio"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 portfolio}}}\uc2  boasts several companies that have gone on to become household names in Indonesia, including financial technology leaders Kredivo and KoinWorks.\par \par \uc2 Binance\uc2  founder and CEO \uc2 Changpeng Zhao\uc2  has expressed his confidence and objectives regarding crypto in Indonesia, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/binance-and-a-consortium-led-by-mdi-ventures-establish-joint-venture-to-grow-the-blockchain-ecosystem-in-indonesia-301444922.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stating}}}\uc2 , \u8220\'20\'1CWith fast technology adoption and strong economic potential, Indonesia could become one of the leading centers of the blockchain and crypto ecosystem in Southeast Asia.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 This sentiment was repeated by MDI CEO Donald Wihardja, who {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/binance-and-a-consortium-led-by-mdi-ventures-establish-joint-venture-to-grow-the-blockchain-ecosystem-in-indonesia-301444922.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 stated}}}\uc2 , \u8220\'20\'1CCryptocurrencies, crypto assets, and the underlying technology, blockchain, present an undeniably important part of the financial and other digital infrastructures in the future.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19ll be worth keeping a close eye on this partnership in the future, but right now, it can be considered a sign that crypto is no longer a niche market in Indonesia. More mainstream players have started moving into it, which could mean more resources and momentum to increase adoption.\par \par \uc2 What\u8217\'20\'19s next for Indonesia?\par \par \uc2 With the rising trend in transaction volume and the number of traders as well as exchanges in recent years, we can assume that crypto and blockchain will only get bigger in 2022 and beyond. Nonfungible tokens (NFT) recently stepped into the spotlight in Indonesia after news broke about Ghozali, a computer science student who {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/22-year-old-indonesian-boy-makes-1m-by-selling-nft-selfies-on-opensea"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 made over $1 million from selling NFT selfies}}}\uc2  on OpenSea. With Indonesia\u8217\'20\'19s burgeoning crypto community and already vibrant artistic scene, NFTs might be the latest chapter in Indonesia\u8217\'20\'19s crypto journey \u8212\'20\'14 either way, it\u8217\'20\'19s become an emerging market to watch out for.\par \par \uc2 Reporting by Diaz Praditya.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDQvNzdmYTY4NTctYTgxNy00OWJlLWJhMTYtNmI3YmU4YmQ0MzgwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220402ei420005l\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 4/1: BTC, ETH, BNB, SOL, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LUNA, AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,790 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 April 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bulls set their targets on new highs now that the brief consolidation phase in BTC and altcoins appears to have ended.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has clawed back much of the losses that took place in January and now the focus of traders shifts to April, which has historically been a strong month for the cryptocurrency. According to Coinglass data, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-fights-for-support-as-btc-price-loses-46k-yearly-open"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin has closed April in the red}}}\uc2  on onlthree occasions and the worst monthly loss was a 3.46% drop in 2015.\par \par \uc2 Although history favors the bulls, the Whale Shadows indicator has noticed that more than {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dormant-for-7-years-moved-right-before-btc-price-dropped-5"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 11,000 Bitcoin has left a wallet}}}\uc2  in which it had been lying dormant for seven to ten years. The movement of similar-sized quantities from dormant accounts has generally resulted in a major top, according to independent market analyst Phillip Swift.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/b7789dae-b7fd-42fe-a38c-735d09963bd7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Along with keeping an eye on the crypto markets, traders should also track the performance of the U.S. stock markets for clues because Bitcoin has been closely correlated to the equity markets for the past several weeks.\par \par \uc2 Could bulls clear the overhead hurdle in Bitcoin and select altcoins and extend the strong recovery from the lows? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from the 200-day simple moving average (SMA) ($48,291) on March 29 and dipped to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($43,935) on April 1. The long tail on April 1\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that buyers are accumulating on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/a5345257-4260-4537-926f-9a037c973b01.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will make another attempt to push the price above the 200-day SMA. If they manage to do that, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to $52,000 where the bears may again mount a strong resistance.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price once again turns down from the 200-day SMA, it will suggest that bears have erected a strong barrier at this level. The pair could thereafter consolidate between the 20-day EMA and the 200-day SMA for a few days.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below the 20-day EMA will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. That could result in a decline to the 50-day SMA ($41,461).\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 200-day SMA ($3,488) on March 29 but the shallow correction and the sharp recovery suggest strong demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/9bc2905c-6718-426a-adbf-2d27f4397586.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($3,098) and the relative strength index (RSI) near the overbought zone indicate that bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 If buyers propel the price above the 200-day SMA, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could pick up further and the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the psychological level at $4,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price once again turns d