aph.com/uploads/2022-04/d74a15ce-491f-405d-9ecf-7ec1a874c182.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the bears pulled the price to the 20-day EMA ($87), the long tail on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests strong demand at lower levels. The bulls are attempting to drive and sustain the price above the overhead zone between $98 and $100.\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the AVAX/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to $120. Conversely, if the price once again turns down from the overhead resistance, it will suggest strong selling at higher levels. That could pull the price to the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure to break above the $23 resistance may have attracted profit-booking by the short-term traders in Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ). That has pulled the price down to the 20-day EMA ($20) today.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/5eb6874a-63a2-4244-9943-30749b6fdcab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The strong rebound off the 20-day EMA suggests buying on dips. The bulls will now make another attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $23. If they succeed, the DOT/USDT pair could start a new uptrend and the price could rally to the 200-day SMA ($29).\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may have weakened. That could pull the price down to $19 and if this level gives way, the next stop could be $16.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down from $0.15 on March 28 and dropped to the moving averages. This is an important support for the buyers to defend if they want the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment to remain intact.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-04/72226b62-9ff1-4b57-826b-604ab4da5c74.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level with strength, the bulls will attempt to push the DOGE/USDT pair above $0.15. If they succeed, the pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $0.17. The marginally rising 20-day EMA ($0.13) and the RSI in the positive territory indicate a minor advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the short term if bears sink and sustain the price below the moving averages. Such a move could open the doors for a possible drop to the critical support zone at $0.12 to $0.10.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDQvNDc4MzhhYWQtOTJiNC00ZjJmLTkwMmQtMmIzYzAyN2Y2ZGJkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220401ei41000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/30: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LUNA, SOL, AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,800 \uc2 words\par \uc2 30 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC and altcoins could enter a short consolidation phase before retesting their breakout levels, a sign that the current price action could be a buying opportunity.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rally is taking a breather near the 200-day simple moving average (SMA) and that has resulted in what is either a minor pullback or consolidation in BTC and select altcoins.\par \par \uc2 In the last few days, Terraform Labs has been on a Bitcoin buying spree. The wallet address, speculated to be that of Terra, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/terra-smash-buys-139m-bitcoin-wallet-reaches-31-000-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 received $139 million worth of Bitcoin}}}\uc2  on March 30, taking its total to about $1.5 billion in BTC.\par \par \uc2 With Terra breathing down its neck, \uc2 MicroStrategy\uc2  seems to have taken up the challenge. The business intelligence firm\u8217\'20\'19s subsidiary {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/microstrategy-subsidiary-will-purchase-bitcoin-after-closing-205m-crypto-collateralized-loan"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MacroStrategy has secured a $205 million loan}}}\uc2  from \uc2 Silvergate\uc2 , which will be used to purchase Bitcoin, cover general corporate expenses and pay the necessary fees and interest on the loan.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/0cc6b384-04d5-4745-a70c-3d74a5328e03.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 The buying interest is not limited to the two companies. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  data showed that institutional investors pumped in $193 million into \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment products last week, the largest inflow since early December 2021.\par \par \uc2 With institutional investors buying in large quantities, could Bitcoin and the major altcoins break above their overhead resistance levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin rose to the 200-day SMA ($48,288) on March 28 but the bulls could not push the price above it. The buyers again tried to clear the overhead hurdle on March 29 but failed.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/57e744e3-79c0-402c-ad6c-08427da7ebe6.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to pull the price to the immediate support at $45,400. If the price rebounds off this support, the bulls will again attempt to thrust the BTC/USDT pair above the 200-day SMA. If they succeed, the pair could start its journey to $52,000.\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($43,531) and the relative strength index (RSI) near the overbought zone indicate that bulls are in control.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and plummets below the 20-day EMA. If that happens, the pair could extend its stay inside the ascending channel for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the overhead resistance at $3,411 on March 29 but the bulls could not clear the obstacle at the 200-day SMA ($3,488). This indicates that bears have not yet given up and are attempting to stall the recovery at the 200-day SMA.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/a5c9d82c-a81d-4454-aae4-c709956942c3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below $3,411, the bears will try to pull the ETH/USDT pair to the 20-day EMA ($3,042). A strong rebound off this level will suggest that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will then again try to propel the price above the 200-day SMA. If they succeed, the pair could rally toward $4,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the traders may be rushing to the exit. That could pull the pair down to the 50-day SMA ($2,853).\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  tight range trading between $425 and $445 has resolved to the upside, indicating that bulls have absorbed the supply and are trying to gain the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/bdb22471-1074-4214-93a4-abcfe37fd5a2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($409) and the RSI in the overbought territory indicate that bulls are in control. If they sustain the price above $445, the BNB/USDT pair could rise to the 200-day SMA ($467) and later to $500.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below $425, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close below it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. The pair could then oscillate between $350 and $445 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke above the overhead resistance at $0.91 on March 28 but the bears did not allow the price to sustain the higher levels. This indicates that the bears are aggressively defending the zone between $0.91 and $1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/c16a331f-17a4-4596-97f7-a1daeeb6a1a2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to sustain the price above $0.86. If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair could again rise to $0.91. A break and close above this level could open the doors for a possible rally to the psychological level at $1.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price sustains below $0.86, the bears will attempt to pull the pair below the moving averages. If they manage to do that, it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. The pair could then drop to $0.70.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is facing resistance at $1.26 as seen from the long wick on the candlestick on March 28 and 29. A minor positive is that the bulls have not given up much ground.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/1ff03349-0830-4b9f-85f9-1a2d9edf5ccb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The upsloping 20-day EMA ($1) and the RSI in the overbought territory indicate that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers propel and sustain the price above $1.26, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rise to the 200-day SMA ($1.51) and thereafter rally to $1.60.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $1.15, the bears will try to pull the pair to the 20-day EMA. This is an important level to watch out for because a break and close below it could sink the pair to $0.74.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token broke and closed above the overhead resistance at $96 on March 28. Although the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick showed selling near $100, the bulls did not allow the price to break back below $96.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/dd84165c-07c9-4b3b-ace6-66030635bf96.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buying resumed on March 29 and the bulls thrust the price above the all-time high at $105. If bulls sustain the price above $105, the buying momentum could pick up and the LUNA/USDT pair may rally to $115 and later to $125.\par \par \uc2 A minor negative is that the RSI is showing signs of forming a negative divergence. If the price breaks and sustains below $105, the pair could drop to $96. This is an important support for the bulls to defend because a break and close below it could aggravate selling. The pair could then drop to the 50-day SMA ($78).\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 After sustaining above $106 for the past two days, Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has risen above the overhead resistance at $122, indicating strong buying by the bulls.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/ba77bb6a-ca08-43ef-a14e-f5aba008c4b0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If buyers sustain the price above $122, the SOL/USDT pair could start a new uptrend, which could reach the 200-day SMA ($150). This level is likely to act as a stiff resistance but if bulls overcome it, the rally could reach $180.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $106, it will suggest that the break above $122 may have been a bull trap. The pair could then drop to the moving averages and remain stuck between $81 and $122 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sentiment-hits-greed-in-2022-first-amid-calls-for-45k-btc-price-pullback"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin sentiment hits 'greed' in 2022 first amid calls for $45K BTC price pullback}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on the candlestick of the past two days shows that bears are defending the level at $98. However, a minor positive is that the bulls have not allowed Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) to drop to the 20-day EMA ($85). This suggests that the traders are in no hurry to exit their positions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/86e8f9ac-5022-4a82-81b2-472bfe0452fd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory indicate that bulls are in control. If buyers thrust the price above the $98 to $100 resistance zone, the AVAX/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to $120.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the short term if bears sink and sustain the price below the 50-day SMA ($81). Such a move will suggest that the pair could extend its stay inside the $65 to $98 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been facing stiff resistance at $23 for the past three days but a positive sign is that the bulls have not ceded ground to the bears. This suggests that the bulls expect a break above the overhead resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/364eba07-356e-404f-99d4-6e450ab3d794.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($20) is sloping up and the RSI is in the positive zone, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If bulls drive and sustain the price above $23, the DOT/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to the 200-day SMA ($29).\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may have weakened. That could keep the pair range-bound between $16 and $23 for the next few days.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) rose above $0.15 on March 28 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick suggests that bears are selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/3c461647-e33f-4871-8641-e76b0d92291a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating that bulls have the upper hand. If the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $0.15, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $0.17 where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price continues lower and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may spend some more time inside the range between $0.17 and $0.10.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvYTBkNTllMTktMWVlOC00YTAyLWFmOTEtZmEwY2Y2MGVmYjlmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220330ei3u000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/28: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LUNA, SOL, AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,769 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The sharp rally in Bitcoin and select altcoins has pushed their RSI near overbought levels, indicating a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and several altcoins surprised many with their newfound strength during the weekend. Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s rally easily sliced through the $45,900 level, which according to Glassnode was an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/buy-pressure-in-bull-market-territory-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 area of resistance because several investors had purchased}}}\uc2  near that level when Bitcoin was declining after hitting its all-time high in November.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s strength may have attracted buying in several altcoins, which are still languishing below their 52-week high. The rally in Bitcoin and the bottom fishing in altcoins has boosted \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2 , pushing the Crypto Fear and Greed Index into the \u8220\'20\'1Cgreed\u8221\'20\'1D territory.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/00eda2e1-d7c7-45f3-8990-a00a5418f552.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Interestingly, the crypto markets have held a large part of their gains despite the tepid performance of the U.S. stock markets on March 28. This suggests that the crypto markets may be in the early stages of decoupling from the equity markets.\par \par \uc2 Could buyers sustain the momentum and clear the overhead resistance levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin hesitated on March 26 as seen from the inside-day candlestick. This indicated indecision among the bulls and the bears. This uncertainty resolved to the upside on March 27 as the bulls regrouped and propelled the price above the overhead resistance at $45,400.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/c1af4bfd-8350-4bf6-89e6-0f340bfb922a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sharp rally of the past few days has pushed the relative strength index (RSI) into the overbought zone for the first time since October 2021. This suggests that the momentum favors the buyers.\par \par \uc2 The bears may attempt to stall the up-move at the resistance line of the ascending channel but if bulls overcome this barrier, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to the psychological level at $50,000 and later to $52,000.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the resistance line, the buyers will try to flip $45,400 into support. If they succeed, it will suggest that the up-move may continue. The bears will have to pull and sustain the price below $45,400 to weaken the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the symmetrical triangle on March 25 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. However, the buyers did not cede ground to the bears and resumed their purchase on March 26.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/f8385451-cfb7-4051-9f5f-5684fbcc7ff8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The momentum picked up on March 27 and the ETH/USDT pair has reached $3,411 where the bulls may encounter a minor resistance. If bulls bulldoze their way through, the ETH/USDT pair could rally toward the psychological level at $4,000.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from $3,411, the pair could retest the breakout level from the triangle. If the price rebounds off this level, it will suggest strong buying on dips. The bulls will then again try to resume the up-move.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to pull and sustain the price inside the triangle to suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may have weakened.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  continued its northward march and has reached the overhead resistance at $445. The bears are likely to defend this level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/f4eb34fa-edd9-4a8d-b962-d7080e241366.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($402) and the RSI near the overbought zone indicate that bulls are in control. If buyers thrust the price above $445, the BNB/USDT pair could rally toward the psychological level at $500. This level could again act as a strong resistance.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $500 but does not break below $445, it will suggest that the bulls have flipped the level into support. That will increase the likelihood of a break above the overhead resistance.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $445, the pair could drop to the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned up on March 26, indicating that bulls are buying on minor dips. The buyers pushed the price above the strong resistance at $0.86 but are facing resistance near $0.91.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/615acc77-ce69-45d4-b345-743238a658ab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are sloping up and the RSI is in the positive zone. If buyers do not allow the price to slide below $0.86, the prospects of a break above $0.91 increase. If that happens, the XRP/USDT pair could rally to the psychological level at $1.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance at $0.91 and plummets below the moving averages. Such a move could pull the price to the strong support at $0.70.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has continued its recovery and the price has reached the overhead resistance at $1.26 where the bears are likely to mount a strong defense.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/2efb0621-87ba-4424-809f-c84e8b2c07c4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA ($1) and the RSI in the overbought zone suggest that bulls are in control. If the price turns down from overhead resistance but the bulls do not give up much ground, it will increase the possibility of a break above $1.26.\par \par \uc2 If that happens, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to $1.60 and then march higher toward $1.80. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down from the overhead resistance and breaks below the psychological level at $1.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token has been stuck in a tight range between the overhead resistance at $96 and the support at the 20-day EMA ($90). This tight-range trading could soon lead to a sharp trending move.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/de4bbb15-4c87-4e59-beb5-1b41aef49aa1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rising 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If buyers propel and sustain the price above $96, the LUNA/USDT pair could retest the all-time high at $105.\par \par \uc2 This level is likely to act as a major obstacle but if bulls overcome it, the uptrend may resume. The pair could then rally to $125. This positive view will invalidate in the short term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. That could open the gates for a possible decline to $82.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 After trading near the overhead resistance at $106 for a few days, Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the level on March 27. The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is near the overbought zone, indicating an advantage to buyers.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/40fea2d6-0e0a-4225-bc4e-aedb70045e48.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls sustain the price above $106, the SOL/USDT pair could rise to $122. The bears are expected to defend this level aggressively. If the price turns down from this level and breaks below $106, it will suggest that the pair may remain range-bound for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to clear the overhead hurdle at $122 to signal the start of a new potential uptrend. The pair could then start its up-move, which could reach the overhead resistance zone between $158 and $163.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-to-58k-next-a-2019-like-reversal-ascending-triangle-hints-at-more-upside-for-btc"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin to $58K next? A 2019-like 'reversal ascending triangle' hints at more upside for BTC}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) rebounded off the 20-day EMA ($83) on March 26, indicating that bulls are buying on dips. The buyers will now try to sustain the price above the immediate resistance at $92.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/dbb5d865-e683-4141-99f8-abf6bb3d8eec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the AVAX/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance zone at $98 to $100. This is an important zone for the bears to defend because a break and close above it could extend the rally to $120.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead zone, the bears will try to pull the pair to the moving averages. If the price rebounds off this level, the pair may remain stuck between the moving averages and the overhead zone for a few days.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) picked up momentum on March 27 and has reached the stiff overhead resistance at $23. The upsloping 20-day EMA ($20) and the RSI near the overbought zone suggest that bulls have the upper hand.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/11b4fb15-e295-4733-ad5e-ee758202554c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive and sustain the price above $23, the DOT/USDT pair could rally to $28. If bulls succeed in clearing this hurdle, the up-move may extend to $30 and later to $32.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the overhead resistance, the bears will try to pull the pair to the 20-day EMA. A strong rebound off this support will suggest that bulls continue to buy on dips. That will increase the possibility of a break above the overhead barrier.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price breaks below the moving averages. That could extend the consolidation between $16 and $23 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls flipped the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($0.13) into support on March 25. This attracted strong buying in Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ), putting it on the path to a possible rally to $0.17.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/2278580e-d2ac-4644-86b4-dcb9d73630c2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are on the verge of a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is near the overbought zone, indicating that buyers have the upper hand. If bulls drive the price above $0.17, the DOGE/USDT pair could rise to $0.22.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $0.17 but does not give up much ground, it will suggest that the traders expect the recovery to continue.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down sharply from the current level or the overhead resistance, it will signal that the pair may remain range-bound between $0.12 and $0.17 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvMmY5M2M4N2QtYTE1Mi00YzY5LTkyMjItMmNkMDUwYzU4ODQxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220328ei3s000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Buy pressure \u8216\'20\'18in bull market territory\u8217\'20\'19 \u8212\'20\'14 5 things to know in Bitcoin this week\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 1,840 \uc2 words\par \uc2 28 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC price action is back at the yearly open for 2022 as the next Bitcoin triggers line up.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) begins the last week of March with a bang after returning to its yearly opening price above $46,000.\par \par \uc2 In a surprisingly strong upward move for a weekend, BTC/USD began surging upwards Saturday, continuing overnight to challenge its highs from the start of 2022.\par \par \uc2 Coming against an ongoing macroclimate of considerable uncertainty, strength in Bitcoin is naturally being taken with a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/beware-the-bitfinex-whale-new-45k-btc-sell-wall-appears-amid-worries-bitcoin-could-retrace"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pinch of salt}}}\uc2  this month. The reaction is understandable given that previous attempts to break out of its multi-month trading range have all ended in failure.\par \par \uc2 Despite volatile periods, bulls were {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-sees-mother-of-all-consolidations-as-40k-btc-price-squeeze-fails"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 always left disappointed}}}\uc2  and Bitcoin subsequently not only reversed but often revisited the lower end of its range, costing both short and long positions dearly.\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, the hope is that this time really will be different \u8212\'20\'14 analysts had long argued that only a breakout above the range ceiling, formed by the yearly open around $46,200, would be enough to cause a paradigm shift.\par \par \uc2 Now that this is in action on the charts, attention is focusing on the final hurdle \u8212\'20\'14 cementing these multi-month resistance levels as support.\par \par \uc2 With the process ongoing Monday, Cointelegraph takes a look at potential triggers that could make or break this important episode in Bitcoin price action.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin wipes out the 2022 dip\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CGradually then suddenly,\u8221\'20\'1D or pure chance? Traders are still trying to make sense of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s newfound strength this week.\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s been a sight absent from the chart since the New Year \u8212\'20\'14 BTC/USD is back at $47,000. After jumping almost $3,000 in 24 hours, the largest cryptocurrency dealt a firm blow to resistance levels that had kept bulls firmly in their place for months.\par \par \uc2 The significance of $46,000 has been a hot topic for almost as long \u8212\'20\'14 a return to the yearly open, many said, would be the signal that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-on-track-to-see-its-highest-weekly-close-of-2022"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin was ready for bigger things}}}\uc2  once more.\par \par \uc2 Few would have thought that the phenomenon would play out \u8220\'20\'1Cout of hours,\u8221\'20\'1D however. Suspicions over the rally\u8217\'20\'19s real strength are naturally pervasive on social media as the week gets underway, just as they were as the rally itself began.\par \par \uc2 march 2020 - ct was \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , fooo was \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 may 2021 ct was \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , fooo was \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 july 2021 ct was \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , fooo was staking fooo's entire reputation on more upside\par \par \uc2 november 2021 fooo began dumping, ct was \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 now ct is \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  and fooo is \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 Wholesome\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 fooo - Mayor of Goblin Town (@bitcoinpanda69) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/bitcoinpanda69/status/1507802506503626752?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 March 26, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, even the more cautious voices are no longer discounting the potential for further upside, even if the longer-term prognosis remains downhill.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}\uc2  update\par \par \uc2 Yearly open tagged\par \par \uc2 Flip to supoort then 50k next with potential move into 53k imo\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Pentoshi (@Pentosh1) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1508184666750259207?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 March 27, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CFundamental buying pressure for Bitcoin has now climbed into bull market territory,\u8221\'20\'1D analyst and statistician Willy Woo {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/woonomic/status/1508145152023756800"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reported}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Fellow analyst Matthew Hyland, a key supporter of the $46,000 argument, gave a target of $52,000 as the next long-term resistance wall to crack.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Bitcoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Bitcoin}}}\uc2  has broken above the $46k resistance zone\par \par \uc2 The next major resistance zone is around $52k: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/ueqi5xwkhi"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/ueqi5xwkhi}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Matthew Hyland (@MatthewHyland_) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MatthewHyland_/status/1508299865335517186?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 March 28, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 In \uc2 Twitter\uc2  posts, he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MatthewHyland_/status/1508232260851585030"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2  that the move was preceded by a breakout on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s relative strength index (RSI) indicator, a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-s-3-ways-the-relative-strength-index-rsi-can-be-used-as-a-sell-signal"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 classic signal of breakout trends}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 RSI assesses how overbought or oversold an asset is at a specific price. In the case of Bitcoin, its score has been climbing off a floor level since mid-January, data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.142027444.742658523.1640948929-762064149.1640948929"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  shows.\par \par \uc2 Further development of RSI, therefore, could dictate the extent of the rally, as per historical behavioral norms.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/2a4c98db-3629-4573-8adb-5ed7ed7c4fab.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ) with RSI data. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Analyst eyes Bitcoin stocks decoupling\par \par \uc2 It\u8217\'20\'19s a confusing world out there, and when it comes to how Bitcoin should be acting, the picture does not get any easier.\par \par \uc2 Inflation, war in Europe and the persistent threat of Coronavirus returning \u8212\'20\'14 to name just three major macro triggers \u8212\'20\'14 have had commentators forecasting doom and gloom for stocks and risk assets alike in 2022.\par \par \uc2 Just this month, multiple sources warned that Bitcoin could soon face its Waterloo as a dramatic stocks capitulation sparks another March 2020 moment.\par \par \uc2 The \u8220\'20\'1Ceasy money\u8221\'20\'1D age which followed that event is gone, and only a continuation of quantitative easing would bring back the huge capital flows Bitcoin enjoyed later that year, some argued.\par \par \uc2 Now, however, Bitcoin appears to be striking out on its own, challenging an intense stock market correlation which in the case of the S&P 500 reached a 17-month high last week.\par \par \uc2 While the S&P has shaken off the impact of the Russia-Ukraine war and plans for tightening by the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2 , analysis shows that selling has been considerable and shorts are everywhere \u8212\'20\'14 the perfect fuel, ironically enough, for a fresh \u8220\'20\'1Cshort squeeze\u8221\'20\'1D upwards.\par \par \uc2 Equity Traders sold heavily into this rally:\par \par \uc2 \u8226\'20\'22 One of the biggest weekly purges in history (as a % of Market Cap)\par \par \uc2 \u8226\'20\'22 Total $ selling hit a new record\par \par \uc2 \u8226\'20\'22 Spec Positioning now significantly Net Short \u8211\'20\'13 at risk of a further squeeze\par \par \uc2 Similar setups led to some Major rallies. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/iTYGfEh5iS"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/iTYGfEh5iS}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Macro Charts (@MacroCharts) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MacroCharts/status/1507673723549138945?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 March 26, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CRisk-on/Risk-off correlations to equities is a short term effect. BTC trades this correlation due to short term speculators,\u8221\'20\'1D Woo {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/woonomic/status/1507340627490775040"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 explained}}}\uc2  in a recent dedicated \uc2 Twitter\uc2  thread on the topic.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CBitcoin\u8216\'20\'18s internal demand fundamentals powered by its adoption curve is more powerful. Eventually the market decouples; the last time was Oct 2020.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Should speculators have been ruling the roost so far this year, then a return of interest in Bitcoin futures could be a trigger to watch going forward. Open interest in Bitcoin futures is now at its highest since December, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coinglass.com/BitcoinOpenInterest"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 data}}}\uc2  from Coinglass shows.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/04e64b09-e9c3-4177-a32a-44b4caa52aba.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin futures open interest chart. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 Who wants their money back?\par \par \uc2 There is another side to the $46,000 story, making it more than just a symbolic level from the New Year.\par \par \uc2 As {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/glassnode/status/1507420357766090753"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 noted}}}\uc2  by on-chain analytics firm Glassnode this weekend, the area around $45,900 is one with a giant amount of prior buyer activity.\par \par \uc2 Market entrants bought in on the way down from all-time highs and have been underwater since, thanks to it providing the ceiling for Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s 2022 trading range.\par \par \uc2 A return, Glassnode warned, may ruin the mood as a rush for the exit from those buyers plays out.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe next major on-chain resistance for Bitcoin is the Short-Term Holder Realized Price, trading at $45.9k. This metric is the average price paid for BTC by investors who purchased after the October ATH,\u8221\'20\'1D it explained on March 25 alongside a chart of its long- and short-term holder realized cap indicator.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C\b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  resistance comes from STHs seeking to \u8216\'20\'18get their money back.\u8217\'20\'19\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/e878659b-8906-4042-90ba-f722263e938d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin long- and short-term holder realized cap chart. Source: Glassnode/ \uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 So far, short-term holders \u8212\'20\'14 defined as entities holding coins for 155 days or less \u8212\'20\'14 have not triggered a reversal of direction. The start of Wall Street trading, however, could still produce surprises.\par \par \uc2 Difficulty should see a new all-time high in days\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s network fundamentals are certainly determined not to disappoint this year.\par \par \uc2 The coming week will be no exception, as Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s network difficulty {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://btc.com/stats/diff"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 climbs}}}\uc2  to new record highs of approximately 28.67 trillion.\par \par \uc2 The move will follow a month of losses, which, as Cointelegraph recently reported, accompanied the results of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hash-rate-may-see-small-capitulation-with-difficulty-set-for-new-all-time-high"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 upheaval for miners operating in Kazakhstan}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Difficulty\u8217\'20\'19s next automated readjustment, however, will not only cancel out those losses but add 4.4% to the existing tally, making difficulty greater than ever before.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/0625f725-0b05-4f5c-af22-5029f6bb35cb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin difficulty 7-day average chart. Source: Blockchain\par \par \uc2 The implication of increasing difficulty is essentially that mining for block subsidies has never been more competitive, as evidenced by Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s equally \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  hash rate data.\par \par \uc2 In turn, Bitcoin becomes more resistant to network attacks as an increasing miner presence dedicates more and more resources to competing for the same fixed reward \u8212\'20\'14 and thus protecting network participants in the process.\par \par \uc2 Last year\u8217\'20\'19s 50% hash rate drop, sparked by a crackdown in China which was previously the world\u8217\'20\'19s mining stronghold, now seems nothing more than a distant memory.\par \par \uc2 Effects of \u8220\'20\'1Cbanning\u8221\'20\'1D bitcoin mining. Bitcoin hash rate new ATH, higher than when the \u8220\'20\'1Cban\u8221\'20\'1D happened. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/pY5ea1rCJB"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/pY5ea1rCJB}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 CZ Binance (@cz_binance) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/cz_binance/status/1507312455311138816?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 March 25, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 An attempt to ban proof-of-work (PoW) cryptocurrency support in the \uc2 European Union\uc2 , meanwhile, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/european-crypto-regulatory-framework-goes-to-three-way-consideration-without-pow-ban"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 failed to gain the support of lawmakers}}}\uc2  for a second time last week.\par \par \uc2 Hash rate provided by known mining pools sat at around 219 exahashes per second (EH/s), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://miningpoolstats.stream/bitcoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according}}}\uc2  to data from monitoring resource MiningPoolStats, itself the highest level ever recorded.\par \par \uc2 Greed is back for the first time since $60,000\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  at the bottom and \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  at resistance \u8212\'20\'14 it\u8217\'20\'19s a classic market sentiment feature which plays out time and time again.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/top-5-cryptocurrencies-to-watch-this-week-btc-ada-axs-link-ftt"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Top 5 cryptocurrencies to watch this week: BTC, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AXS, LINK, FTT}}}\par \par \uc2 For the first time in 2022, however, the Crypto Fear & Greed Index has laid out just how exuberant the average crypto investor is feeling.\par \par \uc2 For the first time since just after Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s most recent all-time highs of $69,000 in November, the classic sentiment indicator has entered \u8220\'20\'1CGreed\u8221\'20\'1D territory.\par \par \uc2 Its transformation, like sentiment itself this month, has been impressive. Just a week ago, it measured the mood as a normalized score of 22/100 \u8212\'20\'14 not just \u8220\'20\'1Cfear,\u8221\'20\'1D but \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme fear.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Now, it is hot on the way to show the opposite, and as long-term investors know, sustained rallies tend only to come alongside gradual increases in sentiment.\par \par \uc2 Big jump up in the Fear and Greed Index today on that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}\uc2  move.\par \par \uc2 Last time we were this far into Greed territory, price was +$60k.\par \par \uc2 Live chart: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/Jr5151icga"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/Jr5151icga}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/KZtsava7jZ"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/KZtsava7jZ}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Philip Swift (@PositiveCrypto) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/PositiveCrypto/status/1508277552103702537?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 March 28, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Some of them, however, remain clearly excited to see what happens next.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThe crypto markets on a steady uptrend while the supply shock kicks in. It will only take one \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  event to send this back to all-time highs,\u8221\'20\'1D JRNY Crypto {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/JRNYcrypto/status/1508163598115168256"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 argued}}}\uc2  on March 27.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWatch how crazy things get when the sentiment goes from fear to greed while supply is limited.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/a095a0e5-9dc9-4ec0-b21e-3c3b74c75563.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto Fear & Greed Index (screenshot). Source: Alternative.me\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvNTQ2OTc0N2MtNTFkOC00YWFlLTg5MDYtMDZmZWY0YjQwNmYzLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220328ei3s00002\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Top 5 cryptocurrencies to watch this week: BTC,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , AXS, LINK, FTT\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,684 \uc2 words\par \uc2 27 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 , AXS, LINK and FTT may start a strong recovery in the next few days if BTC holds the $45,000 level as support.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is attempting to notch its second successive weekly gains and end at the highest weekly closing price year-to-date. According to on-chain data from Glassnode, the recovery in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price was driven by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-on-track-to-see-its-highest-weekly-close-of-2022"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 demand in the spot markets}}}\uc2 . This is likely to cheer the bulls because history suggests that spot market demand leads to sustained upside.\par \par \uc2 Another positive sign is the strong demand for the ProShares Bitcoin Strategy exchange-traded fund (BITO) in the past two weeks, which pushed its exposure to a record high. Arcane Research said the strong inflows \u8220\'20\'1Csuggest that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/proshares-etf-s-bitcoin-stash-hits-1-27b-as-btc-eyes-50k-by-mid-april"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin appetite through traditional investment vehicles is increasing}}}\uc2 ."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/8d093628-5ec2-4ae3-90f7-91d625d8d1b3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto market data daily view. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Along with Bitcoin, the broader crypto space is also attracting investors. According to research firm Fundstrat, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/after-years-of-doubts-and-concerns-it-is-finally-bitcoin-s-time-to-shine"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 venture capital buyers pumped $4 billion}}}\uc2  into the crypto space in the last three weeks of February.\par \par \uc2 Could buyers sustain the momentum and extend the relief rally in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top-5 cryptocurrencies that may outperform in the short term.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The long wick on Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s March 25 candlestick shows that the bears are defending the overhead resistance at $45,400. A minor positive is that the bulls have not given up much ground, suggesting that the traders are not closing their positions in a hurry.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/a4e46af8-3696-4553-b20b-15546653160b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($42,025) has turned up and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the positive territory, indicating that bulls are in command. If buyers drive the price above $45,400, the BTC/USDT pair could rise to the resistance line of the ascending channel.\par \par \uc2 This level may again act as an obstacle, but if bulls overcome it the pair could rally to the psychological level at $50,000.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from $45,400, the bears will try to pull the pair to the strong support at $42,594. This is an important level to watch on the downside because if bulls flip it to support, the possibility of a break above $45,400 increases.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to pull and sustain the price below the moving averages to signal that the bulls have been pushed to the back foot.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/1d8691ba-4ba1-4edb-bb70-d1b0c3525386.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the price turned down from the overhead resistance but the bulls did not allow the pair to break below the 20-EMA. This suggests that traders are buying on every minor dip.\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the RSI near the overbought zone suggest that the path of least resistance is to the upside. This positive view will invalidate in the short term if the price breaks and sustains below the 20-EMA. In that case, the pair may drop to $42,594.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has been sustaining above the critical level at $1 for the past few days. This indicates that bulls who may have purchased at lower levels are not booking profits aggressively as they expect the recovery to continue.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/821ef71b-8c73-4bd5-82e8-86f8efc2c1bd.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the positive zone, indicating that bulls have the upper hand. If buyers push and sustain the price above $1.26, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may pick up and the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to the next critical resistance at $1.60.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from $1.26 but rebounds off $1, it will suggest that the pair may remain range-bound between the two levels for a few more days. The bears will have to sink and sustain the price below the moving averages to invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/8ef3252c-52a7-4856-97c0-0d65073645e8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the bears are aggressively defending the overhead resistance at $1.20 but a minor positive is that the bulls have not allowed the price to sustain below the 20-EMA. If the price rises from the current level, the bulls will again try to clear the hurdle at $1.20 and push the pair to $1.26.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-EMA, it will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened. The pair could then gradually decline toward the strong support at $1.\par \par \uc2 AXS/USDT\par \par \uc2 Axie Infinity ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/axie-infinity-axs-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AXS}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between $72 and $44 for the past few days. The buyers pushed the price above the overhead resistance on March 25 but could not sustain the higher levels. This indicates that the bears are defending the level with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/510445fa-daaf-40c9-aa75-993155f31420.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AXS/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the positive territory, suggesting advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off the 20-day EMA ($56), the bulls will again try to thrust the AXS/USDT pair above $72. If they manage to do that, the up-move may pick up momentum and the pair may rally to $100.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price continues lower and breaks below the 20-day EMA. That could keep the pair range-bound for a few more days.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/262d1f37-c7dc-4dbb-96d9-392c8cf51841.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AXS/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 4-hour chart shows that the bulls pushed the price above the overhead resistance at $72 but could not sustain the higher levels. This may have attracted profit-booking by the short-term traders which pulled the price below the 20-EMA.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level and breaks above $68, it will suggest accumulation on dips. The buyers will then try to clear the obstacle at $72 and start a new up-move.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price sustains below the 20-EMA, the correction could extend to the 50-simple moving average.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dogecoin-signals-bottoming-out-as-doge-rebounds-30-in-two-weeks-what-s-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Dogecoin signals bottoming out as DOGE rebounds 30% in two weeks \u8212\'20\'14 What's next?}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT\par \par \uc2 Chainlink ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/chainlink-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LINK}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a massive range between $13 and $36 for the past several months. Although bears pulled the price below the support of the range, they could not sustain the breakdown. This suggests that the markets rejected the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/6ecebcb0-ad8d-4305-a250-9bfc25fc1b8b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the positive territory, suggesting that the buyers have the upper hand. The rally may face resistance at the downtrend line but if this barrier is crossed, the LINK/USDT pair could rally to $20.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level, the moving averages are likely to act as strong support. If the price rebounds off it, the possibility of a break above the downtrend line could increase. This positive view will invalidate if the bears pull the price below the moving averages. That could open the doors for a possible drop to $13.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/9ad3aeec-3fd8-4103-a1f0-b61003dae3ce.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LINK/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are mounting a strong defense at $16.50 but a minor positive is that the buyers have not allowed the price to slip below the 50-SMA. If the price rises from the current level or rebounds off the moving averages, the bulls will try to propel the pair above $16.50. If they succeed, the pair could rally to $17.50.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price breaks below the 50-SMA, it will suggest that the short-term bulls may be closing their positions. There is a minor support at $15 but if it gives way, the pair could slide to $14.\par \par \uc2 FTT/USDT\par \par \uc2 FTX Token ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ftx-token-ftt-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 FTT}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above $49 on March 24, completing an ascending triangle pattern. Although buyers pushed the price above the psychological resistance at $50 on March 25, they could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/a468f769-8499-4f79-8d1a-1f11c7ec0f0b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 FTT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This suggests that the bears have not yet given up and they continue to sell at higher levels. The bears will now try to pull and sustain the price back below $49. If they manage to do that, the aggressive bulls who purchased the breakout from the triangle may get trapped. This could sink the FTT/USDT pair to the 20-day EMA ($45).\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this level, the buyers will again try to clear the overhead resistance zone between $49 to $52 and resume the up-move.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price slips below the moving averages, it will suggest that bears are attempting a strong comeback. A break and close below the uptrend line of the triangle will invalidate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  pattern. The pair may then decline to $39.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/e17d046d-76bf-458e-973a-1c64fac8b0d8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 FTT/USDT 4-hour chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The rally above $51 pushed the RSI deep into the overbought territory. Usually, such moves are followed by a sharp correction or consolidation. If bears pull the price below $49, the pair could decline further to the 50-SMA.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off this level, the buyers will again try to push the pair above $52 and resume the up-move. On the other hand, if bears pull the price below the 50-SMA, the selling could intensify and the pair may drop to $45.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvNWE3YzQwMWEtNGQ2Yy00MTVkLWIxYjItZjBlYTA5MDQ0ZTExLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220327ei3r000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/25: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , LUNA, SOL, AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,813 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC and most major altcoins could witness a minor dip to retest lower support levels, but the overall trajectory appears to now favor bulls.\par \par \uc2 This week Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and select altcoins broke above their immediate resistance levels and moved higher, which propelled the total crypto market capitalization above $2 trillion on March 24.\par \par \uc2 One of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/digital-currencies-could-get-a-boost-from-the-international-crisis-blackrock-ceo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 triggers that could have driven crypto prices higher}}}\uc2  was \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  CEO \uc2 Larry Fink\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s letter to shareholders where he said that the Russia-Ukraine conflict has opened up avenues for digital currencies to be used as a mode of settlement for international transactions.\par \par \uc2 Another bit of news that may have aided the up-move in crypto prices was that \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  redesigned its website with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-rallies-to-2t-market-cap-as-institutions-signal-readiness-to-enter"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 emphasis on the growth of digital assets}}}\uc2  and the metaverse, mentioning them as \u8220\'20\'1Cmegatrends.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/01d26519-d90b-4224-a993-beca1c175f6e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Apart from the increasing institutional interest, Minneapolis Federal Reserve President Neel Kashkari\u8217\'20\'19s statement that the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-clings-to-43k-as-fed-signals-up-to-7-rate-hikes-in-2022"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 central bank could raise interest rates}}}\uc2  up to seven times in 2022 to curb inflation may also have boosted \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sentiment in cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 Can bulls sustain the higher prices and build upon the up-move or will bears sell aggressively and trap the buyers? Let\u8217\'20\'19s study the charts of the top 10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin closed above the immediate resistance at $42,594 on March 23, indicating that bulls absorbed the supply by the bears. That opened the doors for a move to $45,400 where the bears could again mount a strong defense.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/b39c68a8-7fda-4163-ab9a-aeef9d956c72.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have turned up gradually and the relative strength index (RSI) is in positive territory, indicating an advantage to buyers. If buyers push the price above $45,400, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to the resistance line of the ascending channel.\par \par \uc2 If the bulls clear this obstacle, the pair could rise to the stiff overhead zone between the psychological resistance at $50,000 and $52,000.\par \par \uc2 Any correction from the current level is likely to find support near $42,594 and the moving averages. The bears will have to pull and sustain the price below the moving averages to indicate that the bulls may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are trying to sustain Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) above the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle but the long wick on the candlestick suggests that bears are selling at higher levels aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/7878f0c2-a20d-4d14-b617-b9494d60b15b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI has risen into the positive zone, suggesting that the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the price sustains above the triangle, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to $3,500 and later to the pattern target at $3,907.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price re-enters the triangle, the bears will try to pull the pair to the moving averages. If the price rebounds off the moving averages, it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are accumulating on dips. That will increase the possibility of a break above the triangle.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to pull the price below the moving averages to negate the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view. The pair could then extend its stay inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  has been consolidating in a large range between $445 and $350 for the past few days. There is a minor resistance at $425 but if bulls clear this hurdle, a move to $445 is possible.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/47724c06-f95f-4d74-bffe-f4a6297b72ac.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the positive territory, which suggests a possible change in trend. A break and close above $445 could open the doors for a possible rally to $500.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that traders may be booking profits near the resistance. That could keep the BNB/USDT pair stuck inside the range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) is facing strong resistance at $0.86. A minor positive is that the bulls have not allowed the price to break below the moving averages. This suggests that traders are not rushing to the exit.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/c2c2da12-1250-49a1-8876-8a767bc77b13.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off the moving averages, the bulls will strive to clear the overhead hurdle at $0.86. If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair could rally to $0.91 and thereafter rise toward the psychological level at $1.\par \par \uc2 The rising moving averages and the RSI in the positive territory indicate an advantage to buyers. This positive view will be negated in the short term if the bears sink and sustain the price below the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($0.77).\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is attempting to start a new uptrend. When the bulls pushed the price above the overhead resistance at $1 on March 23, it was the first indication that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/8bf0dd0e-1f2d-4e3f-9fb3-e2761bc4283c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The next level to watch on the upside is $1.26 where the bears will try to stall the relief rally. If the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance, the bears will try to pull the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair to the critical level at $1.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off $1 with strength, it will suggest that the bulls have flipped the level into support. The buyers will then make one more attempt to clear the obstacle at $1.26. If they succeed, the next stop could be $1.60. This positive view will invalidate if the price breaks below $1.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token once again turned down from the overhead resistance at $96 on March 24 suggesting that bears are not willing to give up easily. The price could now slide to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($89).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/4b2e51df-9d68-451b-8d80-49ec4ef76242.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that bulls are defending this level. The buyers will then make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $96. If they succeed, the LUNA/USDT pair could rise to the all-time high at $105.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that traders may be booking profits due to the failure of the pair to rise above $96. The price could then drop to $82 and next to $75.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the 50-day SMA ($93) on March 23. This move also invalidated the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  descending triangle pattern. Strong buying by the bulls has pushed the price to the immediate resistance at $106.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/dab0bdb7-e48e-4849-9546-1ab8242f8c87.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages are about to complete a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the positive territory, which indicates that bulls have the upper hand. If buyers drive the price above $106, the SOL/USDT pair could rally to $122.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level but bounces off the 20-day EMA ($91), it will suggest that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying the dips. That will enhance the prospects of a break above the overhead resistance.\par \par \uc2 A break and close below the 20-day EMA will suggest that the pair may consolidate between $81 and $106 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/beware-the-bitfinex-whale-new-45k-btc-sell-wall-appears-amid-worries-bitcoin-could-retrace"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Beware the Bitfinex whale: New $45K BTC sell wall appears amid worries Bitcoin could retrace}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been trading between the overhead resistance at $92 and the moving averages. This suggests that bears are selling near $92 and bulls are buying on dips to the moving averages.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/49c5c3c9-9627-4b11-9bf8-5d767871c02b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns up from the current level or rebounds off the moving averages, the bulls will again attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $92. If they manage to do that, the AVAX/USDT pair could pick up momentum. The bears may try to stall the rally at the psychological level at $100 but if bulls overcome this barrier, the rally could reach $119.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the short term if the price breaks below the moving averages. Such a move will suggest that the pair may remain range-bound between $92 and $65 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has continued its upward journey, which could reach the overhead resistance at $23. The bears are expected to mount a strong defense at this level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/78a7d40e-1a5c-451f-8b40-fcda484d6b36.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $23 but bulls do not cede ground, it will indicate that traders anticipate a move higher. That will increase the likelihood of a break above $23. If that happens, the DOT/USDT pair could rally to $28 and thereafter to $30.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the bears are active at higher levels. That could keep the pair range-bound between $23 and $16 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 50-day SMA ($0.13) on March 24 but the bulls are struggling to sustain the higher levels. This indicates that the bears are not ready to give up their advantage.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/3be08dfc-5db1-4c81-b908-68c54a35d5d3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($0.12) has started to turn up and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating that bulls have the upper hand. If the price rebounds off the moving averages, the bulls will again try to clear the overhead resistance and push the DOGE/USDT pair toward $0.17.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the breakout on March 24 may have been a bear trap. The sellers will then try to pull the pair to the strong support at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvMDkxNjM3ZDAtOTcwMS00YWI5LWJiZTYtODllODVjYTc1Zjc3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220325ei3p000e3\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Grayscale\par \b \uc2 Crypto Biz: Do you believe in Ethereum killers? Put your money where your mouth is, March 18\u8211\'20\'1324\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Sam Bourgi \par \uc2 836 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Grayscale Investments, a DAO-focused investment fund and \uc2 Qualcomm\uc2  headline this week's Crypto Biz newsletter.\par \par \uc2 While crypto markets are still in a state of \u8220\'20\'1Cfear,\u8221\'20\'1D as evidenced by Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s Fear & Greed Index, the industry as a whole is giving us reasons to be \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Large venture funding rounds, growing adoption of decentralized governance models and new institutional-grade product offerings suggest that crypto is more than just daily chart patterns.\par \par \uc2 This week\u8217\'20\'19s Crypto Biz newsletter looks at a new Grayscale product that\u8217\'20\'19s giving accredited investors more ways to bet on the so-called \u8220\'20\'1CEthereum killers.\u8221\'20\'1D We also document two funding stories and draw your attention to the latest developments surrounding El Salvador\u8217\'20\'19s Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) bond.\par \par \uc2 Grayscale launches smart contract fund for Ethereum competitors\par \par \uc2 Grayscale Investments, the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager, has officially {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-launches-smart-contract-fund-for-ethereum-competitors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 launched its 18th investment produc}}}\uc2  t focused on Ethereum competitors. The Grayscale Smart Contract Platform Ex-Ethereum Fund, also known as GSCPxE, will provide exposure to seven smart contract platforms: Cardano, Solana, Avalanche, Polkadot, Polygon, Algorand and Stellar. These high-profile Ethereum competitors can now be accessed by accredited investors via GSCPxE. While Ethereum remains {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-ethereum-killer-on-chain-data-shows-competitor-networks-are-still-behind"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 king of the decentralized application (DApp) market}}}\uc2 , decentralized finance (DeFi) has become a much more level playing field. Only time will tell whether the aforementioned \u8220\'20\'1CEthereum killers\u8221\'20\'1D will become popular among institutional investors.\par \par \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s a snapshot of Grayscale investment products as of March 21, 2022.\par \par \uc2 Visit our product tracker for daily updates: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/XOE44lKFHm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/XOE44lKFHm}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24AAVE&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $AAVE}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ADA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24AMP&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $AMP}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BAT&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BAT}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BCH&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BCH}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24COMP&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $COMP}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24CRV&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $CRV}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ETH&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ETH}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ETC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ETC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24FIL&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $FIL}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LINK&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LINK}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LPT&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LPT}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LTC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24MANA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $MANA}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24MKR&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $MKR}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SNX&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SNX}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SOL&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SOL}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SUSHI&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SUSHI}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24UNI&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $UNI}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24XLM&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $XLM}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24YFI&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $YFI}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ZEC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ZEC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ZEN&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ZEN}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/Nal3Qg5Mm7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/Nal3Qg5Mm7}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Grayscale (@Grayscale) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Grayscale/status/1506018995337666563?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 March 21, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Former Polychain GP unveils $125M crypto fund with DAO governance ambitions\par \par \uc2 Former Polychain Capital general partner Tekin Salimi has taken a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/former-polychain-gp-unveils-125m-crypto-fund-with-dao-governance-ambitions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 novel approach to fund crypto startups}}}\uc2 . His new fund, dubbed \u8220\'20\'1Cdao5,\u8221\'20\'1D will provide governance tokens to crypto project founders that represent an ownership stake in a future decentralized autonomous organization, better known as DAO. Salimi plans to convert the fund, which is currently valued at $125 million, into a founder-owned DAO around the year 2025. In other words, every grant recipient will have exposure to all other projects in the portfolio \u8212\'20\'14 a feature Salimi says will strengthen the collaboration among project founders. Crypto investors are going to hear a lot more about DAOs in the coming years as more industry leaders look to advance {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-evolution-of-daos-and-why-they-are-expected-to-take-hold-in-2022"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 new models of corporate governance}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 DAOs have multiplied in the last two years empowered by the potential to move the world through democracy. But are they a feasible alternative to the traditional governance models?\par \par \uc2 (Via {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CointelegraphZN?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @CointelegraphZN}}}\uc2  ){\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/w0vdIh0c9n"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/w0vdIh0c9n}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Cointelegraph (@Cointelegraph) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Cointelegraph/status/1499652114401959937?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 March 4, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Chip giant \uc2 Qualcomm\uc2  launches $100M Metaverse fund\par \par \uc2 Semiconductor giant \uc2 Qualcomm\uc2  has made a foray into the Metaverse sector by launching a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/chip-giant-qualcomm-launches-100m-metaverse-fund"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $100 million fund}}}\uc2  that will back projects at the intersection of extended reality (XR), artificial intelligence (AI) and augmented reality (AR). The new fund, dubbed \u8220\'20\'1CSnapDragon Metaverse Fund,\u8221\'20\'1D aims to support developers who are pushing the boundaries of spatial computing. \uc2 Qualcomm\uc2  is positioning itself as the \u8220\'20\'1Cticket to the metaverse\u8221\'20\'1D through its wireless and AI technologies. After {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/breaking-facebook-rebrands-to-meta-as-focus-expands-beyond-social-media"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Facebook rebranded to Meta}}}\uc2  and shifted its focus to the metaverse economy, it was only a matter of time before other major technology plays started following suit.\par \par \uc2 El Salvador postpones Bitcoin bonds to September: Report\par \par \uc2 The government of El Salvador is reportedly {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/el-salvador-postpones-bitcoin-bonds-to-september-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 delaying the issuance of its Bitcoin-backed bonds}}}\uc2  due to unfavorable market conditions brought about by the geopolitical crisis in Eastern Europe. Finance Minister Alejandro Zelaya told local news that the so-called \u8220\'20\'1CVolcano Bond,\u8221\'20\'1D which will be used to fund {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/14-of-salvadoran-businesses-have-transacted-in-btc-chamber-of-commerce"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 El Salvador\u8217\'20\'19s Bitcoin City}}}\uc2 , will be pushed back to September at the latest. If you\u8217\'20\'19re thinking: What does the war in Ukraine have to do with Bitcoin demand? Consider that legacy finance still views crypto as a risk-on asset and traditional investors are more likely to reduce their holdings of such assets during periods of uncertainty. That being said, Bitcoin and the broader crypto markets have held up fairly well amid the geopolitical crisis. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hovers-at-43k-on-wall-street-open-amid-growing-fever-over-terra-s-3b-btc-buy-in"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price breached $43,000}}}\uc2  this week, having recovered more than 30% from its bottom in January.\par \par \uc2 Before you go!\par \par \uc2 Is crypto in a bear market? It depends on how you define it. If digital assets were any other market, we would classify the past four months as a major downtrend. On {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://youtu.be/2nGJnbalmjA"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 The Market Report}}}\uc2  this week, I sat down with fellow analysts Jordan Finneseth, Marcel Pechman and Benton Yuan to discuss the top crypto projects to buy and hold during a bear market. You can check out the full replay below.\par \par \uc2 Crypto Biz is your weekly pulse of the business behind blockchain and crypto delivered directly to your inbox every Thursday.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvNzc0ZDE5YzAtMGQwOS00YTM2LTgxNzUtOTczNmU3YWUxNzM0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220325ei3p000b6\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Beware the \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  whale: New $45K BTC sell wall appears amid worries Bitcoin could retrace\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 510 \uc2 words\par \uc2 25 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin faces new sell-off fears as whales look apt to sour BTC price action.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) was up nearly 5% in 24 hours at the Wall Street open on March 25, but a new warning sign was giving traders cold feet.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/2a31921d-bedd-4c6f-a1e4-b5671cf69d68.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  whale flips to sell mode\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.142027444.742658523.1640948929-762064149.1640948929"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  confirmed BTC/USD hitting multi-week highs of $45,137 on March 25 as Wall Street got underway.\par \par \uc2 As $45,000 reappeared for the first time since the start of the month, however, so did all-too-familiar behavior among some of Bitcoin's biggest investors.\par \par \uc2 Attention turned to exchange \uc2 Bitfinex\uc2  on the day, a platform famous for large-volume traders, or whales, guiding short-term price action with their trades.\par \par \uc2 As noted by popular trader Pentoshi, the entity that had purchased BTC at the last low near $34,000 had now put in a significant ask position beginning at $45,000.\par \par \uc2 The finex whale who made the bottom (same signature) just showed up with a lot of asks presumably to close out those 34k longs. Something to watch in the coming days {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/gDR8qvBVEl"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/gDR8qvBVEl}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Pentoshi (@Pentosh1) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Pentosh1/status/1507360590876090368?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 March 25, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Blockware lead insights analyst William Clemente {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/WClementeIII/status/1507360127178977301"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 agreed}}}\uc2 , telling \uc2 Twitter\uc2  users that it was now "popcorn time" for the market.\par \par \uc2 Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe, meanwhile, flagged "a dozen" possible lower price targets should BTC/USD sweep liquidity at previous rejection points from March, these also lying just above $45,000.\par \par \uc2 "I'm not saying I'm \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  at this stage, but while we're making this build-up, I'm not really interested in longs at this point," he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oa9XD2X8vyA"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  in his latest \uc2 YouTube\uc2  update.\par \par \uc2 Only a rechallenge of $50,000, he added, would form the impetus to consider long positions.\par \par \uc2 "No longs" on Ethereum, says trade\par \par \uc2 Van de Poppe added that altcoins were also on the radar and that it would be interesting to see how Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), in particular, deals with upcoming resistance.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-are-the-btc-price-levels-to-watch-as-bitcoin-nears-march-peak"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 What are the BTC price levels to watch as Bitcoin nears March peak?}}}\par \par \uc2 The top ten cryptocurrencies by market cap showed clear copycat strength on daily timeframes, led by ETH/USD, which matched Bitcoin's 5% gains.\par \par \uc2 Overall still watching how {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Bitcoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Bitcoin}}}\uc2  is going to react at resistance, and especially how {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ETH&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ETH}}}\uc2  will handle it there.\par \par \uc2 Not a long area for me. {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/NalEyg6Jiu"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/NalEyg6Jiu}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe (@CryptoMichNL) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1507333981003554817?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 March 25, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), while dropping several percentage points on the day, was still up 35% compared to the same time last week, making it {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-pares-most-of-its-q1-losses-as-ada-rebounds-60-in-a-month-what-s-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 the top ten's best performer}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-pares-most-of-its-q1-losses-as-ada-rebounds-60-in-a-month-what-s-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/cardano-pares-most-of-its-q1-losses-as-\b  \highlight22ada\b0 \highlight22 -rebounds-60-in-a-month-what-s-next}}}\uc2 .\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/3abcc715-6857-4e1a-a4e5-f0571da47b10.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Coinbase\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvZGExMTJjNzItZmIxNi00OTMyLWE0ODctMDUwNGFkY2ZhYmE3LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220325ei3p0008d\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Crypto rallies to $2T market cap as institutions signal readiness to enter\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Sam Bourgi \par \uc2 511 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 After months of downward price action, Bitcoin and the broader crypto markets are showing signs of life again.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and the broader cryptocurrency market rallied on Thursday, as the total value of digital assets crossed $2 trillion for the first time in over three weeks amid signs of a clear shift in market sentiment \u8212\'20\'14 headlined by \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2 , no less.\par \par \uc2 BTC price printed an intraday high of $44,253, having gained more than 3% during the session, according to data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://subscriptions.cointelegraph.com/signup/?via=markets&_ga=2.240118721.390825259.1639680713-68533732.1612103760"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2 . The largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization has now {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dives-below-33k-to-fill-futures-gap-amid-record-btc-hodling"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recovered over 33% from its January low}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dives-below-33k-to-fill-futures-gap-amid-record-btc-hodling"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dives-below-33k-to-fill-futures-gap-amid-record-btc-hodling}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The total crypto market cap has gained over 7% since Monday to reach nearly $2.1 trillion, according to Coingecko data. The market capitalization figure also reached $2 trillion on CoinMarketCap.\par \par \uc2 While not \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s Fear & Greed Index has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://alternative.me/crypto/fear-and-greed-index/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 escaped}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme fear\u8221\'20\'1D and is now in the \u8220\'20\'1Cfear\u8221\'20\'1D stage with a reading of 40. The \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and sentiment indicator is based on a scale of 0 to 100 with higher readings corresponding to a more \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for BTC.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/bc0f2e63-bdcd-464a-88d3-ff915721e931.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s Fear & Greed Index remains an important proxy for overall market conditions. Source: Alternative.me\par \par \uc2 The crypto market\u8217\'20\'19s apparent shift in sentiment follows months of downward price action for Bitcoin and altcoins, which led some investors to speculate about the possibility of a full-fledged bear market. Amid geopolitical unrest, however, members of the legacy finance community have identified crypto as a potential opportunity.\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph reported, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/digital-currencies-could-get-a-boost-from-the-international-crisis-blackrock-ceo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BlackRock CEO Larry Fink}}}\uc2  said the war in Ukraine could force nations to reevaluate their currency dependencies, potentially paving the way for digital assets. Specifically, the \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  CEO touted cryptocurrencies as a viable tool for international settlements and transactions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-ceo-bitcoin-has-caught-our-attention"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto has been on Fink\u8217\'20\'19s radar}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-ceo-bitcoin-has-caught-our-attention"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-ceo-bitcoin-has-caught-our-attention}}}\uc2  since at least the fourth quarter of 2020.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/goldman-sachs-is-hooking-up-clients-with-galaxy-digital-s-eth-fund"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 multinational investment bank Goldman Sachs}}}\uc2  appears to have put crypto on its radar and even redesigned its website\u8217\'20\'19s homepage to reflect the growth of digital assets and the metaverse. Referring to these technologies as \u8220\'20\'1Cmegatrends,\u8221\'20\'1D Goldman populated a new \u8220\'20\'1CInsights\u8221\'20\'1D section of its website with previously released reports on gaming, the metaverse and Web3.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/66fc83a0-e0f8-4f05-92d4-15cfdd3debc9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2 ' homepage on March 24, 2022.\par \par \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  recently completed its first over-the-counter crypto options trade with Galaxy Digital. The investment bank first launched its Bitcoin futures product for CME in June 2021.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-investment-bank-cowen-launches-dedicated-crypto-division"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 US investment bank Cowen launches dedicated crypto division}}}\par \par \uc2 Finally, Grayscale Investments recently announced the launch of a new {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-launches-smart-contract-fund-for-ethereum-competitors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 smart contract fund}}}\uc2  that allows accredited investors to back Ethereum competitors. The new fund, which has already opened for daily subscriptions, provides exposure to Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ), Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ), Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ), Algorand (ALGO) and Stellar ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvZTMyMjViYmEtNTE1MS00NzgyLWEzZDAtYzFkNjE4Njc2OWMwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220325ei3o0000a\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Crypto rallies to $2T market cap as institutions signal readiness to enter\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Sam Bourgi \par \uc2 511 \uc2 words\par \uc2 24 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 After months of downward price action, Bitcoin and the broader crypto markets are showing signs of life again.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and the broader cryptocurrency market rallied on Thursday, as the total value of digital assets crossed $2 trillion for the first time in over three weeks amid signs of a clear shift in market sentiment \u8212\'20\'14 headlined by \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2 , no less.\par \par \uc2 BTC printed an intraday high of $44,253, having gained more than 3% during the session, according to data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://subscriptions.cointelegraph.com/signup/?via=markets&_ga=2.240118721.390825259.1639680713-68533732.1612103760"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2 . The largest cryptocurrency by market capitalization has now {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dives-below-33k-to-fill-futures-gap-amid-record-btc-hodling"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 recovered over 33% from its January low}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dives-below-33k-to-fill-futures-gap-amid-record-btc-hodling"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-dives-below-33k-to-fill-futures-gap-amid-record-btc-hodling}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The total crypto market cap has gained over 7% since Monday to reach nearly $2.1 trillion, according to Coingecko data. The market capitalization figure also reached $2 trillion on CoinMarketCap.\par \par \uc2 While not \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s Fear & Greed Index has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://alternative.me/crypto/fear-and-greed-index/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 escaped}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Cextreme fear\u8221\'20\'1D and is now in the \u8220\'20\'1Cfear\u8221\'20\'1D stage with a reading of 40. The \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  and sentiment indicator is based on a scale of 0 to 100 with higher readings corresponding to a more \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook for BTC.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/bc0f2e63-bdcd-464a-88d3-ff915721e931.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s Fear & Greed Index remains an important proxy for overall market conditions. Source: Alternative.me\par \par \uc2 The crypto market\u8217\'20\'19s apparent shift in sentiment follows months of downward price action for Bitcoin and altcoins, which led some investors to speculate about the possibility of a full-fledged bear market. Amid geopolitical unrest, however, members of the legacy finance community have identified crypto as a potential opportunity.\par \par \uc2 As Cointelegraph reported, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/digital-currencies-could-get-a-boost-from-the-international-crisis-blackrock-ceo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BlackRock CEO Larry Fink}}}\uc2  said the war in Ukraine could force nations to reevaluate their currency dependencies, potentially paving the way for digital assets. Specifically, the \uc2 BlackRock\uc2  CEO touted digital assets as a viable tool for international settlements and transactions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-ceo-bitcoin-has-caught-our-attention"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto has been on Fink\u8217\'20\'19s radar}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-ceo-bitcoin-has-caught-our-attention"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/blackrock-ceo-bitcoin-has-caught-our-attention}}}\uc2  since at least the fourth quarter of 2020.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/goldman-sachs-is-hooking-up-clients-with-galaxy-digital-s-eth-fund"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 multinational investment bank Goldman Sachs}}}\uc2  appears to have put crypto on its radar and even redesigned its website\u8217\'20\'19s homepage to reflect the growth of digital assets and the metaverse. Referring to these technologies as \u8220\'20\'1Cmegatrends,\u8221\'20\'1D Goldman populated a new \u8220\'20\'1CInsights\u8221\'20\'1D section of its website with previously released reports on gaming, the metaverse and Web3.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/66fc83a0-e0f8-4f05-92d4-15cfdd3debc9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2 ' homepage on March 24, 2022.\par \par \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  recently completed its first over-the-counter crypto options trade with Galaxy Digital. The investment bank first launched its Bitcoin futures product for CME in June 2021.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/us-investment-bank-cowen-launches-dedicated-crypto-division"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 US investment bank Cowen launches dedicated crypto division}}}\par \par \uc2 Finally, Grayscale Investments recently announced the launch of a new {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/grayscale-launches-smart-contract-fund-for-ethereum-competitors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 smart contract fund}}}\uc2  that allows accredited investors to back Ethereum competitors. The new fund, which has already opened for daily subscriptions, provides exposure to Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ), Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ), Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ), Algorand (ALGO) and Stellar ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvZTMyMjViYmEtNTE1MS00NzgyLWEzZDAtYzFkNjE4Njc2OWMwLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220324ei3o000dz\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/23: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, LUNA,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , SOL, AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,799 \uc2 words\par \uc2 23 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and select altcoins are likely to resume their relief rally after a small pause.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and select altcoins broke above their immediate resistance levels but are struggling to sustain the higher levels, indicating that bears are not ready to give up.\par \par \uc2 It is speculated that the spike in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s price on March 22 may have been caused by reports that Terra had sent 125 million USDT to Binance on March 21.\par \par \uc2 This could be the beginning of the proposed {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-hovers-at-43k-on-wall-street-open-amid-growing-fever-over-terra-s-3b-btc-buy-in"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $3 billion worth of Bitcoin}}}\uc2  that the firm plans to purchase. Terra has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/terra-may-be-about-to-repeat-125m-btc-buy-that-sparked-bitcoin-s-run-to-43-3k"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 undertaken another identical transaction}}}\uc2  on March 23, which could boost sentiment in the near term.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/fbacadf3-e767-41d8-9eb4-a03c000912ad.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 While this news could provide a short-term spike, it is unlikely to alter the main trend. Bitcoin remains strongly correlated with the S&P 500, which rallied sharply between March 15 to 22. Crypto traders are likely to take cues from the performance of the S&P 500 in the next few days.\par \par \uc2 Could bulls clear the overhead hurdle and start an up-move in Bitcoin and select altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke above the immediate resistance at $42,594 on March 22 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that bears continue to defend this level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/ba8bb101-1524-473c-899a-1efb802d88a2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive is that the bulls did not give up much ground from the overhead resistance on March 23. This suggests that traders are not closing their position near the resistance as they anticipate the up-move to continue.\par \par \uc2 If buyers push and sustain the price above $42,594, the BTC/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally to $45,400 where the bears may again mount a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages. If that happens, the pair could extend its stay inside the $37,000 to $42,594 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke above the psychological level at $3,000 and reached near the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle on March 22. The long wick on the candlestick indicates that bears are defending the resistance line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/02e78698-0ff4-4886-92f6-a2b892d8e4e4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now attempt to pull the price down to the moving averages. If the price rebounds off this support, it will increase the possibility of a break above the triangle. If that happens, the ETH/USDT pair could start a new up-move. The pair could first rally to $3,500 and then march toward the pattern target at $3,907.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated in the short term if the price breaks below the moving averages. Such a move will indicate that the pair may spend some more time inside the triangle.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  bounced off the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($389) on March 21, indicating buying on dips. The bulls pushed the price above the overhead resistance at $407 on March 22 but could not sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/d9bc954d-884e-45fb-ae73-1f20f38d27c2.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has started to turn up gradually and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating advantage to buyers. The bulls will try to push and sustain the price above the $407 to $410 resistance zone. If they manage to do that, the BNB/USDT pair could attempt a rally to $445.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level, the pair could drop to the moving averages. This is an important support to watch out for because if the bears pull the price below the moving averages, the pair could decline toward $350.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price rebounds off the moving averages, it will suggest that bulls are accumulating at lower levels. The buyers will then again attempt to push the pair to $445.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the downtrend line on March 21 but the bulls are finding it difficult to continue the up-move. This indicates that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/e0738250-7b97-40a8-8c45-1788dcbdb612.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has turned down and the bears are attempting to pull the XRP/USDT pair below the downtrend line. If they manage to do that, the pair could drop to the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off the moving averages will suggest that traders continue to buy at lower levels. The bulls will then again try to push the price toward $0.91.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price breaks below the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($0.76), it will suggest that the break above the downtrend line may have been a bull trap. The pair could then decline to $0.68.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token rose above the overhead resistance at $96 on March 21 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. This suggests that bears are defending this level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/84ea4cd6-a1aa-4471-9efc-74134559d80d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 However, a positive sign is that the bulls have not given up much ground from the resistance. This indicates that traders are not closing their positions in a hurry as they anticipate a move higher.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks and closes above $96, the LUNA/USDT pair could rally to the all-time high at $105. A break and close above this level could indicate the resumption of the uptrend.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the short term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA ($88). The pair could then decline to $82 and later to $75.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) broke above the 50-day SMA ($0.94) on March 22 and reached the overhead resistance at $1. Strong buying on March 23 has pushed the price above the overhead resistance, signaling that the downtrend may be ending.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/d2c6a7fe-1be7-44d6-8a74-3a89d9a60050.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls sustain the price above $1, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could further pick up momentum. The pair could then rally to $1.26. The bears may pose a strong challenge at this level but if bulls overcome this resistance, the pair could extend its rally to $1.60.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and slides below $1, it will suggest that bears continue to sell aggressively at higher levels. The pair could then drop to the 20-day EMA ($0.89), which is an important level to keep an eye on.\par \par \uc2 A strong rebound off this level could suggest that bulls are accumulating on dips while a break below the 20-day EMA will indicate that the break above $1 may have been a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been sandwiched between the moving averages for the past few days. The bears are selling near the 50-day SMA ($93) while the bulls are buying at the 20-day EMA ($88).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/e3eb0bcd-c127-42bd-8257-cf28628d4421.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This tight range trading is unlikely to continue for long. If bulls propel and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA, the descending triangle pattern will be invalidated. That could attract buying and the SOL/USDT pair may rally to the overhead resistance at $122.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to pull the price to the strong support zone at $81 to $77. A break below this zone will complete the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  setup, indicating the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/internet-computer-eyes-50-move-as-icp-enters-falling-wedge-breakout-territory"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Internet Computer eyes 50% move as ICP enters 'falling wedge' breakout territory}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been sustaining above the descending channel for the past few days but the bulls have not been able to resume the up-move by pushing the price above $93. This indicates selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/f57be4f9-91fd-4f22-a63e-bcd84f41c5a4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks below the moving averages, the bears could pull the AVAX/USDT pair to the uptrend line. Such a move will indicate that the break above the channel may have been a bull trap.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the current level, it will suggest that bulls continue to buy on dips. The bulls will then again try to clear the hurdle at $93 and push the pair to the psychological level at $100. A break and close above this level could indicate the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the moving averages and closed above the overhead resistance zone at $19 to $20 on March 22. This suggests that the bulls are attempting a comeback.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/23b68360-bcd4-4bba-82fb-e4e889be7c7d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOT/USDT pair could now rally to the overhead resistance at $23 where the bears may mount a strong defense. If the price turns down from $23, the pair could drop to the moving averages and consolidate in a range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 If bulls push and sustain the price above $23, the pair could pick up momentum and rally toward $30. Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages, the pair could slide to the strong support at $16.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) has been hovering near the 20-day EMA ($0.12) for the past few days, indicating a tough tussle between the bulls and the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/ee526915-fec9-4faf-bbfd-1e5fbd21de64.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish 20-day EMA and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. This balance could tilt in favor of the buyers if they can push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.13). Such a move will signal a likely change in trend and clear the path for a potential rally to $0.17.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the current level or the 50-day SMA and breaks below the March 20 intraday low, the DOGE/USDT pair could drop to the strong support at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvYzIzODk2NTgtNmI0ZC00ZmM2LThhYzUtY2IwNDQ4NDNmMDdkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220323ei3n000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Smart Contracts\par \b \uc2 Grayscale launches smart contract fund for Ethereum competitors\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Sam Bourgi \par \uc2 381 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Investors' appetite for Ethereum competitors is growing.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager Grayscale Investments has unveiled a new cryptocurrency fund dedicated to smart contract platforms excluding Ethereum, underscoring growing investor appetite for alternative blockchain networks.\par \par \uc2 The Grayscale Smart Contract Platform Ex-Ethereum Fund, also known by the ticker symbol GSCPxE, is the company\u8217\'20\'19s 18th investment product. The fund will {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.globenewswire.com/en/news-release/2022/03/22/2407606/0/en/Grayscale-Investments-Launches-Smart-Contract-Platform-Fund.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 provide}}}\uc2  exposure to seven smart contract platforms at the following weightings:\par \par \uc2 * Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ): 24.63%\par \par \uc2 * Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ): 24.27%\par \par \uc2 * Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ): 16.96%\par \par \uc2 * Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ): 16.16%\par \par \uc2 * Polygon ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polygon-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 MATIC}}}\uc2  ): 9.65%\par \par \uc2 * Algorand (ALGO): 4.27%\par \par \uc2 * Stellar ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/stellar-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XLM}}}\uc2  ): 4.06%\par \par \uc2 Grayscale said the new fund is now open for daily subscription by accredited investors.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum\u8217\'20\'19s dominance as the premier smart contract platform is being challenged by competitors that claim to offer superior transaction speeds, lower costs and higher throughput capacity. While Ethereum continues to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/what-ethereum-killer-on-chain-data-shows-competitor-networks-are-still-behind"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dominate the decentralized application space}}}\uc2 , the DeFi industry is becoming a more level playing field. Currently, Ethereum accounts for just over 55.4% of the total value locked on DeFi protocols, down from over 96% in January 2021, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://defillama.com/chains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according}}}\uc2  to DeFi Llama.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/306f21a1-4fe1-4cef-91c9-1eb2e32dac43.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Ethereum remains the largest DeFi platform by total value locked, but its dominance has eroded over the past year. Source: DeFi Llama\par \par \uc2 Grayscale is by far the world\u8217\'20\'19s largest \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  manager with over $36 billion in assets under management as of March 22. Assets under management {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dropgold-worked-grayscale-flippens-world-s-largest-gold-fund-as-aum-hits-60b"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reached north of $60 billion}}}\uc2  in November 2021 during the height of Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) record-breaking rally.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/dcg-announces-250m-share-repurchase-for-grayscale-products"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DCG announces $250M share repurchase for Grayscale products}}}\par \par \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s a snapshot of Grayscale investment products as of March 21, 2022.\par \par \uc2 Visit our product tracker for daily updates: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/XOE44lKFHm"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/XOE44lKFHm}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24AAVE&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $AAVE}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ADA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $\b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24AMP&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $AMP}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BAT&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BAT}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BCH&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BCH}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24COMP&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $COMP}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24CRV&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $CRV}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ETH&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ETH}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ETC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ETC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24FIL&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $FIL}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LINK&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LINK}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LPT&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LPT}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24LTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $LTC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24MANA&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $MANA}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24MKR&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $MKR}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SNX&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SNX}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SOL&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SOL}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24SUSHI&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $SUSHI}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24UNI&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $UNI}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24XLM&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $XLM}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24YFI&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $YFI}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ZEC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ZEC}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24ZEN&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $ZEN}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/Nal3Qg5Mm7"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/Nal3Qg5Mm7}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Grayscale (@Grayscale) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Grayscale/status/1506018995337666563?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 March 21, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 Grayscale Bitcoin Trust\uc2 , also known as GBTC, is the largest offering with over $26.4 billion in assets. As Cointelegraph reported, institutional investors have {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/institutions-increase-exposure-to-grayscale-bitcoin-trust-as-gbtc-discount-nears-30"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increased their exposure to GBTC}}}\uc2  in recent months as its discount to Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s spot price widened.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvZDIyMmU5ZDgtZTJkYy00MTQ2LTgzMjMtNDAyM2E3MWYwNWE4LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220322ei3m0008d\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin hits 3-week high as fresh impulse move sends BTC price to $43.3K\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 522 \uc2 words\par \uc2 22 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC price action emboldens Bitcoin bulls while Ethereum recrosses $3,000.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) saw a fresh impulse move overnight into March 22 as bulls briefly reclaimed $43,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/9a70613a-b7db-469e-8c1f-650351666a0e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 RSI hints at underlying strength\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.142027444.742658523.1640948929-762064149.1640948929"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD reaching $43,337 on \uc2 Bitstamp\uc2  Tuesday, the pair's highest since March 3.\par \par \uc2 The action contrasted with the lack of \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  since the weekend, and neatly fitted with the more \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  predictions surrounding near-term trajectory.\par \par \uc2 For popular trader Crypto Ed, who had previously given $43,000 as a low-timeframe target, all was going to plan.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/BTC?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #BTC}}}\par \par \uc2 Been showing red box at $43k for a couple of days now....\par \par \uc2 Imagine not watching my YT videos.....\par \par \uc2 No need at all to listen to dudes, who like to hear talking themselves for >20mins.\par \par \uc2 All you need to know in 3 minutes! {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/nsWHyUMaYI"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/nsWHyUMaYI}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/sj94yjuzhd"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/sj94yjuzhd}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Ed_NL (@Crypto_Ed_NL) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Crypto_Ed_NL/status/1506136071012335616?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 March 22, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Fellow analyst Matthew Hyland meanwhile {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MatthewHyland_/status/1506148978861264899"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 eyed}}}\uc2  a potential breakout scenario for Bitcoin's relative strength index (RSI) on the daily chart \u8212\'20\'14 a phenomenon which has often preceded price strength.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/d57a8273-7a30-4fee-9c32-ea9d09c70387.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-day chart (\uc2 Coinbase\uc2 ) with RSI. Source: Matthew Hyland/ Twitter\par \par \uc2 "BTC is a few hundred bucks away from the first higher high we've seen in a long time. Will it happen?" crypto market analyst Kevin Svenson {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/KevinSvenson_/status/1506109694368268291"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 added}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin had already sealed an impressive weekly close Sunday, its highest since early February, and now, macro cues were adding to the positive momentum once again.\par \par \uc2 Trading was brisk for Asian markets on the day, the Hong Kong Hang Seng index up 3.15% at the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 Asia unironically max bidding {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/search?q=%24BTC&src=ctag&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $BTC}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Zhu Su (@zhusu) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/zhusu/status/1506107460876087297?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 March 22, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 In Europe, however, there was little sign of a knock-on impact, while U.S. futures were likewise trending down prior to the Wall Street open.\par \par \uc2 The push higher nonetheless did manage to squeeze out some short positions across cryptocurrency, as evidenced by data from on-chain monitoring resource {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coinglass.com/LiquidationData"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coinglass}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Total 24-hour liquidations stood at $168 million at the time of writing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/c2aa1417-dd14-4e6d-8fe4-59704563b18a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto liquidations chart. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 Ethereum returns to $3,000 in altcoin copycat rally\par \par \uc2 On altcoins, the picture likewise turned more rosy overnight.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-3-21-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-luna-sol-ada-avax-dot-doge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 3/21: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, LUNA, SOL, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, DOT, DOGE}}}\par \par \uc2 The top ten cryptocurrencies by market cap were led by Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), which was 5.8% up in 24 hours to cap weekly gains nearing 20%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/7e3d5ebd-db85-45a5-b6b3-746ff592d967.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USD 1-day candle chart (\uc2 Coinbase\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Other major tokens fared almost as well, including Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), the largest altcoin, tapped $3,000 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ether-bulls-eye-resistance-at-3k-as-the-network-prepares-to-undergo-the-merge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 in step with Bitcoin's rally}}}\uc2  before consolidating immediately under that psychologically significant level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/c7b393ce-d2f7-4a26-9c77-3f9e03a004ee.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvOTBiYmMzNDItNGE5Zi00MDUwLWFjNDktZDNiMThjNDRhNmVmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220322ei3m0002v\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 2 metrics signal traders do not expect $2T crypto market cap anytime soon\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Marcel Pechman \par \uc2 680 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The psychological $2 trillion crypto market cap threshold appears to be elusive for now, according to futures premiums and stablecoin demand.\par \par \uc2 Cryptocurrencies failed to break the 42-day long downtrend after the $1.95-trillion capitalization resistance was rejected on March 20. Even though Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) gained a modest 3.7% over the past seven days, altcoins presented a robust rally.\par \par \uc2 Crypto markets\u8217\'20\'19 aggregate capitalization showed a 6.2% increase to $1.92 trillion between March 14 and 21. Such performance was positively impacted by Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) 14% gains, Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) increasing 13%, and Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) gaining 10%.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/0c4d14ba-09e1-4ef5-b5e6-0af2850d4f96.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Total crypto market cap, USD billion. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 While those assets were not the biggest weekly gains among the top 80 coins, Ether may have fueled investors\u8217\'20\'19 expectations after Glassnode\u8217\'20\'19s on-chain data showed that ETH balances on crypto exchanges {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-balance-on-crypto-exchanges-falls-to-lowest-levels-since-2018"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reached their lowest levels since 2018}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Comparing the winners and losers provides skewed results, as only two names presented negative performances over the past seven days:\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/aadd93e7-731d-43d8-9718-62d89c769532.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Weekly winners and losers among the top 80 coins. Source: Nomics\par \par \uc2 Ethereum Classic ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/etc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETC}}}\uc2  ) rallied 51% after the HebeSwap decentralized exchange application {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/BlockHebe/status/1505199341648359427"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 surpassed}}}\uc2  $290 million in total value locked. With liquidity pools growing on the protocol, Ethereum Classic appears to have a decentralized finance hub of its own.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/aave-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Aave}}}\uc2  gained 35% following its {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/aave-launches-v3-liquidity-pool-following-unanimous-governance-decision"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 v3 liquidity pool upgrade}}}\uc2  on March 16, adding cross-chain asset functionality, a community contribution tool, and a gas optimization model. Several wallet-based decentralized applications will be integrated, including Instadapp, DeBank, 1inch, ParaSwap, Zapper, DeFi Saver, Zerion and more.\par \par \uc2 Kusama (KSM) gained 31% after Parity Technology confirmed that it would {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/kusamanetwork/status/1504919344177946627"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 enable}}}\uc2  parachain (sidechain) swaps on the upcoming 0.9.18 release. Moreover, Manta Network\u8217\'20\'19s on-chain privacy Dolphin Testnet {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MantaNetwork/status/1503482583014858764"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 reached}}}\uc2  30,000 transactions on March 14.\par \par \uc2 Tether premium shows slight discomfort\par \par \uc2 The OKX Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) premium is a good gauge of China-based retail trader crypto demand. It measures the difference between China-based peer-to-peer trades and the United States dollar.\par \par \uc2 Excessive buying demand tends to pressure the indicator above fair value at 100%, and during \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets, Tether\u8217\'20\'19s market offer is flooded, causing a 4% or higher discount.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/88babaf8-517c-4c91-80e9-f169e16b116c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Tether (USDT) peer-to-peer vs. USD/CNY. Source: OKX\par \par \uc2 Currently, the Tether premium stands at 99.9%, its lowest level since March 3. While distant from retail panic selling, the indicator showed a modest deterioration over the past week.\par \par \uc2 Still, weaker retail demand is not worrisome, as it partially reflects the total cryptocurrency capitalization, which is down 46% year-to-date.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/no-more-4-year-cycles-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \u8216\'20\'18No more 4-year cycles\u8217\'20\'19 \u8212\'20\'14 5 things to know in Bitcoin this week}}}\par \par \uc2 Futures markets show mixed sentiment\par \par \uc2 Perpetual contracts, also known as inverse swaps, have an embedded rate usually charged every eight hours. Exchanges use this fee to avoid exchange risk imbalances.\par \par \uc2 A positive funding rate indicates that longs (buyers) demand more leverage. However, the opposite situation occurs when shorts (sellers) require additional leverage, causing the funding rate to turn negative.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/9c54723a-f38a-47e0-af13-3d6d0addd4d1.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Accumulated perpetual futures funding rate on March 21. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 As depicted above, the accumulated seven-day funding rate is slightly positive for Bitcoin and Ether. This data indicates slightly higher demand from longs (buyers), but it is insignificant. For example, Solana\u8217\'20\'19s positive 0.20% weekly rate equals 0.8% per month, which should not be a concern for most futures traders.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, both Terra ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  ) and Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) futures showed slightly more demand from shorts (sellers). Thus, the absence of Tether demand in Asia and mixed perpetual contract premiums signal a lack of confidence from traders despite the recent price gains.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/noshitcoins"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 author}}}\uc2  and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvYTA3NzI5NGUtOWNjZC00Yzk3LTg2NmQtNDI3NDg0YWUzYmY5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220321ei3l0008j\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/21: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, LUNA, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,806 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is attempting to stay above $40,000 and that has kept the buying interest alive in select altcoins.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) and most major altcoins are attempting to start the new week on a positive note by bouncing off their respective support levels.\par \par \uc2 Goldman Sachs\uc2  became one of the first major banks in the United States to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/goldman-sachs-completes-first-otc-crypto-options-trade-with-galaxy"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 complete an over-the-counter}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1Ccash-settled cryptocurrency options trade\u8221\'20\'1D with the trading unit of Michael Novogratz\u8217\'20\'19s Galaxy Digital. This could encourage other major banks to consider offering OTC transactions for cryptocurrencies.\par \par \uc2 It is not only select nations that are showing growth in \b \highlight22\uc2 crypto adoption\b0 \highlight\uc2 . A report by cryptocurrency exchange KuCoin shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-users-in-africa-grew-by-2-500-in-2021-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto transactions in Africa have soared}}}\uc2  by about 2,670% in 2022. Bitcoin Senegal founder Nourou believes that Africa could continue its thousand-plus percent growth rates in the next few years.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/9969eca5-ed48-4f2c-aa53-a8c28c7c2edb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Analyst Willy Woo speculated that Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s four-year price cycle, based on the block subsidy halving, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/no-more-4-year-cycles-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 may not work as a predictive tool}}}\uc2  in the future as the price action is likely to be determined by supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins climb above their overhead resistance levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin is facing stiff resistance at $42,594, indicating that bears continue to sell at higher levels. The bears are attempting to pull the price below the moving averages while the bulls are trying to sustain the price above it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/3c588dc9-6cae-4207-a02b-d5c067f2c361.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out and the relative strength index (RSI) is near the midpoint, suggesting a balance between supply and demand. If the price slips below the moving averages, the BTC/USDT pair could drop to $37,000. Such a move will suggest that the pair could spend some more time inside the $42,594 to $37,000 range.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the moving averages with strength, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying on minor dips. That may improve the prospects of a break above $42,594. If the price sustains above this resistance, the pair could rally to the overhead zone between $45,400 and the resistance line of the ascending channel.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the overhead resistance at $3,000 on March 19 but the bears could not pull the price below the moving averages on March 20. This suggests that bulls are buying on minor dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/a0e3b210-d3d6-4b23-a153-6abeac706f19.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will attempt to push the price above $3,000 and challenge the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle. This is an important level to watch out for because a break and close above it will signal a possible change in trend. The ETH/USDT pair could then rally to $3,500.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from $3,000 or the resistance line of the triangle and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair may extend its stay inside the triangle for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  broke and closed above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($390) on March 17 but the bulls could not build upon this advantage. The long wick on the March 19 candlestick indicates selling at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/5a9fb5fe-1701-411f-91a0-c06335a970e7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The BNB/USDT pair turned down and dipped to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($386) on March 20. A minor positive is that the bulls have not allowed the price to slip below this level. This indicates that bulls are buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 If the price rises and breaks above $407, the up-move may continue and the pair could rally to $425. This level may act as a barrier but if crossed, the next stop could be $445.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest a lack of demand at higher levels. The pair could then slide toward $350.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 20-day EMA ($0.77) on March 18 and reached the downtrend line on March 19. The bears again defended this level but could not pull the price below the 20-day EMA. This suggests strong buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/6cb38c7d-4a09-494d-91cc-15b460ff93f8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have started to turn up and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par \uc2 If bulls push and sustain the price above the downtrend line, the buying could pick up further and the XRP/USDT pair may rally to $0.91. If this level is also conquered, the next stop could be the psychological barrier at $1.\par \par \uc2 The bears will have to pull and sustain the price below the 50-day SMA ($0.75) to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/terra-price-signal-that-preceded-an-80-luna-rally-is-back"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 bounced off the 20-day EMA ($86)}}}\uc2  on March 18, indicating that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/d20da6bf-7a74-4403-98ae-5097d4e1e6f7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers have pushed the price to the stiff overhead resistance at $96 where the bears are mounting a strong defense.\par \par \uc2 If bulls overcome this hurdle, the LUNA/USDT pair could retest the all-time high at $105. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above this level to signal the resumption of the uptrend. The rising 20-day EMA and the RSI in the positive territory indicate advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, several short-term traders may close their position. The pair could then drop to the strong support at $70.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) attempted to break above the downtrend line on March 19 but the bears had other plans. They defended the level and pulled the price down to the 20-day EMA ($87) on March 20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/47ebe211-1c4e-41ae-a6eb-ef5ba9146f5e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers have successfully defended the 20-day EMA and will again attempt to push the price above the downtrend line.\par \par \uc2 If they manage to do that, the descending triangle pattern will be invalidated. The failure of a negative setup is a positive sign as it traps several bears who may have sold in anticipation of a breakdown. The SOL/USDT pair could then attempt a rally to $106 and later to $120.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest strong selling at higher levels. The pair could then gradually dip to the support at $81.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($0.86) on March 19 and the bulls held off attempts by the bears to pull the price back below the level on March 20. This suggests that the buyers are attempting to start a relief rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/fe771ee0-d42f-4d75-b2e5-6ca5caf4ed58.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to push and sustain the price above the overhead resistance at $1. If they succeed, it will suggest a possible change in trend. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then rally to the next overhead resistance at $1.26.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level or the overhead resistance and breaks below the 20-day EMA, it will suggest that the pair may remain range-bound between $1 and $0.74 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-could-easily-see-30k-with-stocks-due-30-drawdown-in-2022-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin 'could easily see $30K' with stocks due 30% drawdown in 2022 \u8212\'20\'14 analyst}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) closed above the descending channel on March 18 and the bulls successfully defended the breakout level on March 20 and 21.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/1054217d-4530-4d17-a7fd-82d0c4db0b50.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA ($78) has turned up and the RSI has jumped into the positive territory, indicating advantage to buyers.\par \par \uc2 If bulls drive and sustain the price above $93, the AVAX/USDT pair could rally to the psychological level at $100. The bears may attempt to stall the rally at this level but if bulls do not give up much ground, the likelihood of a break above it increases.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will be negated if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the moving averages.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the overhead resistance at $19 on March 19 but the bulls could not build upon this advantage. The bears used this opportunity and pulled the price back below $19 on March 20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/b481ef3d-f95b-4d07-8307-1e4c95f25aa9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A minor positive is that the bulls have not allowed the price to break below the moving averages. The flattish moving averages and the RSI just above the midpoint suggest that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 If the price rises from the current level, the bulls will attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $20. If they manage to do that, the DOT/USDT pair could rally to $23 where the bears may again pose a strong challenge.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate in the short term if the price breaks and sustains below the 20-day EMA ($18). That could open the doors for a possible drop to $16.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the 20-day EMA ($0.12) on March 19 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. The bears pulled the price back below the 20-day EMA on March 20.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/152e96b6-c090-4fc8-b945-b17eb4ae199a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA is flattening out and the RSI is just below the midpoint, indicating that the selling pressure could be reducing. If buyers push and sustain the price above the 20-day EMA, the DOGE/USDT pair could rally to the 50-day SMA ($0.13). The bulls will have to clear this hurdle to open the doors for a possible rally to $0.17.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down from the current level and closes below the intraday low formed on March 20, the pair could drop to the strong support at $0.10.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvMjVkNTQ1MzMtYmYxYS00ZWYzLWE2NTgtZDBiZGU5ZDA4MWM0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220321ei3l0008n\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Technology\par \b \uc2 Luna token price is soaring, but is the network's growth sustainable?\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Shiraz Jagati \par \uc2 1,650 \uc2 words\par \uc2 21 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 It stands to reason that the best way for the sector to grow is through continued maturity.\par \par \uc2 Terra, an open-source blockchain platform for algorithmic stablecoins, has been on fire over the last half-year or so. The value of its native crypto asset Terra ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/coin/terra-luna"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  ) has risen from $24 to over $100 during the last six months, placing it in the top 10 cryptocurrencies by market capitalization.\par \par \uc2 And, even though LUNA has showcased minor corrections here and there, the currency and the Terra project, in general, have continued to grow from strength to strength. To this point, on March 4, LUNA flipped Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) in terms of total staked value, with $29.5 billion worth of {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/terra-s-luna-flips-ethereum-becoming-second-largest-network-for-staked-value"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA being locked up within the platform}}}\uc2  compared to ETH\u8217\'20\'19s $25.9 billion.\par \par \uc2 Furthermore, Terra\u8217\'20\'19s native data show that the ecosystem currently has over 230,000 stakers, making it the second-most staked crypto asset with more than four times the number of those staking ETH at 54,768. Lastly, in terms of its annual staking rewards, LUNA touts an average annual yield of around 6.62%, while ETH fetches 4.81%.\par \par \uc2 With LUNA up over 350% in the last 12 months, a number of pundits have continued to claim that Terra\u8217\'20\'19s aforementioned growth may not be sustainable. In fact, individuals associated with the ecosystem \u8212\'20\'14 both for and against \u8212\'20\'14 have placed massive bets in regard to where LUNA will be trading around this time next year.\par \par \uc2 The $1 million bet that has the Terra community buzzing\par \par \uc2 With LUNA up over 350% in the last 12 months, a number of pundits have continued to claim that Terra\u8217\'20\'19s aforementioned growth may not be sustainable. In fact, individuals associated with the ecosystem \u8212\'20\'14 both for and against \u8212\'20\'14 have placed massive bets in regard to where LUNA will be trading around this time next year.\par \par \uc2 Pseudonymous crypto trader \u8220\'20\'1CSensei Algod\u8221\'20\'1D is so \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Terra\u8217\'20\'19s token that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/AlgodTrading/status/1503103705939423234"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 he recently wagered $1,000,000}}}\uc2  that by March 14, 2023, LUNA will be trading at a price point lower than what it was on the above said date at $88. Algod\u8217\'20\'19s proposition was swiftly taken up by Do Kwon, CEO and founder of Terraform Labs, the firm behind Terra, who also put up the same amount claiming that the cryptocurrency will most definitely be trading at a price point higher than $88 by then.\par \par \uc2 As conversations between the two escalated via \uc2 Twitter\uc2 , the duo eventually decided to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/cobie/status/1503362673144041474"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 seek out the services}}}\uc2  of Cobie, co-host of the crypto podcast UpOnly, who will serve as an escrow agent facilitating the entire agreement. To elaborate, both Kwon and Algod have locked up a total of $1 million each in Tether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tether-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDT}}}\uc2  ) within an Ethereum address {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://etherscan.io/token/0xdac17f958d2ee523a2206206994597c13d831ec7?a=0x4cbe68d825d21cb4978f56815613eed06cf30152"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 labeled}}}\uc2  \u8220\'20\'1CCobie: LUNA Bet Escrow.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/a3b77f1a-c47f-42d4-b4aa-e18581d729f9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Cobie: LUNA Bet Escrow. Source: Etherescan.\par \par \uc2 Kiril Nikolov, head of DeFi strategy at Nexo, a blockchain-based lending platform, told Cointelegraph that while bets like these can gather a lot of attention, they don\u8217\'20\'19t \u8220\'20\'1Creally matter\u8221\'20\'1D in the grand scheme of things. He added that developers will keep on building on Terra regardless of LUNA\u8217\'20\'19s price or if Do Kwon loses the bet.\par \par \uc2 A similar opinion is shared by Derek Lim, head of crypto insights for cryptocurrency exchange Bybit, who told Cointelegraph:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI don\u8217\'20\'19t think that we can or should read too much into this. It will be a stretch to think that this wager between private parties can mean anything insidious or \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Instead, we should focus on other factors like the sustainability of the project\u8217\'20\'19s yield reserve.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Daniel Santos, CEO of Woonkly, a decentralized finance- (DeFi)-based social media network, believes that wagers showcase LUNA\u8217\'20\'19s growing popularity. \u8220\'20\'1CThe more popular a project is, the more fans and haters it has. One of the haters placed a bet against LUNA and Terra\u8217\'20\'19s founder accepted the bet and why not \u8212\'20\'14 it\u8217\'20\'19s that simple,\u8221\'20\'1D he told Cointelegraph.\par \par \uc2 Is Terra\u8217\'20\'19s growth really sustainable?\par \par \uc2 While on paper, Terra\u8217\'20\'19s rise seems extremely impressive, especially with LUNA flipping ETH in terms of staked value and their number of respective token stakers, Nikolov pointed out that there\u8217\'20\'19s a major difference in the staking model of the two projects, given the inability of investors to withdraw their staked ETH and its rewards until Ethereum 2.0 is released. \u8220\'20\'1CThus, it\u8217\'20\'19s normal that only a small percentage of all ETH is staked, compared to LUNA,\u8221\'20\'1D' he added.\par \par \uc2 Furthermore, Nikolov noted that Terra has done a great job in recognizing that liquid staking solutions are needed in order to generate stable and composable demand that can further be used for collateral, adding:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1COnce the Eth2 merge is complete, we can expect the percentage of staked ETH to become similar to that of LUNA, with liquid staking solutions such as Lido playing the main role of generating utility of the staked ETH, for example, as collateral).\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Lim believes that Terra\u8217\'20\'19s existing staking yields are quite sustainable, adding that at a very baseline-type level, the staking rewards generated via the system\u8217\'20\'19s Tobin tax and the spread fees from the LUNA/TerraUSD (UST) mintburn swaps are very practical.\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s Anchor conundrum\par \par \uc2 The Anchor Protocol (ANC), a decentralized lending application built atop the Terra ecosystem currently allows investors in TerraUSD \u8212\'20\'14 the platform\u8217\'20\'19s native United States dollar-pegged stablecoin \u8212\'20\'14 to accrue an annual percentage yield (APY) of nearly 20%. Theoretically, such high interest rates are made possible by the fact that the deposited stablecoins are pooled and lent out to borrowers to accrue interest.\par \par \uc2 Also, in order for an individual to borrow UST, they need to post staked tokens including staked LUNA and staked ETH as collateral. When the earned interest and staking rewards are not able to stay in line with the outlined interest rate of 20% \u8212\'20\'14 which is the case right now \u8212\'20\'14 Anchor is forced to take money from its \u8220\'20\'1Cyield reserve\u8221\'20\'1D to compensate for the gap existing between its total earnings and payouts.\par \par \uc2 In its current state, Anchor is being manipulated by some savvy users who, over the past few months, have been taking UST loans at an annual percentage rate (APR) of close to 2.5% and then depositing that same sum back into the Anchor protocol to accumulate 20% profits. Thus, there is a major imbalance within this setup because there is more demand for the 20% yields than for UST borrowers.\par \par \uc2 To help meet these unsustainably high payouts, Anchor has been going through its native reserve pools at a furious pace, as is highlighted by the fact that the protocol\u8217\'20\'19s crypto coffers, between late December and mid-February, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://terra.engineer/en/terra_addresses/terra1tmnqgvg567ypvsvk6rwsga3srp7e3lg6u0elp8"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 shrunk}}}\uc2  from $70 million to just a little over $6.50 million.\par \par \uc2 Jack Tao, CEO of cryptocurrency exchange Phemex, told Cointelegraph that even though Anchor\u8217\'20\'19s extremely high yield ratio has helped push the demand for UST and LUNA \u8212\'20\'14 with the latter\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coingecko.com/en/coins/terra-luna"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 value increasing by 60%}}}\uc2  over the past month alone \u8212\'20\'14 the protocol\u8217\'20\'19s current APR may be extremely hard to maintain, adding:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWe have to note that the crypto market is highly volatile and these high yield payouts are definitely hard to sustain in the long run, as much of it may be inflated due to speculation. Now that there\u8217\'20\'19s more UST in existence than ever, there are already critics that believe LUNA won\u8217\'20\'19t be able to sustain its price unless Terra changes its current model.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Lim, too, believes that Achor\u8217\'20\'19s current APR is pretty unsustainable. He pointed out that the protocol functions just like any other money market. If the yield reserve depletes, the APR is adjusted to a sustainable amount \u8212\'20\'14 around 12\u8211\'20\'1315% per annum \u8212\'20\'14 which is pretty good for stablecoins.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/b8e0cc79-897e-4d29-a979-b2070b8ba22e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Terra (LUNA) six-month price chart. Source: CoinGecko.\par \par \uc2 On a more technical note, he stated that there are four key issues facing Anchor that need to be solved immediately in order for the project to move forward in a sustainable manner. These include deposit growth outpacing borrowing, difference in borrowing and spending ratios to maintain an APR of 20%, the slow rate at which the protocol allows for the addition of new collateral assets and existing friction between Anchor and other blockchain ecosystems.\par \par \uc2 Nikolov noted that while UST\u8217\'20\'19s fluctuating rate of yield reserves on Anchor is unsustainable, it has allowed the stablecoin to become widely adopted. This is something he believes could play a big role in the asset\u8217\'20\'19s long-term success.\par \par \uc2 The ecosystem needs to continue maturing\par \par \uc2 Santos is of the opinion that most projects entering the crypto market \u8212\'20\'14 especially the decentralized finance sector \u8212\'20\'14 tend to make use of a high APY model to attract investors, even though they know quite well that these inflated return rates are not very sustainable in the long run.\par \par \uc2 He pointed to Wonderland, a project {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hackernoon.com/wonderlandmoney-is-getting-80000percent-apy-really-possible"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 offering returns in excess of 80,000%}}}\uc2 , which eventually resulted in the project\u8217\'20\'19s demise. That said, he does not believe the same will be the case with Terra because the platform offers users a number of use cases as well as a high degree of operational functionality, adding:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CCardano is a good example, with tons of investors jumping on the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2  train over the last year. A big part of the crypto community was saying that Cardano had \u8216\'20\'18nothing\u8217\'20\'19 to offer, something that LUNA is now facing with its detractors.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 As we move into a future being driven increasingly by decentralized technologies, it stands to reason that the best way for the sector to grow is through continued maturity. This is to prevent those projects entering the fray from being forced to offer extremely high returns \u8212\'20\'14 often bordering on being ridiculous \u8212\'20\'14 in order to attract new clients.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvZmIxYzVlZGEtOWJiZi00ZDlhLTk0ZDgtMjM1OWUxZDFhZWFkLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220321ei3l0005n\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Russia\par \b \uc2 Amid conflict, NFT projects already seek to rebuild Ukraine\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Anupam Varshney \par \uc2 1,301 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Innovation on this scale doesn\u8217\'20\'19t happen too often, and with blockchain creeping into the global consciousness as a robust and valuable financial technology, NFTs could accomplish far more than they already have.\par \par \uc2 The recent invasion of Ukraine has put the world in a state of uncertainty, turmoil and geopolitical risk. \b \highlight22\uc2 Volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the global financial markets has caused immense losses to millions of investors. With rising global inflation, fear of tapering liquidity, and increasing interest rates by the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2 , havoc is spreading across the global economy.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, the delinking of SWIFT messaging services for leading Russian banks is causing concern among entrepreneurs in the nation while also impacting other economies with strong Russian trade ties. With Visa and \uc2 Mastercard\uc2  halting their Russian operations, there will be further untold consequences for the interoperability of their payment systems and the everyday citizens who rely on them.\par \par \uc2 Amid all these uncertainties, cryptocurrencies and other assets such as nonfungible tokens (NFT) are playing a pivotal role in trying to mitigate the fallout from the conflict in Ukraine.\par \par \uc2 Ukraine DAO\par \par \uc2 A collaboration among Nadezhda Tolokonnikova, digital artist Trippy Labs, and artist collective PleasrDAO, Ukraine DAO has sold 10,000 NFTs of the Ukrainian flag on the Ethereum network, alongside a unique NFT of the flag. So far, it has {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ukraine-dao-raises-over-6m-via-nft-sale-to-aid-ukrainian-citizens"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 raised over $6.7 million}}}\uc2  to support Ukraine\u8217\'20\'19s military.\par \par \uc2 An NFT of the Ukrainian flag sold for 2,258 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) ($6.5 million at press time) through a service called Party Bid. All {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Ukraine_DAO/status/1498997683683348481"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 proceeds}}}\uc2  from the NFT sale went to the Come Back Alive organization that aids the Ukrainian military, volunteers and their families.\par \par \uc2 2250 ETH / $6.75M USD CONTRIBUTED TO THE UKRAINIAN FLAG NFT\par \par \uc2 Thank you to all who supported our project\par \par \uc2 Next steps: POAP for all those who donated to partybid, work with Come Back Alive on safely transferring funds\par \par \uc2 You may still donate ETH directly to ukrainedao.eth {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/GsQBLzHIVK"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/GsQBLzHIVK}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 UkraineDAO.eth (@Ukraine_DAO) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Ukraine_DAO/status/1498997683683348481?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 March 2, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Save the Children\par \par \uc2 7.5 million children in Ukraine are caught in the middle of this conflict, risking displacement, trauma, prolonged interruption of education and loss of family income. \uc2 Save the Children\uc2  has raised {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://ukraine.savethechildren.net/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 funds}}}\uc2  to help the families worst impacted by Ukraine\u8217\'20\'19s crisis. The initial {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.savethechildren.net/news/save-children-raises-crypto-funds-support-their-ukraine-response"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $19 million}}}\uc2  worth of appeals on its donation page includes crypto contributions. The organization accepts more than 60 types of cryptocurrencies, including Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), ETH, USD Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/usdc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 USDC}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) and Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 Holy Water\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/b0b3cbf3-ae61-48c3-bd91-7921b5f95884.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Holy Water NFT collection. Source: \uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 Over 500 Ukrainian artists {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/HolyWaterUA/status/1499587808700289035"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 gathered}}}\uc2  to submit art to a new NFT collection sold via Holy Water to raise money for the people of Ukraine. The artists represent some of the most prominent galleries in the country, including Port Agency, Izolyatsia and Ugallery. Bidding for each NFT will start at 0.08 ETH. They aim to raise at least $1 million.\par \par \uc2 Waone Interesni Kazki\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/b1ae207b-bdc3-4e8f-80da-acb2fca32065.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 The Seed of a Good Idea. Source: AGallery\par \par \uc2 A well-known contemporary Ukrainian artist, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.agallery.uk/gallery/vladimir_manzhos_aka_waone_of_interesni_kazki.php"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Vladimir Manzhos}}}\uc2 , aka Waone Interesni Kazki, is selling NFTs of his most famous paintings, which are inspired by surrealists and Ukrainian folk tales. Of the money raised, 50% will go toward defense and medical supplies via Ukrainian war charities.\par \par \uc2 The aim is to raise $7,000 from NFTs of paintings such as \u8220\'20\'1CThe Seed of a Good Idea,\u8221\'20\'1D \u8220\'20\'1CBeta to Alpha Transition\u8221\'20\'1D and \u8220\'20\'1CPrisoned Mind.\u8221\'20\'1D These are 1/1 edition NFTs, each of which is selling for $290.\par \par \uc2 AITX\u8217\'20\'19s NFT sale\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/5eb3cfc8-c576-4f96-8c0e-32b33d5fca4a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: AITX\par \par \uc2 Artificial Intelligence Technology Solutions Inc\uc2  (AITX) announced it would be raising money for the Ukrainian Humanitarian Relief through two avenues, the first of which is a minted NFT containing the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://opensea.io/assets/0x495f947276749ce646f68ac8c248420045cb7b5e/988139275069961811108952295331680457701417126209012029706925291122829819905"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 image}}}\uc2  of a Roameo produced by Robotic Assistance Devices. Funds are currently being raised through an online auction. The second avenue is a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.globenewswire.com/Tracker?data=jv-sKClxNfnJg1KdZxKND-jqlgsxVGFMwUr5MpKK74et7OjTeLzn9fPum1XS5sUSiBS5_mWkiXH38EWi1Umv3TVNlsQ1Su7da8w0_Xb7tNs="}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 GoFundMe page}}}\uc2  that has been created by CEO \uc2 Steve Reinharz\uc2  to provide funds to a Ukrainian aid organization, reportedly verified by the International Red Cross.\par \par \uc2 Wladimir Klitschko\u8217\'20\'19s NFT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/3b8bbf0c-e29f-4db7-bacb-2d290a8c3682.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: DW, Wladimir Klitschko\par \par \uc2 The Olympic champion and boxing icon Wladimir Klitschko {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/markets/cryptocurrency/former-ukrainian-boxer-wladimir-klitschko-releases-nft-to-raise-funds-for-country/articleshow/90095030.cms"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 released}}}\uc2  an NFT collection collaborating with the artist WhlsBe. The collectibles will be available to mint in a tiered pricing model of $100, $1,000 and $10,000. The funds from the sale will go directly to Ukraine.\par \par \uc2 Ukraine\u8217\'20\'19s NFTs for defense\par \par \uc2 Mykhailo Fedorov, Ukraine\u8217\'20\'19s vice prime minister, announced that the government would {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ukraine-cancels-token-airdrop-reveals-new-nft-plans"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 issue NFTs to help fund its military operations}}}\uc2 . The appeal raised about $54.7 million for the Ukrainian government and Ukrainian non-governmental organizations, with a smaller amount being sent to the Come Back Alive organization.\par \par \uc2 After careful consideration we decided to cancel airdrop. Every day there are more and more people willing to help Ukraine to fight back the agression. Instead, we will announce NFTs to support Ukrainian Armed Forces soon. We DO NOT HAVE any plans to issue any fungible tokens\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Mykhailo Fedorov (@FedorovMykhailo) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/FedorovMykhailo/status/1499348177002151937?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 March 3, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Reli3F\par \par \uc2 Headed by crypto artists and prominent NFT influencers, Web3 humanitarian initiative Reli3F {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.one37pm.com/nft/tech/reli3f-fund-raised-over-1-million-for-ukraine-selling-nfts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 initiated}}}\uc2  a large NFT sale that included pieces from 37 artists, including Danny Cole, Vinnie Hager, Sartoshi, Gremplin, Ravi Vora and more. All the proceeds of the sale were sent directly to Ukraine relief efforts. Within 30 seconds of the initial launch, the NFT project sold out, raising over $1 million dollars.\par \par \uc2 TIMEpieces\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/f2799233-2e84-42fe-9862-c5f316a776d0.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 TIMEpieces, a Web3 NFT community initiative from Time magazine, announced an {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://time.com/6152869/timepieces-launches-artists-for-peace/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 exhibition}}}\uc2 , \u8220\'20\'1CMake Art Not War.\u8221\'20\'1D 100% of the income raised from the exhibition will be sent to humanitarian relief efforts in Ukraine. According to Time, collectors have minted over 10,000 NFTs from 99 collages of images \u8212\'20\'14 with each collage representing a year in Time\u8217\'20\'19s 100-year-long history.\par \par \uc2 Forza Ikonia\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/adb8b830-65a7-46bb-8e96-e402ae3c8ee8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: \uc2 Twitter\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/forzaikonia"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Forza Ikonia}}}\uc2  has been helping raise funds for various charities in Ukraine, including \uc2 Doctors Without Borders\uc2  and \uc2 Amnesty International\uc2 . The \u8220\'20\'1CStand with Ukraine\u8221\'20\'1D NFT project was launched by the Kyiv- and Gothenburg-based incubator, consisting of over 43,287,512 editions by artist Felipe Posada. Each edition represents one citizen of Ukraine and is being sold at just $10 per edition.\par \par \uc2 Editions can be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.mauer.digital/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 purchased}}}\uc2  by credit or debit card, and all sales go toward the platform\u8217\'20\'19s selected charities. So far, Forza Ikonia has raised over $264,000.\par \par \uc2 ArtWaRks Ukraine\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/9b65035c-87b8-4253-854b-4c2422d12cd5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Source: OpenSea\par \par \uc2 The {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coinspeaker.com/artwarks-ukrainians-charitable-nft-army/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ArtWaRks Ukraine}}}\uc2  NFT project was created by a group of Ukrainian IT entrepreneurs, art historians, artists and media creators with the aim of raising money for charitable aid toward civilians and the Ukrainian military. The project has 57 \u8220\'20\'1CArtWaRks\u8221\'20\'1D listed on {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://opensea.io/ArtWaRks_Ukraine"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 OpenSea}}}\uc2 , with each being sold at around 0.07 ETH or $182.\par \par \uc2 One of the ArtWaRks in this NFT project is from former Minister of Culture and Sports Vladimir Borodyansky. Other contributors include IT entrepreneur Ruslan Nonka; the co-founders of the NGO Museum of Contemporary Art, Yulia Gnat and Olga Balashova; and many other Ukrainian artists.\par \par \uc2 The bottom line\par \par \uc2 Many cryptocurrency investors see the Russia\u8211\'20\'13Ukraine conflict as a game-changer that could cement the utility of cryptocurrencies and blockchain technology in people\u8217\'20\'19s minds, although it\u8217\'20\'19s still too early to tell whether this will alter the narrative on how governments around the globe view crypto assets and NFTs. What we do know is that digital assets such as NFTs are helping a country in distress raise funds to defend its borders.\par \par \uc2 Innovation on this scale doesn\u8217\'20\'19t happen too often, and with blockchain creeping into the global consciousness as a robust and valuable financial technology, NFTs could accomplish far more than they already have.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvMTAxOTBhYjAtYTYxNS00YzZjLTg4OGQtODA2MmY1OTRlZTYxLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220321ei3k00004\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Venture Capital\par \b \uc2 VC Roundup: NFTs, crypto mortgages, 5G network and Web3 devs raise millions\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Sam Bourgi \par \uc2 718 \uc2 words\par \uc2 20 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Web3 platforms, a crypto mortgage lender and a16z executives headline the latest edition of VC Roundup.\par \par \uc2 The cryptocurrency market has failed to make significant headway in recent months, but that hasn\u8217\'20\'19t stopped the industry\u8217\'20\'19s builders from building. Nonfungible tokens (NFTs), crypto mortgages, blockchain-powered cellular networks and Web3 gaming have all piqued the interest of venture capitalists. These new and familiar investment themes headline the latest edition of VC Roundup, as venture funds continue to target blockchain\u8217\'20\'19s most promising value plays.\par \par \uc2 a16z execs back new NFT fund\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/andreessen-horowitz-aims-to-raise-4-5-billion-to-invest-in-crypto-funds"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Andreessen Horowitz\u8217\'20\'19s foray into the blockchain industry}}}\uc2  continued this month after a large segment of its investing team backed a new nonfungible token fund called Curated. The fund, which is worth $30 million, has the singular purpose of buying and holding NFT artwork. Among the a16z brass, \uc2 Marc Andreessen\uc2 , Arianna Simpson, \uc2 Chris Dixon\uc2 , Andrew Chen and John Lai are all investors in the fund, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://techcrunch.com/2022/03/10/chris-dixon-marc-andreessen-back-a-30m-fund-investing-exclusively-in-nft-art/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according}}}\uc2  to Tech Crunch. NFTs and traditional art are increasingly being viewed as stores of value in an inflationary environment. (Interestingly, a16z has been talking about NFTs since at least 2020, which is eons ago in the crypto industry.)\par \par \uc2 How are crypto marketplaces and NFTs changing the game for creators? Listen to our Q&As with artists {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/muratpak?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @muratpak}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/sigggnasty?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 @sigggnasty}}}\uc2  for an intro to the token-based creator economy: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/Lj42leSkfa"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://t.co/Lj42leSkfa}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 a16z (@a16z) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/a16z/status/1330559206819311619?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 November 22, 2020}}}\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/magazine/2022/03/16/dont-be-angry-about-nfts"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 You don\u8217\'20\'19t need to be angry about NFTs}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto mortgage lender Milo receives $17M\par \par \uc2 Crypto-focused fintech startup Milo has raised $17 million in Series A funding from venture firms M13, QED Investors and MetaProp. Milo will use the funding to advance its suite of product offerings, which includes a 30-year {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bacon-protocol-launches-decentralized-mortgage-platform"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 crypto mortgage}}}\uc2  that allows users to put up digital assets as collateral for their home loans. Since launching in January, Milo\u8217\'20\'19s 30-year mortgage has already received over 7,400 applications. The company\u8217\'20\'19s first product \u8212\'20\'14 a mortgage solution for foreign nationals \u8212\'20\'14 processed $500 million in applications from over 90 countries.\par \par \uc2 Crypto-friendly neobank raises $77M\par \par \uc2 Scandinavian neobank Lunar is planning to launch a new cryptocurrency platform and business-to-business service after raising $77 million at a $2 billion valuation. The crypto trading service will initially focus on just five assets: Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ), Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) and Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ). The company\u8217\'20\'19s crypto gambit reflects a growing desire to service more consumer-oriented sectors in a region that has enjoyed a sizable uptake in \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  trading. According to Tech Crunch, Lunar is already {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://techcrunch.com/2022/03/10/lunar-the-nordic-neo-bank-raises-77m-at-a-2b-valuation-and-launches-crypto-trading-platform-and-b2b-payments/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 raising}}}\uc2  capital for its next funding round, which is expected to close in May.\par \par \uc2 FreedomFi closes $9.5M funding round\par \par \uc2 Crypto-friendly 5G developer FreedomFi has raised $9.5 million in funding to advance a Web3 platform that enables consumers to crowdsource deployments of small cell networks using digital assets. The Series A round was financed by Blueyard Capital, \uc2 Qualcomm Ventures\uc2  and Samsung Next. FreedomFi has already made inroads into the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  space, having partnered with the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/helium-partners-with-dish-network-to-expand-its-crypto-based-distributed-5g-platform"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Helium blockchain}}}\uc2  in 2021 to advance wider adoption of cellular base stations at the consumer level.\par \par \uc2 Web3 platform Joyride raises $14M\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/web3-gaming-in-the-third-world-axie-facilitating-billions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Web3 gaming}}}\uc2  platform Joyride Games recently closed a $14 million seed round that was financed by some of blockchain\u8217\'20\'19s biggest venture funds, including BITKRAFT Ventures, SuperLayer, Coinbase Ventures, Animoca Brands, Dapper Labs and Solana Ventures. The Joyride platform is mainly geared towards developers who want to build and launch blockchain-powered esports and social games. The company said that it plans to launch the first batch of gaming projects on its platform in the near future.\par \par \uc2 Describe Web3 in 3 words.\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Cointelegraph (@Cointelegraph) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Cointelegraph/status/1501224224832241670?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 March 8, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/vc-roundup-web3-infrastructure-developers-attract-major-investors"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 VC Roundup: Web3 infrastructure developers attract major investors}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto Unicorns closes $26M token sale\par \par \uc2 Web3 game developer Laguna Games completed a $26 million token sale for its Polygon-based NFT collection Crypto Unicorns. The biggest buyers included TCG, Backed VC, ACME Capital, BITKRAFT Ventures, Delphi Digital, Polygon Studios and CoinFund, among others. Laguna Games said all of the funds raised will be allocated to the Crypto Unicorns DAO Treasury, whose governance will be transferred to the community over time.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvZGVhNTAxYzctNGMyZS00Mjg2LTkxODMtN2U3NTU4ZDE1ZjNiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220321ei3k00005\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/18: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, LUNA, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,669 \uc2 words\par \uc2 18 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin may remain in a bottoming formation for a few more days but select altcoins may signal a possible trend change.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is facing a challenging environment in 2022 due to the surging inflation and geopolitical turmoil. Although gold has outperformed Bitcoin year-to-date, Bloomberg Intelligence senior commodity strategist Mike McGlone believes that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-faces-new-milestone-in-2022-as-new-forecast-predicts-btc-price-in-the-millions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could make a strong comeback}}}\uc2 . McGlone expects the current circumstances to \u8220\'20\'1Cmark another milestone in Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s maturation.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Another \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  sign for the long term is that the Bitcoin miners have been increasing their Bitcoin holdings since 2021. Compass Mining founder and CEO Whit Gibbs said to Cointelegraph that Bitcoin mining companies are \u8220\'20\'1Ctaking more of a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/miners-that-hodl-the-most-bitcoin-are-relentlessly-expanding"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22bullish\b0 \highlight22  approach to Bitcoin}}}\uc2 .\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/812ca064-801a-42d5-9b31-e8a0804bb410.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 Terraform Labs founder Do Kwon said that its stablecoin TerraUSD (UST) will be {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/we-re-already-buying-terra-founder-plans-to-obtain-10b-btc-for-reserves"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 backed by more than $10 billion in Bitcoin}}}\uc2  reserves. He expects this move to \u8220\'20\'1Copen a new monetary era of the Bitcoin standard.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins find buyers on dips or will bears trap the aggressive bulls? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin broke and closed above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($40,311) on March 16 but the bulls are struggling to build upon this breakout. This suggests that demand dries up at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/d37f3b83-8101-44d5-b603-eb76d2a91e74.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will try to make use of this opportunity and pull the price below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($39,973). If they succeed, the BTC/USDT pair could again drop to the strong support at $37,000.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the moving averages, it will suggest that the sentiment has turned positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then try to push the price above $42,600 and extend the rally to $45,400.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the 50-day SMA ($2,780) on March 16, indicating a strong comeback from the bulls. The buyers held the dip to the 50-day SMA today and are attempting to extend the recovery.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/8240472b-3745-42c4-bb64-6e95d6d653cb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (RSI) has jumped into the positive territory and the 20-day EMA ($2,700) has started to turn up, indicating the path of least resistance is to the upside. If the price sustains above the 50-day SMA, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle. The bears are expected to mount a strong defense at this level.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated if the price turns down from the current level and plummets below the moving averages. The pair could then drop to the support line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  is facing resistance at the 50-day SMA ($389). This is the fourth instance when the bears are posing a strong challenge at this level. Therefore, the 50-day SMA becomes a key level to watch out for on the upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/d16fa8a9-17c5-425f-9b20-0a95559797e7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flat moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. If buyers push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA for three consecutive days, it will indicate a possible change in trend. The BNB/USDT pair could then start its northward march toward $445.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if the price dips below the 20-day EMA ($382), the bears will attempt to pull the pair toward the strong support at $350.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the 50-day SMA ($0.74) on March 15 but the bulls have not been able to challenge the downtrend line. This suggests that the bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/dfea82a3-d429-4bf4-94dc-12fcf05b783a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now attempt to pull the price below the moving averages. If they succeed, the XRP/USDT pair could drop to the strong support at $0.68. If this support also gives way, the decline could extend to $0.62.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price bounces off the moving averages, it will suggest that the bulls are buying on dips. That could enhance the prospects of a break and close above the downtrend line. The pair could then rally to $0.91.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token has broken below the 20-day EMA ($84), suggesting that the failure to sustain the price above $96 may have attracted profit-booking from the short-term traders.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/445de081-2111-4768-8402-6344a314d9df.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI has dropped to the midpoint, indicating that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be waning. If the price sustains below the 20-day EMA, the bears will try to pull the LUNA/USDT pair toward the strong support at $70.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will make another attempt to push and sustain the price above $96. If they manage to do that, the pair could rally to the all-time high at $105.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 20-day EMA ($86) on March 16 but the bulls could not push the price above the downtrend line. This indicates that the bears are active at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/50024d85-035f-4dc4-9673-0e2ad55f3093.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers will now attempt to sink the price below the strong support zone between $81 and $75. If they succeed, it will complete a descending triangle pattern and the SOL/USDT pair could plummet to $66.\par \par \uc2 However, the flattening moving averages and the positive divergence on the RSI suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening. If the price rebounds off the support zone, the bulls will make one more attempt to overcome the barrier at the downtrend line and push the pair to $106.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is facing stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($0.84) which suggests that the bears are defending this level aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/e8c1dca9-868c-4db6-b282-13c13bb10b03.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattening 20-day EMA and the positive divergence on the RSI suggest that the selling pressure may be waning.\par \par \uc2 If the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair does not give up much ground from the current level, it will suggest that the traders are holding on to their position as they anticipate a move higher. If the price breaks and closes above the 20-day EMA, the next stop could be the overhead resistance at $1.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below $0.74. The pair could then resume its downtrend and decline to $0.68.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-could-see-37-5k-weekend-dip-before-bigger-move-next-week-new-report"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could see $37.5K weekend dip before 'bigger move' next week \u8212\'20\'14 New report}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) broke above the moving averages on March 17 and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/avalanche-price-can-double-by-summer-as-avax-s-20-weekly-rally-rekindles-bull-flag"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 rose to the downtrend line}}}\uc2  of the descending channel. The bears are expected to mount a strong defense at this resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/fad45d40-808a-4f46-bbfd-ea7b069cc014.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI just above the midpoint indicate a minor advantage to buyers. If bulls sustain the price above the 20-day EMA ($75), the prospects of a break and close above the channel improve.\par \par \uc2 A close above the channel will be the first sign of a possible change in trend. The bulls will then attempt to drive the price toward the psychological level at $100.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the short term if the price breaks and sustains below the 20-day EMA. The AVAX/USDT pair could then drop to the uptrend line.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the 50-day SMA ($18) on March 16 but the bulls could not sustain the price above the overhead resistance at $19. This suggests that the bears are not willing to give up easily.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/754c8403-c207-44ba-9bd3-50cc3371ca6b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has turned down from the overhead resistance but a minor positive is that the bulls are attempting to defend the moving averages. If the price rebounds off the moving averages, it will increase the possibility of a break and close above the overhead resistance. The DOT/USDT pair could then start its journey toward $23.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price slips below the 20-day EMA ($17), the pair could drop toward the support at $16. The pair could then extend its stay inside the $16 to $19 range for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) once again turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.12) on March 17, indicating that bears continue to sell near the resistance levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/1282365c-f5f2-4d7a-9118-f5ef6d9188f5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The sellers will now try to pull the price down to the strong support at $0.10. If the price bounces here, the DOGE/USDT pair could remain range-bound between $0.12 and $0.10 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 The first sign of strength will be a break and close above the 20-day EMA. That could push the price to the 50-day SMA ($0.13), which may again act as a strong resistance.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above this resistance could attract buyers and open the doors for a possible rally to $0.17. Conversely, a break and close below $0.10 will suggest the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvZTQyNWRiMTktMmNhZS00N2NhLThmOTEtZTVmNmI2MmJhMGRhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220318ei3i000b9\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/16: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, LUNA, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,766 \uc2 words\par \uc2 16 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and most major altcoins are showing signs of forming a bottom.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) is witnessing a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-calls-traders-bluff-with-fresh-40k-fakeout-as-fed-decision-day-arrives"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 see-saw battle near $40,000}}}\uc2  with both the bulls and the bears trying to gain the upper hand. The \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  could remain high as the markets await the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s policy decision due on March 16.\par \par \uc2 Analyst Willy Woo suggests that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-risks-final-bear-market-capitulation-as-rich-investors-continue-btc-selloff-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin could witness a capitulation event}}}\uc2  based on a cost basis, a metric that indicates the transfer of Bitcoin from inexperienced to experienced traders. Such sharp declines usually suggest the formation of market bottoms.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/d1373998-3134-48a5-95a8-acaf9761e014.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 However, Glassnode believes that a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/short-term-bitcoin-buyers-transition-to-long-term-holders-glassnode"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 capitulation has been avoided}}}\uc2  because the sell-offs have been absorbed by a relatively strong market. Although 82% of the short-term holders' coins are in loss, Glassnode considers this to be a late-stage bear market behavior where investors hold their coins until they turn profitable.\par \par \uc2 Could the Fed\u8217\'20\'19s policy decision start a trending move in Bitcoin and altcoins? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin turned down from the moving averages on March 15 but the long tail on the candlestick indicates strong demand at lower levels. The bulls continued their buying and have pushed the price above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($40,151).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/0b15f70e-dabb-400f-992b-026cb4776884.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bulls sustain the price above the 50-day SMA, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to the overhead zone between $45,400 and the resistance line of the ascending channel. The bears are expected to mount a strong defense in this zone.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead zone, the pair could extend its stay inside the channel for a few more days. The flat moving averages and the relative strength index (RSI) near the midpoint also suggest range-bound action is likely in the short term.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and plummets below the moving averages, it will suggest that bears continue to sell at higher levels. The bears will then try to sink the price below the support line of the channel and resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the support line of the symmetrical triangle and the buyers are attempting to push the price above the 50-day SMA ($2,763).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/9f4520fa-77c6-42db-82c3-0efcf486be5c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the price could rise to the psychological level at $3,000 and then to the resistance line of the triangle. The bulls will have to push and sustain the price above the triangle to signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 The RSI has also formed a symmetrical triangle and a breakout from it could signal that buyers have the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the support line of the triangle. That could open the doors for a possible drop to $2,159.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 The buyers are trying to push {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  above the moving averages but the bears are likely to have other plans. They will attempt to stall the recovery near the moving averages as they have done on the three previous occasions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/c73d48ef-4436-43c6-bfa7-a015e347e858.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both the moving averages are flattening out and the RSI has risen above 48, indicating that bulls are attempting a comeback. If buyers drive and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($388), the BNB/USDT pair could rise to $425 and thereafter to $445.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling near resistance levels. The bears will then try to pull the price below the strong support at $350.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the downtrend line on March 12 and dropped to the moving averages. Although the bulls have defended the moving averages, they have failed to achieve a strong rebound off it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/f1659cba-91ac-4188-a8d9-1326056a49ef.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages have flattened out and the RSI is near the midpoint, indicating a balance between supply and demand. The buyers will have to push and sustain the price above the downtrend line to gain the upper hand. The XRP/USDT pair could then rally to $0.91 and later to the psychological level at $1.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down and breaks below $0.69, the advantage will turn in favor of the bears. The pair could then slide to the strong support level at $0.62.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token broke above the overhead resistance at $94 on March 14 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. The bears pulled the price back below $94 on March 15.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/f6238716-afe7-4bf1-81cc-93e8f953a225.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears will now try to pull and sustain the price below the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($84). If they succeed, the LUNA/USDT pair could drop to $70. Such a move could suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum has weakened.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rises from the current level or rebounds off the 20-day EMA, the buyers will again attempt to push the price toward $105. A break and close above this resistance could indicate the resumption of the uptrend. The pair could first rally to $115 and later to $125.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls pushed Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) back above the breakdown level at $81 on March 14, indicating that the recent breakdown on March 13 may have been a bear trap.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/e7518a92-26f6-4f9f-891b-6b60095d869b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers are attempting to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($86). If they manage to do that, the SOL/USDT pair could rally to the downtrend line. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break and close above it will suggest a possible change in trend. The pair could then rally to the overhead resistance at $122.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will be invalidated in the short term if the price turns down from the 20-day EMA or the downtrend line and plummets below $77. Such a move could indicate the resumption of the downtrend and the pair may extend its decline to $66.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is attempting to rise above the 20-day EMA ($0.85) but the bears are expected to mount a strong defense at the resistance.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/30b5a6b4-e06e-431f-9ef9-e868b0b14e62.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the current level, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could drop to the strong support at $0.74. This is an important level for the bulls to defend because if it cracks, the pair could decline to the next support at $0.68.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks and closes above the 20-day EMA, the pair could attempt a rally to the psychological level at $1. This level is likely to act as a strong resistance. If the price turns down from this resistance, the pair may remain range-bound between $1 and $0.74 for a few days.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-cracks-41k-as-hopes-of-peace-in-eastern-europe-send-bitcoin-higher"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC price cracks $41K as hopes of peace in Eastern Europe send Bitcoin higher}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) has been sustaining below the uptrend line since March 13 but the bears have not been able to capitalize on this weakness and sink the price below the immediate support at $64. This indicates a lack of sellers at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/3fb3810f-26bb-48d4-bcc9-0b615e95293d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push the price back above the uptrend line and the moving averages. If they succeed, the AVAX/USDT pair could rise to the downtrend line of the descending channel. This is an important level to watch out for because the bears have successfully defended the resistance on four previous occasions.\par \par \uc2 If the price once again turns down from the downtrend line, it will suggest that the bears are in no mood to relent. The sellers will then try and pull the price back below $64.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls drive the price above the channel, it will suggest that the downtrend could be over. The pair could then rally to the psychological level at $100.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has been trading close to the 20-day EMA ($17) for the past two days, indicating that the bulls are buying the dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/bbb7730f-a528-4ecd-93e7-4c61a723cab8.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest that the bears may be losing their grip. The bulls are again expected to attempt a rally above the overhead resistance at $19.\par \par \uc2 If they can pull it off, the DOT/USDT pair could rise to $23 where the bears may pose a strong challenge. A break and close above this level would complete a double bottom pattern.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below the strong support at $16. That could drag the price down to $14.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) turned down from the 20-day EMA ($0.12) on March 14, indicating that higher levels are witnessing strong selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/99d2f1d5-4b5a-4d1e-b824-f15133ec2bcb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 One minor positive factor is that the bulls have not allowed the price to break below the strong support at $0.10. This could keep the DOGE/USDT pair range-bound between $0.12 and $0.10 for a few more days.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the 20-day EMA could be the first sign that the selling pressure may be reducing. The bulls will then try to push the pair above the 50-day SMA ($0.13) and clear the path for a possible rally to $0.17.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price breaks below $0.10, the selling could intensify and the pair may drop to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvNTJjNTE3NmItY2JkYS00YzhjLTkxZDctMGYwNjc5Yjg1N2VhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220316ei3g000b8\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/14: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, LUNA, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,830 \uc2 words\par \uc2 14 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The buyers will attempt to push Bitcoin above the overhead resistance and if that happens, select altcoins could also rally higher in the short term.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has largely been directionless since the start of the year as the bulls have been buying on dips while bears are selling the rallies. This suggests that the price is consolidating in a large range with both the bulls and the bears waiting for the next trigger to establish their supremacy.\par \par \uc2 The short-term \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  may pick up after the \uc2 United States Federal Reserve\uc2  announces its policy decision on March 16 but unless the Fed springs a surprise, the likelihood of a new trending move could be low. Bitcoin could spend some more time in a bottoming formation before breaking out of it.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/3ff6c973-5482-4df4-99f4-06e95c7620a9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 A positive sign in the range-bound action this year has been {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/two-years-since-the-covid-crash-5-things-to-know-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 evidence of accumulation}}}\uc2  by both the small investors and select whales. This has coincided with a sustained drop in Bitcoin balances on exchanges. The combined Bitcoin balances on the 21 exchanges it covers have dropped to 2.32 million Bitcoin, the lowest since August 2018, according to CryptoQuant.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin break above the immediate resistance level and pull the altcoins higher? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin has bounced from the immediate support at $37,000, indicating that bulls are attempting to defend this level. The buyers will now try to push the price above the moving averages. If they succeed, it will suggest strong demand at lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/9730470c-d3a5-4236-bcaf-5ad36f72ae85.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will then try to extend the up-move by clearing the overhead hurdle at $42,594. If they manage to do that, it will be the first indication that the bears may be losing their grip. The BTC/USDT pair could then rise to the overhead zone between $45,400 and the resistance line of the ascending channel.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that bears are unwilling to let go of their advantage. The sellers will then attempt to solidify their position by pulling the price below the support line of the channel. Such a move could signal the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to defend the support line of the symmetrical triangle. A strong bounce off the current level could push Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) to the moving averages where the bears are again likely to mount a strong defense.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/72af26cb-6e8d-481b-b383-d597b5a44959.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the moving averages, it will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on relief rallies. That will increase the possibility of a break below the triangle. The ETH/USDT pair could then resume its downtrend and decline to $2,159.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if bulls propel the price above the moving averages, it will suggest that the selling pressure may be reducing. The pair could then rise to the psychological level at $3,000 and later challenge the resistance line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  is attempting to rebound off the support zone between $360 to $350. This suggests that buyers continue to accumulate on dips near the support zone.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/7e0fd7cc-f892-4bac-b20d-a94c160eae95.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The buyers will have to push and sustain the price above the moving averages to indicate that the bears may be losing their grip. If the price sustains above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($389), the bulls will attempt to push the BNB/USDT pair to $425.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price once again turns down from the moving averages and breaks below $350. Such a move will suggest that the sentiment remains negative and traders continue to sell on rallies. That could pull the price to the critical support at $320.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) price soared above the downtrend line on March 11 but the rally met with stiff resistance at $0.85. This suggests that the bears have not yet given up and they continue to sell on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/1c35f4ea-8956-430b-8d55-ecdc63787586.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has pulled back to the 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($0.75), which is likely to act as a strong support. If the price rebounds off the current level, the buyers will make one more attempt to push and sustain the XRP/USDT pair above $0.85. If they succeed, the pair could rally to $0.91 and then rise to the psychological resistance at $1.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price breaks below the moving averages. Such a move will suggest that the break above the downtrend line may have been a bull trap. A break and close below $0.69 could open the doors for a possible drop to $0.62.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token slipped below $94 on March 11 but the bears could not pull the price to the 20-day EMA ($82). This is a positive sign as it shows that traders are buying on every minor dip.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/1814a458-abf0-4bc0-85dd-c5f60386551c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Although the rising 20-day EMA indicates advantage to buyers, the negative divergence on the relative strength index (RSI) suggests that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may be weakening.\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push the price back above $94. If that happens, the buyers will make one more attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $105 and resume the uptrend. If they do that, the LUNA/USDT pair could rally to $115.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price turns down from the overhead zone, the bears will try to sink the pair below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below the strong support at $81 on March 11 and followed it up with further selling on March 13. However, the bears have not been able to break the intraday low at $75 made on Feb. 24.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/823d82e0-65ea-4b62-8cc0-39fbaf3ff316.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The positive divergence on the RSI indicates that the selling pressure may be reducing. The bulls are attempting to push the price back above the breakdown level at $81 on March 14. If they sustain the price above $81, it will suggest that the recent breakdown may have been a bear trap. The buyers will then strive to push the SOL/USDT pair above the 20-day EMA ($87).\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below $75. That will suggest the bears have flipped the $81 level into resistance. The pair could then drop to $66.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) is attempting a rebound off the strong support at $0.74 but the effort lacks conviction. A minor positive is that the RSI is showing the first signs of positive divergence, indicating that the selling pressure may be reducing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/18a9fe15-035a-4c22-bc30-de51bc66ec95.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair above the 20-day EMA ($0.85) to signal that the bears may be losing their grip. That could open the doors for a possible retest of the breakdown level at $1. This level is likely to attract strong selling.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that bears are pouncing on every minor rally. That will increase the possibility of a break below $0.74. If that happens, the downtrend could extend to $0.68.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-tracks-39k-ahead-of-europe-vote-on-proof-of-work-legality"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin tracks $39K ahead of Europe vote on Proof-of-Work legality}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) broke below the uptrend line on March 13, indicating that the bears have overpowered the bulls. The attempts by the buyers to push the price above the breakdown level on March 14 met with strong selling by the bears.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/ad0307bc-b17f-45f0-977e-33db70265dcf.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears sink and sustain the price below $64, the AVAX/USDT pair could slide to the strong support at $51. The downsloping 20-day EMA ($74) and the RSI in the negative territory indicate advantage to sellers.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate in the short term if the price turns up from the current level and breaks above the moving averages. The bulls will then try to overcome the barrier at the downtrend line of the descending channel.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level to keep an eye on because the bulls have faltered at the downtrend line on four previous occasions. If bulls push and sustain the price above the channel, the pair could rally to $100.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) once again turned down from the 50-day SMA ($18) on March 13 but the bulls are not allowing the price to sustain below the 20-day EMA ($17).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/f6dc37fa-bc0b-4fa5-bf56-4e6eec425156.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The price has been stuck in a tight range between $16 and $19 for the past few days, indicating indecision among the bulls and the bears. Such tight-range trading is usually followed by a sharp trending move.\par \par \uc2 If buyers push and sustain the price above $19, the DOT/USDT pair could rally to the next overhead resistance at $23. A break and close above this level will signal that the downtrend may be over.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price turns down and breaks below $16, the pair could retest the critical support at $14.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) made a strong attempt to start a relief rally on March 14 but the efforts of the bulls met with stiff resistance at the 20-day EMA ($0.12).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/102ffbad-23df-4028-8e11-7aa05eeddad9.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the bulls fail to clear the overhead hurdle, the bears will fancy their chances and try to sink the pair below the psychological support at $0.10. If that happens, the selling could further pick up momentum and the DOGE/USDT pair may slide to $0.06.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price rises from the current level or rebounds off $0.10, it will suggest accumulation by the bulls. The buyers will have to push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.13) to signal a possible change in trend.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvNjFmOGQxZDUtYzFhNi00M2ZiLTk3YTctMDFhZTA4ZTQ1ZGFmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220314ei3e000ba\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/11: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, LUNA, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,853 \uc2 words\par \uc2 11 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 The sharp pullback in BTC and large-cap altcoins indicates that bears have yet to capitulate and that traders continue to sell the top of each breakout.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) has been volatile in the past few days but the long-term investors seem to be using the current weakness to buy.\par \par \uc2 According to Whale Alert and CryptoQuant, about {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/buying-big-nearly-30k-btc-leaves-coinbase-pro-in-3-transactions"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 30,000 BTC left Coinbase}}}\uc2  and was deposited in an unknown wallet. It is speculated to be a genuine purchase and not an in-house transaction.\par \par \uc2 Although investors may be \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the long term, the short-term picture remains questionable. Stack Funds said in their recent weekly research report that they \u8220\'20\'1Cexpect {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/40k-bitcoin-price-is-in-reach-but-analysts-warn-that-a-sweep-of-recent-lows-is-likely"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 sideways trading and possibly a potential dip}}}\uc2  \u8221\'20\'1D in the short term due to the increase in inflation and the lack of clarity regarding the conflict in Ukraine.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/c0ff36f2-2a09-4c7c-b40e-bec637c590ed.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 While Bitcoin has been volatile, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/gold-backed-cryptos-are-shining-in-2022-market-cap-hits-1b-for-the-first-time"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 gold-backed crypto assets have made a strong showing}}}\uc2  in 2022 as investors shunned risky assets and sought the protection of safe havens. This has boosted the market capitalization of gold-baked crypto tokens to more than $1 billion.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins sustain the recovery or will bears reign supreme? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin soared above the moving averages on March 9 but quickly retraced the rally on March 10. The bulls are again attempting to push the price back above the moving averages today. This indicates that bulls are buying on dips while bears are selling on rallies.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/67be303c-2a39-413a-9b15-bf74615707ec.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Both moving averages are flattening out and the relative strength index (RSI) is just below the midpoint, suggesting a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 This equilibrium could tilt in favor of the buyers if they push and sustain the price above $42,594. The BTC/USDT pair could then rise to the overhead zone between $45,000 and the resistance line of the ascending channel.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price once again turns down from the moving averages, the bears will try to pull the pair below the immediate support at $37,000. If this level gives way, the pair could challenge the support line of the channel. A break and close below this level will increase the possibility of the resumption of the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) rebound met with stiff resistance at the 50-day simple moving average ($2,751) on March 9, indicating that bears are not willing to let go of their advantage easily. The price turned down from the moving averages on March 10 but a minor positive is that the bulls are attempting to defend the support line of the symmetrical triangle.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/ae7c4c9b-da40-4d30-b11f-97e22ef8ea7e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the support line, the bulls will again try to drive and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA. If they manage to do that, the ETH/USDT pair could rise to the psychological level at $3,000 and then retest the resistance line of the triangle.\par \par \uc2 This is an important level for the bears to defend because a break and close above it will signal a potential change in trend. This setup has a pattern target at $4,311 on the upside.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price continues lower and breaks below the support line of the triangle, it could indicate the resumption of the downtrend. The pair could then drop to $2,159.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) rose above the 50-day SMA ($389) on March 9 but the bulls could not sustain the higher levels. The bears took advantage of this situation and pulled the price back below the moving averages on March 10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/e10fd68d-7e08-465c-84af-e26f8db3a25e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below the moving averages, the bears will attempt to pull the BNB/USDT pair to the strong support at $350. This is an important level to keep an eye on because a break below it could clear the path for a decline to $320.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price rebounds off the current level, the buyers will again try to propel and sustain the pair above the moving averages. If they do that, the pair could start its northward march toward $445.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the downtrend line on March 9 but the bulls could not build upon this strength. The bears pulled the price back below the downtrend line on March 10.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/6be71ef7-c894-47b7-86e6-9bfe5a350b57.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls did not allow the price to break below the 50-day SMA ($0.72), which suggests strong demand at lower levels. This tight range trading is unlikely to continue for long.\par \par \uc2 If the price breaks and sustains above $0.78, the XRP/USDT pair could pick up momentum and rally toward the overhead resistance at $0.91. A break above this level could clear the path for a rally to the psychological level at $1.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below $0.69. That could turn the tables in favor of the bears.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token rose to a new all-time high on March 9 but the long wick on the day\u8217\'20\'19s candlestick shows profit-booking at higher levels. The bulls again tried to resume the uptrend on March 10 but the bears had other plans.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/c14d3011-bf60-4601-adaf-3308ea335b4c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The failure to sustain the price above $103 may have attracted profit-booking from the short-term traders. That has pulled the LUNA/USDT pair below the critical level at $94.\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains below $94, the decline could extend to the 20-day EMA ($80). A break and close below this level will suggest that the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum may have weakened. The pair could then drop to $70.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price rebounds off the current level or the 20-day EMA, it will indicate that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then again try to push the pair to a new all-time high and toward the target objective at $125.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/solana"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has been trading inside a descending triangle pattern, which will complete on a break and close below the crucial support at $81. The bulls tried a recovery on March 9 but could not push the price above the 20-day EMA ($89).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/9ff9e2d5-ce6b-4d8e-b666-c81b072aa58b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If bears sink and sustain the price below $81, the selling could intensify. The SOL/USDT pair could then resume its downtrend and plunge toward the next support at $66.\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages suggest that the path of least resistance is to the downside but the positive divergence on the RSI indicates that the sellers need to be careful of a possible bear trap.\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the current level, the bulls will again try to push and sustain the pair above the downtrend line. If they manage to do that, the pair could rally to $122.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) attempt to recover on March 9 met with strong resistance at the 20-day EMA ($0.88). This suggests that the sentiment remains negative and traders are selling on every minor rally.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/d4bd9e2d-2958-4f32-8977-fff88a752c8c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The downsloping moving averages and the RSI in the negative territory suggest the path of least resistance is to the downside.\par \par \uc2 The bears will now again attempt to pull the price below the strong support at $0.74 and resume the downtrend. A close below $0.74 could open the doors for a further decline to the next support at $0.68.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will have to push and sustain the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair above the psychological level at $1 to suggest that the bears may be losing their grip.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/here-s-how-traders-were-alerted-to-rune-s-fun-s-waves-and-knc-s-big-rallies-last-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s how traders were alerted to RUNE\u8217\'20\'19s, FUN\u8217\'20\'19s, WAVES\u8217\'20\'19 and KNC\u8217\'20\'19s big rallies last week}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/avalanche"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) failed to climb and sustain above the moving averages on March 9. This suggests that bears are defending the moving averages while the bulls are buying on dips to the uptrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/384690a7-b1c3-41f4-9353-19aab1324641.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Generally, tight ranges result in sharp trending moves. If bears sink and sustain the price below the uptrend line, the AVAX/USDT pair could start its decline toward the important support at $51. It may not be a straight drop because the bulls will try to arrest the fall in the zone between $64 and $61.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bulls push the price above the moving averages, the pair will again attempt to rise above the downtrend line of the descending channel. A break and close above the channel could signal that the downtrend may be ending.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 After struggling to stay above the 20-day EMA ($17) on March 9 and 10, Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) has managed to break the resistance today. The bulls are currently attempting to push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($18).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/67c91d9f-e760-4ff7-bf13-c5f1b58d5c0e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, it will suggest that the downtrend could be ending. The DOT/USDT pair could thereafter rally to the overhead resistance at $23. A break and close above this resistance will signal a potential change in trend.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level, the bears will try to pull the price below the solid support at $16. If they manage to do that, the pair could retest the next major support at $14.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) relief rally on March 9 fizzled out at the 20-day EMA ($0.12). This suggests that the bears are not ready to give up and they continue to sell near resistance levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/cb3de78f-b542-4c92-9a6a-3751df2c399c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The DOGE/USDT pair dropped back below $0.12 on March 10, increasing the possibility of a retest of the critical support at $0.10. This zone is likely to attract strong buying from the bulls. The buyers will have to push and sustain the price above the 50-day SMA ($0.13) to indicate that the downtrend could be weakening.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if bears sink the price below $0.10, the selling could accelerate and the pair could plummet to the next support at $0.06.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvY2E1MTdiZmEtNzQ2Ny00N2NjLTg2NDMtODZlOGZiZDAxNDg5LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220311ei3b000b5\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin prints classic Bart pattern as BTC price dives back below $40K\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 503 \uc2 words\par \uc2 10 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC price action frustrates traders after breaking then returning under $40,000 again.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) reversed in classic fashion on March 10 after bulls failed once again to hold higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/12ad18a6-06e7-4603-8e3e-48ffea0a2275.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Bart\u8216\'20\'18s back on the Bitcoin chart\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.142027444.742658523.1640948929-762064149.1640948929"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD forming a characteristic \u8220\'20\'1CBart Simpson\u8221\'20\'1D retracement pattern overnight on Wednesday.\par \par \uc2 The pair had managed to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-returns-to-42k-as-markets-await-potential-7-9-cpi-inflation-data"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-returns-to-42k-as-markets-await-potential-7-9-cpi-inflation-data}}}{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-returns-to-42k-as-markets-await-potential-7-9-cpi-inflation-data"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pass $42,000 before consolidating}}}\uc2 , but a lack of support meant that a drop back to its previous trading zone below $40,000 was the grimly familiar outcome.\par \par \uc2 Such Bart formations had come several times in the weeks prior and underscored the difficulty experienced by a market stuck firmly in an established trading range for months.\par \par \uc2 - Was no follow up in price or volume for deriv bidders\par \par \uc2 - attempting to unwind their longs and tanked the market\par \par \uc2 volume, predicted funding, and open interest tell the story {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/hJD6QVRUek"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/hJD6QVRUek}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Dylan LeClair (@DylanLeClair_) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/DylanLeClair_/status/1501789292619866114?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 March 10, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 Those hoping for {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/trader-gives-44k-btc-price-target-as-bitcoin-shrugs-off-executive-order-nothingburger"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 upside continuation were thus left disappointed}}}\uc2  with cross-crypto liquidations for the 24 hours to the time of writing totaling $211 million, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.coinglass.com/LiquidationData"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 according}}}\uc2  to data from analytics resource Coinglass.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/bbb105e0-e612-440b-8ef8-c9354fd49a0d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Crypto liquidations chart. Source: Coinglass\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CFried bulls this morning,\u8221\'20\'1D popular trader Crypto Ed, who had called the end of the upside at Wednesday\u8217\'20\'19s highs, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Crypto_Ed_NL/status/1501827165972832257"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told}}}\uc2 Twitter\uc2  followers.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CThis is not PA but PP Ping Pong And yes, Asians always been good in Ping Pong,\u8221\'20\'1D he added, referring to both the up and down slopes of the \u8220\'20\'1CBart\u8221\'20\'1D occurring during Asian market hours.\par \par \uc2 March 10, meanwhile, would see the release of U.S. consumer price index (CPI) data for February, this tipped to show inflation still running hot at an estimated 7.9% year-on-year.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CCPI number comes out tomorrow & the FOMC meeting is in less than a week (March 15 & 16),\u8221\'20\'1D trader and analyst Matthew Hyland {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MatthewHyland_/status/1501685616173813760/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 forecasted}}}\uc2  in part of a March 9 tweet.\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CI expect \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  ahead, but increased certainty as a result.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 An accompanying chart underlined key resistance levels for BTC/USD to overcome along with support at $36,300 and $33,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/478b977b-db8f-4f63-b603-cfdf71e73194.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD chart with key levels marked. Source: Matthew Hyland/ Twitter\par \par \uc2 Altcoins in copycat U-turn\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  likewise cost altcoins much of their latest gains, with Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) down 5.1% to less than $2,600.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-3-9-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-luna-sol-ada-avax-dot-doge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 3/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, LUNA, SOL, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, DOT, DOGE}}}\par \par \uc2 Many others out of the top ten cryptocurrencies by market cap were equally gloomy on the day, with previous high flyer Terra ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  ) nonetheless managing to linger near $100 highs.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/baf59200-a69a-4956-b8aa-1650627de204.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USD 1-hour candle chart (Binance). Source: TradingView\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvYTMzZjViZDYtYzBhZi00MDAzLWFkNWItMWNlMDI3YjViNGZlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220310ei3a0002w\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin rallied, but analysts say it\u8217\'20\'19s \u8216\'20\'18more of the same\u8217\'20\'19 until $46K becomes support\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Jordan Finneseth \par \uc2 603 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC price made a 10% move toward a key resistance level, but traders warn that the price action is just \u8220\'20\'1Cmore of the same\u8221\'20\'1D until $46,000 is flipped to support.\par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 " is the word of the month, and that is exactly what cryptocurrency investors saw today when Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) rallied after concerns over the Biden administration's executive order on crypto {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/trader-gives-44k-btc-price-target-as-bitcoin-shrugs-off-executive-order-nothingburger"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 turned out to be a "nothingburger}}}\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  shows that, after trading near the $39,000 mark for the past few days, the price of Bitcoin spiked 10.42% to an intraday high of $42,606 as cautious traders flooded back into the market.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/729c7093-9901-4ea2-b028-43ccdda5a24c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT 1-day chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Here\u8217\'20\'19s a look at what traders and analysts in the market are saying about this latest move and the areas of support and resistance to keep an eye on.\par \par \uc2 "Different pump, same story"\par \par \uc2 Wednesday\u8217\'20\'19s move for Bitcoin was just a repeat of recent behavior, according to crypto analyst and pseudonymous \uc2 Twitter\uc2  user "Plan C," who {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/TheRealPlanC/status/1501428878107107329"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 posted}}}\uc2  the following chart, stating, \u8220\'20\'1CDifferent pump, same story.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/b61b1175-c47a-4431-a907-610ca8673051.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Upper and lower trend support bands for Bitcoin. Source: \uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 Plan C further said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1C#BTC needs to break the 'downtrend resistance band,' AKA Uptrend Support Band, and then hold it as support. Otherwise, this is just another cry wolf move. Uptrend Support Band: $43,564 - $46,265.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Independent market analyst "Crypto_Ed_NL" agreed with this sentiment and suggested further sideways trading in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Crypto_Ed_NL/status/1501612724656259072"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 post}}}\uc2  below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/432d4b8e-9561-4607-80aa-460fe0a70089.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 4-hour chart. Source: \uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 Crypto_Ed_NL said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CNo, this is not some new Elliott Wave theory\u8230\'20\'26 It's what I think is coming next. Pump-range-pump-dump-range-dump-range-pump.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Overconfidence is not advised!\par \par \uc2 Analysts at Delphi Digital noted that Bitcoin is now bumping up against the \u8220\'20\'1Csimple trendline connecting the local highs from December 2021 and February 2022.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/8d18c739-97bb-4aa1-a47f-1a7a9d859dde.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 12-hour chart. Source: Delphi Digital\par \par \uc2 According to Delphi Digital, now that BTC is back above $40,000, traders should \u8220\'20\'1Clook for this level around $42,500-$43,000 to be tested,\u8221\'20\'1D which is exactly what occurred in trading on March 9.\par \par \uc2 Delphi Digital said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CContrarian sentiment analysis is often a good place to begin looking for trades much like the latest short-term rally in prices off of the $34,000 lows, but we caution the worsening macro and global backdrop is still a key consideration for market performance at this point in time.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-3-9-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-luna-sol-ada-avax-dot-doge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 3/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, LUNA, SOL, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, DOT, DOGE}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin needs to close above $43,100\par \par \uc2 Independent market analyst "Rekt Capital" {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1501566288820383747"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 posted}}}\uc2  the following chart highlighting that \u8220\'20\'1C#BTC has performed upside wicks beyond the $43,100 resistance on a few occasions over the past few weeks (orange circle).\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/6c8b62f4-80b2-4edd-b352-1a8c33f204b3.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-week chart. Source: \uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 Rekt Capital said:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhich is why it's important that $BTC performs a Weekly Close above this level, just like in the previous blue circle in August 2021.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The overall cryptocurrency market cap now stands at $1.839 trillion and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dominance rate is 43.5%.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvNjE5MjAxMmEtZGJhYS00YzgxLTljZjgtMzdjZDEwMGNkMmJlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220310ei3900008\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Cryptocurrencies\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin rallied, but analysts say it\u8217\'20\'19s \u8216\'20\'18more of the same\u8217\'20\'19 until $46K becomes support\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Jordan Finneseth \par \uc2 603 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 BTC price made a 10% move toward a key resistance level, but traders warn that the price action is just \u8220\'20\'1Cmore of the same\u8221\'20\'1D until $46,000 is flipped to support.\par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 " is the word of the month and that is exactly what cryptocurrency investors saw today as Bitcoin rallied after concerns over the Biden administration's executive order on crypto {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/trader-gives-44k-btc-price-target-as-bitcoin-shrugs-off-executive-order-nothingburger"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 turned out to be a 'nothingburger'}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\f