ment and suggestion further sideways trading in the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/Crypto_Ed_NL/status/1501612724656259072"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 post}}}\uc2  below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/432d4b8e-9561-4607-80aa-460fe0a70089.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 4-hour chart. Source: \uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 Crypto_Ed_NL said,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CNo, this is not some new Elliott Wave theory\u8230\'20\'26 It's what I think is coming next. Pump-range-pump-dump-range-dump-range-pump.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Overconfidence is not advised!\par \par \uc2 Analysts at Delphi Digital noted that Bitcoin is now bumping up against the \u8220\'20\'1Csimple trendline connecting the local highs from December 2021 and February 2022.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/8d18c739-97bb-4aa1-a47f-1a7a9d859dde.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 12-hour chart. Source: Delphi Digital\par \par \uc2 According to Delphi Digital, now that BTC is back above $40,000, traders should \u8220\'20\'1Clook for this level around $42,500-$43,000 to be tested,\u8221\'20\'1D which is exactly what occurred in trading on March 9.\par \par \uc2 Delphi Digital said,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CContrarian sentiment analysis is often a good place to begin looking for trades much like the latest short-term rally in prices off of the $34,000 lows, but we caution the worsening macro and global backdrop is still a key consideration for market performance at this point in time.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-3-9-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-luna-sol-ada-avax-dot-doge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 3/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, LUNA, SOL, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, DOT, DOGE}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin needs to close above $43,100\par \par \uc2 Independent market analyst \u8216\'20\'18Rekt Capital\u8217\'20\'19 {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/rektcapital/status/1501566288820383747"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 posted}}}\uc2  the following chart highlighting that \u8220\'20\'1CBTC has performed upside wicks beyond the $43,100 resistance on a few occasions over the past few weeks (orange circle).\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/6c8b62f4-80b2-4edd-b352-1a8c33f204b3.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-week chart. Source: \uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 Rekt Capital said,\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CWhich is why it's important that BTC performs a Weekly Close above this level, just like in the previous blue circle in August 2021.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The overall cryptocurrency market cap now stands at $1.839 trillion and Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s dominance rate is 43.5%.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvNjE5MjAxMmEtZGJhYS00YzgxLTljZjgtMzdjZDEwMGNkMmJlLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220309ei39000dx\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/9: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, LUNA, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,756 \uc2 words\par \uc2 9 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin and several altcoins are showing early signs that the bear trend could be ending, but overcoming higher levels may prove to be a challenge.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) soared on March 9 as the Dow futures recovered sharply and United States Treasury Secretary Janet Yellen\u8217\'20\'19s statement on President Joe Biden\u8217\'20\'19s executive order regarding digital assets, which was {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/janet-yellen-let-slip-details-of-biden-s-executive-order-on-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 released a day earlier by error}}}\uc2 , contained positive statements about the crypto industry.\par \par \uc2 For the past few days, investors seem to have been accumulating cryptocurrencies at lower levels. \uc2 CoinShares\uc2  data for the week ending March 6 shows that {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-funds-register-largest-weekly-inflows-since-december"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 cumulative inflows of $127 million}}}\uc2  into \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment products were the highest since Dec. 12, 2021, and Bitcoin products saw an increase for the seventh consecutive week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/d19b763a-c7fe-495b-87f0-e20eab97a3fb.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: Coin360\par \par \uc2 However, Bloomberg Intelligence senior commodity strategist Mike McGlone sounded cautious when he warned that the current geopolitical situation and surging crude oil prices caused a global recession, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-s-tvl-dominance-drops-to-55-as-bloomberg-analyst-paints-1-7k-bearish-target"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Bitcoin and Ether could face selling pressure initially}}}\uc2 . McGlone cautioned that if the U.S. equity markets plunge, Ether could drop to $1,700 because it is closely correlated to Nasdaq 100.\par \par \uc2 Could Bitcoin and altcoins sustain the higher levels? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 The failure of the bears to pull the price below the immediate support at $37,000 may have attracted strong buying by the bulls. Bitcoin has soared above the moving averages on March 9.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/e530d98d-a880-49ef-a242-5b2215b4b6a5.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relative strength index (RSI) has jumped into the positive territory, indicating that the momentum may be turning \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2 . If buyers sustain the price above the moving averages, the BTC/USDT pair could rise to the overhead zone between $45,000 and the resistance line of the ascending channel. The bears are expected to defend this zone with vigor.\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from the overhead zone, the pair could extend its stay inside the channel for a few more days. The bears will have to pull and sustain the price below the support line of the channel to gain control.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bears could not capitalize on the breakdown below the symmetrical triangle. Strong buying by the bulls near $2,400 started a recovery and Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) has re-entered the triangle. This suggests that the recent breakdown may have been a bear trap.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/5a0852b7-dc77-47ea-8120-33eda6c10917.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls are attempting to push and sustain the price above the moving averages. If they do that, the ETH/USDT pair could rally to the resistance line of the triangle. If bulls clear this barrier, it will suggest the possible start of a new uptrend. The pair could first rally toward the psychological level at $4,000 and then make a dash toward the pattern target at $4,311.\par \par \uc2 This positive view will invalidate if the price turns down from the current level or the resistance line. That could keep the pair inside the triangle for a few more days. The bears will have to pull the pair below $2,400 to gain the upper hand.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) has broken above the 50-day simple moving average (SMA) ($392) and if bulls sustain the higher levels, the up-move could reach the overhead resistance at $445.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/aff60593-bb54-48fc-b8f8-aa0e95c7865e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bears are likely to mount a strong defense at $445. If the price turns down from this level, the BNB/USDT pair could drop to the moving averages. The flat 20-day exponential moving average (EMA) ($387) and the RSI near the midpoint indicate a balance between supply and demand.\par \par \uc2 If bulls fail to sustain the price above the 50-day SMA, the bears will fancy their chances and try to pull the pair toward the support at $350. The price action inside the range between $445 and $350 is likely to remain volatile.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls continue to defend the 50-day SMA ($0.72), indicating strong demand at lower levels. The buyers will now try to push and sustain Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) above the downtrend line.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/00fa4272-ce12-4acf-93b1-1f5e258aa0f3.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If they succeed, the buying could accelerate and the XRP/USDT pair may rally to the overhead zone between $0.85 and $0.91. This zone may offer strong resistance by the bears but if the bulls bulldoze their way through, the pair could rally to the psychological level at $1.\par \par \uc2 On the downside, the bears will have to pull and sustain the price below $0.68 to turn the tables in their favor. The pair could then drop to the Feb. 24 intraday low at $0.62.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token bounced off the 20-day EMA ($77) on March 8, indicating that the sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/e9a785d2-56ec-4003-ba68-75ca12bd585d.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pushed the price above the overhead resistance at $94 and the LUNA/USDT pair is now close to the all-time high at $103. This level is likely to act as a stiff resistance but if bulls overcome this barrier, it will suggest the start of a new uptrend. The pair could then rally toward $125.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the rally stalls at $103, the bears will attempt to pull the price back below $94. If that happens, the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  momentum could weaken in the short term. The positive momentum could remain intact as long as the price sustains above $94.\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) has bounced off the critical support at $81, indicating strong demand at this level. The RSI has formed a positive divergence, suggesting that the selling pressure could be reducing.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/e3deca8a-f7fc-4f0b-b895-a884d4f9d850.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls will now try to push the price above the downtrend line. If they manage to do that, it will invalidate the developing descending triangle pattern. Such a move may result in short-covering by the aggressive bulls, propelling the price toward the overhead resistance at $122. If bulls clear this hurdle, it could signal the start of a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  assumption will invalidate if the price turns down and breaks below the strong support at $81. That will complete the descending triangle pattern and open the doors for a possible drop to $66.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) bounced off the $0.74 support, indicating that bulls are buying on dips. The bulls will now attempt to push the price above the 20-day EMA ($0.90) and challenge the psychological level at $1.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/4bd46947-783b-4978-bfed-6be9cf2ed38c.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price turns down from $1, it will suggest that bears continue to sell at higher levels. The \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could then spend some time inside the $0.74 to $1 range.\par \par \uc2 If bears sink the price below $0.74, the downtrend could resume. The pair could then drop to the next support at $0.68.\par \par \uc2 On the other hand, if bulls push and sustain the price above $1, it will signal a possible change in the short-term trend. The pair could then rise to $1.26 where the bears may mount a strong resistance.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/trader-gives-44k-btc-price-target-as-bitcoin-shrugs-off-executive-order-nothingburger"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Trader gives $44K BTC price target as Bitcoin shrugs off executive order 'nothingburger'}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) bounced off the uptrend line, indicating that bulls continue to buy on dips to this level. The buyers will now attempt to push the price to the downtrend line of the descending channel.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/070cff06-229a-413d-ba49-d62961e483e4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the channel will signal a potential change in trend. The AVAX/USDT pair could then rally to the psychological level at $100.\par \par \uc2 However, this may not be easy because the price has turned down from the downtrend line on four previous occasions. The bears will again try to stall the up-move at this level. If the price turns down from the downtrend line, the bears will again try to sink the pair below the uptrend line. If they pull it off, the pair could extend its decline to $51.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls held on to the support at $16 on March 7, which is a positive sign. Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) will now attempt to break above the 50-day SMA ($18), which is an important level to keep an eye on.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/b12eb7a2-e7d6-48b9-8afa-fded6572f1d0.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price sustains above the 50-day SMA, it will indicate a possible change in the short-term trend. The DOT/USDT pair could then rally to the overhead resistance at $23. A break and close above this level could signal the start of a new uptrend with the first target objective at $30 and then $32.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that bears are not willing to relent and are selling on rallies. That will increase the possibility of a break below $16.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/doge-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed below $0.12 on March 7 but the bears could not take advantage of this breakdown. This indicates that bulls are defending the zone between $0.12 and $0.10 aggressively.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/25641c4d-7535-4bd5-a1a4-c72d928f5cf7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The bulls have pushed the price back above the breakdown level at $0.12. If the DOGE/USDT pair sustains above this level, the bulls will attempt to drive the price above the moving averages. If they succeed, it will suggest that bears may be losing their grip. The pair could then rally to the overhead resistance at $0.17.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the moving averages, it will indicate that bears have not yet given up and are selling on rallies. The sellers will then again try to sink the pair below the support zone.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph. Every investment and trading move involves risk. You should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par \uc2 Market data is provided by {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://hitbtc.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 HitBTC}}}\uc2  exchange.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvNDBhOTU4ZDgtMmFlOS00MjE5LTgzOGItNmMzNjVjMDM3OTc0LmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220309ei39000b7\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Ethereum\par \b \uc2 Ethereum's TVL dominance drops to 55% as Bloomberg analyst paints $1.7K  \highlight22\uc2 bearish \highlight\uc2  target\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Yashu Gola \par \uc2 913 \uc2 words\par \uc2 8 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 ETH price has been increasingly in lockstep with the Nasdaq, while Ethereum's TVL market share has taken a hit.\par \par \uc2 Another big drop in the U.S. stock market could leave Ethereum's native token Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) in a similar downside spell, according to the latest Bloomberg report on digital assets.\par \par \uc2 Ethereum faces global recession risks\par \par \uc2 Mike McGlone, the senior commodity strategist at Bloomberg Intelligence, anticipates U.S. equities to face downside pressure against the prospects of the {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/rate-hikes-cpi-and-war-in-europe-5-things-to-watch-in-bitcoin-this-week"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ongoing energy-price spikes}}}\uc2  and their ability to invoke a 2008-like global market recession\par \par \uc2 "The war in Ukraine and spiking crude make a potent combination for a global recession," {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://assets.bbhub.io/professional/sites/10/1666154_BloombergCryptoOutlookMarch2022.pdf"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 wrote}}}\uc2  McGlone in the report, adding that top cryptocurrencies like Bitcoin and Ether could also face initial pressures.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/19a6b04b-b2f4-4866-a275-0504b4053131.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 WTI crude oil weekly price chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Correlations between U.S. stock indexes and top cryptocurrencies have only {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-heading-to-36k-analysis-says-amid-warning-global-stocks-look-expensive"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 increased}}}\uc2  during the ongoing global market rout and Ukraine-Russia conflict.\par \par \uc2 In particular, Ether's correlation efficiency with {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/3-reasons-why-bitcoin-can-rally-back-to-60k-despite-erasing-last-week-s-gains"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 tech-heavy Nasdaq 100}}}\uc2  rose to 0.93 four days after Russia invaded Ukraine but has since corrected to 0.67. An absolute value of 1 means the two assets move perfectly in tandem.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/44e6c054-da26-405f-b8b7-5d8b69981a13.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD daily price chart featuring its correlation with Nasdaq 100. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 McGlone spotted Ether trading in the middle of a range defined by its 100-week exponential moving average (100-day EMA; the red wave in the chart below) near $6,000 and its 30-week EMA (the green wave) near $2,000. He also expects significant selling pressure at the interim resistance level of $4,000.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/288ffce0-4d21-40a9-a9e9-26144853a4d4.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD weekly price chart. Source: Bloomberg Intelligence\par \par \uc2 "Our graphic depicts Ethereum at about the middle of the range," the strategist wrote, asserting that "if the stock market takes another leg lower, Ethereum is more likely to revisit the lower end" near $2,000. He added:\par \par \uc2 "If equities drop fast, Ethereum could repeat last summer and revisit about $1,700."\par \par \uc2 Ethereum TVL share drops to record lows\par \par \uc2 The latest data shows that Ethereum's market dominance is {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-dominance-may-dwindle-as-competitors-emerge-morgan-stanley"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 also giving up ground}}}\uc2  to competitors like Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ), Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/avalanche-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ), and Terra ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  ).\par \par \uc2 The share of the total value locked (TVL) on the Ethereum network declined below 55%, its lowest level on record, from 97% at the start of 2021, according to data from DeFi Llama.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/c5f441ee-ba44-4774-91b9-028ffec5c4dc.jpeg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Share of total value locked by chain. Source: Defi Llama, Galaxy Digital Research\par \par \uc2 Tom Dunleavy, a researcher at Messari, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://messari.io/article/the-future-of-l1s-is-near-an-analysis-of-an-emerging-protocol"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 notes}}}\uc2  that new layer-one blockchains are comparatively "faster, cheaper, or provide a more attractive reward structure" than Ethereum.\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, he adds that completely overtaking Ethereum and Ethereum Virtual Machine (EVM), a software platform to create decentralized applications (DApps), would be hard due to first-mover advantage.\par \par \uc2 "The EVM\u8217\'20\'19s advantage has been so great that major competitors use or bridge to the EVM, rather than try to compete head-to-head without this capability," Dunleavy wrote, adding:\par \par \uc2 "Even competitors that held out like Solana and Cardano have recently added or are adding EVM compatibility (Terra being the notable exception). In many cases, the EVM has already cemented itself through its network effects."\par \par \uc2 But most of the so-called "Ethereum killers," except {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/terra-price-gains-75-in-february-as-2-57b-in-luna-tokens-removed-from-supply"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Terra}}}\uc2 , have fared far worse so far in 2022 when faced with geopolitical conflicts, energy crises, and rate hike risks.\par \par \uc2 For instance, Solana and Cardano {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-tvl-and-price-drop-50-from-ath-but-gaming-dapps-could-turn-the-tables"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 dropped}}}\uc2  by more than 50% year-to-date versus Ether's 30% price decline. Avalanche price dropped by 37% in the same period.\par \par \uc2 Can Ethereum regain market share?\par \par \uc2 Not everyone expects Ethereum's TVL market share downtrend to continue, however. Marcus Sotiriou, an analyst at GlobalBlock, {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/ethereum-risks-crashing-under-2k-as-eth-paints-bearish-symmetrical-triangle-analyst"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 anticipates}}}\uc2  Ethereum to regain its dominance as it switches to proof-of-stake later this year from its current proof-of-work protocol.\par \par \uc2 "This is because it should dramatically reduce the cost of transactions on the Ethereum network, which is currently Ethereum's main drawback," he {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://markets.businessinsider.com/news/currencies/ethereum-blockchain-technology-crypto-cryptocurrency-ether-eth-vitalik-buterin-markets-2022-3"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 told Business Insider}}}\uc2  earlier this month. As of now, Ethereum works on a surge-pricing model, leading to highly volatile transaction fees.\par \par \uc2 In August 2021, the network underwent a so-called "{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/cointelegraph-consulting-measuring-the-effects-of-the-london-hard-fork"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 London hard fork}}}\uc2 " that employed a key EIP-1559 protocol. In particular, the EIP-1559 allows the Ethereum protocol to {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/the-ethereum-improvement-proposal-1559-is-the-squeeze-worth-the-juice"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 burn gas fees}}}\uc2 , meaning that a portion of Ether's supply goes out of circulation permanently.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/explained/buyback-and-burn-what-does-it-mean-in-crypto"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Buyback-and-burn: What does it mean in crypto?}}}\par \par \uc2 "Bitcoin and Ethereum remain in early adoption days, with increasing demand vs. declining supply and related price implications," explained McGlone, adding:\par \par \uc2 "Our bias is why complicate it -- unless something unlikely reverses the proliferation of the nascent technology, prices should rise."\par \par \uc2 The strategist also anticipates that Ether's correlation with the U.S. stock market will also decrease due to to so-called "declining relative risk."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/6702d842-5d43-4b25-94e2-c17b54cc7031.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Ethereum \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  vs. the Nasdaq. Source: Bloomberg Intelligence\par \par \uc2 "Closer to 3x now, the relative risk of the nascent technology/asset is poised to keep falling, particularly if the war increases recession risks and stock market \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he asserted.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvMzFiZmExMjYtZTY1My00YTE1LTg3OTQtNGM0YWZmNjY1NTdiLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220308ei380005o\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin loses $40K as BTC price support levels give way to 1-week lows\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 502 \uc2 words\par \uc2 5 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin fails to turn $40,000 to support once more as BTC price action hits weekly lows.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) stayed below some critical support zones into the weekend after a late sell-off cost bulls the $40,000 mark.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/4b2fc2f2-a6b0-4b1d-8ea7-5cef414b7492.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Upper range support levels crumble for BTC\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.142027444.742658523.1640948929-762064149.1640948929"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  painted a lackluster picture for BTC/USD Saturday, the pair lingering near $39,000 after seeing lows of $38,600.\par \par \uc2 Traders had hoped that various price points above $40,000 would be sufficient to steady the market after its latest run to $45,200.\par \par \uc2 In the event, however, bids {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-declines-with-us-stocks-as-nuclear-threat-ripples-through-markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 failed to preserve}}}\uc2  the trend, sending Bitcoin back to the middle of a range in which it had acted throughout 2022.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/hashtag/Bitcoin?src=hash&ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 #Bitcoin}}}\uc2  is hanging onto the edge of a cliff the past few hours {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://t.co/dAD2AveTOi"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 pic.twitter.com/dAD2AveTOi}}}\par \par \uc2 \u8212\'20\'14 Matthew Hyland (@MatthewHyland_) {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/MatthewHyland_/status/1499947314571579394?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 March 5, 2022}}}\par \par \uc2 In a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://decentrader.com/market_updates/bitcoin-htf-analysis/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 market update}}}\uc2  released Friday, Filbfilb, co-founder of trading suite Decentrader, had highlighted $36,000 as a potential target for shorts should the area around $39,500 fail to hold \u8212\'20\'14 something which ultimately proved to be so.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin, he had said, was "still rangebound on a macro level," but support was there as a "rising tide," which looked apt to preserve long-term structures.\par \par \uc2 Among these was the 200-week moving average (MA), now above $20,000 and rising, which should provide definitive support as macro markets experience something similar to the March 2020 Covid crash in terms of sentiment.\par \par \uc2 "Systematic risk in the market is high and as a result, \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\uc2  should be expected and trade size and duration should be considered with this in mind," Filbfilb advised.\par \par \uc2 "Short-term panic"\par \par \uc2 Also eyeing the macro environment was Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe, who in an extended {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eiXqyypxOK0"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 YouTube video}}}\uc2  discussed the impact of the Ukraine-Russia conflict and its knock-on effects worldwide.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-3-4-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-luna-sol-ada-avax-dot-doge"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Price analysis 3/4: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, LUNA, SOL, \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 , AVAX, DOT, DOGE}}}\par \par \uc2 Due to short-term flights to safety, he argued, gold and the U.S. dollar were profiting at Bitcoin's expense, yet under the surface, adoption was taking place.\par \par \uc2 "At this stage, we're seeing that Bitcoin is dropping down significantly. Why is that? That's because of short-term panic," he said.\par \par \uc2 In another nod to the events of March 2020, both Bitcoin and altcoins should be in for a renaissance as usage increases, Van de Poppe added, this beginning with Bitcoin before expanding into DeFi assets.\par \par \uc2 Major altcoin tokens managed to avoid the extent of Bitcoin's losses on daily timeframes, broadly keeping these under 5%.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) was down 3.1% in 24 hours at the time of writing at $2,650.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/de114a1b-f8e6-441a-b76d-0947cf130a84.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvMTAzYmE2NDItMTk3NC00NTYxLWFhOTMtYjdmMjFjNTM0MmNmLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220305ei350002t\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Bitcoin\par \b \uc2 Bitcoin sees $43K dip amid expectations of 'another run' for BTC price\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By William Suberg \par \uc2 388 \uc2 words\par \uc2 3 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin retains most of its gains after BTC price dips to $43,000.\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) corrected from highs above $45,000 on March 3 as traders' optimism over continued upside remained in the driving seat.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/cb807085-4d44-4a60-9d8b-2428f09603da.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 "Liquidity taken" at $43,000\par \par \uc2 Data from {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://pro.cointelegraph.com/?via=markets&_ga=2.142027444.742658523.1640948929-762064149.1640948929"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Cointelegraph Markets Pro}}}\uc2  and {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.tradingview.com/symbols/BTCUSD/?exchange=BINANCE"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 TradingView}}}\uc2  showed BTC/USD briefly dipping below $43,000 Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The reset was expected, punctuating a multi-day uptrend which had seen the pair add $10,000 in a single week.\par \par \uc2 "Short term correction happened on Bitcoin after taking the liquidity again," Cointelegraph contributor Micha\u235\'00\'EBl van de Poppe summarized in a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1499288538839502851"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Twitter update}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "Looks to me like we're going to see another run to the highs, as the correction is not as swift as we normally would be."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bitcoin-casts-off-dip-climbs-past-45k-as-fed-signals-rate-hike-coming-in-march"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Eyes were on}}}\uc2  the yearly opening price at just above $46,000, alongside order book resistance at $48,000.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, accumulation continued, with smaller investors coming into focus as keen buyers at current levels.\par \par \uc2 "The small fish are stacking sats like there is no tomorrow," analytics resource Ecoinometrics {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/ecoinometrics/status/1499215805585637378"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 commented}}}\uc2  alongside a chart showing buying habits this week.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/8d0ef118-d79c-459a-8b8b-3b5610ffd879.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin investor accumulation chart. Source: Ecoinometrics/ \uc2 Twitter\par \par \uc2 Altcoins retain higher \b \highlight22\uc2 volatility\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 Despite the overall \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  performance this week, none of the top ten cryptocurrencies by market cap were all in the red on daily timeframes at the time of writing.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/45-000-bitcoin-looks-cheap-when-compared-to-gold-s-marketcap"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 $45,000 Bitcoin looks cheap when compared with gold\u8217\'20\'19s market cap}}}\par \par \uc2 While BTC/USD was down around 1.8%, major altcoins fared worse, led by Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/solana-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) and Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), both more than 5% lower.\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ), the largest altcoin by market cap, shed 3.5% to return under the $3,000 mark, something which had yet to established itself as meaningful support.\par \par \uc2 "The markets are relatively calm. People have low interest in crypto right now. Engagement is low on social media on all accounts," Van de Poppe {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoMichNL/status/1499310622475005952"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 continued}}}\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "Ethereum gas fees are on an ultra-low level. Those are the times that you actually should start paying attention, as it gives opportunities."\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/fb6977de-47b2-4830-8418-60946ff0992b.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USD 1-hour candle chart (\uc2 Bitstamp\uc2 ). Source: TradingView\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXBoLmNvbS91cGxvYWRzLzIwMjItMDMvMTdiYTEwM2QtNGMzMi00ZTNlLWFiM2UtNmZjOTVkNzI2ZGVhLmpwZw==.jpg"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Document CONTEL0020220303ei330005r\par }\page {\par\fs20\uc2 Markets\par \b \uc2 Price analysis 3/2: BTC, ETH, BNB, XRP, LUNA, SOL,  \highlight22\uc2 ADA \highlight\uc2 , AVAX, DOT, DOGE\b0\par\par\uc2 Cointelegraph By Rakesh Upadhyay \par \uc2 1,843 \uc2 words\par \uc2 2 March 2022\par \uc2 The Cointelegraph\par \uc2 CONTEL\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 \u169\'00\'A9 Cointelegraph 2022. All rights reserved. \par \par \uc2 Bitcoin appears to be losing momentum and altcoins are stalling, but the fact that bulls are holding key support levels could signal that the rally will continue after a brief pause.\par \par \uc2 The speculation regarding the \uc2 U.S. Federal Reserve\uc2 \u8217\'20\'19s tightening cycle and recent geopolitical developments may have resulted in panic selling by short-term traders. Analysis from Glassnode suggested that traders who had purchased Bitcoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) near the November 2021 high liquidated their positions in the past two and half months. This {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/btc-price-now-has-support-above-40k-as-data-shows-bitcoin-redistribution-event"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 supply was absorbed by high conviction investors}}}\uc2 , which resulted in a redistribution from weak hands to strong hands.\par \par \uc2 The crypto market, due to its resilience, continues to attract erstwhile naysayers to its fold. The latest popular figure to have a {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/billionaire-admits-he-was-wrong-about-bitcoin-as-citadel-looks-to-crypto-markets"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 change of heart is Ken Griffin}}}\uc2 , founder of American multinational hedge fund and financial services company \uc2 Citadel\uc2 . In an interview with Bloomberg, Griffin said that \uc2 Citadel\uc2  will \u8220\'20\'1Cengage in making markets in cryptocurrencies\u8221\'20\'1D over the next few months.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/5a3a2e04-77fe-48de-acb5-c3ec6c04cf82.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Daily cryptocurrency market performance. Source: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coin360.com/"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Coin360}}}\par \par \uc2 Voyager Digital\uc2  co-founder and CEO \uc2 Stephen Ehrlich\uc2  told Cointelegraph that the firm\u8217\'20\'19s recent quarter was its \u8220\'20\'1Cbest ever, so I certainly feel {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-businesses-will-be-rewarded-over-the-long-term-says-voyager-ceo"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 it's a great time to be in crypto}}}\uc2 ." Along with businesses, Ehrlich believes that crypto investors are likely to be rewarded in the long term.\par \par \uc2 Will the demand remain intact at higher levels and could the recovery extend further in the next few days? Let\u8217\'20\'19s analyze the charts of the top-10 cryptocurrencies to find out.\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT\par \par \uc2 Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s recovery has reached the overhead resistance zone between $45,821 and the resistance line of the ascending channel. The bears are expected to defend the zone with vigor.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/322937e0-d3e4-422d-a296-f1e78678adf7.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BTC/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day exponential moving average ($40,797) has started to turn up and the relative strength index (RSI) is in the positive territory, indicating advantage to buyers. If the bulls arrest the next dip at the 20-day EMA, it will increase the possibility of a break above the channel. If that happens, the BTC/USDT pair could rally to $52,088.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down and breaks below the moving averages, it will suggest that the pair could remain stuck inside the channel for a few more days. The pair may then drop toward the support line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ether ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ethereum-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 ETH}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the 50-day simple moving average ($2,860) on Feb. 28, indicating that bulls are attempting a comeback. The moving averages are close to completing a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover and the RSI is in the positive territory, indicating that the path of least resistance is to the upside.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/36cb7062-7ba6-4e3e-ae9a-4b350054dace.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 ETH/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price rebounds off the 20-day EMA ($2,824), it will suggest that the bulls are buying on every minor dip. The ETH/USDT pair could then rise to the resistance line of the symmetrical triangle pattern. The bears are likely to defend this level aggressively but if bulls surpass this barrier, the pair could start a new uptrend.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, if the price slips below the 20-day EMA, the pair could drop to the support line of the triangle. A break and close below the triangle could suggest the resumption of the downtrend. The price action inside the triangle is likely to remain volatile.\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT\par \par \uc2 Binance Coin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 50-day SMA ($406) on March 1 but the long wick on the candlestick indicates selling at higher levels. The bulls again pushed the price above the 50-day SMA today but are struggling to sustain the higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/f24e6f15-0ac2-427c-b114-c92cb174b234.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 BNB/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 This indicates that the bears are trying to defend the 50-day SMA. If the price turns down from the current level but does not break below the 20-day EMA ($391), it will suggest that bulls are buying on dips.\par \par \uc2 That will improve the prospects of a break and close above the 50-day SMA. If that happens, the BNB/USDT pair could rally to the overhead resistance at $445. This positive view will invalidate in the short term if the price breaks and sustains below the 20-day EMA.\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT\par \par \uc2 Ripple ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/ripple"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  ) rose to the downtrend line on Feb. 28 where the bears are mounting a strong defense. The price has turned down from the downtrend line and could now drop to the 50-day SMA ($0.72).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/71ccb990-4d73-4e01-8087-525d17d6eb65.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 XRP/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI near the midpoint suggest a balance between supply and demand. This balance will shift in favor of the buyers if the XRP/USDT pair rises and sustains above the downtrend line. The pair could then rally to $0.85 and later to $0.91.\par \par \uc2 Conversely, if the price slips below the 50-day SMA, it will suggest that higher levels continue to witness strong selling. The pair could then drop to $0.68 and if this level also cracks, the next stop may be the Feb. 24 intraday low at $0.62.\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT\par \par \uc2 The bulls have been trying to sustain Terra\u8217\'20\'19s {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/terra-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LUNA}}}\uc2  token above the overhead resistance at $94 for the past two days but the bears have not allowed that to happen.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/9bb945e6-c88d-4f3d-9608-99f3109e8cae.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 LUNA/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The moving averages have completed a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  crossover, indicating advantage to buyers. However, the RSI in the overbought territory suggests that the rally may be extended in the short term. The failure to push and sustain the price above $94 could attract profit-booking from short-term traders.\par \par \uc2 That could pull the price toward $80. If the price rebounds off this level, it will suggest that sentiment remains positive and traders are buying on dips. The bulls will then again attempt to clear the overhead hurdle at $94. If they succeed, the LUNA/USDT pair could retest the all-time high at $103.\par \par \uc2 Alternatively, a break and close below $80 could suggest a deeper correction to the 20-day EMA ($68).\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT\par \par \uc2 Solana ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/solana"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 SOL}}}\uc2  ) broke above the 20-day EMA ($95) on Feb. 28 and successfully held the retest on March 1. The bulls are striving to push the price above the 50-day SMA ($106). If they succeed, the rally could extend to $122.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/0cb5106d-e267-4931-9791-b707ec48e926.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI has risen into the positive zone, indicating that bulls are on a comeback. If bulls push and sustain the price above $122, the SOL/USDT pair will complete a double bottom pattern. The pair could then rally to $163.\par \par \uc2 This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate in the short term if the price turns down and breaks below the 20-day EMA. Such a move will suggest that demand dries up at higher levels. That could keep the pair range-bound between $81 and $122 for a few days.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT\par \par \uc2 Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/cardano"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ) has reached the breakdown level at $1. This is an important level for the bears to defend because a break and close above it will suggest that the markets have rejected the lower levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/e978a46d-5fba-457e-a642-02148cb9f711.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The flattish moving averages and the RSI just below the midpoint suggest that the bears may be losing their grip. If bulls push and sustain the price above $1, the \b \highlight22\uc2 ADA\b0 \highlight\uc2 /USDT pair could rally to the resistance line of the channel.\par \par \uc2 A break and close above the channel will suggest a possible change in trend. The pair could then rise to the overhead resistance at $1.60. This \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  view will invalidate if the price turns down sharply from the current level. In that case, the pair may retest the support at $0.82.\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-price-eyes-150-as-sol-s-25-jump-this-week-puts-double-bottom-in-play"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Solana price eyes $150 as SOL\u8217\'20\'19s 25% jump this week puts \u8216\'20\'18double-bottom\u8217\'20\'19 in play}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT\par \par \uc2 Avalanche ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/avalanche"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 AVAX}}}\uc2  ) broke above the moving averages on Feb. 28 and reached the downtrend line of the descending channel on March 1. The bears are attempting to defend this level as they have done on three previous occasions.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/1dbac495-c4af-4adc-b8c4-79bffbcd9711.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 AVAX/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 If the price dips from the current level but does not break below the moving averages, it will suggest that the sentiment may have changed from sell on rallies to buy on dips.\par \par \uc2 The bulls will then make one more attempt to push and sustain the price above the channel. If they succeed, it will signal a possible change in trend. The AVAX/USDT pair could then rally to $100.\par \par \uc2 On the contrary, if the price breaks and slips below the moving averages, it will suggest that bears continue to sell aggressively. The pair could then drop to $64.\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT\par \par \uc2 Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/polkadot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ) broke and closed above the 20-day EMA ($18) on Feb. 28 but the bulls have not been able to clear the overhead hurdle at the 50-day SMA ($20). This indicates that bears continue to sell at higher levels.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/8b922696-436a-4574-90b1-2efd03a6da7e.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOT/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The 20-day EMA has flattened out and the RSI is just above the midpoint, indicating a possible range-bound action in the near term. If buyers push the price above the 50-day SMA, the DOT/USDT pair could rally to $23.\par \par \uc2 Contrary to this assumption, if the price turns down from the current level and breaks below the 20-day EMA, the pair could retest the strong support zone at $16 to $14. The bears will have to pull the price below this zone to resume the downtrend.\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT\par \par \uc2 Dogecoin ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/tags/dogecoin"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOGE}}}\uc2  ) sharply rebounded off the $0.12 support on Feb. 28, indicating that the bulls are aggressively defending the level.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/54f78b22-ca6f-4304-825f-e707b6d80e62.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 DOGE/USDT daily chart. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 The relief rally is facing resistance at the 20-day EMA ($0.13), suggesting that the bears have not yet given up and they continue to 