 \par \uc2 A $150 SOL ahead?\par \par \uc2 Double-bottoms typically appear at the end of a downtrend when the price falls to a low, rebounds, and returns to the level near the previous low. With bears unable to push the price to a newer low, the selling sentiment becomes exhausted, leading to a sharp upside retracement and a breakout move afterward.\par \par \uc2 SOL has been somewhat {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/bottom-ahead-solana-paints-its-first-death-cross-as-sol-losses-50-in-january"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 painting a similar pattern}}}\uc2  since Jan. 24, especially after extending its rebound move by rising 25% week-to-date to reach above $100.\par \par \uc2 Additionally, a visible \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence between SOL\u8217\'20\'19s price and relative strength index trends indicates a high probability of a double-bottom breakout.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/05868d6b-3d77-4737-ad9b-0caadc232e9a.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USD daily price chart featuring double-bottom and \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  divergence setups. Source: TradingView\par \par \uc2 Nonetheless, a \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  confirmation might come if SOL\u8217\'20\'19s price breaks above the double-bottom neckline near $120 with a rise in trading volume. As it happens, SOL\u8217\'20\'19s upside target could be at length equal to the maximum distance between the double-bottom pattern\u8217\'20\'19s lowest point and its neckline.\par \par \uc2 That would put SOL en route to at least $150, with a possibility of continuing the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  move toward $170, marked in red in the chart above.\par \par \uc2 Bull-trap risks\par \par \uc2 As double-bottom envisioned SOL at $150 or above, popular market analyst Capo {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/solana-s-weekend-bounce-risks-turning-into-a-bull-trap-can-sol-price-fall-to-60-next"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 warned about a potential bull trap}}}\uc2  in the Solana market, noting that altcoins, on the whole, would resume their downtrends.\par \par \uc2 The pseudonymous analyst presented $120, the double-bottom neckline, as a solid resistance level that would most likely {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/price-analysis-2-28-btc-eth-bnb-xrp-ada-sol-avax-luna-doge-dot"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 limit SOL\u8217\'20\'19s ongoing upside retracement}}}\uc2 . He also applied the popular Elliott Wave Theory to hint about the beginning of Solana\u8217\'20\'19s next \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  wave cycle, as tagged with \u8220\'20\'1Cc\u8221\'20\'1D in the chart below.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/35013dd9-3a00-432a-b209-f5f561459248.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 SOL/USD daily price chart. Source: Capo/TradingView\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CIt\u8217\'20\'19s impossible to me to be \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  here, after the break of all the \b \highlight22\uc2 bullish\b0 \highlight\uc2  MS + correctives moves to the upside,\u8221\'20\'1D Capo {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://twitter.com/CryptoCapo_/status/1498390220517093386"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 said}}}\uc2  on March 1, adding:\par \par \uc2 \u8220\'20\'1CYou can enjoy the LTF pumps while they last, but don\u8217\'20\'19t get too comfy.\u8221\'20\'1D\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 bearish\b0 \highlight\uc2  outlook lined up with a \uc2 CoinShares{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://coinshares.com/research/digital-asset-fund-flows"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 report}}}\uc2  published last week showed most altcoin-based investment vehicles witnessing negative \b \highlight22\uc2 investor sentiment\b0 \highlight\uc2 , including {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/binance-coin-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BNB}}}\uc2 , Polkadot ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/polkadot-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 DOT}}}\uc2  ), Cardano ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ada-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 \b  \highlight22ADA\b0 \highlight22 }}}\uc2  ), {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/xrp-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 XRP}}}\uc2  and \uc2 Litecoin\uc2  ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/ltc-price-index"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 LTC}}}\uc2  ).\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://s3.cointelegraph.com/uploads/2022-03/a3e7503e-fa74-470c-b675-eb4c1cc68b14.png"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Click to view image.}}}\par \par \uc2 Flow by asset in the week ending Feb. 25. Source: Bloomberg/\uc2 CoinShares\par \par \uc2 Related: {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/news/crypto-investment-funds-attract-36m-in-capital-despite-market-turmoil"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 Crypto investment funds attract $36M in capital despite market turmoil}}}\par \par \uc2 Solana also suffered as the week ending Feb. 25 saw SOL investment products losing $2.6 million in capital outflows.\par \par \uc2 In contrast, all the \b \highlight22\uc2 digital asset\b0 \highlight\uc2  investment products combined attracted $36 million in the same period, with multi-asset portfolios injecting the highest capital \u8212\'20\'14 of $14 million, followed by Bitcoin\u8217\'20\'19s ({\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://cointelegraph.com/bitcoin-price"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 BTC}}}\uc2  ) 17.3 million.\par \par \uc2 The views and opinions expressed here are solely those of the author and do not necessarily reflect the views of Cointelegraph.com. Every investment and trading move involves risk, you should conduct your own research when making a decision.\par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://images.cointelegraph.com/images/840_aHR0cHM6Ly9zMy5jb2ludGVsZWdyYXB